window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1201,"title":"Chapter 1201 Public Execution","paragraphs":["1201 Public Execution","Xia Yunlou was the first to come back to her senses. She pretended to be calm and replied, “Madam Ye, Miss Ye, I’m really sorry that we couldn’t attend Miss Ye’s birthday banquet. Mengyan and I returned to Shengdu and couldn’t rush back in time. My father reject some banquets on our behalf, so the moment the two of us came back, we wanted to relay our apologies to you!","“What Madam Ye just said has nothing to do with us. We haven’t been in Li City for the past two days. How could I have framed my daughter? As for being detained, that’s even more nonsense. I hope everyone won’t make wild guesses!”","Xia Yunlou’s tone was serious, but her gaze was lacking in confidence. Her breathing was slightly trembling, but she had to deny it and warn everyone not to make wild guesses.","The eyes of the noblewomen and their daughters were filled with disdain. If they did not know, they might really believe Xia Yunlou’s words.","Seeing that no one refuted, Xia Yunlou’s expression softened. It seemed that everyone believed her. She did not expect that not only had Qiao Xi sent them to the detention center, but she had also spread the news. Fortunately, everyone had only heard about this and did not know that they were the ones who were detained.","Xia Mengyan heaved a sigh of relief and closed her eyes in exhaustion. She picked up the glass of water and drank the lemonade in one gulp. She then picked up a tissue to wipe her sweat before recovering.","Just as the two of them thought that everything was fine, Madam Ye suddenly sneered, scaring Xia Yunlou so much that her entire body trembled. She frowned unhappily. Before she could speak, Madam Ye slammed the table and said loudly, “Xia Yunlou! Do you think we’ll believe you just because you casually made up a few words? The news of you and Xia Mengyan framing Mrs. Gu has already spread. I didn’t expose you just now because I wanted to see you defend yourself nervously!”","The banquet hall was silent. Xia Yunlou’s pupils suddenly constricted as she looked at everyone in fear. They actually knew?","Xia Mengyan’s heart, which had just calmed down, suffered another blow. Her face suddenly turned pale, and her lips trembled as if she was about to faint in the next second.","Madam Ye was a ruthless person, so she naturally wouldn’t go easy on them. “I didn’t ask you to come here today to treat you to a meal. I wanted to teach you two bad women a lesson!","“Xia Mengyan! Don’t forget that your grandmother is a mistress and your father is an illegitimate child. Since your status isn’t honorable, you should keep a low profile. If you’re kind and humble, no one will make things difficult for you. But now that Xia Yunlou has found her biological daughter, you’re afraid that your status will be threatened, so you framed Mrs. Gu and used a one-million-yuan bracelet as a bet. You hoped that Mrs. Gu’s reputation would be ruined and she’d be sentenced. That way, you’d always be the high and mighty daughter of the Xia family and no one would threaten you. I have to say that this move is really ruthless!”","Xia Mengyan was publicly executed. She felt as if everyone’s gazes were sharp knives stabbing into her body, causing her to tremble in pain.","After reprimanding Xia Mengyan, Madam Ye looked at Xia Yunlou. “You’re an idiot. Xia Mengyan wanted to use you to get rid of Mrs. Gu, and you were willing to be used. You framed your daughter for your niece. Xia Yunlou, you deserve what you’ve gotten yourself into today!","“Don’t blame Mrs. Gu for being heartless. You were the one who cut off this mother-daughter relationship first. You asked the police to arrest her and send her to prison. She has shown you plenty of mercy!”","Xia Yunlou’s entire body trembled, and her sharp nails dug into her palms. She had never thought of sending Qiao Xi to jail from the beginning. She just thought that Qiao Xi had stolen something and wanted to teach her a lesson. As long as Qiao Xi handed over the bracelet and apologized to Mengyan, she would withdraw the case.","No matter how much she hated Qiao Xi, she would not let her go to jail. After all, she would also be embarrassed!","Madam Ye looked at the two of them with disgust in her eyes. She waved her hand impatiently and said, “Someone! Chase them out. If they stay here, I won’t be able to breathe easily. Besides, we friends are gathered here to relax. With them here, we’ll have to be on guard against being framed.”","“That’s right! Quickly chase them out. With them around, we won’t have the appetite to eat!”","Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan were chased out just like that. When they reacted, they had already left the hotel. The two of them stood in the cold wind and shivered.","Now that everyone in Li City’s upper class society knew that they had been detained, what would they do in the future?","“Ah!!! Why did she spread this news?! I’m her biological mother!” Xia Yunlou roared indignantly, her eyes filled with tears."]},{"number":1202,"title":"Chapter 1202 Finding The Real Xia Yunlou","paragraphs":["1202 Finding The Real Xia Yunlou","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi lazily lay on the sofa in the study while scrolling through her phone. Gu Zheng had just taken a shower and walked out. He was wearing a loose white bathrobe, and his wet hair hung low, making him look even gentler.","He bent down slightly and smiled gently. “Xi Xi, what are you looking at?”","Qiao Xi had just received a message from Madam Ye and had just read the first few sentences when she heard Gu Zheng’s voice coming from above. She subconsciously locked her screen.","Gu Zheng glanced at the phone screen and sneered. “Why are you hiding it? I didn’t say I wanted to see it. But you seem to be very concerned about Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan’s recent situation?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly hid her phone behind her back and smiled awkwardly.","Gu Zheng revealed a triumphant smile. Only then did Qiao Xi realize that when Gu Zheng leaned over, she had already locked the screen. Moreover, the words on the screen were so small that Gu Zheng definitely did not see them clearly. He said that just now to trick her!","Qiao Xi: “...”","What a scheming man! Xia Mengyan’s methods were nothing against his!","Qiao Xi didn’t care if he knew or not. She pretended to be confused. “Xia Yunlou? That’s right! Counting the days, they should be out soon!”","Gu Zheng reached out and gently pinched her chin, forcing her to look up. There was a smile on his lips as he raised his eyebrows. There was a hint of teasing in his eyes. “What are you pretending for?”","The expression on Qiao Xi’s face suddenly stiffened.","She was stunned for a few seconds before quickly adjusting her emotions. She pushed his hand away and said casually, “I’m already prepared to sue them. Of course, I have to pay attention. Is there a problem?”","“No problem at all. Mrs. Gu, what’s your next plan?” Gu Zheng asked softly.","Qiao Xi suddenly stood up and retorted with a serious expression, “Ah Zheng, what do you mean? Do you think I want to scheme against them?”","Gu Zheng looked at her meaningfully and sneered. “Mrs. Gu, don’t be so nervous. It makes you look guilty!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. As expected, she could not hide anything from Gu Zheng. She seemed to be unable to keep secrets in front of Gu Zheng!","Gu Zheng sat beside her and pulled her into his arms. He gently pinched her little face. “Mrs. Gu, we’re husband and wife. In front of me, you can be more casual. There’s no need to hide anything. Besides, even if you pretend to not know anything, I can still tell.”","Qiao Xi glared at him playfully and could only answer truthfully, “I want to investigate Xia Yunlou’s identity. I have to unlock this secret.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes flashed as he looked at her deeply. He said in a low voice, “Didn’t you already try it last time? Even under hypnosis, she still thinks she’s Xia Yunlou.”","This was indeed the case, but Qiao Xi had a feeling that the person in front of her was not the real Xia Yunlou. She did not know why, so she wanted to investigate.","She had thought about it carefully. Since she did not find out anything even after hypnotizing Xia Yunlou, she would find an opportunity to hypnotize the rest of the Xia family. She would try it with everyone. Perhaps there would be clues.","“Actually, you’ve already confirmed that she’s not the real Xia Yunlou, so it’s meaningless to probe further. What you lack now is evidence,” Gu Zheng said slowly.","“I can’t be sure that I’m right. After all, it’s just my intuition.” Qiao Xi was a little helpless.","Gu Zheng looked at her gently. “Your intuition won’t be wrong. What we lack is a way to find evidence.”","“DNA test?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes.","Gu Zheng shook his head. “All these years, the Yin family has been suspecting her identity and have secretly done a test, but they didn’t find anything. This means that Xia Yunlou has a way to deal with it. Moreover, it’s very easy for the Xia family to fake a DNA test. Even if we get a test report, they’ll still think that we faked it and deny it.”","When he was labeled as the illegitimate son of the Gu family, he had thought of this method, but it didn’t work at all. The Xia family was even more shameless than the Gu family. With just a guess, Gu Zheng knew they would definitely not admit that there was something wrong with Xia Yunlou’s identity and would even bite back at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi nodded. She was sure that the person in front of her was not the real Xia Yunlou. The Yin family thought so too. How could an obedient and sensible child become surly and heartless overnight? She definitely would not snatch away her sister’s fiancé after she reached adulthood!","Xia Yunlou was shrewish and sharp. She did not resemble that kind child in the past at all. Instead, she was exactly the same as Old Madam Xia. They could all tell that there was something wrong, but there was no evidence to prove that she was not Xia Yunlou.","In order to find the real Xia Yunlou, Qiao Xi had to make a detailed plan."]},{"number":1203,"title":"Chapter 1203 They’re Back","paragraphs":["1203 They’re Back","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes. “The Xia family is able to hide Xia Yunlou’s identity flawlessly. There must be someone secretly helping them. Otherwise, with the Yin family’s power, they would have found clues all these years.”","“They’ve been planning for years, and someone is secretly helping them. It’s really not easy to find evidence.”","“But it doesn’t matter even if there’s no evidence. Since I’m sure that the person in front of me isn’t the real Xia Yunlou, I’ll just fake the evidence.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “The Xia family forged a DNA test report to prove Xia Yunlou’s identity, so I’ll fake evidence to prove that she’s fake. There’s no problem with that, right?”","“Before Mom passed away, she was still thinking about her sister. It was her last wish to find her sister. No matter if Xia Yunlou is dead or alive, I have to investigate it clearly. I can’t let that vicious woman taint Xia Yunlou’s reputation.”","Gu Zheng asked casually, “So what are you going to do?”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly as she said meaningfully, “I want to set up a trap for the Xia family to fall into.”","Gu Zheng hugged her in his arms and laughed heartily. He teased, “Mrs. Gu, you’re really smart. But didn’t you say that you weren’t going to scheme against the Xia family?”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face suddenly stiffened.","...","In the dead of the night, Gu Zheng came to the study to deal with work.","Song Shijing walked in and asked nervously, “President, Mr. and Mrs. He have returned to the country. The old master has also rushed over from the capital. They’re holding a welcome banquet in Li City. They sent an invitation today. Do you want to attend?”","Gu Zheng glanced at the invitations on the table, looked away, and chuckled. “They still came back in the end.”","Song Shijing was a little unhappy. “The He family hasn’t been developing well overseas all these years. If you hadn’t helped them directly, they would have gone bankrupt long ago. Instead of doing business honestly, they always want you to clean up their mess. They’re too greedy. Now that they’ve returned to Li City, they actually have the cheek to invite you over!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes, and a cold glint flashed across them. He sneered. “Back then, I wasn’t welcomed in the Gu family. It was the He family who helped me. Perhaps without the He family, my entrepreneurial path wouldn’t have been so smooth, so I should repay them. Whenever they encounter difficulties, the first person they think of is naturally me.”","“President, you’ve done enough for the He family over the years. You’ve already returned their kindness. Moreover, when they went overseas back then, they said that they would never contact you again. But they couldn’t survive overseas and returned to Li City. Aren’t they going too far?”","Gu Zheng’s slender fingers tapped on the word ‘He’ on the invitation in silence.","Song Shijing, who was at the side, was indignant. “Everyone in Li City thinks that the He family helped you back then. They think that you have a close relationship with the He family and that you treat them as your benefactors. Now that they’ve just arrived in Li City, a group of people is trying to curry favor with them. The He family has benefited a lot by relying on your name. Are you still going to indulge them?”","Qiao Xi stood at the door of the study and listened to Song Shijing’s angry voice. He had always been calm and humble. This seemed to be the first time he was talking to Gu Zheng so agitatedly!","The He family? Qiao Xi seemed to have never heard of this family before. Previously, they had cut off all contact with Gu Zheng. Now that their business overseas failed, they returned to Li City. Did they want to rely on Gu Zheng to survive?","In the study, Gu Zheng said casually, “The He family won’t be smug for long.”","Song Shijing: “...” He really felt indignant for the president. The president had already done enough for the He family. Now that the He family still dared to approach him, did they really think that the president had such a good temper that he would just tolerate it?","If they angered the president, the He family would definitely suffer!","At this moment, Qiao Xi knocked on the door and interrupted their conversation.","Qiao Xi pushed open the door and swaggered in without hiding the fact that she had eavesdropped. “Who’s the He family?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled into a disdainful smile. “We’re old friends, but we might be enemies in the future.”","Actually, Qiao Xi also understood. It was probably because when Gu Zheng was bullied by the Gu family back then, the He family helped him. Now that Gu Zheng had become the richest man in Li City, the He family wanted to get benefits from him.","On account of their past kindness, Gu Zheng had directly helped the He family on multiple accounts. They received enough money to prepare to go overseas to develop, but they despised Gu Zheng’s identity as an illegitimate child and were unwilling to interact with him. Now that Gu Zheng’s identity as an illegitimate child was debunked and he became the legitimate heir of the Gu family, the He family came back to curry favor with him."]},{"number":1204,"title":"Chapter 1204 Photos From The Past","paragraphs":["1204 Photos From The Past","Everyone in Li City’s upper class society knew about the He family and Gu Zheng’s past. They had always thought that the He family was Gu Zheng’s benefactor. Therefore, as soon as the He family returned, everyone swarmed over, wanting to use the He family to negotiate a collaboration with Gu Zheng. Hence, the He family was able to be popular because of Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng looked at her intently. “They’re not worthy of Mrs. Gu’s attention. I’ll handle it well.”","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng was confident in handling this matter. His calmness meant that he no longer took the He family seriously. After all, it was the He family who took the initiative to cut ties with him back then. Now, they regretted it. How could they want Gu Zheng to accept them?","“Xi Xi, why aren’t you sleeping yet? What’s the matter?” Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows with a smile in his eyes.","Qiao Xi smiled slyly and hurriedly leaned in front of him. She said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, I have something to tell you.”","“Go ahead,” Gu Zheng said gently.","Qiao Xi said impatiently, “Ah Zheng, although we’ve known each other for 10 years, I’ve never seen what you looked like in the past. I want to see your old photos, okay?”","Gu Zheng raised his eyes slightly, and his light brown eyes seemed to be hiding something. His probing gaze landed on Qiao Xi, who was a little nervous under his gaze. She hurriedly explained, “I just suddenly had that thought and wanted to see what you looked like when you were younger.”","She had gone to look for the butler just now, but the butler said that Gu Zheng did not like to take photos. He did not know where his old photos were and even asked her to ask Gu Zheng herself.","Later on, the butler even told her mysteriously, “Although the president doesn’t like to take photos, Young Master Gu Yao often took photos! He even took many photos of the president, but those photos were confiscated by the president. Even so, he wouldn’t have destroyed them. He must have hidden them.”","Then, Qiao Xi anxiously called Gu Yao to ask about the photos. Gu Yao replied excitedly, “Yes! I had just bought a camera at that time and took a lot of photos of Gu Zheng. There were also some private photos of him! The kind where he was without clothes!”","When Qiao Xi heard this, she almost drooled. She could not help but sigh in her heart. Gu Yao was really a little angel.","Not long after, Qiao Xi found the study. She knew that Gu Zheng must have hidden the photos, so she fawned over him. “Ah Zheng... I want to see your old photos!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and glanced at her, then hurriedly looked away. His ears were slightly red, and his Adam’s apple moved. He said in a hoarse voice, “I don’t have any.”","Of course, Qiao Xi did not believe him. She pulled Gu Zheng’s collar and said in a bewitching tone, “Ah Zheng, we’ve been married for so long, but you’re still unwilling to show me the photos. Could it be that you were very ugly in the past and are too embarrassed to show the photos to me?”","Gu Zheng snorted. “Mrs. Gu, how are you so sure that I have any photos?”","“Of course, I’m sure! I asked...” Qiao Xi stopped talking. She could not expose Gu Yao. That would be too disloyal.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and replied calmly, “Mrs. Gu, I was the illegitimate son of the Gu family in the past. I was struggling at death’s door. How could I have been in the mood to take photos? Besides, I don’t like taking photos to begin with. How could I have any photos?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked.","She thought for a long time before saying hesitantly, “Really? Didn’t you take a graduation photo when you were in school? You should have a graduation photo, right? There must be a photo on your graduation certificate! Let me see it!”","Gu Zheng asked meaningfully, “Mrs. Gu, why do you suddenly want to see my old photos?”","Qiao Xi instantly became nervous and gulped. She pondered for a long time and thought about it carefully. If she made up an excuse to lie to Gu Zheng, Gu Zheng would definitely see through her. In that case, Gu Zheng would definitely not show her any of his photos.","After hesitating for a moment, Qiao Xi replied truthfully, “Actually, it’s nothing much. I just dreamed of you when you were in your teens last night, so I wanted to see if the younger you were exactly the same as the version of you I dreamed of.”","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu: “...”","Young Madam’s reason was too far-fetched!","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes before quickly returning to normal. He smiled at her. “Mrs. Gu, even if you want to lie to me, you should find a better excuse.”","Qiao Xi wanted to cry but had no tears.","She defended herself anxiously. “I’m not lying to you! I’m telling the truth!”","She was afraid that Gu Zheng would not believe her, so she told him the truth. However, he still did not believe her! She was clearly telling the truth!"]},{"number":1205,"title":"Chapter 1205 Gu Yao Is Innocent","paragraphs":["1205 Gu Yao Is Innocent","“Mrs. Gu, it’s not strange for you to dream of me, but...” Gu Zheng suddenly leaned closer, and a cold smile appeared in his deep eyes. “But how do you know that I have old photos of myself? Who did you hear it from?”","At this moment, Gu Yao’s words echoed in Qiao Xi’s mind. There were photos of Gu Zheng naked! She originally just wanted to see Gu Zheng’s past appearance, but Gu Yao’s words aroused her curiosity.","“I know even if you don’t say it.” Seeing Qiao Xi’s excited expression, Gu Zheng understood. He said firmly, “It was Gu Yao, right?”","Qiao Xi gasped, and the scene in her mind instantly dissipated.","“Your reaction has already told me that Gu Yao was the one who told you. That’s why you want to see my photos. Did Gu Yao tell you that he took my private photos?” Gu Zheng smiled charmingly, and the atmosphere around him became ambiguous.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly, and her heart beat violently. This man was too seductive.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and clenched his fists. “It seems that I haven’t beaten him up in a long time. Gu Yao has completely become arrogant.”","Qiao Xi hurriedly shook her head. “It’s not like that. I really dreamed of you, so I called Gu Yao to ask if he had any old photos of you. Gu Yao just told me the truth. This matter has nothing to do with him. It’s all because I want to see those photos!”","Gu Zheng clenched his fists even tighter. “Mrs. Gu, you’re really loyal. You’ve been speaking up for Gu Yao and even taking on all the responsibility yourself. You’re better to him than to me, your husband.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Why couldn’t she explain it well?","She frowned, looking innocent and aggrieved. “You... Sigh, I’m telling the truth!”","Gu Zheng looked up at her with jealousy. “Mhm.”","Qiao Xi: “...” This bastard was even jealous of his brother. She was really impressed!","Gu Zheng’s face was still filled with certainty. “I have to beat Gu Yao up.”","Gu Yao, who was far away at home, was innocently implicated. In the past, he was often beaten up. Now that he had become the president of the company, he still had to be beaten up.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with disappointment. It was fine if she didn’t get the photos, but she even harmed Gu Yao. She had never felt so defeated before. However, in the next second, Gu Zheng smiled and said, “Actually, Mrs. Gu, you can look at my photos.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened in surprise. Then, she heard Gu Zheng say calmly, “When Gu Yao was young, his dream was to be a celebrity. He bought a lot of role-playing clothes and pestered me to wear them. He also took a few photos of me.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with anticipation. Was it the role-playing she thought it was? With Gu Zheng’s figure, he would definitely look very tempting!","“Mrs. Gu, do you want to see them?” Gu Zheng’s seductive voice sounded in her ear.","Qiao Xi blushed and pretended to be reserved. “Actually, I don’t want to see those photos that badly, but we’re already married and have known each other for 10 years. As your wife, I have to know you better, so I’ll just have a quick look.”","She pretended not to care and straightened her back. “It’s not that big of a deal. It’s mainly for our relationship!”","Gu Zheng smiled brightly. “Of course, you can take a look if you want, Mrs. Gu, but if I show you my photos, shouldn’t you show me your past photos too? After all, this is also to let us understand each other more and improve our relationship.”","A glint flashed across his eyes. He had dreamed of Black Tide last night, so he also wanted to know if the Black Tide in his dream was exactly the same as her in the past.","Qiao Xi’s expression froze. Obviously, she did not expect Gu Zheng to make a request.","Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows and said, “Actually, I don’t really want to see your old photos. It’s just that you said that looking at past photos can improve the relationship and understanding between husband and wife, so I made the suggestion of looking at your past photos. If you’re unwilling, then forget it.”","With that, he stood up and was about to leave. “It’s late. Let’s rest early.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Wait! She hadn’t even seen the photos yet. Why was he leaving?","Qiao Xi’s mind was in chaos. She hurriedly grabbed Gu Zheng’s arm with a worried expression.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked down at her. “It doesn’t matter if you don’t want to show them to me. Anyway, we won’t alienate each other just because of a few photos.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was extremely conflicted. Actually, there was nothing difficult about it. She had been very cute since she was young. If Gu Zheng wanted to see her past photos, she could show them to him!","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and stomped her feet. “I’ll show you!”","Gu Zheng revealed a triumphant smile, but it disappeared in the blink of an eye and was not discovered by Qiao Xi."]},{"number":1206,"title":"Chapter 1206 Lost The Same Memories","paragraphs":["1206 Lost The Same Memories","10 minutes later, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she looked at Gu Zheng’s photos.","So? These were Gu Zheng’s private photos? What happened to him being naked?","When she heard Gu Yao say it so seductively, she thought that they were shameful photos. At that time, she thought that the serious Gu Zheng turned out to be a very passionate man in the past!","The young man in the photos in front of her had a sinister look in his eyes. He was wearing a set of ancient martial arts clothes, which gave him a different charm. He was indeed shirtless, but he was wearing pants and holding a heavy shield in his hand that covered his upper body.","Qiao Xi was a little disappointed, but at the same time, she realized that the Gu Zheng in the photos was exactly the same as the one in her dream. There were a few photos of him, so she was very sure that the young man in her dream was Gu Zheng. Dreams were produced by people’s thoughts. She had never seen Gu Zheng 10 years ago, so why did she see him in her dream?","Moreover, generally speaking, when one woke up from a dream, there was a high chance that one would forget the person in the dream. As time passed, even the details of the dream would become blurry, but she could clearly remember Gu Zheng’s face.","Gu Zheng was also holding a photo in his hand. The young Qiao Xi and Qin An were standing together with smiles on their faces. Qiao Xi was exactly the same as the Black Tide in his dream.","Last night, he dreamed of the young Qiao Xi. Coincidentally, Qiao Xi also dreamed of him. He did not believe that there was such a coincidence in the world. Had they known each other for a long time?","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes, and the temperature around him dropped. If they had met before, why did both of them forget about each other?","What happened that made them lose those memories?","Gu Zheng slowly looked up, and his gaze landed on the shell wind chime. “Why did you bring the wind chime here?”","Qiao Xi frowned and said, “Ah Zheng, I don’t know if you believe me or not, but I’ve been having some very strange dreams recently. I don’t remember who gave me this shell wind chime at all, but I always see it in my dreams. Moreover, I care a lot about this wind chime in my dreams, but if this wind chime is really important to me, how could I have forgotten it?","“It’s something that has been kept away for a long time. I’ve long forgotten about it. Why did I suddenly start dreaming of it? I keep feeling like I’ve lost a part of my memory.”","Gu Zheng’s pupils constricted!","Qiao Xi did not notice his abnormality and continued, “Actually... in my dream, you were the one who gave me this shell wind chime.”","Gu Zheng’s body stiffened, and a trace of fluctuation appeared on his calm face.","Qiao Xi said, “We clearly didn’t meet before we got our marriage certificate. We were just chatting online, but that dream was so real that it was terrifying. It was as if it really happened. In order to give me this gift, you even personally went to the seaside to pick up shells and made this wind chime.","“But after I woke up from my dream, I didn’t have any memories of our past. I couldn’t figure out where this shell wind chime came from or why it suddenly appeared beside me. Why did Xu Mei think that this thing was very important to me back then and put it together with Mom’s belongings?","“I seem to have... forgotten everything.”","Qiao Xi rubbed her temples. “I keep feeling like I’ve lost memories of us. The disappearance of these memories has no effect on my life because I’ve never felt anything strange about it.”","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple bobbed as he said hoarsely, “It’s possible that we really lost our memories.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “But that’s even stranger. Even if I lost my memory, why don’t you remember? Could it be that you’ve been having dreams recently as well?”","She was just asking casually. She had dreamed of the old Gu Zheng, so she just thought that Gu Zheng might have also dreamed of her. However, this was just a guess. She thought that it was impossible.","Gu Zheng suddenly looked up at her seriously. “That’s right. I dreamed of you too.”","Qiao Xi was instantly dumbfounded.","Gu Zheng said in a low voice, “We met 10 years ago. At that time, I only knew that your name was Black Tide, and you only knew that I was Mo Yuan.”","They met 10 years ago? Didn’t they meet at the entrance of the Civil Affairs Bureau?","It was precisely because of this that Gu Zheng felt a force in his heart guiding him to the Civil Affairs Bureau. He originally thought that everything was predestined, but now that he thought about it, it was just because of the obsession in his heart.","If he lost someone important and happened to have a premonition that he could see her there, he would naturally abandon everything to see her.","Perhaps they had already agreed to meet on that day, but he lost his memory and did not remember this agreement. However, subconsciously, he still knew that there was an important person waiting for him at the Civil Affairs Bureau."]},{"number":1207,"title":"Chapter 1207 Destined To Be Married","paragraphs":["1207 Destined To Be Married","That day, Gu Zheng wilfully went to the Civil Affairs Bureau and waited like a fool. Finally, Qiao Xi arrived.","Qiao Xi’s mind was filled with questions. Why did they lose their memories? If they had already lost their memories, why did they coincidentally meet at the entrance of the Civil Affairs Bureau? Whose scheme was this?","Gu Zheng’s deep voice sounded in her ear as he gently called her name.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes, and they were filled with seriousness. She was about to ask Gu Zheng when she heard him say gently, “Xi Xi, it seems that this is fate! 10 years ago, God arranged for us to be together. It was fate!”","They were destined to be husband and wife!","So... it was not a coincidence that he appeared at the Civil Affairs Bureau. Was he there just to wait for her?","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi opened her eyes in a daze. She had many dreams last night. She dreamed about what had happened 10 years ago and about what had happened in Stars. When she woke up, she felt extremely exhausted.","At this moment, Gu Zheng had already gone out. Qiao Xi got up, washed up, and prepared to go out.","Seeing that she was about to go out, the butler hurriedly said, “Young Madam, breakfast is ready. Eat first before going out.”","“No, I’m in a hurry to go to Blue Dream Pavilion.” Qiao Xi quickly walked out and said without looking back.","Perhaps she could find something if she went to the Medical Association.","At this moment, there was almost no one in Blue Dream Pavilion. Qiao Xi did not need to hide and directly entered the Medical Association. An elder had already been waiting at the door for a long time.","“Eldest Miss, why are you here so early?” the elder asked.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Yes, I have something to discuss with Third Brother.”","When she entered, she felt that the matter of her and Gu Zheng losing their memories was not simple. Moreover, memories were very strange. They might recover in a year or two, or they might not be able to remember it for the rest of their lives.","Although she and Gu Zheng had not regained their memories, they had dreamed of their past memories. This was like an omen.","She pushed open the door and walked in. Qin An was wearing a white coat and mixing medicine. He looked up at Qiao Xi. “Little Six, why did you think of making a visit today?”","“Third Brother, I need your help with something.” Qiao Xi had a serious expression.","“Sure! You don’t have to be so polite with me.” Qin An put down the medicine, took off his gloves, and washed his hands. He pointed at the chair beside him and gestured for her to sit down. “Is the matter so urgent that you had to come to the Medical Association yourself? Couldn’t we have talked over the phone?”","Qiao Xi nodded, feeling very tired. “Previously, the doctors introduced a batch of brain instruments. Please do a test on me.”","Qin An looked puzzled. “Why do you suddenly want to take a test? Did something happen?”","Qiao Xi’s face was expressionless, but her tone was very firm. “I think I lost my memory.”","The room was silent for a moment. Qin An suddenly stood up and asked in surprise, “Little Six, do you still know who I am?”","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression. “I’ve already called you Third Brother. Of course, I know who you are. The memories I lost are from the past, and they’re not about you. I can’t confirm the exact time. I only know that it happened after I was 10 years old.”","Qin An was dumbfounded.","“Little Six, how could you have such thoughts? You’ve been living with us since you were 10 years old. If you really lost your memory, we’d definitely know!”","Qiao Xi’s lips were tense. She was usually a mischievous little girl, but she had become so deep.","Qin An’s face was filled with fear as he asked a few questions in a row, “Are you sure you’re not just pranking me? Why do you think you lost your memory? Wouldn’t you have forgotten everything if you’ve lost your memory? Do you still remember me?”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment. “I’ve been having strange dreams recently. Many things happen in my dreams. They’re terrifyingly real, but I don’t have any memories of them happening.”","Qin An rubbed his chin. “Since you have your suspicions, let’s proceed with the test. Go lie down over there.”","Qiao Xi lay on the equipment bed. Qin An stroked her hair comfortingly before pressing the button. A moment later, the test was completed, but Qin An had a puzzled expression. “There’s no problem!”","The equipment did not detect any signs of amnesia. Qin An looked at Qiao Xi meaningfully. He believed that Xi Xi would not be suspicious for no reason. Moreover, she would not joke about such a thing.","However, whether she had lost her memory or not depended on whether her brain had suffered an impact or if certain drugs had interfered. However, she was in a good state and there was no damage. If it was not a problem with her brain, it might be a psychological problem."]},{"number":1208,"title":"Chapter 1208 Hidden Hypnosis Expert","paragraphs":["1208 Hidden Hypnosis Expert","Some people would selectively lose their memories after experiencing grief or shock. For example, they would forget a certain person or a certain memory. Furthermore, it would not affect other memories.","If it wasn’t a problem with her brain, Qin An could only suspect that it was a psychological problem. He said softly, “Little Six, let me give you a hypnosis test.”","Qiao Xi’s heart beat violently. Qin An did not find any problems, so he wanted to do a hypnosis test to see if she had psychological problems.","However, if she had a psychological problem, how could it explain Gu Zheng’s amnesia? Could it be that he also had a psychological problem?","Next, Qin An conducted a hypnosis test on her. After a long time, Qin An called out softly, “Little Six, wake up...”","Qiao Xi opened her eyes and glanced at her watch. It had only been an hour, but she felt that it was very long.","Qin An said solemnly, “According to my equipment and hypnosis tests, your brain is normal. There’s nothing wrong with it. I suspected that you were poisoned, but your body is immune to all poisons. Even if you were really poisoned, you would have sensed it. If you had treated it in time, it wouldn’t have much of an impact on your body.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “You mean I didn’t lose my memory?”","Qin An thought for a moment. “That may not necessarily be true. After all, there’s another possibility...”","He paused and said, “It’s possible that you were hypnotized. Psychological cues caused you to lose part of your memory. Little Six, you’ve also learned hypnosis. You should know the power of hypnosis. If you want to change a person’s memory, you have to hypnotize that person and keep hinting that they’ve forgotten.”","Hypnosis could indeed be done, and if it was done well, no issues would be detected.","“But...” Qin An frowned. “Little Six, it’s precisely because we’ve learned hypnosis that we know it’s very difficult to modify a person’s memory with hypnosis. At least, we can’t do it. Therefore, even though I used hypnosis earlier, I didn’t realize that you’ve lost part of your memories.","Qiao Xi knew that it was not easy to use hypnosis to modify one’s memory. Her hypnosis methods could only temporarily hypnotize a person. Moreover, if the other party’s willpower was very strong, she could only hypnotize them for a few seconds.","If she had really been hypnotized, that person could actually make those memories completely disappear from her mind. Even after so long, she had no impression of them at all. If she had not dreamed of Gu Zheng, she might not have been able to remember that portion of her memories for the rest of her life. In other words, that person’s hypnosis skills were very strong and had reached a terrifying level.","After all, not only did he hypnotize her, but he also hypnotized Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng’s willpower had always been very strong. She could only hypnotize Gu Zheng for a few seconds each time, but that person had actually hypnotized Gu Zheng for so many years!","“Little Six, perhaps there really is such a hypnotist in the world, but they’re a rarity. This person’s ability is even stronger than Grandpa’s, so I really can’t help you recover your memory.”","Qiao Xi was still expressionless as she said indifferently, “Mm, I understand.”","“By the way, has your second brother called you recently?” Qin An suddenly asked.","Qiao Xi revealed a meaningful smile. “Of course. I asked Second Brother to do me a small favor, but I didn’t expect the other members of the Luo family to be mobilized as well.”","Qin An said, “The porcelain designed by Madam Xia Yunqiu can be said to be peerless in the world. Moreover, the Luo family is a porcelain family, so they’re naturally willing to produce Madam Xia’s works.”","Qiao Xi asked curiously, “Did Second Brother personally make the porcelain pieces this time?”","When she was sorting out her mother’s belongings earlier, Qiao Xi discovered that a portion of the designs her mother had left behind had already been destroyed by Xu Mei. After Qiao Xi restored those designs, she showed them to Luo Qing.","The Luo family had been studying porcelain and jade for generations. When they saw those perfect designs, they couldn’t remain calm anymore. They got Luo Qing to personally make those porcelain and jade pieces so that Madam Xia Yunqiu’s creativity could be honored.","Qiao Xi took this opportunity to set up a trap for the Xia family. At this moment, the Xia family had already sneaked in.","Looking at Qiao Xi’s smile, Qin An could not help but laugh. “I’ll definitely be happy to be able to stand up for you!”","The two of them chatted for a while before Qiao Xi left Blue Dream Pavilion. As soon as she walked out of the door, she saw a black car parked at the entrance. Gu Zheng was dressed in a suit and leather shoes as he stood beside the car. His figure was tall, and his deep eyes were fixed on her.","He was bathed in sunlight, but his eyes were cold as if no one could see through him.","Seeing Qiao Xi walk over, Gu Zheng’s eyes softened. “Mrs. Gu, what are you doing in Blue Dream Pavilion so early in the morning?”"]},{"number":1209,"title":"Chapter 1209 Qiao Xi’s Suspicion","paragraphs":["1209 Qiao Xi’s Suspicion","Qiao Xi could not help but feel nervous. How could she explain this? She wanted to tell Gu Zheng directly that she was here to take a test, but the results of the test were confusing. Qin An could not find any problems with her brain. Instead, he suspected that she had been hypnotized by an expert hypnotist, or that all of this was just their imagination.","When she walked out of Blue Dream Pavilion just now, she had been wondering who had hypnotized her. She didn’t even realize that something was wrong and had no room to resist.","Now that she was also a hypnotist, she knew very well that it was very difficult to modify a person’s memory with hypnosis. Even if she was very talented, she could not do it to that extent.","Moreover, she and Gu Zheng had very strong willpower. If someone wanted to hypnotize them, they had to do it while they were caught off guard. Otherwise, the two of them would quickly notice it and resist with all their might. Then the hypnosis would fail.","Could it be that the person who hypnotized them was someone they were very familiar with? Was that why they were unprepared?","After thinking for a long time, a person appeared in Qiao Xi’s mind. Her grandfather’s hypnosis skills were invincible. If he was the one who hypnotized her, she would definitely be caught off guard.","Gu Zheng probably knew that the divine physician was her grandfather, so he naturally would not be on guard either. But why?","“What are you thinking about, Mrs. Gu? Why are you so engrossed?” Gu Zheng’s words pulled Qiao Xi back to reality.","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as she hurriedly raised her eyes.","“You probably didn’t come to Blue Dream Pavilion so early in the morning just to chat. You probably did something medical-related. But it seems like you don’t want to tell me.” Gu Zheng sized her up, his deep eyes completely seeing through her.","Qiao Xi’s body suddenly stiffened as she met his cold eyes guiltily. His eyes had always been so cold, but whenever she approached, she could always see the gentleness overflowing from his eyes.","The two of them gradually approached each other. Gu Zheng put an arm around her waist and pulled her closer, his eyes filled with affection. “Xi Xi?”","Qiao Xi thought for a long time and really did not know how to answer. She could only laugh awkwardly. “I’m from the Medical Association. Isn’t it normal for me to come here? I don’t have anything to say!”","Gu Zheng did not ask further. Instead, he turned around and opened the car door. After the two of them got into the car, Gu Zheng pulled down the partition in the middle, blocking Song Shiyu’s line of sight. His tall and straight body pressed against Qiao Xi’s body. He raised his eyebrows. “Are you sure?”","Song Shiyu could vaguely hear their voices. Why did he feel that the president’s voice was filled with killing intent? How did Young Madam offend the president today?! ‘Hurry up and admit your mistake, Young Madam!’","Qiao Xi leaned back and distanced herself from Gu Zheng. She thought about it carefully. She could tell Gu Zheng that someone had hypnotized them, but she would not tell him that the person was her grandfather. After all, everything was just her guess. It would be fine if she did not tell Gu Zheng first.","Gu Zheng sized up the person in front of him with his cold eyes. He could clearly feel that she had become active. In the next second, Qiao Xi suddenly raised her eyes and looked at him pitifully. “Ah Zheng, I originally wanted to take on everything alone and didn’t want you to feel pressured, but since you insist on asking, I’ll tell you!”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched as if he was saying, ‘I’ll just quietly watch you pretend.’","Qiao Xi whined aggrievedly. “Ah Zheng, we suspected that we lost our memory yesterday. After all, there’s no such coincidence in the world.”","Gu Zheng’s slender fingers brushed past her eyes that were watering up. “So you came here to investigate this matter? Then why didn’t you want to tell me?”","Qiao Xi whimpered. “Third Brother tested me for more than an hour, but we didn’t find any problems. Then, Third Brother said that there was only one possibility—we were hypnotized! Ah Zheng, how could I tell you this?!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed slightly, and the temperature around his body seemed to have decreased a little. Actually, he knew that Qiao Xi would definitely come to the Medical Association to investigate the truth, but for some reason, he kept having a premonition that it was his idea to make Qiao Xi lose those memories.","He lowered his head subtly to hide his gaze and asked casually, “Did you find out who hypnotized us?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly shook her head. “N-No! Being hypnotized is just a guess. We don’t have any substantial evidence yet. Actually, losing a portion of our memories might not mean that we were hypnotized. Perhaps there’s another reason.”","“A-Anyway, someone who can do such a thing must be an expert. My hypnosis is so weak. I definitely don’t know such a person!”"]},{"number":1210,"title":"Chapter 1210 Miss He Is Here","paragraphs":["1210 Miss He Is Here","At this moment, the butler hurriedly explained, “President, the two ladies of the He family said that they wanted to discuss cooperation with you. They also said that they were here under Old Master He’s orders. I really couldn’t stop them, so I could only let them come in and wait for you.”","Members of the He family?","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted. She had heard from Song Shijing last night that at that time, Gu Zheng was young and many families had secretly helped him. These families could tell that he was a promising talent and hoped that he could help them when he became rich in the future.","After that, Gu Zheng lived up to everyone’s expectations and founded Gu Corporation. The families who had helped him before also benefited greatly.","However, it was naturally impossible for them to endlessly take advantage of their past kindness and constantly ask Gu Zheng to reward them. Moreover, the He family had already cut off contact with Gu Zheng a few years ago and went overseas to develop. This time, they had suddenly come to visit and did not mention the past at all. Were they still thinking of discussing cooperation with Gu Zheng?","At this moment, Miss He, who was wearing a tight dress, walked forward with a warm smile on her face as if there had never been any estrangement between them. “Mr. Gu, actually, Big Brother wanted to come personally to discuss a collaboration. It’s just that we’ve just returned to Li City and have a lot of things to deal with. He’s too busy, so he sent the two of us to talk with you first.”","The woman smiled formally. “Mr. Gu, He Group’s proposal has been sent to Gu Corporation. Our previous cooperation was very pleasant. I hope it’ll be better this time.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the living room fell silent.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng asked casually, “Has the proposal been sent to Gu Corporation?”","He Wenxian nodded. “It was sent over this morning. As for the details...”","“Since the proposal has been sent over, we’ll just wait for the evaluation. What are you doing in Longwan Residential? Do you want me to choose He Group on the spot?” Gu Zheng interrupted coldly.","Qiao Xi: “...”","He Wenxian did not expect Gu Zheng to be so cold. She was a little surprised, but she quickly composed herself and said with a smile, “Mr. Gu, actually, I didn’t come here just for work. My father asked me to visit you on his behalf. After all, we haven’t seen each other for a long time. He misses you very much.”","As soon as she finished speaking, her gaze landed on Qiao Xi. She asked generously, “Miss, you are...”","The second daughter of the He family, He Wenyin, also glanced at Qiao Xi with an unfriendly gaze.","Gu Zheng chuckled, his tone filled with mockery. “Really? Miss He, don’t you look at your phone?”","He Wenxian’s expression froze. The smile on her face was no longer warm, but she still asked gently, “Mr. Gu, I don’t understand what you mean.”"]},{"number":1211,"title":"Chapter 1211 Deep Love And Hatred","paragraphs":["1211 Deep Love And Hatred","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “Since you’re preparing to work with Gu Corporation, you should have looked for my information. Didn’t you see the news that I’m already married?”","“I...” He Wenxian opened her mouth but did not know how to explain.","“Miss He, are you blind? Can’t you see that I’m holding hands with Mrs. Gu? Who else could appear in Longwan Residential and be so close to me other than Mrs. Gu?” Gu Zheng’s tone carried a trace of impatience.","The expression on He Wenxian’s face was still gentle. She was not angry. Instead, she greeted Qiao Xi enthusiastically, “It’s you, Mrs. Gu! Nice to meet you! It’s my first time visiting you, but I didn’t prepare a congratulatory gift. I’m really sorry. I hope you won’t mind. We’re all friends of Mr. Gu. I’ll make it up to you when I visit next time!”","After all, He Wenxian was quite enthusiastic about her, so Qiao Xi naturally responded with a smile and glanced at He Wenyin beside her. Her expression was intriguing. She was a little surprised as if she was asking He Wenxian, ‘Didn’t you already know that Gu Zheng was married?’","After all, He Wenyin was still young and did not know how to hide her emotions. Everyone in Li City knew that she and Gu Zheng were married. With He Wenxian’s connections, she naturally knew about it long ago. Why was she still pretending not to know?","“Miss He, welcome. But I’m not short of gifts,” Qiao Xi replied calmly.","He Wenxian had a gentle smile on her face, but in Qiao Xi’s opinion, this smile was filled with insidiousness. She refused so stiffly, but He Wenxian was not dissatisfied at all. She did not point out her mistakes, nor did she pretend to be pitiful like other women. It was as if nothing had happened.","Qiao Xi could not help but sigh. She had encountered an expert this time. If He Wenyin’s expression had not exposed everything, she would have really thought that He Wenxian was genuinely very friendly to her!","After a few seconds of silence, He Wenxian looked up at Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, I’m really sorry for visiting you rashly today. I hope you won’t take offense.”","“Miss He, since you think it’s inappropriate, you should leave immediately,” Gu Zheng said coldly. His words made the smile on He Wenxian’s face stiffen.","Qiao Xi understood in her heart. No matter what she said, it could not affect He Wenxian. However, Gu Zheng’s cold attitude had indeed hurt He Wenxian. This meant that her feelings for Gu Zheng were not pure!","He Wenxian looked hurt. “Ah Zheng, you weren’t angry when I came here often in the past. Why now... It’s probably because the He family hasn’t interacted much with you all these years. We’re strangers now.”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips tightly. He Wenxian said such words to show off in front of her. In the past, Gu Zheng was very close to the He family, so he was naturally very close to her. Now that Gu Zheng was so cold to her, it was probably because he had loved her deeply in the past and now hated her. He even hated the He family for severing ties with him and leaving the country. This meant that he had always cared about the He family.","Now that He Wenxian mentioned the He family, did she want Gu Zheng to let bygones be bygones on account of the He family’s past kindness?","However, Gu Zheng did not give her any hope. “Miss He, you said so yourself that it was in the past. We have nothing to do with each other now. I hope you can have some sense of propriety and not rashly disturb our lives.”","Song Shiyu pursed his lips. Did they really think that the president had a good temper? They had entered Longwan Residential rashly. They knew that their actions were wrong, but they refused to leave. They said so much nonsense just to get the president to help the He family establish themselves in Li City again. Did the He family think that everyone else was stupid?","He Wenxian’s expression did not change. “Ah Zheng, I know you blame us. If it weren’t for something important, I wouldn’t have suddenly come over.”","As she spoke, He Wenxian took out a document from her bag and said solemnly, “Previously, Gu Corporation was maliciously attacked and some data was leaked. I’ve already found out the other party’s information.”","Song Shijing took the document and flipped through it carefully. Then, he leaned toward Gu Zheng and whispered, “President, this information is real.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was still cold, but he did not refuse. Song Shijing understood what Gu Zheng meant. He turned to He Wenxian and said, “Miss He, please follow me to the living room.”","He Wenxian’s gaze flickered. In the past, when she came to look for Gu Zheng, he would always ask her to go to the study. Now, this assistant actually asked her to go to the living room.","Just as she was about to leave, He Wenxian turned to look at He Wenyin and said gently, “Wenyin, haven’t you always wanted to stay in Brother Ah Zheng’s house for a few days? You can ask Mrs. Gu to show you around now, but you can’t be willful. You have to be polite and not make Mrs. Gu angry. She’s Ah Zheng’s wife. You have to respect her.”"]},{"number":1212,"title":"Chapter 1212 An Innocent Girl","paragraphs":["1212 An Innocent Girl","He Wenyin’s eyes were filled with unwillingness. “Sister, why should I tolerate her? Our family clearly wanted to marry me to Brother Ah Zheng...”","“That’s all in the past.” He Wenxian’s voice was filled with helplessness. She lowered her voice and tried to sow discord. “As you can see, Mrs. Gu is so beautiful. Which man wouldn’t like her? Ah Zheng dotes on her so much. You don’t have a chance anymore, so be good and don’t cause trouble.”","Then, He Wenxian pulled He Wenyin and reminded her in a low voice, “Wenyin, to be honest, she’s really beautiful. You can’t compare to Mrs. Gu. Now that she’s married to Ah Zheng, you should give up.”","He Wenyin’s eyes were filled with unwillingness. She did not hide it at all.","Qiao Xi looked at the two sisters muttering. Even if she couldn’t hear them, she could guess that they were talking about her. However, the two of them were clearly sisters from the same mother, but their personalities were very different. He Wenxian was scheming and good at pretending, while He Wenyin was simple-minded and easily instigated.","After He Wenxian finished speaking, she turned around and said gently, “Ah Zheng, we can leave now.”","Gu Zheng did not even bother to look at her. He walked up to Qiao Xi and rubbed her hair dotingly, his gaze flashing.","Although he did not say anything, Qiao Xi understood what he meant. The data leakage of Gu Corporation was a secret that only a few senior executives in the company knew. How did the He family find out?","Seeing them leave, Qiao Xi leaned lazily on the sofa.","He Wenyin stared at Qiao Xi’s face with a burning gaze. Her sister was right. Mrs. Gu was indeed very beautiful. It was precisely because of her face that Brother Ah Zheng married her.","She had long known that Brother Ah Zheng was married, but she naively thought that he had no choice but to get married and have children due to his age. She thought he had no feelings for that strange woman at all. However, now that she saw Mrs. Gu’s face, she finally understood that no man could reject a beauty like Mrs. Gu!","This woman was not inferior to Brother Ah Zheng at all. He was tall and handsome, while she was gentle and pure. Her figure was curvaceous, and it seemed that everyone would think that the two of them were a perfect match.","However, in the past, her family had said that they wanted her to marry Brother Ah Zheng. Even if it wasn’t her, it should be her sister! Why did this woman occupy the position of Mrs. Gu?","The more He Wenyin thought about it, the angrier she became. She suddenly stood up and said, “Mrs. Gu, I want to talk to you.”","Qiao Xi said casually, “I’m sorry, but I don’t want to talk to you.”","The corners of He Wenyin’s mouth twitched. Unconvinced, she said, “Mrs. Gu, a-are you afraid?”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and glanced at the woman in front of her. He Wenyin looked innocent and had round cheeks. Even when she was angry, she revealed a trace of cuteness. She even felt that He Wenyin’s eyes were somewhat similar to hers.","She knew very well that He Wenyin was probably provoked by He Wenxian, so she wanted to vent her anger on Qiao Xi. Unexpectedly, when she opened her mouth fiercely, she let her fear slip!","This young lady looked willful, but she was actually very innocent!","Qiao Xi suddenly became interested and raised her eyebrows. “If you want to say something, say it here.”","He Wenyin glanced around and saw that the butler was still at the side. She said angrily, “Let’s talk in the backyard!”","“Alright!” Qiao Xi agreed without hesitation before standing up and leaving with her.","When the two of them arrived at the backyard, Qiao Xi lay on the rocking chair and said contentedly, “Miss He, if you have something to say, say it quickly. I don’t have that much patience to play with you.”","He Wenyin’s face turned red. After a long time, she said fiercely, “D-Don’t think that you can marry Brother Ah Zheng and get your hands on him. Do you think you can win a man’s heart just because you’re good-looking?”","On the other hand, in the surveillance room upstairs, Song Shiyu was sitting at the table and looking at the surveillance footage. The president was afraid that Young Madam would suffer, so he asked him to keep an eye on her. Once Young Madam was bullied, he would immediately attack.","However, no matter how he looked at it, Young Madam did not look like the person who was being bullied!","The next second, Qiao Xi smiled in surprise. “That’s right! Ah Zheng likes me just because I’m good-looking!”","He Wenyin felt a lump in her throat as she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi’s face. The two of them were very close to each other. He Wenyin realized that Qiao Xi’s face was as smooth as the skin of a newborn baby. Moreover, her facial features were exquisite. Her eyelashes were long, and her eyes were sparkling. Her nose was tall and small, while her lips were pink. Her face was like a masterpiece of God, making others feel ashamed."]},{"number":1213,"title":"Chapter 1213 Vixens Are All Beauties","paragraphs":["1213 Vixens Are All Beauties","Looking at her almost perfect face, He Wenyin really could not be fierce. Her face turned red as she blurted out, “You’re really... very beautiful.”","After being silent for two seconds, she suddenly reacted. She suddenly stood up, pointed at Qiao Xi, and shouted, “You seduced me!”","Qiao Xi touched her face in amusement and teased, “Miss He, you specially lured me to the backyard to praise me for being beautiful! Then why beat about the bush? Just praise me openly. I know I’m as beautiful as a fairy!”","He Wenyin: “...” She had never seen such a narcissistic woman like Qiao Xi. He Wenyin’s face turned red. She thought hard before scolding, “You vixen, you only know how to seduce people!”","“Miss He, you’ve been holding it in for a long time. Is that all you have to say? If you have time, you should study more. Even if you want to scold someone, you have to be cultured. Otherwise, you’ll be so aggrieved if you want to scold someone but can’t!”","Qiao Xi smiled and continued, “Thank you for praising me as a vixen! After all, vixens are all beauties. I’ve never heard of a vixen who’s ugly.”","He Wenyin was so angry that she wanted to vomit blood. Why was this woman staring at her when she spoke? Was she saying that she was ugly?","‘No! I have to teach this woman a lesson today!’","She turned around angrily and subconsciously rummaged through her bag. She took out a small medicine bottle. This was a powder that could disfigure people. When did it end up in her bag?","He Wenyin hesitated for a moment. She probably felt that this method was too vicious. Even if she wanted to teach Qiao Xi a lesson, she did not want to use this method. Hence, she rummaged through her bag again, and her eyes suddenly lit up.","“Mrs. Gu, I offended you just now. Well... you must be thirsty. I’ll get you a glass of water!”","With that, He Wenyin left in a hurry. Qiao Xi looked at her back and curled her lips. Who didn’t know what she was thinking with her nervous and guilty appearance? Did Miss He treat her as an idiot?","After a while, He Wenyin walked over with a glass of water and handed it to Qiao Xi with a smile.","In the living room on the other side, He Wenxian glanced at the garden outside the window through the glass and told Gu Zheng what she had prepared. Gu Zheng’s expression was very calm when he heard all this.","Seeing that Gu Zheng did not react, He Wenxian felt a little uneasy. “Ah Zheng?”","Song Shijing said, “Our president will take into consideration the He family’s thoughts. Miss He, it’s getting late. I’ll send you off.”","He Wenxian smiled and nodded. She looked outside out of the corners of her eyes and clearly saw He Wenyin take something out of her bag. Then, she hurriedly handed a glass of water to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi took it and downed it in one gulp without any warning. A trace of surprise flashed across He Wenxian’s eyes. She actually drank it obediently? Could it be that Mrs. Gu was only good-looking but very stupid?","He Wenxian looked at the time and said goodbye to Gu Zheng enthusiastically. Then, she stood at the door and waited for Gu Zheng. The two of them walked out of the living room one after another and came to the garden in the backyard.","As soon as she reached the garden, she asked angrily, “Wenyin, what did you put in Mrs. Gu’s water? Mrs. Gu, are you okay?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed as he hurriedly walked to Qiao Xi’s side.","Five minutes ago, He Wenyin came back with a glass of water. Qiao Xi took the glass and sniffed it carefully. He Wenyin, who was at the side, said arrogantly, “Drink this glass of water and take it as you’ve accepted my apology. I won’t cause trouble for you in the future.”","Qiao Xi had a body that was immune to all poisons. Ordinary poisons were ineffective on her, so she was not worried that He Wenyin would poison her. It was just that she did not expect this young lady to actually put such a thing in the glass!","Her expression was a little mysterious. She picked up the glass and hesitated for a moment before asking meaningfully, “Miss He, are you sure you won’t trouble me anymore as long as I drink this?”","He Wenyin looked at her. “Yes! And you have to finish it in one gulp!”","Qiao Xi looked at the slightly yellow water and sniffed it. She already knew what was going on. She originally thought that He Wenyin was like her sister, a seemingly gentle but vicious woman. She did not expect He Wenyin to be truly pure and kind!","He Wenyin was so angry that her face had turned red. Even if she was innocent, Qiao Xi felt that she could at least put some medicine in the water that would make her have rashes or diarrhea. She did not expect that after such a long time, He Wenyi would put such a thing in the water instead.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and looked at the bitter ginseng in the glass with an indescribable expression."]},{"number":1214,"title":"Chapter 1214 Killing Two Birds With One Stone","paragraphs":["1214 Killing Two Birds With One Stone","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi glanced at He Wenyin with a sympathetic and amused expression. If this young lady knew that she had no taste buds and could drink anything like it was water, would she explode in anger?","Qiao Xi picked up the cup and finished the bitter ginseng drink in one gulp. She turned the cup upside down and gestured to He Wenyin. She had already finished it. She showed no expression from beginning to end.","Such a calm appearance stunned He Wenyin. She was stunned for a long time before hurriedly picking up Qiao Xi’s glass to take a look. She then looked at the floor to confirm that Qiao Xi had really drunk the contents of the glass. Then, she asked with a shocked expression, “You drank it all. You didn’t show a reaction at all?”","She had been mischievous since primary school. She liked to think about teasing people the most. She was the one who concocted this bitter ginseng powder. She had drunk a mouthful of it, and her entire body was trembling. However, this woman actually finished an entire glass without any reaction.","Qiao Xi calmly glanced at He Wenyin and said casually, “Only a little girl like you will find it bitter. I’m already a mature woman.”","He Wenyin’s expression froze. “Who are you calling a little girl?!”","She approached Qiao Xi and suddenly smelled something. She did not notice that Mrs. Gu actually smelled strongly of medicine.","He Wenyin was the second daughter of the He family. She usually interacted with many socialites and noblewomen. Those women smelled of expensive perfume, but this Mrs. Gu looked and dressed exquisitely. She even smelled of medicine.","Was she sick? But it didn’t look like it!","After thinking about it, there was only one possibility. Mrs. Gu was a doctor and often used medicine, so her body carried a faint medicinal fragrance. Ordinary people would not be able to smell it, and only people who practiced medicine all year round would notice it.","He Wenyin stuck her head out and sniffed Qiao Xi’s side. The smell on her body was very similar to her master, Mr. Liao.","Mr. Liao was an elder of the Medical Association and had taken her in as his disciple a few years ago. She had been hiding this from the He family. Mrs. Gu smelled of medicine, and it was similar to the smell on her master’s body. Could she also be Mr. Liao’s disciple?","Mrs. Gu drank an entire glass of bitter ginseng but did not show any reaction. It seemed that her medical skills were above hers. She might have become a disciple earlier than her. In other words, had she offended her senior?","“Miss He, I’ve already drunk it. Remember what you just said.” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and looked at her.","He Wenyin gritted her teeth. “You’re also Master’s—”","Before she could finish, He Wenxian’s angry voice came from behind. “He Wenyin!”","He Wenyin quickly turned around and saw that her sister’s eyes were filled with anger. She rushed over and snatched the glass from her hand. When she realized that the glass of water was empty, she frowned.","“He Wenyin, what did you give Mrs. Gu to drink?”","As soon as she said this, the surrounding temperature dropped a few degrees. Gu Zheng’s entire body emitted a biting coldness. Before He Wenyin could react, a few bodyguards rushed over and restrained her.","This scene stunned Qiao Xi. She raised her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng. Before she could speak, He Wenxian’s angry voice sounded in her ear. “Wenyin, what did I tell you just now? I told you not to anger Mrs. Gu and to respect her, but what did you do? You actually poisoned Mrs. Gu with the medicine you developed!”","He Wenxian looked really angry, and her body was trembling. She could not help but glance at Qiao Xi. She did not expect her plan to be completed so smoothly. Moreover, all of this was done by He Wenyin and had nothing to do with her.","When the time came, in order to give Gu Zheng an explanation, the He family would definitely hand He Wenyin over to Gu Zheng to deal with. Not only would they get rid of Mrs. Gu, but they would also chase He Wenyin out of the family. This was a plan to kill two birds with one stone.","He Wenyin’s background was unknown, but she had been the second daughter of the He family for so many years. He Wenxian had already endured it for so long. Now, she could finally chase He Wenyin out. And that b*tch, Qiao Xi, was clearly a wild girl. She actually married Gu Zheng for no reason. She must have used some despicable methods.","He Wenxian knew very well that there were naturally many women around a man like Gu Zheng, but she did not care. Those women were all passersby and could not marry Gu Zheng. However, Qiao Xi was actually sitting in the position she had dreamed of.","She would not allow it!","Coincidentally, she seized this opportunity to use He Wenyin to poison Qiao Xi. As long as Qiao Xi was disfigured, Gu Zheng would hate her and abandon her. She did not have to bear any responsibility for getting rid of two annoying people."]},{"number":1215,"title":"Chapter 1215 Depends On Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["1215 Depends On Mrs. Gu","He Wenxian hid the joy in her heart and ordered, “Wenyin! Quickly take out the antidote!”","Her voice trembled slightly, and it was filled with a trace of helplessness. There seemed to be nothing wrong with severely teaching her sister a lesson, but Qiao Xi saw a trace of something else in her eyes.","He Wenxian’s eyes flashed with schadenfreude and excitement.","Hearing her reprimand, He Wenyin panicked. She had indeed put something in Qiao Xi’s water, but it was not poison! But now, everyone seemed to have misunderstood her! It was just bitter ginseng water. Not only was it harmless to the body, but it also had the effect of reducing heat and stopping bleeding.","She clearly didn’t poison her. How could there be an antidote?","He Wenxian frowned and turned to look at Gu Zheng. With a guilty expression, she said, “Ah Zheng, I’m sorry. The He family will give you and Mrs. Gu an explanation for this matter. Wenyin has always been willful and likes to develop strange medicine. Previously, she said that she hated Mrs. Gu’s face. She might have already poisoned Mrs. Gu, so it’s better to quickly invite a doctor over to prevent harm to Mrs. Gu’s body.”","When He Wenyin heard this, she panicked. “Sister, I didn’t poison her!”","“Shut up! You’ve already done it. Don’t you dare admit it?” He Wenxian did not give her a chance to speak at all. She apologized, “Ah Zheng, Wenyin’s medicine is extremely poisonous. It’ll flare up soon. It’s better to quickly call a doctor for treatment!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. Song Shijing immediately reacted. “President, I’ll call the doctor.”","The next second, Gu Zheng walked up to Qiao Xi and protected her in his arms. His cold gaze swept across the two of them as he said coldly, “Scram!”","He Wenyin’s face was filled with fear and grievance. “I didn’t—”","“Wenyin!” He Wenxian scolded angrily and interrupted her. Now that the plan had been completed, she could not give He Wenyin a chance to defend herself. Otherwise, Gu Zheng’s anger would quickly burn her.","“Even at this point, are you still thinking of exonerating yourself? If Mrs. Gu’s face is disfigured, how will you explain it to Ah Zheng? The He family will also pay the price for your rashness! Do you still think of the He family?”","When they heard that the poison could disfigure one’s face, Song Shiyu and the butler could not remain calm. If Young Madam was really poisoned and disfigured, would the president kill He Wenyin in a fit of anger?","He Wenxian said gently, “Mrs. Gu, I apologize to you on Wenyin’s behalf. No matter what, I’ll be responsible for this to the end. I’ll stay in Longwan Residential to take care of you—”","“Miss He, I said get lost. Don’t you understand?” Before she could finish speaking, Gu Zheng interrupted her coldly.","He Wenxian thought that Gu Zheng had decided to let He Wenyin off on account of their past relationship, so she told He Wenyin to get lost. However, since He Wenyin had offended Gu Zheng, the He family naturally would not let her stay.","In order to atone for He Wenyin’s sins, she could ask to stay in Longwan Residential. She wanted to see Qiao Xi’s disfigurement with her own eyes and also get the chance to get close to Gu Zheng. However, she did not expect Gu Zheng to ask her to get lost too.","He Wenxian’s face flushed due to awkwardness, and she adjusted her expression. “Ah Zheng, I’ll immediately inform my family about this. The He family will send an apology soon. I’ll also persuade Wenyin to take out the antidote.","“Mrs. Gu, I’m sorry. If you want to punish Wenyin, our He family will definitely not stop you. If you have any requests, we’ll try our best to satisfy them.”","The surroundings instantly fell silent. After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi suddenly chuckled. Her expression was mysterious, and her eyes were filled with ridicule. “Miss He.”","He Wenxian took a few steps closer. Her tight dress perfectly outlined her figure. Her chestnut curly hair made her look flirtatious, and she exuded the beauty of a mature woman.","Qiao Xi asked casually, “If I want to punish He Wenyin, you won’t stop me?”","He Wenxian looked at He Wenyin coldly and pretended to be sad and helpless. She gritted her teeth and said, “It’s all up to you, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “What if I want to destroy her face? After all, she poisoned me just now. It’s not too much for me to do that, right?”","When He Wenyin heard this, she shouted in panic, “Are you crazy? What I gave you just now was clearly—” ‘Bitter ginseng water!’","The bodyguard at the side covered her mouth. Qiao Xi ignored her and continued to look at He Wenxian coldly. “Miss He, do you have any objections?”","He Wenxian looked at her sister reluctantly and took a deep breath. As if she had no choice but to give up her sister for the sake of the family, she said sadly, “If doing this will appease you, our He family won’t have any objections. Even if you wish to kill her, we’ll agree.”"]},{"number":1216,"title":"Chapter 1216 Miss He, Do You Want Bitter Ginseng Water?","paragraphs":["1216 Miss He, Do You Want Bitter Ginseng Water?","“Kill her? She’s your sister! Miss He, are you willing to let me kill her to vent my anger?” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile as her sharp gaze descended on He Wenxian.","“Of course, I can’t bear to, but since she did something wrong, she has to bear all the responsibility. We’re willing to hand Wenyin over to you to deal with. I just hope you won’t take your anger out on the He family. After all, the family is innocent.”","Although He Wenxian said that, she could actually tell from Qiao Xi’s eyes that she didn’t want to kill He Wenyin. Sure enough, a moment later, Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said, “Miss He, murder is against the law. I don’t want to commit a crime.”","He Wenxian heaved a sigh of relief. She looked at He Wenyin sadly and said gently, “Wenyin, you have to be punished for your mistake. It doesn’t matter if you’re disfigured. I’ll take care of you in the future.”","“Heh...” Qiao Xi smiled with a subtle expression. “Miss He, I’m very curious. How are you so sure that He Wenyin poisoned me?”","He Wenxian’s expression changed drastically. Of course, she was sure because she was the one who put the medicine in He Wenyin’s bag. But why was Qiao Xi asking this?","She was afraid that she would be exposed, so she pretended to be worried. “Mrs. Gu, I’m not certain, but I know Wenyin. She has been willful and mischievous since she was young. She would drug someone whenever she was unhappy. You should quickly see a doctor to prevent the poison from entering your body...”","“Second Miss He did put something in the water I drank,” Qiao Xi said indifferently. “But it’s not poison. She just gave me a glass of bitter ginseng water. It can prevent heatiness in the body. Miss He, do you want to drink it?”","The crowd fell silent.","He Wenyin nodded frantically and broke free from the bodyguard’s grip. She shouted, “That’s right! I just gave her something bitter!”","The excitement in He Wenxian’s eyes instantly dissipated. The expression on her face suddenly stiffened as she took two steps back in disbelief.","Qiao Xi leaned back in her rocking chair and raised her eyes lazily. The corners of her mouth carried a trace of ridicule. “Why would Miss He think that He Wenyin poisoned me?”","“Sister! I didn’t poison her. Why did you accuse me?” He Wenyin looked aggrieved.","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with resentment and unwillingness. She calmed down for a few seconds before smiling. “It was just bitter ginseng water? Then it’s fine! I thought Wenyin was being willful again. Fortunately, it was just a glass of bitter ginseng water. Mrs. Gu, I’m really sorry for scaring you!","“Wenyin, you’re so naughty. Why did you give Mrs. Gu bitter ginseng water? You scared me to death. I thought you gave her—”","“Miss He, there’s something I don’t understand.” Qiao Xi interrupted her. “He Wenyin and I did have some quarrels, but you’ve been in the living room all this time. You shouldn’t have heard us. Why do you insist that she wanted me to be disfigured?”","He Wenxian instantly became nervous.","“Even if He Wenyin wants to harm me, there are many options. Why did it have to be disfigurement medicine? Why are you so sure that she even has this medicine? Moreover, this is Gu Zheng’s territory. Even if He Wenyin is stupid, she can’t possibly poison me under Gu Zheng’s nose. After all, if anything happens to me today, she’ll definitely not be able to walk out of this door.”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up, and he did not hide his killing intent at all.","He Wenxian’s heart skipped a beat, but her expression was still calm. She replied gently, “I was just guessing. Because Wenyin previously developed that poison and said that she hated your face, I was afraid that she would use this poison on you. It turns out that I was overthinking. WEnyin, you won’t blame me, right?","“Mrs. Gu, I was doing it for your own good. I was afraid that Wenyin would cause trouble and hurt you. If you’re injured, Ah Zheng will definitely be sad. That’s why I reprimanded Wenyin so agitatedly. I hope you won’t take offense. I’ll send someone to send an apology. Please forgive Wenyin.”","He Wenyin’s words were very professional. She got so agitated because she was afraid that Gu Zheng would be sad. She reprimanded He Wenyin for Qiao Xi’s own good.","This matter had nothing to do with her to begin with, yet she was still willing to give Qiao Xi an apology, making her look like a well-mannered young lady.","“Mrs. Gu, Ah Zheng and I are just friends. Don’t think too much about it. I care about Ah Zheng and the reputation of the He family. That’s why I lost my composure and embarrassed myself in front of you.”","No one could find fault with He Wenxian’s words, but Qiao Xi felt that such a person was terrifying.","“I don’t need you to care,” Gu Zheng said coldly.","He Wenxian turned around and looked at him. The cold and handsome young man from before had become an outstanding man who was all-powerful in business. The person standing beside Gu Zheng was supposed to be her."]},{"number":1217,"title":"Chapter 1217 Give Her A Big Gift","paragraphs":["1217 Give Her A Big Gift","In the past, the He family thought that Gu Zheng was just an illegitimate child who was struggling at death’s door under the Gu family’s suppression. No one expected him to actually establish Gu Corporation in Li City and become the business emperor everyone admired.","Actually, she had always liked Gu Zheng. The aura this man exuded fascinated her, but because he was an illegitimate son, she had never expressed her feelings. Now that she was finally back, Gu Zheng had become distant.","Gu Zheng’s voice was low and calm. “I’m not familiar with you, Miss He. You don’t have to worry about me. There’s no need.”","He Wenxian’s heart ached, and her eyes were filled with sadness.","“Come here.” Qiao Xi waved at He Wenyin. When He Wenyin saw Qiao Xi’s face, she could not resist. Regardless of the current situation, her body could not help but walk up to Qiao Xi. She stammered, “W-What’s wrong?”","“I’ll give you a gift.” Qiao Xi’s tone was gentle.","He Wenyin turned around and looked at He Wenxian as if she was asking for her sister’s approval. He Wenxian naturally smiled and nodded. “Wenyin, it seems that Mrs. Gu likes you very much. Just accept the gift from Mrs. Gu. You must thank her properly.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and ignored her. Instead, she brought He Wenyin into the house and took out a report from her bag. “Give this to your master.”","He Wenyin took it and saw what was on it. Her eyes widened. This report was the research data of a new drug. She and her master had been studying it for a long time, but they had yet to confirm the ratio of the drug. The report in front of her contained detailed experimental data and the specific operation method.","Before He Wenyin could react, Qiao Xi stuffed another jade token into her hands. “Give this to Mr. Liao too.”","He Wenyin took a closer look. This was actually the Medical Order of the Medical Association. Only the core members of the Medical Association were qualified to get it. She asked in shock, “Why is Master’s jade token with you? Y-You...”","“Of course, it’s because he lent it to me, so this report is my thank-you gift.”","He Wenyin flipped through the report excitedly and jumped up. “Mrs. Gu, you’re too outstanding!”","Qiao Xi smiled. It turned out that this woman was Mr. Liao’s disciple. She couldn’t help but ask, “He Wenyin, do you know what would’ve happened to you had you really poisoned me?”","He Wenyin’s eyes widened. “How could I have poisoned you?”","Qiao Xi said, “But your sister said that you used to poison people. She said that you were jealous of my beauty, so that’s why she guessed that you poisoned me. Why would she think that?”","He Wenyin frowned and said in a low voice, “It’s probably because Sister has been too tired recently, so...”","Qiao Xi really did not understand why Mr. Liao would take an innocent little girl as his disciple. She did not want to say anything else and turned to leave.","“Wait a minute!” He Wenyin shouted. “Actually, I know you’re giving me a reminder, but this is my business. Anyway, thank you. I’ll be careful.”","Qiao Xi smiled. After she and Gu Zheng left, He Wenyin walked up to He Wenxian.","He Wenxian was still gentle. “Wenyin, I’ve already talked to Ah Zheng. This time, he won’t open a back door for the He family, but he won’t make things difficult for us either. I’m already very satisfied with this.","“We’ve only been away for a few years, but Ah Zheng is already married. Do you still remember how you used to follow behind Ah Zheng? Do you feel terrible when you see Mrs. Gu now?”","The look in He Wenyin’s eyes changed. She lowered her head and said, “I don’t feel bad anymore. Sister, you don’t have to comfort me.”","“Yes, Wenyin, you’re so obedient. I was just afraid that you would make a mistake on impulse. I misunderstood you today. It’s better for me to rush up and reprimand you than for Ah Zheng to punish you personally, right? Can you understand my intentions?”","He Wenyin: “...”","She had a secret, so she couldn’t leave the He family yet. Hence, she hesitated for a moment and smiled innocently. “I understand, Sister. You’re so good to me.”","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with contempt. What a fool. She managed to deceive He Wenyin with just a few words. A bastard of unknown origin wanted to occupy the identity of a daughter of the He family. Was she worthy?","In the living room.","The butler went forward and reported, “President, Madam, the two misses from the He family have left.”","Gu Zheng gestured for him to leave, then raised his eyebrows and looked at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, don’t you have anything to ask?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up into a sly smile. “Ah Zheng, I heard that you used to have a close relationship with the He family. Second Miss He has loved you since you were young. The He family even said that they would let her grow up and marry you! Is that true?”"]},{"number":1218,"title":"Chapter 1218 This Girl Has Good Acting Skills","paragraphs":["1218 This Girl Has Good Acting Skills","“Xi Xi, are you very curious about it?” Gu Zheng’s tone was teasing.","Back then, He Wenyin was only a child in her early 10s. Under He Wenxian’s instigation, she naturally had a good impression of Gu Zheng. This was not surprising.","However, He Wenyin’s words caused a ripple in Qiao Xi’s heart.","Could this girl be pretending to be innocent? If it was true, then He Wenyin’s acting skills were really good. Even she was deceived!","Although He Wenyin did not say it explicitly, her words meant that she knew everything. She thanked Qiao Xi for her reminder, but she did not want others to interfere.","In that case, He Wenyin was not a brainless fool. There must be a reason why she was pretending to be like that. It seemed that the matter of her liking Gu Zheng was also fake.","Qiao Xi did not want to ask anymore. She would not be jealous of He Wenyin, but He Wenxian was a little difficult to deal with!","...","The next morning, at Gu Corporation.","As the chief designer of Liuli, Qiao Xi represented the company and worked with Gu Corporation, so she went to the company with Gu Zheng. This project was mainly about the cooperation between Gu Corporation and Liuli, but another company needed to participate in it as well.","Gu Corporation and Liuli were both top companies in the industry. It was a great thing to be able to work with these two companies. Hence, as soon as the news spread, more than 10 companies began to compete.","Qiao Xi did not care who Gu Zheng chose. He naturally had his own considerations. She was only in charge of designing. After she and the person in charge of Gu Corporation confirmed the direction of the design, she started to draw designs.","The employees of Gu Corporation might not like the pampered Mrs. Gu, but ever since they found out that she was Gu Shan, they admired her.","“Xi Xi, take a look and see if there’s anything wrong.” The designer of Gu Corporation handed her the design plan.","Qiao Xi had worked at Liuli for so many years and was famous internationally. The designers of Gu Corporation admired her very much, so they would ask for her permission before confirming the design draft.","“Miss He.” At this moment, footsteps came from outside the door. As soon as the designer saw who it was, he immediately went forward to welcome her and greeted her warmly.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look, and her expression instantly turned cold.","“Xi Xi, He Corporation is the partner in the bidding process. Miss He is the person in charge of He Corporation, and this is Miss He’s assistant, Mr. Wang,” the designer introduced. It was not strange for the partner to come to the company to take a look.","They were busy with the design drafts, so they naturally did not have time to pay attention to them. They only gave a brief introduction, thinking that He Wenxian would leave soon. However, the next second, He Wenxian said in surprise, “Mrs. Gu, you’re here too!”","He Wenxian, who was originally arrogant, immediately beamed when she saw Qiao Xi. She was wearing a business suit, and her chestnut curly hair was casually draped over her shoulders. She casually flipped her hair and looked very flirtatious.","He Wenxian walked up to Qiao Xi and said with a smile, “Mrs. Gu, what a coincidence! I actually bumped into you here. Yesterday, I went to Longwan Residential on short notice and didn’t have time to prepare a gift. Since we met today, can I treat you to a meal?","“Coincidentally, there’s a Western restaurant near the company. The desserts there are good. Shall we try them?”","Qiao Xi didn’t even raise her eyes as she replied coldly, “I’m sorry, but I’m very busy.”","He Wenxian was a little surprised. “Mrs. Gu, are you working here?”","The designer explained, “Xi Xi... Mrs. Gu is our chief designer. Miss He, didn’t you know?”","He Wenxian smiled meaningfully and glanced at the assistant beside her. Assistant Wang seemed to have received a signal and said in a low voice, “Miss, don’t forget what the chairman said. It’s better to tell them.”","He Wenxian hesitated and smiled helplessly. “It’s okay.”","Assistant Wang looked troubled. “But... before you came, the chairman specially instructed us to withdraw from the project if the jewelry collaboration between Liuli and Gu Corporation doesn’t achieve the desired effect.”","Although his voice was very soft, the people nearby could hear him clearly. Everyone’s complexions did not look too good. The He family meant that if they were not good enough, the He family would withdraw from the cooperation.","There were many companies competing this time, but He Group was undoubtedly a special existence. Everyone had heard about their past with the president. If He Group withdrew from the collaboration because of their ability, would they still be able to stay in Gu Corporation?","Everyone was flustered. He Wenxian smiled embarrassedly. Then, she turned around and reprimanded Assistant Wang, “Don’t talk nonsense. The designers of Gu Corporation must be very outstanding. Mrs. Gu is only here to help. It won’t affect the final product.”"]},{"number":1219,"title":"Chapter 1219 Those Who Are Here To Make Up The Numbers","paragraphs":["1219 Those Who Are Here To Make Up The Numbers","He Wenxian smiled helplessly at everyone. “Everyone, I’m really sorry. My assistant doesn’t have any ill intentions. He just doesn’t want some people to be here just to make up the numbers and have it ruin the final outcome. After all, everyone has been working hard for so long...”","Everyone gasped and subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi. One of the young designers could not stand He Wenxian’s arrogance and was about to go forward to argue when he was stopped by his colleague beside him.","No matter what, He Wenxian was from He Corporation. Designers like them could not offend her, so this matter could only be handed to Mrs. Gu to handle herself.","Qiao Xi threw down the pen in her hand and lazily leaned against the table. She crossed her arms and asked casually, “Miss He, am I the person you’re talking about?”","The office was even quieter now. Everyone seemed to have stopped breathing.","He Wenxian did not panic at all and smiled gently. “Mrs. Gu, I’m not targeting you. I just didn’t expect you to come to the company today.”","“So you admit that I’m just here to make up the numbers, Miss He?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were sharp as she looked coldly at her.","He Wenxian hurriedly explained, “Mrs. Gu, I’m not...”","Before she could finish speaking, Assistant Wang stood up to defend her against the injustice. “Eldest Miss, you’re just telling the truth! Why are you afraid of her?! A rich madam should be drinking tea at home and admiring the flowers, but she insisted on coming to Gu Corporation to design clothes. What good things can she design?! If the things she designs aren’t good, not only will it affect He Corporation’s collaboration but it’ll also ruin Liuli and Gu Corporation’s reputation!”","His voice was not loud, but the surrounding people could hear him. The design director frowned unhappily. The first time she found out that Qiao Xi was Gu Shan, she was very surprised. After all, Qiao Xi was only 20 years old and had such achievements at such a young age. It was enough to prove how much effort she had put into in designing.","The He family had yet to officially become a partner of Gu Corporation, yet they were already so arrogant. They were criticizing Mrs. Gu for not knowing how to design. When did outsiders have the right to interfere in Gu Corporation’s family matters?","The design director was just about to retort when he heard Qiao Xi chuckle. “So, Miss He, you think that I’m relying on my identity as Mrs. Gu to fool around in Gu Corporation, and the design department has no choice but to let me join because of my identity? You’re afraid that my designs won’t be good and will affect Gu Corporation’s reputation, right?”","He Wenxian’s tone was still calm. “Mrs. Gu, I really don’t have any ill intentions. I just think that the matter of designing is no small matter. If you’d like to work in Gu Corporation, you can go to other departments. Actually, I don’t care about this, but I’m afraid outsiders will gossip.”","“Oh?” Qiao Xi sneered. “Then where do you think I should go, Miss He? Can you help me arrange it?”","The design director at the side said angrily, “Miss He, Mrs. Gu is a designer in charge of supervising us!”","Assistant Wang said disdainfully, “It’s just a title. It’s not strange for President Gu to arrange a position for Mrs. Gu. The specific design issues will still be decided by the design director.”","He Wenxian pretended to be unhappy and glared at her assistant. Then, she smiled helplessly. “Mrs. Gu...”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and asked meaningfully, “Miss He, since you can represent He Corporation to discuss business, why can’t I be in charge here? Perhaps your job is just a title given to you too. It’s not strange for the He family to arrange a position for you, Eldest Miss He. The company’s specific matters still have to be decided by the president.”","She imitated Assistant Wang’s tone, and the assistant instantly retorted unhappily, “How can you be the same as Eldest Miss? She’s a top student and has always been in charge of the He family’s business, while you...”","“Shut up!” The design director could not take it anymore. She was a higher-up in Gu Corporation, so He Wenxian had to show her some respect. If He Corporation became a partner, this design director would be in charge of the subsequent docking.","Seeing that the design director was angry, He Wenxian hurriedly turned around and shot the assistant a look. Then, she said gently, “Director Liu, calm down. I’ve spoiled my assistant too much, so she’s a little straightforward. Mrs. Gu must be really talented to be able to enter the design department...”","“Miss He, that’s not what you meant just now. Who here can’t tell?” The design director was furious. He was not afraid of offending He Wenxian. “Aren’t you beating about the bush just to say that Mrs. Gu relied on President Gu to enter the design department and doesn’t have the ability at all?”"]},{"number":1220,"title":"Chapter 1220 Meeting Her Soulmate","paragraphs":["1220 Meeting Her Soulmate","“If you weren’t the daughter of the He family, could you be the general manager of He Corporation with your ability? Since you relied on your family’s power to get to where you are today, what right do you have to criticize others? Miss He, you look down on others so much. I really doubt the sincerity of your He family,” the design director questioned.","He Wenxian’s expression changed. Wasn’t this group of people standing up for Qiao Xi because she was Gu Zheng’s wife? If she hadn’t married Gu Zheng, who would give her face?","Hearing the director’s mockery, He Wenxian was not angry. She still smiled and said, “Director Liu, all these years, I’ve been the general manager of He Corporation overseas. I’ve also received the recognition of the entire company...”","The design director sneered. “Miss He, you’re too confident. To put it bluntly, He Corporation hasn’t been doing well all these years. If it weren’t for Chairman He and Mr. He, the company would’ve gone bankrupt a long time ago. You’ve indeed been the general manager for a few years, but have you made any achievements? You’re clearly not capable, yet you look down on Gu Shan. Miss He, you’re so arrogant. Well then, you can be the designer!”","After he finished speaking, the design director walked to Qiao Xi’s side and looked at He Wenxian with an icy-cold expression. “Miss He, since you’re prepared to collaborate with Gu Corporation, you should’ve done some investigations, right? Could it be that you don’t know who Gu Shan is?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi saw the two figures outside the door. She could not help but smile. He Wenyin was actually here too.","At this moment, Gu Zheng stopped at the door. He had no intentions of entering, Instead, he lowered his eyes and glanced at the innocent-looking young lady beside him. “Second Miss He, I’ve underestimated you.”","He Wenyin smiled innocently. “Brother Ah Zheng, I don’t understand what you mean! Why do you think my sister is making things difficult for Mrs. Gu? Mrs. Gu is so beautiful. How can she bear to do this to Mrs. Gu? Look at how she’s bullying Mrs. Gu. Hurry up and stand up for her.”","Song Shiyu’s mouth twitched: “...”","Why did he feel that Second Miss He’s style was very similar to Young Madam’s? One liked to pretend to be weak, while the other liked to pretend to be innocent.","Gu Zheng curled his lips. He Wenyin specially came to see him and even lured him to the design department. She wanted him to see He Wenxian make things difficult for Xi Xi and make him completely cut off all contact with He Corporation.","It had to be said that her plan was very ingenious. When they passed by the design department, they happened to hear He Wenxian accuse Mrs. Gu of making up the numbers.","Qiao Xi looked at the two people outside the door with narrowed eyes. He Wenyin was a little similar to her! It was like she had finally met her soulmate!","At this moment, in the office, He Wenxian’s expression changed drastically. Of course, she knew Gu Shan and understood what the design director meant. She was saying that Mrs. Gu was the internationally renowned designer, Gu Shan!","She had heard of Gu Shan and had always thought that she was a middle-aged woman in her 30s or 40s. Unexpectedly, she was actually a young lady like Qiao Xi!","Director Liu glanced at He Wenxian and saw the shock and unwillingness in her eyes. Director Liu said disdainfully, “If you can design a piece that’s more perfect than Xi Xi’s, we’ll naturally listen to your guidance. If you can’t, please leave and don’t disturb our work.","“This is Gu Corporation, not He Corporation. Miss He, if you want to show off, feel free to go home. Forgive us for not going along with your whims!”","Qiao Xi smiled. This design director was indeed a good man. Every word he said slapped He Wenxian hard in the face.","He Wenxian’s expression was heavy, and her eyes were filled with shock. Then, her face showed surprise. “Mrs. Gu, you’re actually the famous Gu Shan! I’ve always liked the clothes you designed. I’ve been wanting to have a chance to meet you. I didn’t expect my wish to be fulfilled so quickly.”","Previously, she had always thought that Qiao Xi was just a vase. Now, it seemed that she did have some ability. No wonder Ah Zheng decided to marry her.","He Wenxian’s eyes revealed a trace of forbearance. No matter how angry and unwilling she was, she could not fall out with Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, I’m really sorry. I misunderstood just now.”","Qiao Xi didn’t even raise her eyes, and her expression was slightly impatient.","Outside the office, He Wenyin was like an ignorant girl as she explained anxiously, “Brother Ah Zheng, don’t be angry. Sister has always hated people who got in through the back door and used higher-ups in the company as a stepping stone. That’s why she said the wrong thing this time. She didn’t mean to target Mrs. Gu.”","Gu Zheng snorted. It was obvious that he did not believe He Wenyin’s words."]},{"number":1221,"title":"Chapter 1221 Disqualifying He Corporation","paragraphs":["1221 Disqualifying He Corporation","He Wenyin’s tone was a little arrogant. “Actually, Sister didn’t say anything. It’s all because that assistant doesn’t respect Mrs. Gu. You have to believe that our He family is sincere to you. Moreover, the He family was kind to you back then. All these years, my father has been thinking about you. You can’t suspect Dad and Sister!”","Gu Zheng glanced at her meaningfully.","Song Shijing: “...”","Second Miss He brought the president here so that he could see He Wenxian’s actions. Then, Second Miss He pushed all the responsibility to He Wenxian’s assistant, making the president think that the He family was shirking responsibility and would only push the blame on their subordinates. Then, she mentioned the He family and reminded the president that the He family was his benefactor.","How was this persuasion? She was clearly trying to anger the president and make him attack the He family!","Gu Zheng looked up, his eyes filled with sharpness. He pushed the door open and walked into the office.","He Wenyin did not know if her plan would succeed. Just as Song Shijing was about to follow Gu Zheng in, she grabbed Song Shijing and smiled at him. “Assistant Song, please remember that the He family is Brother Ah Zheng’s benefactor. I’ll go over now.”","Song Shijing: “...”","Second Miss He was really slandering the He family! However, why was she doing this? Was she deliberately angering the president so that he would completely hate the He family?","But wasn’t she the second daughter of the He family? Why would she do something that would harm her family when it would bring no benefit to herself?","Song Shijing looked at He Wenyin meaningfully and asked her to enter first before following her in.","In the office, He Wenxian was about to explain when she suddenly heard footsteps. When she turned around, her heart trembled.","“President.” The design director brought many designers forward to greet him.","Gu Zheng nodded and looked at Qiao Xi who was not far away. He asked in a doting tone, “Xi Xi, are you unhappy?”","Qiao Xi looked at He Wenyin who was behind him and said casually, “Someone said that I’m just here to make up the numbers. They even said that they don’t want to work with someone like me who got in through the back door. How could I be happy?”","Gu Zheng ordered immediately, “Song Shijing, disqualify He Corporation.”","The moment that was said, He Wenxian’s expression changed. She hurriedly said, “President Gu, it’s my fault, but this has nothing to do with He Corporation. I’ve already apologized to Mrs. Gu...”","“How is it unrelated? Miss He, you’re the general manager of He Corporation. Your words and actions represent He Corporation,” one of the designers said sarcastically. “A mere assistant of the He family dares to offend Mrs. Gu like this. If the He family hadn’t agreed to his behavior, would he have dared to do this?”","Director Liu also echoed, “He Corporation hasn’t even become a partner yet, yet they’re already questioning the person in charge of the project, Miss Gu Shan. If we really collaborate in the future, I don’t know what will happen. We have many options for third-party companies. Everyone’s ability is similar, so what we value the most is cooperation. Naturally, we have to choose a company where both parties will be happy.”","He Wenxian’s expression gradually darkened. Her mind was a mess. The moment she heard Gu Zheng give the order, her heart turned cold. The originally calm and composed eldest daughter of the He family was at a loss.","At this moment, her phone suddenly rang. She looked at the caller ID, and her expression suddenly changed. After bidding farewell to Gu Zheng, she left in a panic.","Song Shijing leaned over to Gu Zheng’s ear and said in a low voice, “President, the He family seems to have found out about it.”","Gu Zheng nodded and looked up at He Wenyin.","He Wenyin met his cold eyes and hurriedly turned around to shout, “Sister! I’ll go with you!”","Then, she said indignantly, “Gu Zheng, don’t forget that our He family has done you a favor. This project should be handed to He Corporation to handle. Now that you no longer find us useful, you’re burning bridges! You’re really too heartless! I’ll go home and tell my father now!”","She was angering Gu Zheng again, but Gu Zheng was expressionless as if he did not hear her.","Two hours later, Qiao Xi finished editing the last design draft. She followed Gu Zheng back to the president’s office and entered. Qiao Xi asked, “Do you think the He sisters are very interesting?”","Gu Zheng smirked. “Yes, they’re interesting, especially Second Miss He.”","“Yeah! If she hadn’t lured you over, how would you know that I was bullied?” Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and stretched her arm.","Gu Zheng sat beside her, his eyes filled with amusement. “He Wenxian and He Wenyin came to Gu Corporation together, but He Wenxian let He Wenyin wander around alone. Unexpectedly, she went straight to the president’s office and was caught by the bodyguards. When the bodyguards wanted to chase her out, He Wenyin clamored to see me. She even hugged Song Shijing and refused to let go."]},{"number":1222,"title":"Chapter 1222 Suspecting He Wenyin","paragraphs":["1222 Suspecting He Wenyin","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. He Wenyin was really using all kinds of methods to achieve her goal. She was really capable.","Gu Zheng continued, “Not only that, but she also shouted near the president’s office that the He family has done me a favor. If I didn’t see her, I’d be heartless. After I agreed to let her in, she asked me to bring her around Gu Corporation and even deliberately lured me to the design department. I knew that she had a plan, so I followed her wishes to the design department. I happened to see He Wenxian and her assistant criticizing you.”","Qiao Xi knew that He Wenyin had deliberately lured Gu Zheng to the design department, but it was not easy to get the timing right. How could she be sure that Gu Zheng would agree? Moreover, she even knew that He Wenxian would criticize her at that time.","He Wenyin was not a simple character!","...","In the He family’s villa.","Gu Zheng disqualified the He family from the competition. Now, everyone in He Corporation knew about it. When Song Shijing called to inform them, they were in a high-level meeting. Song Shijing’s call was displayed on the big screen, and everyone heard his words.","“Chairman He, I regret to inform you that after Miss He Wenxian publicly accused Mrs. Gu of fooling around with the project design and interfering in Gu Corporation’s internal affairs, President Gu got very angry and revoked He Corporation’s right to compete.”","When Chairman He heard this, he immediately called He Wenxian to ask her to return to the company.","When He Wenxian returned, Chairman He Weinian was standing by the window with a gloomy expression. Beside him was He Wenxian’s brother, He Tingchen, who was now the president of He Corporation.","He Wenyin walked behind her sister. When He Weinian saw her, a glint flashed across his eyes. He casually looked away and looked at He Wenxian. He said calmly, “Wenxian, what happened today?”","When He Weinian asked this, He Wenxian was slightly stunned. She did not understand why Gu Zheng would suddenly come to the design department. Moreover, it was such a coincidence that he happened to see her targeting Qiao Xi.","He Weinian’s sharp gaze landed on He Wenyin, and he exuded a cold aura.","He Wenyin pretended not to see it and complained loudly, “Sister isn’t in the wrong at all. It’s clearly Gu Zheng who doesn’t know what’s good for him! Our He family is his benefactor, yet he’s so heartless! And Song Shijing is too annoying. If he hadn’t said that Mrs. Gu was in the design department, Gu Zheng wouldn’t have gone over!”","The three members of the He family sized up He Wenyin as if they suspected her words.","“Moreover, my sister didn’t say anything wrong! Didn’t Mrs. Gu enter the company because of Gu Zheng? If it weren’t for Gu Zheng, would she have been able to become the person in charge? That ingrate, Gu Zheng, has received the He family’s favor but he didn’t give my sister any face at all! Dad! Previously, you even said that you wanted to marry me to Gu Zheng! Now that woman is occupying the position of Mrs. Gu. She seduced Gu Zheng until he forgot about the He family!”","He Weinian’s expression gradually calmed down, and he slowly let down his guard against He Wenyin.","He walked over to He Wenyin and held her hand. He coaxed her softly as if he really doted on his daughter. He smiled affectionately, but his eyes were cold. “Yin Yin, Gu Zheng’s identity is different now. You can’t be as willful as before. Going against him isn’t a good thing for you or our He family. You didn’t suffer today, right?”","He Wenyin snorted. “No, but they made my sister suffer. I was really angry, so I shouted at Gu Zheng in public. He doesn’t take our He family seriously at all. We have to take revenge for my sister. We can’t let this go!”","He Wenxian looked up and sized up He Wenyin, feeling a little puzzled. At that time, He Wenyin and Gu Zheng appeared at the entrance of the design department together. Didn’t she lead Gu Zheng there?","Thinking about it carefully, with He Wenyin’s stupid personality, she would not lie to them.","He Weinian looked at his two daughters and smiled affectionately. “Yin Yin, do you have enough pocket money? Do you want me to give you more? If you have nothing to do, go shopping more often. You don’t have to worry about the company’s matters. You just have to be happy.","“Wenxian, this matter started because of you. No matter what, you have to obtain Gu Zheng’s forgiveness. Prepare to visit and apologize.”","He Wenxian followed He Weinian into the inner room, while He Wenyin skipped out the door after taking the pocket money her father gave her. He Tingchen watched her leave with a frown."]},{"number":1223,"title":"Chapter 1223 His Relationship With The He Family","paragraphs":["1223 His Relationship With The He Family","He Wenyin left the office happily and got into the car. She went to the mall. After getting out of the car, a mall manager was in charge of receiving her. She was surrounded by people. If she took a liking to something, she would order the bodyguards to pay.","Looking at this scene, anyone who saw it would sigh and say that Second Miss He was really favored!","Eldest Miss He had just made a mistake and was being punished in the company. On the other hand, Second Miss He came to the mall to sweep the place. Chairman He was really too biased.","He Wenyin walked to a corner and deliberately avoided everyone’s gazes. She threw the ring on her finger into the trash can.","!!","In the president’s office.","He Weinian and Madam He asked seriously, “Say that again. What happened today?”","He Wenxian was a little down. “Didn’t Yin Yin already explain it?”","“How could you be so rash? She’s Gu Zheng’s wife. Even if you’re dissatisfied, you can’t target her in public, right? Now that the He family has lost their collaboration, how are you going to explain this to the higher-ups of the company?","“Does it have anything to do with you whether that woman is capable or not? You’re the general manager of He Corporation. In the future, you and your brother will be in charge of He Corporation together. How can that woman compare to you? I told you a long time ago that you should try your best to fight for what you want, but you can’t be anxious about quick success. You exposed your thoughts as soon as you returned to the country. Gu Zheng isn’t a fool. He already knows!”","He Weinian reprimanded her angrily, “He Wenxian, immediately prepare an apology. We can give up on this collaboration, but we can’t offend Gu Zheng. We have to let everyone know your sincerity. We have to show Gu Zheng that you weren’t targeting Mrs. Gu. What happened today was just an impulse.","“From now on, you have to remember not to expose your thoughts. You have to plan slowly. I know you want to marry Gu Zheng, so I’ll naturally help you. However, in the end, it all depends on your own ability. Until the last moment, no one can be sure who the position of Mrs. Gu belongs to. Do you understand?”","He Weinian’s eyes were filled with anger. Madam He comforted her softly. “Wenxian, you have to remember that you’re the daughter of the He family. You have a noble status, so why bicker with a wild girl? She’s very popular now. Even if you go against her and become Mrs. Gu, people will naturally stand up for her. You can get as close to her as possible first. It’s best if you become friends with her. This way, everyone will subconsciously compare you two. At that time, they’ll realize that you’re the woman who should be standing beside Gu Zheng.","“You’re the general manager of He Corporation. You and Gu Zheng might have to see each other a lot for work. As long as you don’t expose your thoughts, no one will gossip.”","Madam He’s tone was gentle as she continued, “You’re different from He Wenyin. She’s a bastard of unknown origin. I’m keeping her in the He family to restrain that person. When she’s useless one day, I’ll naturally chase her out of the He family.”","When He Wenxian heard this, she took a deep breath. “Mom, I understand.”","Just as she was about to stand up and leave, she suddenly thought of something. “Dad, Mom, I realized that Mrs. Gu looks very similar to someone. It’s the woman in that old photo.”","He Weinian’s expression changed. “What? She looks like the woman in the photo?","“I’ll go with you tomorrow. I want to see what kind of person Mrs. Gu is!”","...","The next day.","Qiao Xi lay lazily on the rocking chair as she listened to the servant, Xiao Lan, describe the scene. “Young Madam, the second daughter of the He family is really too favored by her family. She casually bought a bag worth more than 100,000 yuan. I heard that she spent millions in the mall in Xin City yesterday! The He family is really good to her!”","Qiao Xi smiled and did not say anything. Were they good to her just because they were letting her spend a lot of money?","She looked at the time, stood up, and followed Gu Zheng into the car to Gu Corporation.","“Mrs. Gu, don’t you want to know about my relationship with the He family?” Gu Zheng asked softly.","Qiao Xi said casually, “The He family and the Meng family are exactly the same. On the one hand, they want to curry favor with Huang Lilan, but on the other hand, they want to help you. That way, no matter which one of you emerges at the top in the future, they’ll still benefit from it.”","“No.” Gu Zheng shook his head. His gaze was calm, and the corners of his mouth curled into a meaningful smile. “Xi Xi, you guessed wrong this time.”","Qiao Xi was interested. From Gu Zheng’s tone, the He family was indeed a very different existence from the Meng family. Since they were different, there must be a special reason. For example, his relationship with Chairman He.","Seeing Qiao Xi’s pensive appearance, Gu Zheng smiled heartily. “Chairman He is my master.”"]},{"number":1224,"title":"Chapter 1224 Master For A Day, Father For Life","paragraphs":["1224 Master For A Day, Father For Life","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “He Weinian is indeed my benefactor. He even has my mother’s token. At that time, he didn’t know that I was the legitimate son of the Gu family, but he promised my mother that he would teach me. He naturally didn’t go back on his word.","“Hence, he didn’t curry favor with Huang Lilan. Instead, when the Gu family was suppressing me, he always helped me. He’s my master, so I grew up with the children of the He family.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. He Weinian was actually asked by Lu Qingyun to take care of Gu Zheng. Moreover, a person who Gu Zheng addressed as ‘Master’ was definitely someone he respected and trusted.","Qiao Xi suddenly recalled that before she met Gu Zheng, she once heard people talk about him. He did not have many friends and was not close to his family. In the entire Li City, there were only a few families who were willing to lend him a helping hand. Other than Ye Qingyuan, who was his closest friend, there was only one family that had always spared no effort to support him. If it were not for that family, perhaps Gu Zheng would not be where he was today.","Although these words were a little exaggerated, it was undeniable that this family had a deep impact on Gu Zheng. It turned out it was actually the He family.","“But...” Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Do you want to ask why we parted ways? Take a guess.”","Qiao Xi thought carefully. At that time, Gu Zheng definitely trusted the He family very much and treated their entire family as his own family. A master for a day was a father for life. He Weinian was his master, so Gu Zheng naturally respected him as much as he respected his father. The sisters of the He family were his childhood playmates, and He Tingchen was his good friend. However, Qiao Xi was able to sense that Gu Zheng had no feelings for the He family and was even slightly disdainful of them.","What exactly happened?","She thought for a long time and said in a cold voice, “The He family betrayed you, right?”","“Yes.” Gu Zheng nodded, his eyes filled with coldness.","Previously, when Lu Yan was blind and Old Master Lu lost his position as the head of the family, she had asked Gu Zheng why he did not react at all. His answer at that time was, “I don’t care about these people at all. Their outcome won’t affect my emotions.”","To Gu Zheng, it was inevitable that the Lu family would end up like this. Those people could not affect him at all, but the He family was different. When Gu Zheng mentioned the He family, his eyes revealed a trace of disdain.","The more emotional he was, the more it meant that the He family was very important to him back then but they were also the ones who had hurt him the most.","When she thought about this, Qiao Xi’s heart ached. The young man who was abandoned by everyone had been struggling at death’s door under the suppression of the Gu family. When someone found him with his mother’s token, it was like a ray of light that illuminated his dark life. He gave the remaining love and trust in his heart to the He family.","To him, He Weinian was his master and father, but such a person had betrayed him. The He family had hurt Gu Zheng greatly. They had torn his heart into pieces.","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “Ever since then, the He family went overseas and never returned to Li City. We never contacted each other again.","Song Shiyu said indignantly, “Young Madam, the He family went overseas to take refuge. They offended many people and their company wasn’t doing well either. Coupled with the fact that they betrayed the president, they should’ve gone bankrupt at that time. It was the president who gave them a sum of money to tide them over.”","Qiao Xi looked at the man beside her, and her heart ached even more. He had clearly been hurt, yet he still went soft-hearted and helped them again.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as if all of this had nothing to do with him.","However, at the thought of this, Song Shiyu was so angry that his face turned red. He could not understand why the He family was so heartless. With the president’s character, he should’ve killed them all after they betrayed him, but the president actually gave them money!","Qiao Xi also understood Gu Zheng’s thoughts. It was a fact that the He family had betrayed him, but it was also a fact that the He family had helped him at his lowest point. He remembered the He family’s kindness, so he gave them a sum of money. He similarly would not forgive them for their betrayal, so from then on, he cut off all contact with the He family.","After the He family left Li City, they went to another city to start afresh. Even with Gu Zheng’s sponsorship, it was still very difficult. It was not easy for the situation to stabilize. Initially, the grudge between the He family and Gu Zheng was resolved with the family’s departure, but they suddenly came back.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as a wave of anger instantly surged into her head. She gritted her teeth and said, “Did the He family come back this time to reconcile with you?”","Back then, they had already decided not to contact each other anymore. However, the He family pretended that nothing had happened and looked for Gu Zheng again. They wanted to use Gu Zheng’s power to establish themselves in Li City once more. What right did they have?"]},{"number":1225,"title":"Chapter 1225 She’s In The President’s Office","paragraphs":["1225 She’s In The President’s Office","Gu Zheng sneered and nodded, but his eyes were red. He did not hide the coldness emanating from his body.","“I’ve already returned the He family’s kindness. We shouldn’t be in contact anymore, but the He family suddenly returned to Li City. They seem to have forgotten about what happened before.”","Gu Zheng knew He Weinian well. He was a true businessman, but he was also a ferocious beast. There must be an important reason for his actions.","At this moment, their car had already stopped at the entrance of Gu Corporation. The staff member saw that Gu Zheng’s car had been parked at the door for some time and thought that it had broken down. He hurriedly went forward and asked warmly, “Mr. Gu, do you need help?”","Qiao Xi glanced at the time. They had actually stayed at the entrance for so long. “Ah Zheng, I’m going to the design department.”","“Xi Xi,” Gu Zheng suddenly said. He grabbed her wrist and instructed softly, “The He family has ill intentions. You have to be careful. But He Wenyin doesn’t have any ill intentions toward us. Instead, she’s filled with hostility toward the He family.”","When Qiao Xi heard his words, the corners of her mouth curled up into a smile before she turned around and left.","As he watched her leave, Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold. He asked, “Have you found out about that?”","Song Shiyu felt the coldness around him and was too scared to say anything. Song Shijing said respectfully, “Not yet, President.”","Gu Zheng’s expression changed. “You can’t find any news of He Weinian from when he was overseas?”","“Yes! I keep having the feeling that there’s a powerful force behind the He family. The other party has erased all news of the He family. I can’t find any clues.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold, scaring Song Shijing so much that he trembled. “President, please give me a little more time. I’ll do my best to search.”","“There’s no need. There’s no point in giving you time.” A cold killing intent burst out of Gu Zheng’s eyes. “I knew He Weinian wouldn’t have come back for no reason.”","...","Qiao Xi entered the design department and found a corner to sit down. She logged into Black Tide’s account. It should be very easy for her to investigate a family. The internal information of Stars was very detailed, but she could not find any useful information after investigating for a long time.","Back then, after He Weinian left Li City, he opened a company overseas. Although his business was not as good as when he was in Li City, it could at least be maintained. Everyone knew that his business overseas had not been optimistic all these years, so he opened a few more companies in the country. Only then did the He family gradually stabilize.","After going overseas, He Weinian arranged for He Tingchen and He Wenxian to continue their studies. After they graduated, they would return to the company to work.","He Weinian had a good reputation outside, and his business partners had a high evaluation of him. He never mistreated the company’s employees, nor was he biased toward his children. The assets were equally divided between He Wenxian and He Tingchen.","The information that could be found on him was all positive, and it was limited. It made people feel that something was wrong.","Qiao Xi knew that this information was true, but she kept having the feeling that this was just what He Weinian wanted others to see. There was more information that was being concealed. Perhaps only the He family knew about it.","He Weinian might not be as good as the rumors said. He might even be a complete villain!","An hour later, Qiao Xi was sitting in the office drawing designs when there was a knock on the door. “Xi Xi, Assistant Song is looking for you.”","Qiao Xi went out and saw Song Shijing waiting for her outside with a frown. As Gu Zheng’s assistant, he had always been calm, but at this moment, he looked extremely embarrassed.","“Young Madam, the He family is here again.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “Why are they here?”","“Uh...” Song Shijing hesitated for a moment and said with a subtle expression, “They said they want to apologize to you in person.”","“Apologize?” Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disdain.","“Yes! He Wenxian wishes to apologize. Moreover, Chairman He and Madam He are both here as well. Young Master He and Second Miss He aren’t around this time.”","Qiao Xi’s tone was playful. “Oh? He Wenyin isn’t here?”","“Um...” Song Shijing was a little uneasy. “Young Madam, you should go take a look at the situation yourself.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze landed on him as if she had captured the crux of the problem. “I asked you why He Wenyin isn’t here. Why didn’t you answer me? Do you know where she is?”","Song Shijing’s expression froze.","He wanted to say something but hesitated. He felt his heart almost stop beating as he said with difficulty, “She... She’s in the president’s office.”","At this moment, in Gu Zheng’s office, his long legs were stretched out as he lazily leaned against the chair. He opened his eyes slightly and smiled distantly. “Second Miss He, why do you think I should agree?”"]},{"number":1226,"title":"Chapter 1226 Her Acting Skills Are Truly Heaven-Defying!","paragraphs":["1226 Her Acting Skills Are Truly Heaven-Defying!","He Wenyin replied nervously, “Because the He family betrayed you and you hate the He family. The enemy of my enemy is my friend. We can join forces to deal with them.”","“Join forces?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and said indifferently, “Second Miss He, with my strength, I don’t think I need to join forces with you. Moreover, we’re not friends.”","He Wenyin was unconvinced. “Gu Zheng, I know you’ve been pretending to be a warm man in front of Mrs. Gu. To be honest, it doesn’t match your temperament at all. Your wife isn’t simple either. In terms of acting skills, she’s the best. She probably already knows what kind of person you are. Why are you pretending? Today, we’ll be frank!”","Song Shiyu could not help but sigh. Second Miss He was indeed smart. She could tell at a glance that Young Madam’s acting skills were good!","!!","Gu Zheng’s expression remained indifferent. “Xi Xi likes me like this. What can you do about it, Second Miss He?”","He Wenyin instantly choked. They were clearly husband and wife, but they were still acting with each other. They pretended to be warm and weak. What kind of new way of communication was this?","He Wenyin pursed her lips. “Let me remind you that He Weinian didn’t return to Li City just for the He family’s company. He wants to deal with you and me. I don’t know his true plan yet, but he definitely won’t let you off. He might even kill you and take everything from you.”","Gu Zheng snorted coldly. Kill him?","Seeing Gu Zheng’s disdainful expression, He Wenyin shook her head helplessly. “That’s all I have to say. Whether you believe it or not, it’s up to you. Looking at the time, the He family will be here to apologize soon. Hurry up and look for your wife. Who are you putting on an act for if not her?”","“Miss He.” Gu Zheng’s voice was calm. “No matter what secrets and motives you have, don’t come to my office on your own in the future. I’m afraid Xi Xi will misunderstand our relationship. I don’t want anything to affect our relationship as husband and wife.”","He Wenyin: “...”","Damn! If she had known earlier, she would have gone straight to look for Mrs. Gu. Now, she was actually despised by Gu Zheng.","After He Wenyin left, Gu Zheng’s eyes revealed a trace of coldness. He did not know why He Weinian wanted to deal with He Wenyin, but He Weinian would not kill him if he wanted to deal with him. He Weinian was just after some benefits.","Song Shiyu asked tentatively, “President, the He family is here, but He Wenyin said that they’re going to deal with you. Are you still going to see them?”","“They didn’t go to Longwan Residential to apologize but came to Gu Corporation with great fanfare. They want everyone to be an audience so that I can’t refuse them in public. If I don’t go, won’t I be disrespecting them?”","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng arrived at the fifth meeting room of Gu Corporation almost at the same time. When they saw the two of them arrive, everyone from the He family immediately stood up with enthusiastic expressions.","When He Weinian saw Gu Zheng, his eyes were filled with gratification and joy. Even Qiao Xi could not discern anything from his appearance. He was like an elder who truly doted on his disciple. If he was pretending, then his acting skills were really heaven-defying!","He Weinian’s eyes were gentle as he smiled affectionately. “Gu Zheng, it’s been so many years since we last met. You’ve changed a lot. I didn’t know that you were already married. Why didn’t you tell me?”","He looked at He Wenxian helplessly and sighed. “Gu Zheng, you’ve probably guessed why I’m here today. If there’s nothing else, I wouldn’t have disturbed you. I know that Wenxian offended Mrs. Gu in Gu Corporation yesterday.","“After Wenxian returned home, I reprimanded her severely. Now that she knows her mistake, I shamelessly brought her here to apologize to your wife. Don’t worry, I won’t make things difficult for you. The He family has already given up on the collaboration. Take it as a lesson for Wenxian. I’ll make sure she learns her lesson and won’t dare to spout nonsense anymore.”","With that, he turned to look at He Wenxian and berated coldly, “Wenxian, quickly apologize!”","Only then did Qiao Xi understand He Weinian’s intentions. He came to apologize so ostentatiously, but he was saying that the He family had taken the initiative to withdraw from the competition. This was a punishment for He Wenxian. Was he doing this to express his sincerity to Gu Zheng or to show outsiders? He wanted to prove to everyone that his children had done something wrong, and he would absolutely not tolerate it.","It was really strange! What was he trying to do? Why was he deliberately maintaining his perfect image?","Just then, Song Shiyu walked in and whispered in Gu Zheng’s ear, “President, the Xia family is outside. They’re asking to see Young Madam.”","Qiao Xi was speechless. Why did she have to meet these annoying people every day? Today, both families were here."]},{"number":1227,"title":"Chapter 1227 Can’t Understand He Weinian","paragraphs":["1227 Can’t Understand He Weinian","When He Weinian heard the words ‘Xia family’, his expression changed. Madam He and He Wenxian’s faces turned pale as they looked at each other in surprise.","Qiao Xi noticed the change in their expressions.","He Weinian glared at the two of them. Madam He and He Wenxian adjusted their emotions and calmed down as if they were never surprised.","Qiao Xi caught this scene with her eyes. She really did not understand why the He family was surprised. Why were they surprised that the Xia family was here to look for her? Or was it because of the Xia family’s name?","!!","Not only did Qiao Xi see a look of surprise in their eyes, but she even saw a trace of panic and fear.","How many more secrets did the He family have that she did not know?!","Qiao Xi turned around and asked Song Shiyu, “Who’s here?”","Song Shiyu glanced at the He family as if signaling that it was not convenient for him to say it here. He Weinian could tell what he meant, so he smiled and said, “Since Mrs. Gu has an honored guest to see, we won’t disturb her anymore. I just hope that Mrs. Gu will accept the gift we got her. I’ll get Wenxian to go to Longwan Residential to formally apologize to you another day, Mrs. Gu. I hope you’ll be magnanimous and forgive her this time!”","Qiao Xi replied indifferently, “I accept your apology, Miss He. You don’t have to come to Longwan Residential to apologize. Chairman He has already personally come to apologize. If I don’t forgive you, that’ll only mean I don’t know what’s good for me.”","He Weinian smiled gently. “Mrs. Gu, you’re being too serious. Wenxian, come over and apologize.”","He Wenxian hurriedly went forward and sincerely expressed her apology. Then, He Weinian left with his wife and daughter. As an elder, no one could find fault with him.","He had given up the right to compete and specially brought He Wenxian to apologize. He even gave Mrs. Gu a valuable apology gift. In everyone’s eyes, his actions were already very appropriate.","After the three of them left, Song Shiyu said unwillingly, “Are we just letting it go?”","Song Shijing explained, “Chairman He has come to the company in person. If Young Madam insists on not forgiving them and chases them out, it’ll be seen as her being rude and unreasonable.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “He Wenxian only said a few words to me yesterday. It’s not like she hurt me. In any case, I didn’t suffer. Moreover, it seems that Chairman He just apologized and didn’t have any intention of targeting me.”","However, it was precisely because of this that Qiao Xi was even more unable to understand He Weinian. She raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. His expression was still calm, and his eyes were gentle. In front of Qiao Xi, he had indeed always maintained a good image and temperament.","“Xi Xi is right. He was just apologizing. My master really cares about his image!” Gu Zheng sighed softly. “Now, everyone in Li City knows that Chairman He Weinian is gentle and polite. He’s a sincere man.”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “If a person likes to pretend to be kind and loving, it means that they’re not such a person.”","Gu Zheng smiled, and his eyes were bright like stars. “Xi Xi, you’re right.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked into Gu Zheng’s eyes. Her heart instantly skipped a beat, and her face instantly flushed red.","Even though she was already married to Gu Zheng and they had been together for so long, she could not resist the temptation of Gu Zheng’s smile. This man was really too seductive.","She quickly looked away and cleared her throat. “Why is the Xia family looking for me?”","Song Shiyu’s expression was profound. “I’m not too sure either, but... Madam Xia Yunlou insists on seeing you. She’s already waiting in the waiting room.”","“Tell her that I’m very busy and don’t have time.” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she added, “There’s still a design that hasn’t been finalized in the design department. I have to ask Lu Zhi for his opinion.”","Qiao Xi did not care about Xia Yunlou’s feelings at all. In short, she did not want to see her.","Song Shiyu understood and patted his chest. “I understand, Young Madam. Leave Madam Xia Yunlou to me.”","The Xia family had only arrived in Li City for a short while before the He family returned to the country. Qiao Xi still did not know the He family’s motive for returning, but she kept having the feeling that this matter seemed to be related to the Xia family. Perhaps she would be able to learn the truth soon.","...","In the living room, Xia Yunlou knew that Qiao Xi was unwilling to see her, and her expression instantly turned malicious. “What? She doesn’t want to see me? I’m her biological mother. How can she leave me here? There are some misunderstandings between us, but we’re mother and daughter, after all! Could it be that she wants to hate me for the rest of her life over that small matter?”","Song Shiyu sneered in his heart. In her eyes, wanting to send her own daughter to jail was a small matter?"]},{"number":1228,"title":"Chapter 1228 The Reference Target Appeared","paragraphs":["1228 The Reference Target Appeared","Song Shiyu could see the disgust and anger in Xia Yunlou’s expression. It was as if she thought that giving birth to this daughter was the most unlucky thing to have happened in her life. She clearly did not treat Young Madam as her biological daughter, but she asked Young Madam to treat her as her biological mother. Was this fair?","He frowned. The bodyguards at the side instantly understood and asked Xia Yunlou to leave.","Seeing this, Xia Yunlou said helplessly, “Since she’s unwilling to see me, please help me pass a message to Xi Xi. The Luo family is about to collaborate with the Xia family to produce the porcelain designs left behind by my sister, Xia Yunqiu.","“The Xia family provided the designs, and the Luo family is in charge of the production. Xi Xi should be in charge of the docking, but my father wants Mengyan to do it. No matter what, Xi Xi is my daughter. I’m still on her side, so I specially came to tell her that if she doesn’t want to let go of this good opportunity, she should quickly return to the Xia family.”","!!","Song Shiyu: “??”","He was stunned. Before he could ask, Xia Yunlou stood up and left.","What was going on? Had Xia Yunlou found her conscience? However, she had just criticized Young Madam, and her eyes were filled with disgust. How did she transform into a mother who was considerate of her daughter? Her acting skills were far inferior to Young Madam’s.","Song Shiyu returned to the office and told Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi what Xia Yunlou had said.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up. If these two families worked together, their reputation would rise. Hence, under normal circumstances, the heirs of the families would be in charge.","According to their identities, the most suitable person was Qiao Xi. It was just that everyone in the Xia family doted on Xia Mengyan. As Qiao Xi’s biological mother, it was normal for Xia Yunlou to come and remind her daughter. However, according to Xia Yunlou’s past actions, her words today were strange.","Gu Zheng asked softly, “Xi Xi, do you think Xia Yunlou is up to something?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes lit up, and she shook her head with a smile.","Gu Zheng’s gaze was deep as he turned to look at her. “What do you think, then?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile. “Do you still remember that I guessed that Xia Yunlou has been revealing her true nature more and more over the years? It’s possible that it’s because the real Xia Yunlou is no longer around that she’s exposing herself like this. After all, she has no reference to follow. She’s unable to interact with Xia Yunlou’s mother and brother and doesn’t have the slightest emotion for me, her daughter.","“But Song Shiyu thinks that Xia Yunlou looks like she cares about me very much. What could be the reason for it?” Qiao Xi’s expression was gloomy, scaring Song Shiyu so much that his body trembled. “It’s probably because her reference has appeared again. She knows how to care about her daughter.”","Gu Zheng hissed. “Xi Xi, you’re really getting smarter and smarter. I’m ashamed of my inferiority.”","Song Shiyu’s pupils trembled when he heard that. It took him a long time to understand what she meant. In that case, the woman who had just appeared in front of him was not the real Xia Yunlou.","Qiao Xi turned around and left. Song Shiyu said with lingering fear, “President, other girls have warm and sunny smiles, but why is Young Madam so scary when she smiles?”","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at him coldly. Song Shiyu understood instantly. “You don’t have to say anything. I know that Young Madam will always be the cutest and most beautiful woman in your heart.”","Gu Zheng: “...”","His eyes suddenly turned sharp. “Song Shiyu, are you itching for a beating?”","Song Shiyu’s heart trembled. He took a few steps back and said in a panic, “President, calm down! Don’t hit me! Don’t send me to the mountains either. I still have something to say!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes regained their calm.","Song Shiyu lowered his voice and said, “President, don’t you think that Young Madam has been estranged from you recently? She has a plan, but why isn’t she telling you about it? This isn’t a good sign!”","Song Shiyu’s words instantly piqued Gu Zheng’s interest. He raised an eyebrow and asked, “What do you think I should do?”","“It’s simple! First of all, you have to show more concern for Young Madam and coax her with sweet words. If she wants to eat, pass her the chopsticks. If she wants to sleep, cover her with the blanket. If she wants to hit someone, bring her a rod. Remember not to let her suffer. You have to be gentle and become a completely warm man!” Song Shiyu said excitedly.","Song Shijing: “...”","Although Song Shiyu usually did not do any proper work, what he said made sense. A man had to be meticulous, gentle, and attentive to women.","After Qiao Xi left, she still had a lot on her mind. She did not know where the real Xia Yunlou was. If she was still alive, why did she not acknowledge the Yin family? Why did she not stand forward and expose the fake Xia Yunlou?","What difficulties did she have? Or was it because she could not appear?"]},{"number":1229,"title":"Chapter 1229 The Xia Family’s Secret Is About To Surface","paragraphs":["1229 The Xia Family’s Secret Is About To Surface","The Yin and Xia families had cut off all contact for decades, but Old Madam Yin had always been thinking of Xia Yunlou. She suspected that the one in the public eye was not her real daughter, but she did not have any evidence. If the real Xia Yunlou was found and this matter was made public, the Yin and Xia families would become enemies. At that time, the Xia family’s situation would be very difficult.","Xia Yunlou, who was hiding in the dark, probably hoped to see this scene.","Qiao Xi kept having the feeling that her guess was logical. It was as if someone had left clues for her to investigate. If that person really existed, why didn’t they come forward and expose all of this themselves?","“Little Six.” In the living room of Longwan Residential, Shen Yu was leaning against the sofa. When he saw her return, he said with a smile, “Did Xia Yunlou go to the company to look for you?”","Qiao Xi sized up Shen Yu.","That was right! He Weinian was also like a smiling tiger. He was exactly the same as her eldest brother, but her eldest brother was a Best Actor while He Weinian was just a businessman!","Seeing that she was silent, Shen Yu was a little surprised, but there was still a gentle smile on his lips. “Little Six, what are you thinking about? Why aren’t you saying anything?”","Luo Qing glanced at him: “...” ‘Why does Xi Xi despise Eldest Brother so much today?’","He was silent for a few seconds, and his cold eyes gradually became gentle. His deep eyes were like clear springs. “Xi Xi, everything is ready.”","Qiao Xi looked at Luo Qing and could not help but sigh in her heart. Among the siblings, the eldest brother was clearly cunning and sinister, but he pretended to be gentle. The third brother would bring out a knife and a gun at the slightest disagreement, but he became a doctor. The fourth brother liked poison, but he became an artist. Xue Yi had a bad temper, but she was a gentle socialite.","As for her...","She was even better at pretending!","Among the six of them, only Second Brother was normal. He was like a god in heaven. His eyes were clear, and his temperament was cold. It was as if nothing could move him.","Now that everything was ready, it was time for her to carry out her plan.","This collaboration between the two families was actually facilitated by her. Her goal was to expose Xia Yunlou’s identity and reproduce the designs her mother left behind.","She indeed did not have any evidence, but even without evidence, she could use public opinion. When a group of people began to suspect Xia Yunlou’s identity, the Xia family’s secret could not be kept anymore.","In the Xia family’s villa.","Xia Cheng paced in the living room with a gloomy expression. Xia Ji and Old Madam Xia sat at the side with livid expressions.","“Yunlou, I asked you to go to the company because I wanted you to persuade Qiao Xi to hand over the designs in her hand. Why did you ask her to be in charge of the docking? This time, it’s a collaboration with the Tang family. What ability does she have to be in charge of such a large collaboration? What if she screws up? I think it’s safer to have Mengyan do it.” Xia Cheng frowned unhappily.","Old Madam Xia suddenly cried out, “Everyone is saying that Mengyan isn’t the legitimate daughter of the Xia family and that my son is an illegitimate child! All these years, Mengyan has suffered so many grievances and slander! She’s clearly so outstanding and hardworking, but she’s still being gossiped about by outsiders! Yunlou! You’re Mengyan’s... aunt! Why are you helping that wild girl?”","Madam Xia, who was ignored by everyone, sat in a corner. Her gaze changed imperceptibly.","In the eyes of outsiders, Qiao Xi was Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter, while Xia Mengyan was only Xia Yunlou’s niece. What was wrong with her helping her daughter?","Madam Xia lowered her head and tried her best to reduce her presence, but her eyes were clear. The Xia family’s secret was finally about to surface.","Seeing Old Madam Xia’s tears, Xia Yunlou explained aggrievedly, “I did go to look for Qiao Xi for the designs. I don’t understand why I said those words either.”","Old Madam Xia’s voice was sharp. “Although Qiao Xi is your biological daughter, she’s been wandering outside all these years and has no feelings for you at all. Mengyan grew up by your side. Think about it carefully. Who exactly should you help?”","A few days ago, the Luo family came to visit and asked to collaborate with Xia Yunqiu. However, Xia Yunqiu had long died, so the Luo family suggested that the Xia family choose someone to represent Xia Yunqiu.","The Luo family was the head of the four major porcelain families and was famous in high society. In the past, the Luo family had lived on Xuan Island for generations and did not interact with outsiders. Hence, it was a great honor for the Xia family to be able to build a relationship with the Luo family. Now that the Luo family had personally come to ask for collaboration, Xia Cheng naturally could not let go of this good opportunity.","However, Xia Yunqiu’s designs had already been destroyed by Ai Sumei and Xia Yunlou. There were only fragments left. They really did not have the ability to restore them."]},{"number":1230,"title":"Chapter 1230 Ah Zheng, Is There Something Wrong With You Today?","paragraphs":["1230 Ah Zheng, Is There Something Wrong With You Today?","When Xia Cheng heard this news, he was angered to the point of almost fainting. Then, he recalled that Qiao Xi still had some of the designs in her hands. The Luo family wanted to reproduce Xia Yunqiu’s designs, so Qiao Xi had no reason to refuse. That was why he asked Xia Yunlou to persuade Qiao Xi to give them the designs.","Who knew that Xia Yunlou would actually let Qiao Xi compete for the position of person in charge? If Qiao Xi became the person in charge, what would Mengyan do?","Xia Cheng thought for a moment and said, “Qiao Xi cares about Yunqiu the most. When she finds out that the Luo family is willing to produce Yunqiu’s work, she’ll definitely not refuse. I’ll talk to her in two days. She’ll definitely agree.”","However, why couldn’t he go tomorrow? It was because the Luo family would come to the Xia family to discuss a collaboration tomorrow. It was best if Qiao Xi didn’t appear. If she really came, he would definitely chase Qiao Xi out. As the head of the Xia family, wasn’t it reasonable for him to chase an outsider away?","!!","...","The next day, at seven in the morning.","After breakfast, Gu Zheng took a sip of coffee. His entire body exuded nobility and elegance. He looked at Qiao Xi, who was at the table, and asked softly, “I happen to be going to discuss business today. I’ll send you to Xia Corporation later.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “President Gu, you have so many subordinates. Do you need to personally discuss business?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched. His voice was gentle, but it carried unyielding insistence. “Xi Xi, I’ll send you there.”","In the car, the man had a smile on the corners of his mouth. After the car stopped below Xia Corporation, Qiao Xi was just about to get out of the car when she was grabbed by the man.","His tall body suddenly approached her as he muttered in her ear, “Xi Xi, if you’ve been wronged in the Xia family, you must tell me. I’ll avenge you.”","Qiao Xi’s mind was filled with question marks. She kept having the feeling that Gu Zheng was acting so strangely today. What was wrong with him?","Gu Zheng was acting like a gentleman, and his gaze was tightly glued to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi: “...!!!” Why did she feel that he was a little scary?","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi frowned and asked seriously, “Ah Zheng, is there something wrong with you today?”","The smile on Gu Zheng’s face froze: “...”","He should not have trusted Song Shiyu, but Song Shijing had agreed to this idea! They were indeed brothers. They were both so unreliable. What bad ideas did they come up with?!","Qiao Xi sized up Gu Zheng with a subtle expression and stretched out her weak and fair hand to touch his head.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched slightly. “It looks like the Luo family is about to arrive.”","Qiao Xi immediately opened the car door. “Then I’ll get going first.”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips and suddenly said, “Xi Xi, you can wait in the car for a while. You can go in when the Luo family comes.”","Qiao Xi smiled noncommittally. “Ah Zheng, don’t you understand me? You should know very well what I’m thinking! I’m not afraid of those people from the Xia family. They can go ahead and use whatever tricks they have.”","Gu Zheng curled his lips into a smile. “As long as you don’t suffer, you can do whatever you want. If anything happens, I’ll take responsibility for you.”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently and waved at Gu Zheng before turning to leave.","Gu Zheng sat in the car and watched her leave. The smile on his face gradually disappeared. He asked coldly, “Have they arrived?”","Song Shijing appeared outside the window and replied respectfully, “They’re here, President.”","Gu Zheng played with a sharp dagger in his hand while exuding strong killing intent. “Alright, I want to see what they want.”","...","At Xia Corporation.","Cooperating with the Luo family was an important matter. Xia Cheng took it very seriously, so he had already instructed someone to prepare for it. He even redecorated the lobby.","It had to be known that the Luo family was an existence that many noble families looked up to. If the Xia family could get close to the Luo family this time, all the noble families in Li City would think highly of them.","Xia Yunlou sat on the chair and fell into deep thought. She suddenly recalled something. Previously, when Qiao Xi and Xu Anran were holding their respective birthday parties on the same day, someone with the surname Luo had come to celebrate Qiao Xi’s birthday.","When all the guests heard that the young master of the Luo family had personally come to celebrate Qiao Xi’s birthday, they ran from Xu Anran’s birthday party to Qiao Xi’s birthday party.","Could it be that the Luo family Qiao Xi knew was the same Luo family?","At this moment, Qiao Xi was standing at the door of the living room with the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. It was a good thing that the Luo family wanted to produce the designs her mother left behind, but this glory belonged to her mother and had nothing to do with the Xia family.","All these years, the Xia family had always been covering up their crimes. After a long time, they probably did not even remember their past actions. Hence, Qiao Xi directly joined forces with the Luo family to set a trap for the Xia family to fall into."]},{"number":1231,"title":"Chapter 1231 The Shameless Xia Family","paragraphs":["1231 The Shameless Xia Family","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart and stepped into the lobby. As soon as she entered, she saw a few printed drawings that were even framed in gold. The funny thing was that Xia Ji’s name was actually written on the drawings.","She frowned, and her eyes suddenly turned cold.","Heh! How could these people be so shameless?","In the eyes of the Xia family, the designs were drawn by her mother, but her mother was from the Xia family. In other words, the designs belonged to the Xia family. They knew that these designs were drawn by her mother, but outsiders did not. As long as it was something from the Xia family, the family could use it however they wished. They believed that the Luo family would not mind.","If the Luo family did not expose them, no one else would care.","Qiao Xi turned her head and saw a group of reporters rushing in from outside. At this moment, many reporters were gathered outside Xia Corporation’s building. She seemed to understand the Xia family’s intentions.","She looked out. As soon as Xia Ji got out of the car, many reporters surrounded him. Xia Mengyan followed Xia Ji obediently and greeted everyone with a smile.","Xia Yunlou had specially come to inform her about the collaboration between the Xia and Luo families. It was not agreed upon by the Xia family and seemed to be Xia Yunlou’s own idea, so she did not come together with the Xia family today.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. She saw someone in the crowd. It was Assistant Gao, who was beside Xia Ji. At this moment, he was doing an interview on behalf of Xia Ji while Xia Ji quickly went upstairs.","Seeing this, Qiao Xi immediately sent Luo Qing a message: [Second Brother, I’ll have to trouble you to cooperate with me today.]","...","In the chairman’s office.","Xia Ji rushed over in a hurry, his expression not looking good. He asked uneasily, “Dad, will things really be fine? I don’t feel at ease.”","Xia Cheng was expressionless, but Ai Sumei snorted. “Don’t worry! These designs belonged to that b*tch... They were designed by Xia Yunqiu, so they belong to the Xia family. Now that she’s dead, they’re yours! Outsiders don’t know about it at all. What are you afraid of?”","Xia Ji still wanted to say something, but Ai Sumei glared at him and turned to Xia Cheng with a flattering smile. “Ah Cheng, Xia Yunqiu has been dead for so many years. The heir in her will is Qiao Xi, but Qiao Xi just so happens to be at odds with our Xia family. If we announce that these designs all belong to Xia Yunqiu, Qiao Xi might snatch them away.","“The Luo family is clearly here to discuss a collaboration with us. We’ve been preparing for so long, so how can we let all of this be snatched by Qiao Xi?”","Xia Cheng was silent for a moment before he frowned and said, “Yunqiu is my daughter. She’s from the Xia family. If she has belongings left in the Xia family, they’re ours.","“Xia Ji is the next head of the family. There’s nothing wrong with giving these designs to him. Moreover, this is for the sake of the Xia family. If Yunqiu was still alive, she wouldn’t have refused.”","Sumei smiled widely. “Ah Cheng, you’re right! Son, since your father said so, you should be relieved now!”","Xia Ji felt as if a rock was pressing down on his heart. He could not breathe. When he thought of the reporters outside the door and the ingratiating smiles of Li City’s business magnates, he felt a little better.","In the past, this group of people looked down on him and thought that he was just an illegitimate child. They thought his aptitude was mediocre and that he could never compare to Yin Yunyi or Xia Yunqiu. Now that he was the one working with the Luo family, Yin Yunyi was the one who did not have the ability!","With the Luo family’s protection, who would dare to laugh at him for being an illegitimate child?","At the thought of this, he became even prouder, and the uneasiness in his heart gradually dissipated.","Xia Yunqiu was already dead. Even if she was the one who drew these designs, who could prove that she was the one who drew them? Could it be that Xia Yunqiu would jump out of her grave to prove it?","Sumei smiled proudly. “It doesn’t matter even if the Luo family suspects it. Just say that it was you and your sister who learned how to carve porcelain and jade together back then. Say that Yunqiu passed away early, so there are very few works that she left behind. Claim ownership for all the works here and just mention in passing that the style happens to be very similar to Yunqiu’s. The Luo family won’t investigate who drew these designs.”","If Xia Yunqiu’s name was on the designs, Qiao Xi and the Yin family would have to take a share. To the Xia family, only by giving these designs to Xia Ji could they maximize the benefits.","“Alright, let’s do that. With the Xia family as witnesses, I believe the Luo family won’t suspect anything. Xia Ji, you must calm down. Don’t let your guard down in front of the Luo family,” Xia Cheng instructed.","Xia Ji continued to ask, “But what if the Luo family wants me to draw some more designs? We don’t have that many of Xia Yunqiu’s designs left.”"]},{"number":1232,"title":"Chapter 1232 The Most Important Thing In Business Is Integrity","paragraphs":["1232 The Most Important Thing In Business Is Integrity","Xia Cheng’s expression was serious. “Just say that your wrist is injured and you can’t draw anymore. If they insist, recommend Mengyan. She’s also very talented in porcelain design. Although she might not satisfy the Luo family, it can at least dispel the Luo family’s doubts.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the assistant rushed in. “Chairman, President Xia! There’s bad news! Miss Xia and Assistant Gao are arguing with a woman outside. The reporters are all outside. Hurry up and take a look at the situation!”","Xia Cheng frowned. “Today is an important day for our Xia family. The Luo family is about to arrive. We can’t let unimportant people affect our collaboration. Hurry up and chase them away!”","“That woman...” The assistant hesitated and said while trembling, “But that woman said her surname is Qiao.”","Everyone’s expressions instantly changed. Anger suddenly surged on Xia Cheng’s face. He slammed the table and roared, “She’s really here? These designs all belong to Xia Ji! What does she want? Does she still want to compete with Mengyan for the position of the person in charge?”","Ai Sumei gritted her teeth. Xia Yunqiu had been dead for so many years, so her belongings should be left to the Xia family. What right did Qiao Xi have to occupy them? It was absolutely impossible!","Her voice was sharp. “Let’s go! I want to see what she wants to do. No matter what, we have to chase this little b*tch out today. This is the Xia family’s territory. We won’t allow her to commit crimes!”","At this moment, the lobby was silent. The reporters raised their microphones and aimed their cameras at Qiao Xi.","Many business giants who came to watch the collaboration between the Luo and Xia families had vague expressions. They had just heard Miss Qiao say with their own ears that these designs belonged to her mother and not Xia Ji.","Not long ago, there were rumors in Li City that the Xia family wanted to collaborate with the Luo family. Everyone was also curious about who was so talented in the Xia family to have caught the Luo family’s eye. The Xia family was in a difficult situation now. They could not stand firmly in Li City and could not return to Shengdu either. They were in a dilemma. If they could be on good terms with the Luo family, all their difficulties would be resolved.","It was only today that everyone was informed that the creator of the designs was Xia Ji. Unexpectedly, the mediocre and useless illegitimate child actually had the talent to design porcelain.","But now...","Under everyone’s suspicious gazes, Assistant Gao said indignantly, “Miss, don’t spout nonsense! The designs are President Xia’s work. Who’s your mother? We don’t know her at all! I know what’s going on. Someone must have instructed you to cause trouble and interfere with our Xia family’s collaboration!”","The reporters were instantly interested when they heard this and surrounded Qiao Xi, afraid that she would run away in the next second.","Qiao Xi was not nervous in the slightest. Her phone vibrated. She picked it up and saw a message: [No problem.]","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a smile as she said casually, “First of all, I’ll state that no one instructed me to cause trouble. No one knows better than the Xia family who the creator of these designs is. President Xia and Chairman Xia aren’t here themselves but sent an assistant to deal with me... Are they afraid?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the entire venue was in an uproar. It was like a rock had smashed into a calm lake.","Qiao Xi came to Xia Corporation today to blow things up. The bigger the fuss, the better. Only then would the Xia family lose even more face and gradually expose themselves!","Most people were jealous and unwilling to see the Xia family collaborate with the Luo family. Now that someone had revealed that the designs were not Xia Ji’s, doubts sounded.","Assistant Gao’s face turned red as he ordered the security guards at the side, “What are you waiting for? Chase this crazy woman out! She must have been sent by a competitor to cause trouble. Don’t believe her. The designs were designed by President Xia!”","Everyone stared at Qiao Xi. If the designs were really not designed by Xia Ji, then the Luo family would definitely not collaborate with the Xia family. After all, the most important thing in doing business was integrity.","There were more and more doubts about the matter. Assistant Gao was at a loss and could only roar, “Go! Chase her out!”","The security guards passed through the many reporters and rushed in front of Qiao Xi. “Miss, please leave immediately. Otherwise, don’t blame us for being merciless.”","This was the lobby of Xia Corporation, so the reporters would not speak up for Qiao Xi. Those business giants did not dare rashly offend the Xia family without knowing the truth either, so everyone just looked at her. No one was willing to stand up for Qiao Xi."]},{"number":1233,"title":"Chapter 1233 Cooperating With Xi Xi’s Acting","paragraphs":["1233 Cooperating With Xi Xi’s Acting","Qiao Xi did not panic in the slightest and smiled indifferently. “Assistant Gao, are you angry from embarrassment? Are you panicking just because I told the truth? Assistant Gao, do you think I came here today just to cause trouble and don’t have any evidence? Then I must say that you’re looking down on me.”","Assistant Gao’s lips trembled violently as he stammered, “You... You were sent by our competitor. I know who you’re working for. If you dare to spout nonsense again, I’ll... call the police!”","“Call the police? Alright! Assistant Gao, you can ask Miss Xia who I am and who my mother is!” Qiao Xi’s icy-cold gaze landed on Xia Mengyan.","Assistant Gao instantly choked, and his heart trembled. Could it be that her identity was very extraordinary?","“I know! Isn’t she Miss Qiao?” Suddenly, someone in the crowd said, “I saw her at the Qiao family’s banquet previously. She’s the daughter of Qiao Zhenguo’s first wife, Xia Yunqiu. In that case, she can be considered a member of the Xia family!”","Xia Yunqiu’s daughter?","If that were the case, Miss Qiao could be considered the daughter of the Xia family. Why did Assistant Gao say that she was sent by a competitor?","Everyone subconsciously looked at Xia Mengyan. If Miss Qiao was Xia Yunqiu’s daughter, Xia Mengyan would definitely have recognized her long ago. Why didn’t she say so earlier?","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale, and her forehead was covered in cold sweat. She did not dare to rashly speak and could only roar helplessly in her heart. Qiao Xi was actually here! If it were not for that b*tch, Xia Yunlou, telling Qiao Xi about the collaboration between the Luo and Xia families, Qiao Xi wouldn’t have come! Qiao Xi had always hated Xia Yunlou. Wasn’t she afraid that Xia Yunlou would scheme against her?","These designs did belong to Xia Yunqiu, but that woman had been dead for so many years. Her things should belong to the Xia family. Now that they were working with the Luo family, it could be considered Xia Yunqiu’s contribution to the Xia family. This was her honor!","What right did Qiao Xi have to cause trouble here? What good would it do her to expose the Xia family?","Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth, and the resentment in her heart was about to overflow. However, no matter how much she hated Qiao Xi, she could not show it in front of everyone.","Under everyone’s burning gazes, she walked forward and smiled gently. “Everyone, I’m sorry. I didn’t have the time to introduce you. Miss Qiao is my younger cousin. She’s Aunt Yunlou’s—”","“I’m Madam Xia Yunqiu’s daughter!” Qiao Xi interrupted her without the slightest hesitation.","The moment the name Xia Yunqiu was uttered, everyone could not help but be stunned. Miss Xia was a beautiful woman! Unfortunately, beautiful women had short lives!","Qiao Xi said coldly, “These drawings are the blood, sweat, and tears of my mother, Xia Yunqiu. She spent days and nights thinking about how to draw them. Now, they’ve become Xia Ji’s work. I’m not here today to cause trouble. I just want to ask all of you if it’s reasonable for the Xia family to treat their legitimate deceased daughter like this while giving all the glory to their illegitimate child?”","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled, and the sweat on her forehead slid down her face. Her hair was stuck to her face, making her look a little disheveled. She pretended to be calm and said, “Xi Xi, you must have remembered wrongly. Aunt Yunqiu did do some designs, but they’re not the ones that we’re using to collaborate with the Lu family this time. Back then, my father and Aunt Yunqiu learned to design porcelain together. It’s just that he wasn’t as ambitious about it, so he put it aside all these years. Everyone in the Xia family knows that these designs belong to my father. If you don’t have evidence, don’t spout nonsense.”","“Miss Xia, why are you so sure that I don’t have any evidence?” Qiao Xi smiled coldly.","At this moment, Luo Qing got out of the car and met Gu Zheng at the entrance of Xia Corporation’s building. He greeted indifferently, “President Gu.”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Young Master Luo.”","The two of them stood together, and the surrounding temperature dropped a lot. After a few seconds of silence, Gu Zheng asked, “Young Master Luo, why are you here today?”","Luo Qing looked up with a glint in his eyes. “To cooperate with Xi Xi’s acting.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was slightly gloomy. Xi Xi’s other three brothers mostly called Qiao Xi ‘Little Six’, but only Luo Qing always called her ‘Xi Xi’.","For some reason, Gu Zheng’s heart ached. No matter what, Luo Qing was a man. He was such a noble and outstanding man too.","“Why are you here, President Gu here?” Luo Qing asked.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and sneered. “Of course, for the same reason as Young Master Luo.”","Luo Qing looked up, and the two of them sized each other up before leaving without saying anything.","Song Shijing asked curiously, “President, Young Master Luo is here to help Young Madam, so why are you...”"]},{"number":1234,"title":"Chapter 1234 Mother’s Will","paragraphs":["1234 Mother’s Will","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled into a smile, but his eyes were filled with coldness. “Haven’t you realized that Luo Qing treats Xi Xi very differently?”","“I was stupid and didn’t realize it sooner.” Only then did Song Shijing understand why the president was so hostile to Young Master Luo. He was jealous.","Gu Zheng smiled and retracted his gaze. “Let’s go.”","At this moment, in the lobby of Xia Corporation, the argument between Qiao Xi and Xia Mengyan had already reached its climax. The reporters and the businessmen present looked between the two of them.","Xia Mengyan suppressed the uneasiness in her heart and still had a smile on her face. She maintained her dignity. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. Since you’re from the Xia family, you should think about the Xia family. The Luo family will be here soon. Don’t delay our collaboration because of your nonsense.”","Now, Qiao Xi had a few designs in her hands, but it was impossible to prove that the designs in the Xia family’s hands now were done by Xia Yunqiu. Qiao Xi had no evidence at all. She just wanted to interfere with the Xia family’s collaboration.","At the thought of this, Xia Mengyan became confident. “Xi Xi, I’m very sure that these designs were all created by my father. I also know that you won’t harm the Xia family. You must have misunderstood. Stop fooling around first. After the collaboration is over, we’ll talk at home, okay?”","Xia Mengyan had already thought of a way out for Qiao Xi. As long as she admitted that this was a misunderstanding, this matter would be resolved. Neither party would lose anything. Everyone would only treat what had just happened as a small episode.","Everyone quietly waited for Qiao Xi to speak. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi sneered, and her cold expression carried a trace of disdain. “Miss Xia, since you said that the designs were created by your father, then tell me when he created them.”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed. Could it be that Qiao Xi really had evidence?","However, didn’t Grandpa say that everything was already prepared? Even if Qiao Xi came to cause trouble, he had a way to deal with her.","Xia Mengyan thought for a moment and replied, “I was about six or seven years old. Although I was still young at that time, I clearly remember that my father always liked to draw designs in the study. There are still some sketches in the study now. Everyone in the family knows that my father likes to design, but he’s usually too busy with work and can’t spend too much time on design, so he doesn’t draw anymore.”","Her words dispelled many people’s doubts, and it seemed as though there was nothing wrong with what she said.","“Xi Xi, I don’t understand why you’re here to cause trouble, but today is a very important day for the Xia family. If there’s a problem, let’s talk about it at home. Grandpa’s health hasn’t been good recently, and he really can’t take the stimulation. Be good, okay?”","Xia Mengyan’s tone was gentle, and her voice trembled slightly with a hint of pleading.","When everyone heard Xia Mengyan’s words, they felt that Xia Mengyan was more credible. She was thinking about the overall situation. Moreover, if the designs were really Xia Yunqiu’s, why did the Xia family sign the designs with Xia Ji’s name? They were all descendants of the Xia family, so what difference did it make who signed it? Why did they have to make things difficult for others?","Xia Mengyan could not help but be proud. Everyone believed her now. As long as Qiao Xi could not produce any strong evidence, she would be chased out. In the future, she would be mocked by Li City.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi sneered, and her eyes were filled with disdain. She took a few steps toward Xia Mengyan and said with a trace of ridicule, “Miss Xia, I didn’t come empty-handed today. Coincidentally, everyone is here, so I’ll show the evidence to everyone.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi took out a stack of documents from her bag.","Xia Mengyan’s heart thumped violently. Was this the evidence Qiao Xi was talking about? How was this possible? Could it be that Xia Yunqiu had left something behind?","“This is my mother’s will. She left all the assets under her name, including her designs, to me. My mother is a meticulous person. She left behind specific information and photos of everything. These documents contain all the information about the designs she drew. They were entrusted to me by a lawyer.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with resentment. Will? Xia Yunqiu actually recorded all the designs in her will? Was she crazy?","Xia Mengyan immediately shot a look at the bodyguard beside her. The bodyguard hurriedly rushed over, but the next second, Qiao Xi had already flipped open the documents. A few designs appeared in front of everyone. They were indeed exactly the same as the ones signed by Xia Ji.","Moreover, the date on it was 24 years ago. Every design was signed by Xia Yunqiu.","Xia Mengyan’s face was as pale as paper, and her body trembled uncontrollably."]},{"number":1235,"title":"Chapter 1235 The Illegitimate Child Goes Too Far","paragraphs":["1235 The Illegitimate Child Goes Too Far","Qiao Xi said casually, “Miss Xia, you were probably just born 24 years ago, right? You said that these designs were drawn by your father when you were six or seven years old. At that time, my mother had already passed away, so it’s utterly impossible for her to have signed your father’s designs.”","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan in shock. The discussions became more and more heated. Every word was like a thousand-kilogram rock smashing into Xia Mengyan’s heart, making the blood in her entire body freeze and making her tremble uncontrollably.","“Miss Xia Yunqiu’s designs were completed 24 years ago. At that time, there was a lawyer to notarize them, but Xia Mengyan said that Xia Ji designed them when she was six or seven years old. That was about 18 years ago. In other words, these designs were Xia Yunqiu’s. Now, they’re being occupied by Xia Ji!”","From the time, it was obvious that Xia Yunqiu completed her designs earlier than Xia Ji, according to Xia Mengyan’s words. After Xia Yunqiu passed away, it was impossible for anyone to forge evidence.","However, since they were Xia Yunqiu’s designs, why did the Xia family have to discuss a collaboration with the Luo family using Xia Ji’s name?","If Xia Ji was really occupying Xia Yunqiu’s designs, then this illegitimate child was going too far. Did he think that he could be fearless just because Miss Xia had passed away?","Everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain as they discussed softly. Their burning gazes were about to burn Xia Mengyan to ashes.","Xia Mengyan was flustered. Under Qiao Xi’s questioning and everyone’s disdainful gazes, she was on the verge of fainting. She could only lower her head and try her best to reduce her presence.","“Miss Xia, now that I’ve proven that these designs were drawn by my mother 24 years ago, please give me a reasonable explanation for your claim about how these designs were made by your father 18 years ago.”","“I...” Xia Mengyan opened her mouth, but she did not know where to start. Her face was pale, and her lips could not help but tremble. She bit her lip and forced herself to calm down.","Everyone stared at her, waiting for her answer. There was silence.","Qiao Xi chuckled and broke the silence. She said gently, “Miss Xia, don’t be nervous. You have plenty of time. Think carefully about what to say. I’ll wait for your explanation.”","Xia Mengyan’s legs went weak, and she almost fell. She looked at Qiao Xi’s disdainful eyes and was on the verge of breaking down. She never expected that Qiao Xi would actually have evidence.","Now that such a thing had happened, whose name would be on the designs when the Luo family came later if they could not explain it clearly?","If they continued to use her father’s name, Qiao Xi would definitely not let the matter rest. She might cause a scene at Xia Corporation, but if they put Xia Yunqiu’s name, wouldn’t it be equivalent to admitting that Xia Ji plagiarized Xia Yunqiu’s work?","Xia Mengyan listened to the discussions around her. Those people were mocking her father for being an illegitimate child and having a bad character. Otherwise, why would he steal his sister’s things?","Her teeth chattered. She originally thought that after so many years, no one would mention it again. Moreover, she had already become the eldest daughter of the Xia family and was doted on. Those people naturally did not dare to easily offend her. Now that her flaws were exposed in public, Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth in hatred. Her eyes were filled with resentment, and she wished for nothing more than strangle Qiao Xi to death.","Qiao Xi took a few steps closer and said softly, “Miss Xia?”","Xia Mengyan looked up, her eyes filled with panic. The sweat on her back had already soaked her clothes, making her look a little disheveled. After thinking for a long time, she gritted her teeth and was about to speak.","“This is just a misunderstanding!” At this moment, a dignified and old voice suddenly sounded. Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia walked over with extremely gloomy expressions. Behind them was the ashen Xia Ji.","Seeing Xia Ji appear, the reporters immediately swarmed over and aimed their microphones and cameras at them.","Xia Cheng stood in front of the reporters and was not nervous at all. He still smiled kindly. “Everyone, please calm down. I’ll explain this matter clearly later. I want to handle the family matters first.”","“Xi Xi, you’re Mengyan’s younger sister. You know very well how Mengyan treats you. She has already tolerated you so much, so why are you still making things difficult for her in public? We could’ve talked about this at home, but you just had to be so unforgiving and make her lose her dignity with you.","One of the reporters said in confusion, “Chairman Xia, you’re saying that it’s inappropriate for Miss Qiao to be so unforgiving, but Miss Qiao has evidence to prove that these designs are Madam Xia Yunqiu’s work. Xia Mengyan was the one who said that they were Xia Ji’s work. This isn’t Miss Qiao’s fault!”"]},{"number":1236,"title":"Chapter 1236 What’s The Difference Between This And Daylight Robbery?","paragraphs":["1236 What’s The Difference Between This And Daylight Robbery?","Xia Cheng ignored the reporter and said earnestly, “Xi Xi, you’re really too much of a fool. You made everyone know about your dissatisfaction. Now, it seems that I can’t hide this matter anymore. For the sake of the collaboration with the Luo family, as well as Xia Ji and Mengyan, I can only tell the truth.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. She quietly watched Xia Cheng put on an act.","Xia Cheng was silent for a long time before he said helplessly, “I didn’t want to say this at first, but now that Xi Xi has blown things up, I have to explain it clearly. This matter is a secret of our Xia family. Mengyan is young and doesn’t know about it. Now, I’ll tell the whole story in front of everyone!","“These designs were... created by Xia Ji, not Yunqiu.” Xia Cheng’s eyes were filled with sorrow. “As Xi Xi said, they were created 24 years ago. Mengyan thinks that they were created 18 years ago. That was when my son, Xia Ji, took out all the designs and sorted them out. At that time, Mengyan happened to see those designs, so she always thought that Xia Ji drew them 18 years ago.","“We’ve been keeping it a secret, so we never told Mengyan the truth. Please don’t blame Mengyan, everyone. If you want to blame someone, blame me. If I hadn’t hidden it from her, she wouldn’t have said the wrong thing.”","Everyone frowned. What secret did the Xia family have to keep? Someone finally could not help but ask curiously, “Chairman Xia, what secret are you talking about? Why couldn’t you tell Miss Xia?”","Xia Cheng sighed helplessly. “Xi Xi, don’t blame me for being heartless. Now that things have come to this, I have to say it.","“Yunqiu has been dead for so many years. As her father, I wasn’t willing to make this matter public. Even if I had to let Xia Ji suffer, I didn’t care. However, this concerns the Xia family’s reputation and the collaboration with the Luo family now. I can’t hide it anymore.”","Xia Cheng spoke for a long time but was still keeping them in suspense. This made everyone even more anxious. They all wanted to know what the secret behind this was.","The old man seemed to have fallen into his memories. He shook his head helplessly. “24 years ago, after Xia Ji completed the designs, Xia Yunqiu borrowed them. At that time, she said that she wanted to borrow them, but she kept them and refused to return them. After a long time, she treated them as her own work.","“Xia Ji carried the reputation of an illegitimate child. He was mocked by others outside and couldn’t raise his head at home. He already felt that he had let Yunqiu down, so he didn’t pursue the matter. It was only when the Luo family came to ask for a collaboration that he dared to say that they were his designs. Who knew that Xi Xi would reveal this incident in public today?”","Everyone gasped. They did not expect the situation to turn around again. In other words, the person who really occupied someone else’s work was Xia Yunqiu.","Xia Ji felt that he had let Xia Yunqiu down, so he had been hiding this matter. If the Luo family had not come to collaborate with the Xia family, the Xia family would have kept this secret forever. No one would have known that the real Xia Yunqiu was so unbearable.","“Sigh! Perhaps Miss Qiao didn’t know that Xia Yunqiu was such a person either. After all, from the evidence she provided, it was clearly Xia Ji who plagiarized Xia Yunqiu’s designs. Who would have thought that the truth would be like this?!”","“Chairman Xia is doing this for his daughter’s own good. He has been keeping this secret all these years. Xia Yunqiu said that she wanted to borrow those designs but never returned them. How is this any different from daylight robbery? If Miss Qiao hadn’t come looking for trouble, I don’t know how long we would have misunderstood the Xia family!”","“Miss Qiao wanted to seek justice for her mother, but who knew that her mother was the one who plagiarized someone else’s work?! Hehe!”","Xia Mengyan shed tears aggrievedly. “Father, you’ve suffered all these years.”","Xia Ji smiled and waved his hand. “It’s nothing. Yunqiu is my younger sister. She wanted my designs, so I just gave them to her. As long as she liked them, it didn’t matter even if I suffered a little.","“However, we had to make things clear with the collaboration with the Luo family this time. That’s why these designs are under my name. If I had known that this would involve this past, I would’ve kept Yunqiu’s name on them. Sigh...”","Xia Ji said helplessly, “Xi Xi, you’re still too young. You’re rash when you encounter problems. It would’ve been better to talk about it at home. How could you come to the company to kick up a fuss?”","Qiao Xi glanced coldly at him, and a cold light burst out from her eyes.","She knew that the Xia family would not admit to plagiarizing her mother’s work and would push all the blame on her and her mother. However, she did not expect the Xia family to be so shameless. They did not even blush when they lied and even looked helpless as if they had suffered a lot."]},{"number":1237,"title":"Chapter 1237 Not Xi Xi’s Fault","paragraphs":["1237 Not Xi Xi’s Fault","Everyone had different expressions. Xia Cheng had already given an explanation, and the Xia family still had to discuss a collaboration with the Luo family. The Luo family would not collaborate with a family that plagiarized and lied, so the Xia family would definitely not admit that Xia Ji plagiarized Xia Yunqiu’s work no matter what.","Although Qiao Xi had produced evidence, the Xia family had also given a reasonable explanation. They were unable to get the dead to stand up and tell them the truth. Both parties had their own arguments, so it could only depend on who lost first.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with coldness. She had not gotten so angry in such a long time.","Xia Ji pretended to be tolerant. “This isn’t Xi Xi’s fault. She wasn’t even born at that time, so she didn’t know the truth. Actually, I didn’t care at all. If Yunqiu was still alive, she would naturally be representing the Xia family in this collaboration with the Luo family. Unfortunately, she passed away at a young age. Xi Xi, I hope you can understand our painstaking efforts. We don’t want Yunqiu to bear the infamy either, but now that things have come to this, we had no choice but to tell the truth.”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were red, and her heart ached. “Dad! Why didn’t you tell me?! I almost misunderstood you!”","Xia Ji patted her back gently and said with a loving gaze, “Mengyan, I didn’t want to tell you because I was afraid you’d be too rash and stand up for me like Xi Xi. However, your Aunt Yunqiu and I are biological siblings. I won’t ruin Yunqiu’s reputation for my own benefit. Unfortunately, I still exposed it in the end. Now that this matter has been explained clearly, I hope everyone won’t take it to heart. After all, the dead are gone. Everything is in the past.”","Everyone praised him obsequiously, “President Xia, you’re really tolerant! What a rare quality!”","“After all, we’re family! Miss Qiao didn’t know either. Moreover, she was just defending her mother. This is just a misunderstanding. No one is wrong here!”","“Although Xia Yunqiu is the legitimate daughter, it’s too much for her to snatch someone else’s work. She stole the glory that should have belonged to you, President Xia. You’ve really suffered all these years. Fortunately, the truth is finally out.”","“Chairman Xia, Xia Yunqiu has already passed away. You should’ve said this out loud a long time ago. Otherwise, Miss Qiao wouldn’t have misunderstood you. Miss Qiao is a junior and has wronged her elders. She should apologize!”","The businessmen who were close to the Xia family stood up and echoed, “That’s right! Miss Qiao, although this isn’t your fault, you caused a scene in the lobby and seriously affected President Xia’s reputation. You should apologize to him. A tolerant and magnanimous person like President Xia won’t blame you.”","Qiao Xi curled her lips into a gloomy smile, and the coldness in her eyes grew even stronger.","Sumei tugged at the corner of Xia Cheng’s shirt and looked at him aggrievedly. Xia Cheng cleared his throat and said, “Xi Xi, I know that you and Yunqiu had a deep relationship as mother and daughter. Yunqiu is also the child I doted on the most. I’m very happy that you had such intentions, but you were too rash today and misunderstood your uncle. No matter what, he’s your elder. You should apologize. As a child of the Xia family, you should be brave enough to admit your mistake so that you can continue to improve.”","Everyone’s burning gazes landed on Qiao Xi. They also felt that it was understandable for the Xia family to ask Qiao Xi to apologize. After all, today was an important day for the Xia family as they were going to be discussing a collaboration with the Luo family, yet she chose this day to cause trouble. She clearly did not take the Xia family seriously. She should apologize to her elders.","However...","The scene was silent. After a long time, Qiao Xi did not speak. Xia Ji’s expression gradually turned gloomy.","Even if he was an illegitimate child, he was Qiao Xi’s uncle according to seniority. What right did she have to look down on him?","Xia Mengyan bit her lip and cursed in her heart, but there was a fake and gentle smile on her face. “Xi Xi, it’s just an apology. As long as you apologize, my father and grandfather will forgive you. We’re family, so no one will make things difficult for you. It won’t do you any good if you continue to be in a deadlock with us.”","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at her, then a meaningful smile appeared in her eyes. The air around her became icy-cold.","Xia Cheng’s tone gradually became impatient. “Xi Xi, this isn’t your fault, but you slandered your uncle without distinguishing right from wrong. Is it wrong for me to ask you to apologize?”","Everyone stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. Some people knew that she was Mrs. Gu, and they thought that she was able to be so unyielding because she had Gu Zheng as her backer. Those who did not know her identity sighed in their hearts. This woman was really audacious to not take the Xia family seriously at all."]},{"number":1238,"title":"Chapter 1238 It’s Still Uncertain Who’ll Regret It!","paragraphs":["1238 It’s Still Uncertain Who’ll Regret It!","Qiao Xi lazily raised her eyes. “Old Master Xia, why should I apologize?”","Her words were like a rock smashing into a calm lake. The entire venue was in an uproar. They did not expect her to be so arrogant.","Xia Cheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “Qiao Xi, what do you mean?”","“Old Master Xia, your ears aren’t good, so I’ll say it again. I won’t apologize!” Qiao Xi’s voice was calm, but it was filled with a powerful aura. She wasn’t defeated in the slightest in front of Xia Cheng.","!!","The surroundings were silent. Xia Cheng gritted his teeth and said, “Qiao Xi! Think carefully. As long as you apologize to Xia Ji today, we can let bygones be bygones and pretend that nothing happened.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm, and there were no other emotions in her eyes. She raised her head and smiled arrogantly, but her tone was still firm. “I said I won’t apologize!”","“Qiao Xi!!!” Xia Cheng was instantly infuriated. She was just a junior, yet she went against his orders time and time again in front of everyone, causing him to lose all his dignity in front of outsiders!","She shouldn’t think that just because she was married to Gu Zheng that the Xia family wouldn’t dare to attack her. This matter was caused by Qiao Xi’s rashness. Even if Gu Zheng came, he wouldn’t be able to protect the weak Qiao Xi in front of everyone.","Xia Cheng suppressed his anger and said, “Xi Xi, the Luo family will be here soon. The two families want to discuss a collaboration. I don’t want to see anyone cause trouble here. Even if you’re from the Xia family, you can’t fool around like this. If you insist on not apologizing, then don’t blame me for disregarding our kinship and chasing you out!”","Everyone gasped. Miss Qiao was Xia Yunlou’s daughter who had led a wandering life for many years. Now that the old master said such things, it meant that Miss Qiao was not favored by the Xia family.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she said casually, “Old Master Xia, no matter what you say, I still believe that the designs belong to my mother. Since you don’t welcome me, I’ll leave.”","Xia Cheng was instantly proud. It seemed that she was afraid, so...","However, he had only been happy for a few seconds when Qiao Xi coldly said, “But if I leave now, I won’t come back to the Xia family ever again. Even if Xia Ji and you personally come to beg me to come back, I won’t be willing.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi left without turning her head.","Xia Cheng stood on the spot and was stunned for a long time before he reacted. Qiao Xi still dared to say such harsh words? This wild girl actually dared to threaten him? He was the head of the Xia family and Qiao Xi’s grandfather. What right did she have to threaten him?","He was already unable to suppress the flames of rage in his heart and roared furiously at Qiao Xi’s back. “Alright! Even if you’re unwilling to come back, we won’t look for you! Qiao Xi! Let me tell you, don’t regret it if you leave!”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and turned slightly to reveal a stunning smile. “It’s still uncertain who’ll regret it!”","Everyone looked at the tense situation between the two parties and could not help but widen their eyes. However, they did not expect such a stubborn person as Miss Qiao to be scared away in the end.","Someone could not help but sigh. “Miss Qiao is too rash. It wasn’t easy for her to reunite with the Xia family. Now that things have come to this, she won’t get anything good out of it.”","“Although the Xia family has been struggling all these years, they’re still a noble family. Moreover, the Xia family is about to collaborate with the Luo family. Their power and status will increase in the future. There’s no benefit in offending them. Moreover, if Miss Qiao leaves just like that, she won’t have a share in the Xia family’s assets in the future.”","“She’s still too young! The person who plagiarized the designs was clearly Xia Yunqiu, but Miss Qiao insists on believing her mother. She lost a lot this time...”","“She’s so disrespectful to her elders. No wonder Chairman Xia is angry. If it were me, I wouldn’t want such a stubborn granddaughter who causes trouble either.”","“When Miss Qiao left, she even said that she would never step into the Xia family again. Even if Chairman Xia and President Xia begged her, she wouldn’t come back. Actually, in the eyes of the Xia family, she’s nothing at all. After all, she has been wandering outside for many years and has no feelings for the Xia family. Moreover, the Xia family already has Xia Mengyan. To the Xia family, Qiao Xi is just a stranger who’s related to them by blood.”","Hearing everyone’s discussions, Xia Mengyan pursed her lips proudly. The resentment in her heart finally dissipated.","However, Xia Mengyan still could not believe that Qiao Xi would leave just like that. She left without turning the Xia family upside down first?","According to Qiao Xi’s usual character, she wouldn’t be able to wait to blow things up and make the Xia family lose all their dignity. It was really not her character to return in defeat like this!"]},{"number":1239,"title":"Chapter 1239 The Luo Family’s Power Can’t Be Underestimated","paragraphs":["1239 The Luo Family’s Power Can’t Be Underestimated","With Xia Mengyan’s understanding of Qiao Xi, she was not the kind of person who would be easily defeated and leave dejectedly without achieving her goal. However, she left just like that today. It was truly strange.","A trace of uneasiness surged in Xia Mengyan’s heart. Could it be that Qiao Xi still had a backup plan?","She had always been uneasy and afraid that Qiao Xi would interfere with their collaboration with the Luo family. It was only when the Luo family appeared that her heart calmed down and she smiled generously.","It seemed that she had overestimated Qiao Xi. The Luo family was not affected by Qiao Xi.","Moreover, the person sent by the Luo family to discuss the collaboration this time was actually the butler, who had always been in charge of the Luo family’s internal and external matters. Although he was a butler, this person had a lot of power. The head of the Luo family trusted him very much and treated him as a brother. Since he personally appeared, it meant that the Luo family valued this collaboration very much.","Butler Luo had just gotten out of the car and walked to the door when everyone congratulated Xia Cheng.","“Congratulations, Chairman Xia!”","“Chairman Xia, you’re really good at raising your son. You gave birth to such an outstanding son. The Luo family actually took a liking to your work. How rare!”","“Chairman Xia, once you have the resources in the future, don’t forget us brothers!”","Xia Cheng beamed with joy and nodded at everyone. He thought in his heart, ‘Qiao Xi caused a scene in Xia Corporation but still left dejectedly in the end. She’s still too inexperienced to want to fight me!’","On the other hand, after Qiao Xi walked out of Xia Corporation, she immediately contacted Luo Qing. After a minute, the Luo family’s shadow guards appeared in front of her. “Eldest Miss, our young master invites you to rest first. Leave everything to him.”","Qiao Xi smiled and entered a private room in a coffee shop beside Xia Corporation. She leisurely leaned against the chair. Soon, the Xia family would know why she had said those words just now.","The scene she caused at Xia Corporation today was just an appetizer. Did the Xia family really think that she had lost?","Qiao Xi closed her eyes and savored the aromatic coffee. She suddenly recalled that Gu Zheng seemed to be here today as well. What was he doing here?","Gu Corporation and Xia Corporation were so far away from each other. What business did he want to discuss? Why did he have to come here? Or did he just want to drop her off?","Qiao Xi abruptly opened her eyes. Perhaps Gu Zheng was indeed here to see someone, but it was not for business. Maybe he had other motives, so it was not convenient to tell her.","At the thought of this, Qiao Xi immediately took out her phone and sent Song Shiyu a message.","At this moment, a shadow guard of the Luo family knocked on the door and walked in. He said respectfully, “Eldest Miss, Young Master instructed me to prepare desserts for you. He said that if you’re tired, you should sleep for a while. Now, the butler of the Luo family has already entered Xia Corporation’s building.”","Qiao Xi nodded. The guard put down the things and left immediately.","At Xia Corporation’s building.","Everyone from the Xia family was originally worried that the Luo family would not collaborate with the Xia family after hearing the rumors. When Xia Cheng saw Butler Luo getting out of the car and walking toward the entrance of Xia Corporation, he heaved a sigh of relief.","Amidst everyone’s congratulations, Xia Cheng hurriedly went forward. Even though this person was just a butler, Xia Cheng did not dare to be negligent. Butler Luo stood at the back while another young man walked forward. He looked to be Butler Luo’s personal assistant.","Xia Cheng’s attitude was still respectful without any difference.","Some people did not understand why Xia Cheng was so humble. No matter how noble the Luo family was, this person was just the butler’s assistant. Why should Xia Cheng lower his status?","However, some people knew very well in their hearts that the Luo family’s identity was special. To be able to occupy the island and be the king, their strength naturally could not be underestimated. Not only did they have to be rich, but they also had to be powerful and strategic. It was enough to prove that the Luo family was extremely powerful. They could even destroy the entire Xia family.","Xuan Island was the Luo family’s base. The Luo family had lived there for generations. No one knew what they did on the island, but they knew that anyone who provoked the Luo family would have a tragic outcome. Hence, they naturally did not dare to offend the Luo family.","Butler Luo’s assistant walked forward. He was wearing a custom-made suit with an insignia embroidered on his chest. It was the symbol of Ling Pavilion.","“Hello, Chairman Xia.” The assistant smiled faintly.","Xia Cheng immediately said respectfully, “Hello, nice to meet you.”","The butler glanced at him and nodded slightly, but he did not say anything. Even so, it made Xia Cheng extremely excited. Being able to build a relationship with the Luo family was something he had never dreamed of. Now, it had really happened!","Xia Ji and Xia Mengyan did not dare to rashly go forward, but a group of ingratiating people appeared beside them. “President Xia, you’re really awesome! I didn’t expect you to be so accomplished in art!”"]},{"number":1240,"title":"Chapter 1240 Is The Designer Still Alive?","paragraphs":["1240 Is The Designer Still Alive?","“Miss Qiao is really too much! She actually wanted to snatch President Xia’s designs. Fortunately, Chairman Xia appeared in time and explained this matter. Otherwise—”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be sad and interrupted that person. “Don’t blame Xi Xi. This isn’t her fault. She was very close to Aunt Yunqiu. When she heard that Aunt Yunqiu stole my father’s designs, she was unable to accept it for a moment. It’s understandable. If my father hadn’t said it today, I wouldn’t have known about this either.”","That person continued, “Even if she was on good terms with Xia Yunqiu, she can’t be indiscriminate and snatch someone else’s things!”","Listening to everyone criticizing Qiao Xi and Xia Yunqiu, Xia Ji and his daughter revealed proud smiles.","!!","On the other hand, Xia Cheng was talking to the Luo family’s representatives. He wanted to let Xia Ji, as the designer, speak during the official ceremony and show his face in front of the Luo family. If he could obtain the Luo family’s recognition, Xia Ji’s future would definitely be limitless. The Xia family would also receive preferential treatment.","After everyone chatted for a while, the butler’s assistant got to the main topic. “Our young master likes these designs very much and wants to personally carve and restore these exquisite designs. Are there any other designs?”","Xia Cheng explained with a smile, “I’m really sorry, Assistant. He only has a few designs in his hands, but don’t worry. He’s in the lobby now. I’ll introduce him to you later. I promise that he’ll design more outstanding works in the future. They’ll definitely satisfy Young Master Luo!”","Actually, Xia Cheng knew very well that Xia Ji did not know how to draw designs, but he had to say that now. As long as they signed the contract with the Luo family, everything would be fine. If it really did not work out, he could hire someone to draw the designs at a high price.","However, as soon as Xia Cheng finished speaking, the butler’s expression changed. His assistant understood and hurriedly asked, “Chairman Xia, you said that person is inside?”","They looked up and searched the crowd.","Xia Cheng did not expect the Luo family to value these designs so much. He was extremely excited. “Yes! He’s waiting in the lobby. I’ll get him to come over now.”","The assistant suddenly asked in surprise, “Chairman Xia, do you mean that the designer has always been alive? Young Master will be very happy to know about this!”","His voice was very loud and entered the lobby on the first floor. Everyone was stunned for a long time and showed curious expressions. What was going on? Xia Ji was, of course, living well!","The corners of Xia Cheng’s mouth twitched slightly, but the other party was from the Luo family, after all. He naturally did not dare to say anything and could only smile helplessly. “Assistant, you must be joking. Of course, the designer is still alive! It’s a good thing as he can always draw designs for Young Master Luo.”","The assistant was pleasantly surprised. “I see! I remember hearing rumors that the designer has been dead for many years. Young Master and the head of the family even sighed for a long time when they mentioned this. It turns out that it’s just a rumor. It’s good that the designer is still alive.”","Xia Mengyan’s heart thumped violently in the hall. From the moment the assistant asked if the designer was still alive, she had a bad feeling.","Xia Yunqiu passed away many years ago. Could it be that the Luo family knew Xia Yunqiu?","It did not matter. It did not matter even if they knew Xia Yunqiu. Xia Yunqiu had already passed away for so many years. She could not get up from the grave and tell everyone the truth. They could still use what they had just said to explain it to the Luo family.","Of course, Xia Cheng also sensed that something was wrong. He knew that the designer the assistant was talking about was his daughter, Xia Yunqiu. However, Xia Yunqiu passed away many years ago. How could she have known the Luo family? Xia Cheng had heard that Young Master Luo was only in his 20s. When Xia Yunqiu died, Young Master Luo was still a child who could not remember anything. It was absolutely impossible for him to know Xia Yunqiu.","Thinking of this, Xia Cheng heaved a sigh of relief.","The assistant then asked indifferently, “Chairman Xia, our young master didn’t intend to come at first, but now that he knows the designer is still alive, he decided to come and take a look. Young Master will arrive later. Please wait for a moment. Our young master will personally complete the collaboration ceremony. You don’t mind, right?”","Of course, Xia Cheng did not dare to mind. The arrival of the Luo family’s butler had already brought light to the Xia family’s humble dwelling, making everyone present jealous. Now that the person who was coming was the young master of the Luo family, Xia Cheng wouldn’t complain even if he had to personally pick the young master up, not to mention waiting for a while.","Xia Cheng hurriedly nodded in agreement. Under everyone’s burning gazes, his face was filled with pride."]},{"number":1241,"title":"Chapter 1241 Is The Luo Family Really That Scary?","paragraphs":["1241 Is The Luo Family Really That Scary?","The assistant looked at the butler beside him. The butler gave him a look, then the assistant slowly said, “Chairman Xia, since our young master is coming here for that designer, can we meet the person in question first?”","Xia Cheng had always wanted to introduce Xia Ji to the Luo family. Now that the assistant from the Luo family had spoken first, Xia Cheng was naturally excited.","He quickly turned around and said in a kind voice, “Xia Ji, come here. The butler and assistant from the Luo family want to see you.”","When Xia Ji heard his father’s voice, he straightened his clothes and walked out with his head held high. From today onward, he would be an honored guest of the Luo family. No one would mock his identity as an illegitimate child anymore.","!!","All these years, he had been questioned countless times. Even a portion of the higher-ups of Xia Corporation did not agree to let him be the heir and did not allow him to be the next head of the family. It was all because of his identity as an illegitimate child that he could never compare to Yin Yunyi or Xia Yunqiu. They all claimed that he was not qualified to sit in that position.","However, now that the Luo family had personally come to collaborate with him, he had become a supreme designer. In the future, he would lead the Xia family to become the overlord of Li City and become an existence that everyone looked up to. At that time, no one would despise his identity and think that he was not worthy to be the head of the family.","Xia Ji’s face was filled with a proud smile. He walked to Xia Cheng’s side. The father and son were full of smiles. Xia Cheng hurriedly introduced, “Assistant, this is the designer, Xia Ji. He’s also my son.”","Xia Ji smiled and nodded, not noticing their expressions at all. “Hello, I’m the designer, Xia Ji.”","He took a few steps closer and wanted to shake the butler’s hand. He was the heir of the Xia family and a designer of porcelain sculptures. Even though the butler of the Luo family had a lot of power, he was still just a butler. It was only right for the two of them to shake hands. Xia Ji thought that the butler would not refuse.","However, his hand remained in midair. After a few seconds, the butler did not respond.","Xia Ji’s heart skipped a beat, and his expression was extremely ugly. The air around him seemed to have frozen. Everyone present held their breaths and watched this awkward scene.","A moment later, Xia Cheng smiled in embarrassment. “Butler, please don’t take offense. Xia Ji doesn’t know the rules.”","Xia Ji retracted his hand awkwardly, and the smile on his face instantly vanished. The butler, who was at the side, narrowed his eyes. His cold gaze landed on Xia Ji, then he glanced coldly at Xia Cheng.","At that moment, Xia Cheng felt as if a thousand-kilogram rock was pressing down on his spine, making him unable to straighten his back. He had the urge to grovel in front of the butler.","Was the Luo family really that scary? Xia Cheng heard that apart from normal business dealings, Xuan Island had also established an assassin organization. Now, the coldness exuding from the butler’s body seemed to be tainted by the smell of blood. It could not help but make Xia Cheng tremble in fear.","However, he did not understand why the butler was looking at him like this. Did he say something wrong?","Just as Xia Cheng was feeling puzzled, the butler suddenly sneered and said, “Chairman Xia, is this the porcelain designer you were talking about?”","The moment he spoke, the surroundings instantly fell silent. His entire body exuded a powerful aura, making everyone present unable to breathe smoothly. He was just a butler, yet he had such a sharp aura. How terrifying was the Luo family?!","Xia Cheng nodded in fear. “Yes, Butler. This is the designer of the porcelain sculptures...”","“Nonsense! The designer is clearly a woman. How could it be him? How dare you deceive our Luo family?! Do you think we’re fools?”","The butler’s voice was suddenly sharp. His berating voice reached everyone’s ears, scaring them.","The entire venue was silent. Even the sound of breathing had stopped. Xia Mengyan’s heart was beating violently, and her lips were pale as they trembled.","Xia Ji was so scared that his face turned pale. The veins on his forehead were throbbing uneasily.","No one dared to say anything. The reporters also looked at each other. The Luo family said that the real designer was a woman, so Xia Ji was not the real designer. In other words, the Xia family was lying?","After the butler’s reminder, everyone could not help but think of Miss Qiao’s words. Her mother, Xia Yunqiu, passed away many years ago. Could it be that she was the designer mentioned by the Luo family?","Everyone was just guessing, but once they started to suspect something, they disliked Xia Ji even more."]},{"number":1242,"title":"Chapter 1242 Young Master Luo Appears!","paragraphs":["1242 Young Master Luo Appears!","The butler sneered. “Business depends on integrity. Since the Xia family hasn’t shown their due integrity, let’s not talk about the collaboration anymore. I’ll tell Young Master now that he doesn’t have to come!”","With that, the butler turned around and left. The assistant hurriedly followed.","This turn of events made Xia Cheng’s expression change drastically, and his eyes were about to pop out. Xia Corporation was in a difficult situation now, and their competitors were eyeing them covetously. They would trip the Xia family up from time to time. During this period of time, the family had spread the news of the collaboration with the Luo family, which made their competitors finally stop scheming against them. A few of them even came to apologize. If they canceled the collaboration with the Luo family now, the Xia family would become a thorn in those competitors’ side again.","Moreover, he had invited so many reporters and business giants to watch the collaboration take place because he wanted to spread this news to the entire Li City. If this collaboration was canceled and Xia Ji was accused of plagiarizing someone else’s work, how would Xia Corporation survive in Li City in the future?","!!","Why did the Luo family think that the designer was a woman? Could it be that they had seen Xia Yunqiu before? Even if they had, how could they be sure that Xia Yunqiu had drawn so many designs? After all, even the Yin family did not know that Xia Yunqiu’s designs were in their hands. How did the Luo family know?","Could it be... Qiao Xi?!","Yes! She must have leaked the news!","Xia Cheng suddenly reacted. After Qiao Xi left, she must have told the butler of the Luo family about this and exaggerated their mistakes in front of the butler. That was why the butler was so cold to them.","“Excuse me!” At this moment, Xia Cheng couldn’t care less about his image and chased after him crazily. “Don’t leave yet! This must be a misunderstanding. The designer is Xia Ji. Where did you hear that the designer is a woman? Is it from that woman surnamed Qiao? You can’t believe her words!","“She just came to Xia Corporation to cause trouble today. She has always thought that these designs were created by her mother, but it was actually my son who drew them. Her mother snatched them away. After she found out about this, she left dejectedly. As she was unhappy about it, she must have said something in front of you.”","When the butler heard his words, he stopped in his tracks, and his eyes were filled with disdain.","“Butler, I know that there were rumors previously that the designer was a woman, but it’s a long story. Actually, it was my daughter, Xia Yunqiu, who stole my son, Xia Ji’s, designs 24 years ago. She even kept them as her own. That’s why many people think that the designs were hers, but Xia Ji is actually the real designer!","“I didn’t want to say anything about this at first, but after all, Yunqiu was in the wrong. I didn’t want Xia Ji to suffer, so I made this secret public today. This is just a misunderstanding. Butler, our Xia family has no intention of lying to you.”","The disdain in Butler Luo’s eyes grew stronger and stronger. He asked meaningfully, “Chairman Xia, do you want to know where I heard that the designer is Miss Xia Yunqiu?”","His words meant that the designer he was looking for was Xia Yunqiu. Xia Cheng was uneasy, but he knew very well that at this moment, he could only insist that the real designer was Xia Ji to salvage this collaboration. Otherwise, the Xia family would fall into a predicament again.","“Qiao Xi said it, right? Butler, you—”","“It wasn’t her, it was me.” A cold male voice came from outside the door. This man exuded the aura of a king. He was like a noble lion, making others not dare to approach him.","Xia Cheng knew that this man’s identity must be extraordinary, so even though he was a little angry at being interrupted, he still asked gently, “Who are you?”","As Xia Cheng spoke, he looked up at the man in front of him. The man’s eyes were extremely cold, clear, and translucent. They were suffused with a faint blue color. One look at them made one feel as if one were in the deep sea and one’s body was surrounded by cold seawater. The fear of drowning would appear in one’s heart.","Could this person be Young Master Luo?","However, this man was too young and did not have any bodyguards by his side. Other than the aura he exuded and his blue eyes, Xia Cheng was really unable to confirm that this person was Young Master Luo.","Xia Cheng said nervously, “Sir, Butler, I’m very sure that the designer is Xia Ji and not Xia Yunqiu. Xi Xi refused to believe that her mother stole someone else’s designs, so she spouted nonsense in front of you. Don’t believe her!”"]},{"number":1243,"title":"Chapter 1243 Drew The Designs On Xuan Island","paragraphs":["1243 Drew The Designs On Xuan Island","The butler looked at Xia Cheng in front of him and said in a cold tone, “Chairman Xia, you still dare to deceive me even now? Everyone in our Luo family knows that the designer is Madam Xia Yunqiu. Now, you still dare to say that it’s Xia Ji?”","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale. She mustered her courage and walked forward. She said while trembling, “Mister, you’ve misunderstood. The designer has always been my father, but his designs were snatched away by Aunt Yunqiu. Qiao Xi is Aunt Yunqiu’s adopted daughter. She has always thought that Aunt Yunqiu is the real designer, so...”","“Miss Xia, I don’t think I was talking to you, right? Moreover, what does this have to do with Miss Qiao?” The butler glanced at her sharply. Xia Mengyan was so scared that she lowered her head and did not dare to speak.","“Chairman Xia, our Luo family never believes in others when discussing business. We only believe in ourselves. Before we collaborate, we naturally have to understand our business partners. Miss Qiao didn’t tell us the identity of the designer. It was said by the young master and the family head. Are you still going to question our family head and young master?”","Xia Cheng’s eyes were filled with surprise, and he was so scared that his face turned pale. The head and young master of the Luo family both knew that Xia Yunqiu was the designer? Where did they hear that?","After the butler finished speaking and before Xia Cheng could react, he bent slightly toward the young man at the side. “Young Master, you’re here.”","Everyone widened their eyes. This was the young master of the Luo family, Luo Qing?","Xia Cheng suddenly looked up. Coincidentally, Luo Qing was also sizing him up. Their gazes met, and in an instant, Xia Cheng felt as if he had been electrocuted. Half of his body was numb, and sweat trickled down his forehead. His lips trembled. “Y-Young Master Luo?”","“Chairman Xia, I won’t beat about the bush with you.” Luo Qing’s voice was cold. “24 years ago, when Madam Xia Yunqiu was recuperating on Xuan Island, she drew a total of 64 designs. She gave a total of 21 designs to my Luo family. She took the rest of the designs with her, but now, 18 designs have been claimed by Xia Ji as his own.”","Luo Qing slowly looked up, his blue eyes filled with coldness. His voice carried a trace of killing intent. “Chairman Xia, can you explain why?”","The entire venue instantly fell silent. Luo Qing’s voice still echoed in everyone’s minds.","24 years ago, Madam Xia Yunqiu had drawn a total of 64 designs on Xuan Island. She had 43 in her hands, but 18 of them had become Xia Ji’s?","Xia Cheng’s pupils suddenly constricted, and his vision turned blurry. The corners of his mouth twitched slightly.","The uneasiness in Xia Mengyan’s heart instantly turned into fear that invaded her heart. Her body could not help but tremble.","Luo Qing’s words stunned everyone present. Their burning gazes landed on Xia Ji and Xia Cheng. No one said anything, but their gazes were enough to explain everything.","Xia Ji was shocked and afraid. He lowered his head and did not dare to look into Luo Qing’s eyes. At this moment, he had nothing to say.","A few rich daughters stood beside Xia Mengyan. They were all the only daughters of their families. They came to the collaboration ceremony this time to build a good relationship with the Xia family so that they could inherit their family business in the future. Now that the truth was exposed, one of the daughters looked at Xia Mengyan in shock.","“Mengyan! Are the designs your father’s work? Young Master Luo says that they’re your aunt’s design. He can’t be lying, right?! So what Miss Qiao said just now is the truth?”","Everyone looked at Xia Mengyan. She bit her lip and did not say anything.","The young miss wanted to ask another question, but she was stopped by her father. Actually, anyone with discerning eyes knew the current situation. The Xia family did not retort, which meant that they were already guilty. They thought that since Xia Yunqiu was dead, no one would stand up to question them, so they claimed her work as theirs and even accused her of snatching Xia Ji’s design.","Xia Cheng, who had always been calm, could not remain calm anymore. However, he had been in charge of the Xia family for so many years. He was used to seeing the world. He forced himself to calm down and squeezed out a smile. He said respectfully, “Young Master Luo, I think there must be a misunderstanding. Everyone knows that Yunqiu grew up in Shengdu. Why would she go to Xuan Island?”","Luo Qing asked indifferently, “Chairman Xia, are you sure that these designs belong to Xia Ji?”","At this point, Xia Cheng naturally could not deny it. He could only brace himself and answer, “Y-Yes, it’s Xia Ji...”","Before he could finish, a higher-up of Xia Corporation rushed in in a panic and shouted, “Director Xia! There’s bad news!”"]},{"number":1244,"title":"Chapter 1244 Do You Want To Be An Enemy Or A Friend?","paragraphs":["1244 Do You Want To Be An Enemy Or A Friend?","Xia Cheng glared at that person unhappily, but the higher-up did not realize it and said loudly in front of everyone, “Chairman Xia, the designs left behind by Miss Yunqiu have all been circulated. Moreover, the Luo family and the Shen family in the capital are testifying for Miss Yunqiu. Now that public opinion is everywhere online, the company’s shares have plummeted. You have to quickly solve this matter, or the company will be doomed!”","The moment that was said, Xia Cheng’s head buzzed. His vision darkened, and he almost fainted. He forced himself to calm down and widened his eyes at Luo Qing.","The butler of the Luo family, who was at the side, said with a smile, “I’m sorry, Chairman Xia. Since you refuse to admit it, we can only resort to this. The person we wish to collaborate with is the real designer, not an impostor. If we get the name wrong, how can we face Madam Xia Yunqiu’s soul in heaven?”","At this moment, Xia Cheng’s phone vibrated crazily. He took out his phone and looked at it. His face was as pale as paper.","So this was the Luo family’s power? To them, dealing with the Xia family was as easy as crushing an ant. Just this small lesson caused the entire Xia family to be in turmoil.","Luo Qing’s tone was firm as he made his final decision. “Uncle Zheng.”","Luo Zheng, the butler, took two steps forward and said with a trace of disdain, “Director Xia, this collaboration won’t be canceled, but we won’t be working with Mr. Xia Ji. We’ll work with Miss Xia Yunqiu.","“It can be said that Miss Xia Yunqiu’s designs are perfect. Our patriarch likes them very much. What happened just now was just a small lesson. I hope you can understand our Luo family’s intentions. If you’re willing to return the designs to Miss Xia Yunqiu, this collaboration will go very smoothly. Our Luo family will also take responsibility for causing a series of losses to the Xia family.”","Luo Zheng paused, and his eyes suddenly turned sharp. “But if you’re unwilling...”","Of course, Xia Cheng did not want to agree. Xia Ji was his favorite son. He had nurtured him carefully for so many years so that he would be able to successfully become the head of the family in the future. Moreover, Xia Ji’s daughter, Xia Mengyan, was also very capable. The father and daughter would definitely bring the Xia family to greater heights.","However, now that something had happened and Xia Ji had been scolded like this, how was he going to be the heir of the Xia family in the future? How could the higher-ups of Xia Corporation agree?","However, if he did not agree...","“Chairman Xia, haven’t you thought it through? If the collaboration is canceled, not only will you suffer a huge loss, but the Xia family will also be the Luo family’s enemy from now on. Are you sure you want to be enemies with the Luo family?”","Luo Zheng’s tone was calm. “If you agree to collaborate, the Xia family and our Luo family will be friends. Whether you want to be enemies or friends, it all depends on your choice.”","The higher-ups of Xia Corporation all looked at Xia Cheng and said anxiously, “Chairman Xia, please agree! The company’s shares have been plummeting, and the internet is filled with curses. If we become enemies with the Luo family, the Xia family will be completely doomed!”","“Director Xia! They’re clearly Miss Yunqiu’s designs, so they should have her name on them. She’s also your daughter! You can’t destroy the entire Xia family for Xia Ji!”","“That’s right! Xia Ji is just an illegitimate child, while Miss Yunqiu is the daughter of your first wife. Moreover, Miss Yunqiu and the Luo family are old acquaintances. It’s only right to collaborate with the Luo family in her name!”","Xia Cheng originally wanted to use this collaboration to make a name for Xia Ji. After collaborating with the Luo family in his name, the higher-ups of Xia Corporation would definitely agree to let him inherit the company. However, not only did Xia Ji not get the chance to collaborate with the Luo family, but he also offended the Luo family of Xuan Island. It was even harder for him to be the heir.","At this moment, many of the higher-ups’ eyes were filled with anxiety. They knew that if the Luo family wanted to destroy Xia Corporation, they just had to move their fingers. Once Xia Corporation fell, the shares in their hands would be worthless. Who would be responsible for their losses? Hence, they all advised Xia Cheng to agree.","Xia Cheng looked at the dozens of calls on his phone and listened to the higher-ups’ persuasion. He could only grit his teeth and say word by word, “The real designer... is Yunqiu, not... Xia Ji. He was just muddle-headed. He’ll apologize to everyone later.”","Xia Ji’s vision darkened, and his breathing almost stopped. His heart ached. He was clearly in heaven a moment ago and was flattered by everyone, but all his glory had vanished at this moment. He had fallen into a quagmire and was hated and mocked by everyone. He had once again become an illegitimate child who was despised by everyone. He was even more detestable than before."]},{"number":1245,"title":"Chapter 1245 The Imposter’s Daughter","paragraphs":["1245 The Imposter’s Daughter","Xia Ji’s face was pale and so were his lips. He staggered forward. “Dad...”","“No! No, I don’t accept it!” Old Madam Xia finally reacted and shouted crazily. The proud expression on her face instantly turned to shock and anger. She roared in the lobby without caring about her image.","Her expression was vicious, making her old face even more terrifying. She opened her mouth and shouted, “No! These designs belong to Xia Ji. That b*tch is already dead, so why bother putting her name there? This honor belongs to Xia Ji. If the name on those designs is changed to Xia Yunqiu’s name, what will Xia Ji do? How will he raise his head in the future? Xia Cheng! Are you going to watch us die?”","Luo Qing’s gaze landed on her as he sneered. His sneer was not loud, but it scared everyone.","Ai Sumei did not think too much about it. She only knew that if they changed the name on the designs to Xia Yunqiu’s name, Xia Ji would be infamous. She would also lose her reputation. Most importantly, it would be difficult for Xia Ji to sit in the position of the head of the family.","She did not care about what would happen to Xia Corporation. She only cared about her son. She wanted her son to become the head of the Xia family. When the old master died, the Xia family would belong to the mother and son. However, now that the name on those designs would be changed to Xia Yunqiu, all the glory would belong to Xia Yunqiu. No one would take her son seriously!","That b*tch was already dead. What right did she have to snatch this away from her son?","Xia Cheng glared angrily. This idiot actually dared to spout nonsense in front of Young Master Luo!","Before he could speak, Luo Zheng said casually, “Young Master, this is Chairman Xia’s current wife. I heard in the past that she doesn’t like the children of the first wife. Even though Miss Xia has passed away, Old Madam Xia’s hatred hasn’t subsided. She curses at the deceased and even wants to snatch Miss Xia’s belongings. It’s really an eye-opener for us.","“In my opinion, some people are innately useless. I advise you not to hand the family business to such people, Chairman Xia, lest you lose the family business you worked so hard to build. It’ll be too late to regret then.”","When Xia Ji heard this, his expression was extremely ugly.","Xia Cheng naturally understood what Luo Zheng meant. The Luo family wanted him to give up on Xia Ji and choose a new heir. He looked at Xia Ji meaningfully and sighed helplessly. “I agree to write Yunqiu’s name on the designs and announce to the public that Xia Ji is an impostor. He stole Yunqiu’s designs back then, which caused a series of misunderstandings. It’s his fault. I’ll make him apologize in front of everyone!”","“Dad!”","“Ah Cheng!”","Their roars sounded at the same time. Xia Cheng’s breathing trembled, and the smell of blood filled his throat. “Young Master Luo, what do you think?”","The higher-ups of Xia Corporation rushed forward and pulled Xia Ji and Old Madam Xia back. Everyone subdued them and covered their mouths, afraid that they would spout nonsense in front of the Luo family.","Everyone looked up at Luo Qing. Now that Xia Cheng had already agreed and announced that he would change the name on the designs to Xia Yunqiu, Luo Qing should be satisfied, right?","However, under everyone’s expectant gazes, Luo Qing said casually, “There’s nothing much to say.”","Luo Qing’s eyes were filled with disdain as he smiled coldly. “Director Xia, you seem to feel very aggrieved? But I’m not satisfied.”","Not satisfied? What else did he want?","Xia Cheng’s heart ached violently, and he almost stopped breathing.","Luo Zheng said indifferently, “Chairman Xia, it has been proven that the designs are all Madam Xia Yunqiu’s work. In that case, the person in charge of this collaboration should be Madam Xia’s daughter.”","“We’ve already decided on Mengyan...”","Luo Zheng interrupted without hesitation, “So what? Our young master won’t want to work with the daughter of an impostor, so our young master has chosen a more suitable person to be in charge. If you insist on Miss Xia Mengyan being in charge, then there’s no need to continue discussing this collaboration.”","The daughter of an impostor?","Xia Mengyan was so angry that her face turned red. Why did they call her that? In the past, everyone said that she was the daughter of an illegitimate child. She had worked hard for so many years to get rid of the label, but now, she was being scolded again.","Xia Cheng could no longer care about Xia Mengyan’s feelings. He asked tentatively, “In that case, who did Young Master Luo choose?”","A trace of gentleness appeared in Luo Qing’s eyes again as he said the name.","At this moment, in the cafe beside Xia Corporation.","Qiao Xi lay on a bed. The beautician was applying cream to her face and saying with a smile, “Miss Qiao, your skin is really good. It’s as smooth as a baby’s.”","Qiao Xi grunted in enjoyment. “I was born beautiful!”"]},{"number":1246,"title":"Chapter 1246 Kneel And Apologize","paragraphs":["1246 Kneel And Apologize","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. The corners of her mouth curled into a smile when she heard the voice on the phone.","Xia Cheng’s extremely kind voice came from the phone. “Xi Xi...”","He was naturally calling to beg Qiao Xi to return to the Xia Corporation because the person in charge, Luo Qing, had chosen Qiao Xi to collaborate with. At that time, when he said this name, everyone was dumbfounded.","Previously, they mocked Qiao Xi for being chased away by the Xia family and not being liked by the Xia family. Now, they could not help but feel ashamed. Miss Qiao was someone Young Master Luo had acknowledged.","Xia Cheng’s expression was ugly, and the corners of his mouth twitched. “But Xi Xi...”","“Mr. Xia, our young master’s words are very clear. He only wants Miss Qiao to be in charge. If you’re unwilling to let Miss Qiao come back and insist on watching Xia Corporation be destroyed, we have nothing to say.”","Luo Zheng said, “We don’t care if Miss Qiao is Miss Xia’s biological daughter or adopted daughter. In short, we’ve already decided on Miss Qiao. If you don’t agree, then I might think that you’re disregarding the company’s safety for the sake of your illegitimate child.”","“Director Xia! You have to take the overall situation into consideration!”","“Quickly invite Miss Qiao back! She’s also from the Xia family!”","Hearing everyone’s shouts, Xia Cheng’s throat was dry. How could he beg Qiao Xi? However, when he saw the Luo family’s determined appearance, he knew that if he did not lower his head, Xia Corporation would face a devastating blow.","He could only brace himself and call Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, you’ll be in charge of the collaboration! Are you coming over now? I’ll send a car to pick you up. Can you come over now?”","“What collaboration?” Qiao Xi lazily lay on the bed and replied with an indifferent expression, “What does the Xia family’s matter have to do with me?”","Xia Cheng suppressed his anger and said patiently, “Xi Xi, I know that the designs belong to your mother. I didn’t investigate it clearly before. Now that the Xia family wants to collaborate with the Luo family, as Yunqiu’s daughter, you should be in charge of the collaboration this time...”","“Why should I be the person in charge? Shouldn’t we let Xia Mengyan do it?” Qiao Xi said slowly.","Xia Cheng was speechless, and the flames of rage in his heart surged. Qiao Xi was only a junior, yet she was actually putting on airs in front of him. Did she really think of herself as someone important?","However, in front of Young Master Luo and the many higher-ups, he did not dare reprimand Qiao Xi. He could only try his best to suppress his anger and say gently, “Xi Xi, it’s my fault for what happened before. I misunderstood you. I apologize...”","“That’s not necessary. I don’t need your apology.” Qiao Xi’s attitude was still casual. “If you want me to go back and be in charge of the collaboration, that’s fine, but...”","Everyone in the lobby became nervous. What request did she have?","“But I have a request.” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “When I left Xia Corporation today, I said that even if you begged me, I wouldn’t go back. But I can give you a chance now. I just want to know why Xia Ji’s name is written on my mother’s designs. Did Xia Ji lie to everyone, or did someone plan this with him?”","Qiao Xi’s voice was very soft, but every word she said was forcing the Xia family to admit the truth. She continued, “If you’re willing to make the mastermind kneel and apologize to me, I can be the person in charge of the collaboration.”","Get the mastermind to kneel and apologize to her? But who was the mastermind? Was it Xia Ji who claimed Xia Yunqiu’s works as his, or was it Xia Cheng who was hiding the truth for Xia Ji?","The lobby was silent. Qiao Xi’s words were truly unacceptable to Xia Cheng. Why did he have to kneel and apologize to her? No matter if it was him or Xia Ji, it was absolutely impossible for them to kneel to her!","Qiao Xi waited for a moment, but there was still no sound on the other end of the phone. She had already lost her patience. “Then forget it...”","“Grandpa, I’ll apologize!”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s eyes turned red as she said pitifully, “Since someone has to take responsibility, I’m willing to go. You and my father are both elders. How can you kneel down to Xi Xi? This will also affect Xi Xi’s reputation. Xi Xi and I are sisters. It’s most suitable for me to kneel and apologize to her.”","When everyone heard Xia Mengyan’s words, a trace of admiration appeared in their eyes. They had to admit that Miss Xia was quite responsible and knew how to take the overall situation into consideration. She indeed had the demeanor of a daughter of a rich family.","Moreover, everyone knew very well that Xia Ji was the one who snatched Xia Yunqiu’s designs 24 years ago. At that time, Xia Mengyan was just born and did not know anything at all. However, she actually took the initiative to take responsibility and kneel down to apologize to Miss Qiao."]},{"number":1247,"title":"Chapter 1247 Xia Yunqiu’s Relationship With The Luo Family","paragraphs":["1247 Xia Yunqiu’s Relationship With The Luo Family","In everyone’s opinion, although Miss Xia was the daughter of an illegitimate child, her character and knowledge were very outstanding. To be able to sacrifice herself for the sake of the overall situation and kneel down to apologize for her father meant that she was very filial.","Qiao Xi sneered when she heard the praise coming from the other end of the phone. It would be best if Xia Mengyan knelt down and admitted her mistake. It was truly a delight to be able to watch Xia Mengyan grovel and admit her mistake.","10 minutes later, Qiao Xi returned to the lobby. Xia Mengyan went forward nervously. “Xi Xi...”","“Miss Qiao.” Luo Zheng went forward to greet her with a smile. “Previously, your mother, Madam Xia Yunqiu, even wrote a letter to the head of our family. She said that if she had the chance, she would bring you to Xuan Island.","!!","“After that, when our madam died of an illness, she kept thinking about Madam Xia. Our Luo family searched for her for a long time but couldn’t find her. Madam said that she wouldn’t have the chance to meet her anymore and could only instruct me to give these gifts to her. She died with regret.","“Now that Madam Xia Yunqiu has passed away, as her daughter, the things our madam left behind should be handed to you. I hope you won’t refuse.”","After Luo Zheng finished speaking, the assistant took out a sandalwood box. There was a jade bracelet inside. It was obvious that it was expensive.","“This was Madam’s favorite piece of jewelry. She had always wanted to give this bracelet to Madam Xia, but unfortunately, she didn’t have the chance. There are many other gifts like this. I’ll get someone to deliver them to your house soon,” Luo Zheng said.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at Luo Qing before reaching out to take the bracelet.","Butler Luo, who was arrogant and cold in front of Xia Cheng, was extremely respectful in front of Qiao Xi.","Everyone listened for a long time before understanding that Luo Zheng was respectful to Qiao Xi because of Xia Yunqiu. The wife of the head of Xuan Island seemed to have a good relationship with Xia Yunqiu. Even though Xia Yunqiu left Xuan Island 24 years ago, the wife of the head still remembered her and prepared gifts for her every year.","They did not expect Xia Cheng to give birth to such a powerful daughter. Although Xia Yunqiu passed away for so many years, the Luo family still had deep feelings for her. With this relationship, the Luo family would definitely treat the Xia family well.","Young Master Luo had taught the Xia family a lesson just now, but that was the punishment for offending Madam Xia Yunqiu. As long as they did not make similar mistakes in the future, the Xia family’s status would definitely rise.","Butler Luo was so respectful to Qiao Xi, which meant that Xia Yunqiu’s status on Xuan Island was equivalent to that of the owner. It was just that Xia Ji was unlucky. He could have stolen anyone else’s things, but he just had to steal Xia Yunqiu’s. However, judging from the Luo family’s attitude, they would not take their anger out on Xia Cheng. They would definitely be a little more respectful to Xia Yunqiu’s father.","Everyone looked at Xia Cheng with envy.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she glanced meaningfully at Xia Cheng. His entire body was stiff, and his teeth were chattering. He knew very well in his heart that there was no father-daughter relationship between him and Xia Yunqiu. A few years ago, Xia Yunqiu moved to the Yin family with Yin Lianxin.","At this moment, Luo Qing said, “Since you’re here, Miss Qiao, we can hold the collaboration ceremony.”","Xia Corporation had long been prepared and was just waiting for the Luo family to nod in agreement. Now that Young Master Luo had spoken, they could not wait to complete the ceremony immediately to prevent him from going back on his word.","Xia Cheng had thousands of thoughts in his heart. In any case, outsiders did not know that his relationship with Xia Yunqiu was not good. Since Xia Yunqiu’s surname was Xia, she was from the Xia family. She should bring benefits and honor to the Xia family. Now that Xia Ji’s reputation had already been ruined, he could no longer care about him. The most important thing now was to protect Xia Corporation.","Luo Qing handed the contract to Qiao Xi. Under the burning gazes of everyone, Qiao Xi picked up the pen.","The reporters hurriedly went forward and took a few suitable photos. The atmosphere in the lobby returned to normal, but the next second...","Luo Zheng suddenly turned around and said, “Miss Xia, now that Miss Qiao has agreed to collaborate, it’s time for you to kneel and admit your mistake.”","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled as she bit her lip. She knew very well that even if she was unwilling, the higher-ups of Xia Corporation would still force her to kneel. After all, no one wanted to see Xia Corporation destroyed.","She raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi who was standing in the crowd. She was the center of attention when signing the contract, yet she now had to kneel in front of Qiao Xi and admit her mistake. They were both daughters of the Xia family. What right did one have to be high and mighty while the other had to kneel in front of everyone and be mocked?","Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at her as if it was only right for her to kneel. To Qiao Xi, it did not matter who knelt here. Xia Mengyan was just a dispensable existence."]},{"number":1248,"title":"Chapter 1248 Alligator Tears","paragraphs":["1248 Alligator Tears","Qiao Xi was arrogant, while she had to be humble. The two of them were clearly the same age, yet they had different fates.","Xia Mengyan’s sharp nails dug into her palms. She bit her lip and slowly knelt in front of Qiao Xi. She was wearing a knee-length dress. When she knelt, her knees came into contact with the floor, causing waves of dull pain.","‘Qiao Xi! Qiao Xi! I won’t let you off!’","Why did the Luo family stand up for Qiao Xi? Why did Qiao Xi have so many backers? Why could she, Xia Mengyan, only rely on the Xia family? Why was she inferior since she was born? She was clearly not inferior to Qiao Xi!","!!","Xia Mengyan would not forget today’s humiliation. She would definitely take revenge on Qiao Xi!","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had already signed the contract and handed it to Luo Qing. Then, she glanced indifferently at Xia Mengyan.","Qiao Xi was very clearly aware that Xia Mengyan had taken the initiative to kneel and admit her mistake because she was betting that Qiao Xi only said those words in a moment of anger and would not really make her kneel in front of everyone. After all, kneeling to someone was an extremely great humiliation, and it was not good for her reputation.","However, she did not care about the opinions of outsiders. Since Xia Mengyan had agreed to kneel and admit her mistake, she had to do it. Moreover, the person who asked Xia Mengyan to kneel just now was not her but Butler Luo.","Xia Mengyan should be thinking of crying a few tears of grievance. Would she and Luo Qing be soft-hearted then? However, Qiao Xi would never pity the enemy, nor would she believe Xia Mengyan’s pretense.","Now that Xia Mengyan was kneeling here, she should be very humiliated, right? There was still anger in her eyes, but what right did she have to be angry? It was clearly the Xia family’s fault, yet she still had the cheek to feel angry.","Qiao Xi glanced at her and said casually, “Young Master Luo, there are too many people here. Let’s go to the meeting room to talk.”","Luo Qing left with Qiao Xi. When the reporters saw that they could not take any photos, they left one after another. In an instant, only the Xia family was left in the lobby.","Old Madam Xia hurriedly pulled Xia Mengyan up and complained, “Ah Cheng, how could you make Mengyan kneel?! She was mocked in front of so many people!”","Xia Cheng had a helpless expression. “What else could I do? The Luo family has already decided on Qiao Xi. If Qiao Xi didn’t come back, the collaboration would be canceled. At that time, it’s very likely that Xia Corporation will go bankrupt. Everything we have now will be gone!”","Xia Mengyan shed tears aggrievedly and sobbed softly. “Grandpa, Grandma, I’m fine. It doesn’t matter if I suffer a little. As long as I can protect Grandpa and Father’s reputation, I’ll do anything!”","Xia Cheng nodded, and his eyes were filled with determination. “Mengyan, it’s been hard on you this time, but you have to remember that even if Xi Xi is the person in charge of the collaboration, the glory and benefits will still belong to the Xia family. Although Qiao Xi is in charge, we’re the final winners. You have to take the overall situation into consideration and stop fooling around! Do you understand?”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly nodded. “I’ll remember, Grandpa. It’s just that I’m afraid that Xi Xi still has some resentment in her heart and might not be able to successfully complete the collaboration. Moreover, most of Aunt Yunqiu’s designs were destroyed. They need to be restored. I’ve learned porcelain design, so I can help restore them.”","“That’s right! Mengyan has studied recovery technology at university. Moreover, it’s just a few designs. Mengyan will definitely be able to help. Why don’t we let Mengyan help Qiao Xi?!” Old Madam Xia said excitedly.","Xia Cheng was a little hesitant, but Xia Mengyan’s eyes lit up. If she could help, the final credit would definitely belong to her. If she restored the designs, so she would definitely make the Luo family look at her in a different light. At that time, the Luo family would also know who the truly outstanding daughter of the Xia family was.","...","At this moment, in the cafe beside Xia Corporation.","Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa with his eyes closed. The door of the private room was pushed in, and a group of people walked in.","He Tingchen walked in front of Gu Zheng and smiled. “Ah Zheng, long time no see.”","Gu Zheng opened his eyes and glanced at the group of people coldly. A mocking smile appeared on his face.","He Wenxian sat opposite Gu Zheng and smiled gently. “President Gu, it’s been so many years since we last met. My brother has been thinking about you. We just returned to the country and he was already clamoring to see you. He felt embarrassed to come alone, so he got me to accompany him.”","This explanation was very clear. It was not He Wenxian who wanted to come but He Tingchen who pulled her here. She was different from other women. She did not want to seduce Gu Zheng and just treated him as a friend. The two of them would not meet in private, which was why the three siblings came over.","He Tingchen talked about many things that had happened all these years. Suddenly, he realized that a group of men in black had appeared in the building opposite. He was a little surprised. “The Luo family?”"]},{"number":1249,"title":"Chapter 1249 Everything She Does Is Right","paragraphs":["1249 Everything She Does Is Right","“Young Master He, you know the Luo family?” Gu Zheng asked.","He Tingchen waved his hand. “Of course not, but I know that they established an assassin organization and have many skilled assassins under them. Ah Zheng, they’re not simple!”","“Oh?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","He Tingchen was about to speak when there was a commotion outside the door. He went out to ask a few questions. When he returned to the private room, he asked in surprise, “Ah Zheng, do you know that your wife is actually forcing a young lady to kneel?”","“So what?” Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent.","He Tingchen was even more shocked. “She’s your wife. Her words and actions represent you. Today, she forced someone to kneel. Her doing this will affect you...”","“What do you want me to do?” Gu Zheng interrupted casually. “Young Master He, you don’t seem to agree with Mrs. Gu’s actions?”","He Tingchen hesitated for a moment. Sensing that Gu Zheng was a little unhappy, he deliberated for a moment. “Ah Zheng, that’s not what I meant. It’s just that your wife’s actions...”","“She’s right no matter what she does.” Gu Zheng’s tone was cold. “Moreover, outsiders don’t have the right to judge what she wants to do.”","“Brother!” Seeing that the situation was not good, He Wenxian hurriedly pulled He Tingchen over, then smiled in embarrassment. “I’m sorry, President Gu. My brother is a straightforward person. It’s not that he thinks that Mrs. Gu is in the wrong, but he’s just worried about you. I also looked for a friend of mine who’s a reporter to ask about what happened today. I know that Chairman Xia’s illegitimate child did something wrong first. Mrs. Gu can’t be blamed. She did that for her adoptive mother.”","A trace of impatience appeared in Gu Zheng’s eyes. Song Shijing understood instantly and said respectfully, “Young Master He, Miss He, I’m sorry. Our president has something important to attend to. Please leave first.”","He Tingchen still wanted to say something, but he was stopped by He Wenxian. She smiled in embarrassment, and her every move was very appropriate. “President Gu, since you still have something to do, we’ll leave first.”","He Tingchen was pulled away by He Wenxian with a face full of question marks. He Wenyin looked at Gu Zheng with a subtle gaze. The moment she stood up and left, she placed a note at the bottom of the cup.","After the three of them left, Song Shijing took out the note from the bottom of the glass. He opened it and gasped.","[I was wrong earlier. Their target isn’t you but your wife. Tell her to be careful. They’ll do anything!]","“President!” Song Shijing tensed up.","Gu Zheng’s face was still calm, but his eyes were already filled with killing intent. “What do you think of those two from the He family?”","Song Shijing thought for a moment and said, “Young Master He is still the same. He’s pure, kind, and a little stupid. He can’t stand others being wronged and easily used.”","“Eldest Miss He looks gentle and kind, but she’s just pretending. She’s very similar to He Weinian.”","“Yes.” Gu Zheng nodded. “The people in the He family are like He Weinian. They like to pretend to be kind. They want everyone to think that they’re kind, honest, and gentle.”","He Weinian wanted to use all the beautiful words in the world to describe himself. He pretended not to reveal anything, but the more perfect a person was, the more fake they looked.","Gu Zheng took out a lighter and burned the note to ashes. Then, he said coldly, “I don’t care if the He family wants to pretend to be kind, but if they want to attack Xi Xi, how can I ignore them?”","“President, what are you going to do?” Song Shijing’s heart trembled. He knew that Young Madam was the president’s life. If anyone wanted to touch Young Madam, the president would not show any mercy.","What was the He family’s motive for suddenly returning to Li City and creating a kind image for themselves?","Song Shijing suddenly remembered the note He Wenyin had left behind. Could it be that the He family had done so much so that they would not be suspected when they made a move in the future?","After all, who would believe that a family filled with kindness and conscience would kill someone?","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. Why would they target Xi Xi? What exactly did they want?","Song Shijing suddenly said, “President, Young Madam is done. Do you want her to come here?”","Gu Zheng nodded. Song Shijing was about to go out to pick Qiao Xi up when Gu Zheng stood up. “I’ll go.”","At this moment, He Tingchen was sitting by the window on the first floor of the cafe. He looked unhappy. “Wenxian, I wasn’t done just now. Why were you in such a rush to pull me out?”","He Wenxian chuckled. “Brother, Gu Zheng dotes on Mrs. Gu very much. If you say bad things about Mrs. Gu in front of Gu Zheng, won’t you be slapping Gu Zheng’s face?”"]},{"number":1250,"title":"Chapter 1250 Miss He Is Understanding","paragraphs":["1250 Miss He Is Understanding","He Tingchen’s gaze suddenly looked out of the window. It was raining outside. Gu Zheng, such a proud person, was actually holding an umbrella and waiting for Qiao Xi at the entrance of Xia Corporation’s building.","After Qiao Xi walked out, the two of them held the umbrella and entered the cafe. From the beginning until the end, the man tilted the umbrella toward Qiao Xi, afraid that she would get drenched in the rain.","He Tingchen looked at the two of them and could not help but sigh. “Ah Zheng really dotes on Mrs. Gu. I was originally worried that he would be lonely, but it seems that I was thinking too much. He’s doing very well now.”","The viciousness in He Wenxian’s eyes vanished in an instant, and a gentle smile appeared on her face. “That’s right. So if you had said that his wife wasn’t good in front of Gu Zheng, of course, he would’ve gotten angry. Even if it was Mrs. Gu’s fault today, Gu Zheng wouldn’t want to hear anyone say that she isn’t good. That’s his family matter, after all. We shouldn’t interfere too much.”","He Tingchen’s eyes were filled with gratification when he heard his sister’s words. “Wenxian, I remember you once said that if Yin Yin doesn’t want to marry Ah Zheng, you’d marry him. I thought you liked Ah Zheng a lot, but I didn’t expect you to not be sad at all when you heard that Ah Zheng was married!”","At this moment, a noblewoman happened to enter and heard He Wenxian’s words. “Brother, although Gu Zheng and I are childhood sweethearts, he’s married now, so we’re just friends. I have to keep a distance from him, lest Mrs. Gu misunderstands and causes him trouble.","“Moreover, I only treat Gu Zheng as my brother. I never liked him to begin with. If we have to meet in the future, I’ll call you and Yin Yin over. We can’t meet alone. Otherwise, Mrs. Gu will definitely be unhappy if she finds out.”","When the few of them heard He Wenxian’s words, they could not help but discuss in low voices. “Miss He is really understanding! When she found out that President Gu was already married, she stopped meeting him in private. The daughter of the He family is indeed extraordinary!”","“Miss He is good, but Mrs. Gu is too much. She gets unhappy even when President Gu is just hanging out with his friends. Speaking of which, Miss He and President Gu are childhood sweethearts. They’ve known each other since they were young. Now, for Mrs. Gu’s sake, their relationship is estranged.”","Although their voices were not loud, He Wenxian still caught the main point of their words and smiled proudly.","“Brother, it’s getting late. Let’s go home,” He Wenxian said.","He Tingchen stood up, his eyes filled with affection. “My sister is really understanding, gentle, and beautiful. I’ve never seen a socialite more outstanding than you! If only Yin Yin could be as steady and sensible as you. In my opinion, Mrs. Gu can’t compare to you!”","He Wenxian smiled shyly and pulled him away.","On the other hand, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi entered the cafe. A table full of dishes was already prepared in the private room. Qiao Xi widened her eyes in surprise. “Isn’t this a cafe? We can get a meal like this here?”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Of course. Not only can we feast here, but didn’t you also receive beauty treatment here, Mrs. Gu?”","“You even know about this? Sure enough, money can make the world go round,” Qiao Xi said as she picked up a piece of meat and tasted it.","“Has everything been settled?” Gu Zheng asked.","Qiao Xi nodded. “It’s about time. Moreover, the Xia family probably doesn’t know that I’m here for Xia Yunlou. Why were you here today? Just to see the He family?”","Gu Zheng said meaningfully, “Yes, I met them to understand the situation.”","“What’s going on?” Qiao Xi looked at him curiously. “Have you discovered the He family’s secret?”","Gu Zheng suddenly recalled the note He Wenyin left behind. He raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi, then quickly looked away. “Not for the time being, but I don’t think their goal is money and power.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “Then what could it be? If it’s not for money and power, what else could it be? If that isn’t the He family’s goal, why did they come all the way back to Li City?”","“Although there’s very little news of the He family overseas, everyone around them says that they’re famous for being kind people. Even though they’ve returned to Li City, they’re still very popular. Everyone has a high evaluation of the He family. They’re gentle, kind, and polite. It seems that the He family has put a lot of effort into this.”","To do something to the extreme, one had to invest several times more energy than others. The He family had spent so much effort to be known for being kind. It was impossible for them to do it just for reputation’s sake.","However, Qiao Xi really did not know what they were up to."]},{"number":1251,"title":"Chapter 1251 Killing Three Birds With One Stone","paragraphs":["1251 Killing Three Birds With One Stone","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before raising her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “The He family is different from the Meng family. Back then, the He family did their best to help you, but they weren’t as greedy as the Meng family. Other than betraying you back then, it seems that they haven’t done anything else.”","“That’s right.” Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a cold smile.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Then what do you plan to do? At that time, He Weinian was your master. He appeared when you were at your most helpless and difficult time. Perhaps he had already started planning something more than ten years ago. He didn’t get to finish the plan, so he returned to Li City again. Is that right?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were bright like stars. “Xi Xi, you’re right.”","Qiao Xi could not help but fall into deep thought. He Weinian was not asking for money or power. Did he want world peace, or did he want to live forever?","These words were truly far-fetched. After thinking for a long time, Qiao Xi was unable to come up with a reasonable excuse.","After the two of them finished eating in the cafe, they had just walked out of the door when Qiao Xi saw Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan walking out of Xia Corporation’s building together. Their faces were full of smiles. Xia Mengyan held Xia Yunlou’s arm intimately, while Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with affection. Her eyes were filled with affection, making her look like a gentle mother.","Gu Zheng had a smile on his face as he looked at Qiao Xi. “Looks like Miss Xia is in a good mood!”","“Xia Mengyan is just shameless.” Qiao Xi blinked and sneered.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to look at Qiao Xi, who was beside him. Her eyes were filled with confidence as if Xia Mengyan’s actions were within her expectations. Moreover, her target had never been Xia Mengyan but Xia Yunlou.","Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan did not notice Qiao Xi opposite them. They got into the car and left together.","Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “The two of them are so intimate. Those who don’t know might even think that Xia Mengyan is Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter! Their relationship is that like of a mother and daughter!”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Xi Xi, are you planning to kill two birds with one stone this time?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with innocence. “What do you mean kill two birds with one stone? I don’t understand what you’re talking about!”","Her plan was clearly to kill three birds with one stone!","After the two of them returned to Longwan Residential, Gu Zheng went to the study to work while Qiao Xi went to the studio to draw designs.","Swoosh—","A hidden weapon passed through the gap in the window and landed on the floor. Qiao Xi widened her eyes and picked up the hidden weapon. She hurriedly pushed the window open and scanned the area. After confirming that there was no one around, she walked out of the studio and saw a black figure standing in the corner.","Seeing her walk over, the man bent down and said respectfully, “Eldest Miss.”","“Yes, what is it?” Qiao Xi frowned.","“Young Master sent me to protect you. Please forgive me for disturbing you.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. “What does Second Brother know?”","The man replied, “I don’t dare to casually guess Young Master’s thoughts. I only obey his orders.”","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Even though her strength was far inferior to Second Brother’s, it was more than enough to deal with ordinary people. Moreover, she had hidden weapons that could save her life. However, Second Brother actually sent the fifth-ranked assassin from Xuan Island to protect her. Moreover, he even appeared in Longwan Residential.","She raised an eyebrow. “Since you’re here to protect me, why can’t you do it openly? Why did you have to send me a message so late at night? Can’t we let Gu Zheng know about this?”","The man’s voice was calm as he replied respectfully, “I don’t dare to casually guess Young Master’s thoughts. I only obey his orders.”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless: “...”","She waved her hand helplessly. “Alright, if you want to stay, then stay. I’ll ask Second Brother myself! By the way, did Second Brother agree to the invitation from the cultural relics professor?”","Before the man could speak, Qiao Xi spoke first, “If you don’t know, then shut up. There’s no need to repeat what you just said.”","“I do know. Young Master said that if he can go to the capital with you, he’ll meet that cultural relics professor.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with pleasant surprise. “Second Brother has agreed!”","“But you must go with him.”","Qiao Xi blinked. A batch of ancient books needed to be repaired. There were many experts in this area in the country, but the Luo family was definitely top-notch in this aspect.","“Young Master said that you can handle such a small matter yourself and he doesn’t have to do anything at all.” The man added, “Young Master also said that you have many talents when it comes to repairing ancient books...”","“Shut up!” Qiao Xi nervously interrupted the man and lowered her voice. “Stop talking. It’s fine as long as you know it in your heart. You don’t have to say it out loud.”","Previously, she learned how to restore ancient books and paintings from Luo Qing. She originally wanted to casually pick a book to practice on, but in the end, she accidentally restored a scroll. At that time, the seniors in the cultural relics world spent a year but were unable to restore the scroll. She only used a month to do it. After that, she became famous in the industry. She was known as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor."]},{"number":1252,"title":"Chapter 1252 Childish Name","paragraphs":["1252 Childish Name","Qiao Xi’s expression was slightly subtle. She did not want to mention this matter because she was still young at that time and had watched an ancient drama. Coincidentally, there was a woman called Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor in it, so she thought of this name.","She still remembered that when she handed the scroll to the professor of cultural relics, the old professor held her hand excitedly and asked her what her name was. She had always been low-profile, so she naturally could not reveal her real name. Hence, she said that she was called the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. From then on, this name was circulated in the cultural relics world.","Ever since then, she stopped restoring ancient books, but the cultural relics world still remembered her. Moreover, everyone knew that a damaged scroll that many professors were helpless about was actually restored by a young lady and the young lady disappeared after leaving her name.","This matter had spread throughout the industry. Everyone treated her as a fairy who had descended to the mortal world. When the scroll was restored, she returned to the sky. Moreover, because the name she gave was too strange, she even became popular online for a period of time.","!!","At that time, the scroll she restored and the restoration techniques she used were taught in textbooks for relevant majors. The teachers often mentioned this mysterious figure in class, so everyone treated the work of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor as the benchmark for the restoration of ancient paintings and calligraphy.","Qiao Xi really did not want to face what she had done as a young and frivolous girl.","The man was puzzled. “Eldest Miss, why don’t you let me say it? Do you think the name Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor isn’t nice?”","Qiao Xi was speechless. “Yes, this name sounds like it was given by a child! At that time, I was brainwashed by that TV show. I regret it so much now!”","“But... Young Master said that this name makes you sound like a cute little fairy!” the man said seriously.","Qiao Xi widened her eyes. She very much doubted her second brother’s standard of appreciation. He actually thought that this name was cute and pleasant?","She returned to the bedroom with grief and indignation. She turned on her computer and found Xia Mengyan’s information. Her expression was serious. She was in a very bad mood now, so she would destroy the Xia family as soon as possible!","At this moment, in Gu Zheng’s study.","Song Shiyu said seriously, “President, I heard Young Madam and that man talking about the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. From what they said, Young Madam seems to be the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Song Shiyu instantly became nervous. “Why did Young Master Luo send someone to protect Young Madam behind your back? Does he think that the guards of Longwan Residential are all useless?”","Gu Zheng smiled and instructed, “Keep an eye on him.”","“President, don’t you think...” Song Shiyu’s breathing trembled. He stopped mid-sentence and sighed softly. “I have to say that the name Young Madam came up with is too childish! She actually called herself the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor! I didn’t expect Young Madam to...”","“The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?” Gu Zheng muttered, his eyes filled with gentleness. “As expected, every name of Mrs. Gu sounds so nice. She’s like a little fairy.”","Song Shiyu: “???” ‘Please don’t lie through your teeth!’","...","The next day, at Xia Corporation.","Many shareholders and higher-ups were gathered in the meeting room. Now that the collaboration with the Luo family had been finalized, everyone was full of smiles.","“Chairman Xia, it’s a joyous occasion to be able to collaborate with the Luo family. Why are you unhappy?” one of the higher-ups asked.","Xia Cheng frowned. “Of course, it’s a joyous occasion to sign the contract. It’s just that Xi Xi is still so young and has never taken on such an important collaboration. Moreover, most of Yunqiu’s designs are damaged. Xi Xi doesn’t know how to restore the designs at all. If anything goes wrong, what if the Luo family blames us?","“After all, Xi Xi has never worked in the company and doesn’t know the ways of the world. What if she accidentally offends the Luo family? Actually, she shouldn’t be in charge of this matter, but the Luo family just had to ask for her. Sigh...”","The higher-up knew what Xia Cheng meant and followed his words. “That’s easy! Although the person in charge now is Miss Qiao, she still lacks helpers. Director Xia, you should send a few capable people to help Miss Qiao complete the collaboration. I think... Miss Xia is a very good candidate!”","“I heard that Miss Xia previously restored an ancient book in the capital! At that time, it even caused a huge commotion in the cultural relics world in the country. Many professors admire Miss Xia very much. If the Luo family learns that Miss Xia has skills in restoration, they’ll definitely agree to let her join the collaboration. After all, no one is more suitable than her to restore Miss Yunqiu’s designs.”","The moment that was said, everyone looked at Xia Mengyan, their eyes filled with shock and admiration."]},{"number":1253,"title":"Chapter 1253 This Seat Belongs To Me","paragraphs":["1253 This Seat Belongs To Me","No one was interested in the restoration of cultural relics, but after all, the Xia family was collaborating with the Luo family this time. Hence, they had also learned about this beforehand. They heard that a scroll that the professors spent a lot of effort to restore six years ago was finally restored by a young lady who called herself the ‘Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’. Moreover, she used a special method. There were no traces of the restoration at all. At that time, this matter caused a sensation in the industry.","However, no one expected that the young lady was Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan smiled in embarrassment. “I’m not as good as you make me out to be. Maybe I’m just lucky. I still have to work harder in the future. I don’t have much work experience, and I’m still lacking in ability. I hope you can help me. The company will rely on all of you in the future.”","Her words were very beautiful. She did not directly admit that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but her words implied that. In everyone’s eyes, she was being humble. Moreover, even though she was already so outstanding, she was still very respectful to everyone and asked to rely on her seniors. Everyone felt smug when they heard her words and thought highly of the daughter of the Xia family.","!!","In the past, they did not accept Xia Mengyan when she joined the company because she was the daughter of an illegitimate child. However, when everyone heard these words, they could not help but waver.","Although Xia Mengyan was Xia Ji’s daughter, she was much more outstanding than him. Xia Ji was stupid and useless, while Xia Mengyan was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Not only could she manage the company, but she could also lead the collaboration between the Xia and Luo families. The heir Xia Cheng had nurtured since he was young was really different!","Everyone smiled in satisfaction, but someone suddenly asked, “Chairman Xia, we naturally agree to let Miss Mengyan be the assistant of the person in charge, but if Miss Qiao is unwilling—”","Xia Cheng said arrogantly, “This is a collaboration with the Xia family. Even if Xi Xi is the person in charge, we can’t let her do as she pleases. We can’t just watch her ruin the collaboration. Moreover, Mengyan knows restoration technology and can help her at work. Qiao Xi has no reason to disagree!”","Seeing that Xia Cheng had already decided, everyone smiled and echoed, “Chairman Xia, you’re right!”","“Miss Qiao is the person in charge chosen by the Luo family, but she’s not as outstanding as Miss Mengyan. Moreover, the fate of our Xia Corporation can’t be handed to a little girl!”","“Miss Mengyan, we’ll leave the collaboration with the Luo family to you. We believe that you’ll definitely succeed!”","Xia Mengyan had a smile on her face as she said shyly, “I’ll do my best. It’s just that when Xi Xi comes later, don’t say such things in front of her. I’m afraid she’ll be unhappy. After all, she’s the person in charge. We still have to listen to her opinion.”","The higher-up from earlier knew that Xia Cheng did not like Qiao Xi, so he instantly grunted coldly when he heard this. “Why should we listen to her? We informed her of the meeting yesterday. It’s already come to this point, yet she hasn’t arrived yet. She hasn’t even called. She’s so irresponsible. How can we be at ease handing the collaboration to her?”","“That’s right! She doesn’t look reliable. Fortunately, there’s Miss Mengyan. She’ll definitely facilitate the collaboration. Qiao Xi only relied on Gu Zheng’s power to get to this position. She can still—”","“Is there a problem with me relying on my own husband? Is this gentleman jealous of me because he doesn’t have anyone to rely on?” A cold female voice interrupted the higher-up.","The entire venue was silent. The higher-up swallowed the words in his mouth, and his face was ashen as he looked at Qiao Xi in shock and fear.","Qiao Xi stood at the door and wore a simple suit, but she had fully released her aura. Her tone was icy-cold. “Since everyone doesn’t want me to be the person in charge, I’ll go talk to Young Master Luo. I’ll get him to quickly replace me!”","Everyone from Xia Corporation was stunned for a moment. They were dissatisfied, but they did not dare to criticize Qiao Xi in front of everyone. She was the person in charge that Luo Qing had acknowledged. If she went to look for Luo Qing and said that she wanted to withdraw, Luo Qing would definitely not agree. Perhaps the collaboration would be canceled.","“If there are no objections, I’ll still be the person in charge.” Qiao Xi pointed at the middle position. “Then this position should belong to me, right?”","That seat was where Xia Mengyan was sitting. After she entered, she took the opportunity to sit there. No one thought that it was inappropriate. Now that Qiao Xi had asked Xia Mengyan to give up her seat, it angered the higher-up from earlier. He said unhappily, “Miss Qiao, there’s an empty seat beside you. Why do you have to snatch Miss Xia’s?”","“Since that’s the case, I’ll go look for Young Master Luo now.” Qiao Xi’s tone was very calm, but her words terrified everyone."]},{"number":1254,"title":"Chapter 1254 Let Her Be Your Assistant","paragraphs":["1254 Let Her Be Your Assistant","Qiao Xi did not take these people seriously at all and directly took out her phone. The higher-up’s expression changed abruptly. “Miss Qiao...”","“Xi Xi, I’ll give up my seat to you.” Xia Mengyan hurriedly stood up and smiled helplessly. Then, she found a corner seat and sat down. “It’s just a seat. I can sit anywhere. Xi Xi, quickly take a seat.”","Qiao Xi did not even bother to look at her. She sat arrogantly in the middle and did not care about the strange gazes from the surroundings.","Such arrogant behavior angered the shareholders and higher-ups so much that their faces turned red. One of the older higher-ups could not take it anymore. They had already made a concession by letting this brat be in charge. Now, not only was she late, but she was also showing off in front of them. She did not take them seriously at all!","!!","“Miss Qiao, we already informed you yesterday that the meeting would start at ten, but it’s already half past ten. We’ve been sitting here for half an hour!”","“That’s right! You’re late for the first meeting. How can we leave the collaboration to you?”","“Look at Miss Xia. She arrived half an hour earlier and even specially decorated the meeting hall. Why is the difference between you two so big?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and her cold gaze landed on Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan’s face was pale as she moved her body uneasily.","The next second, Qiao Xi took out her phone and placed it on the table. She pressed the play button, and a recording sounded.","“Xi Xi, come to the company for a meeting tomorrow at 10:30 a.m. sharp. The company’s higher-ups and shareholders value this collaboration very much. As the person in charge, you must perform well.”","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale, and her lips were trembling slightly.","Qiao Xi picked up her phone and said casually, “Everyone, did you hear that? Am I late, or did someone deliberately inform me of the wrong time? It’s me this time, but if you inform Young Master Luo of the wrong time in the future, could it be that you’ll blame Young Master Luo for being irresponsible?”","The face of the higher-up who stood up just now turned red as he glared at Xia Mengyan. She bit her lip tightly, and her eyes turned red from grievance. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. It’s my fault for making you late.”","“If you know your mistake, improve yourself. I hope you won’t make such a mistake in the future, Miss Xia. I can forgive you this time, but I can’t say the same if you repeat the mistake.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s cold words, Xia Mengyan felt as if a rock was stuck in her throat, and her heart ached.","What right did Qiao Xi have to be so arrogant? She had just remembered the time wrongly. She had already admitted her mistake. What else did Qiao Xi want? Did she think that just because she became the person in charge, she could order her around? She was the eldest daughter of the Xia family!","Xia Mengyan lowered her head, and her eyes were filled with viciousness. She would not let this go. She would definitely find a chance to snatch back the position of the person in charge. She was clearly more outstanding than Qiao Xi. If it were not for Xia Yunqiu, the Luo family would absolutely not have chosen Qiao Xi to be the person in charge.","“It’s just a small matter. Forget it,” Xia Cheng said. There was some dissatisfaction in his eyes, but his tone was very gentle. “Xi Xi, we’ve already confirmed most of the matters regarding the collaboration. I asked you to come over today because I have something else to discuss with you.”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes. Her eyes were clear and calm like a lake. She looked indifferently at Xia Cheng and smiled lightly. “Alright, tell me.”","Seeing that Qiao Xi was still considered gentle, Xia Cheng went straight to the point. “Xi Xi, you’ve never been in charge of such an important collaboration before. Moreover, the Luo family has very high expectations. We can’t afford to make any mistakes!","“I know you’re capable, but the person in charge has too many things to do every day. I’m worried that you’ll tire yourself out, so I want to send someone to be your assistant.”","Qiao Xi had long seen through Xia Cheng’s thoughts, but she pretended to be puzzled and asked, “Who do you think is suitable?”","Xia Cheng shot the shareholders a look. One of the small shareholders who did not have a lot of shares stood up and said, “Miss Qiao, you should know that Miss Xia has been in charge of several company collaborations in the past and has completed all of them very well. Hence, it’s perfect for her to be your assistant. You’ll be much more relaxed, and we’ll be at ease too!","“Moreover, a portion of Miss Yunqiu’s designs are damaged and need to be restored. I heard that the Luo family’s restoration technology is top-notch, but Miss Qiao, you don’t know anything about it. It’s better not to get involved. If you accidentally damage the designs further, it’ll inevitably make the Luo family unhappy.","“Miss Xia has once learned ancient book restoration technology. Moreover, her ability has been affirmed by many professors in the industry. It’s most suitable for her to cooperate with the Luo family to restore the designs. Miss Qiao, what do you think?”"]},{"number":1255,"title":"Chapter 1255 Waiting For Xia Mengyan To Jump Into A Trap","paragraphs":["1255 Waiting For Xia Mengyan To Jump Into A Trap","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at Xia Mengyan with a faint smile.","Xia Mengyan felt a burning gaze land on her. She raised her eyes slightly and met Qiao Xi’s cold eyes. Her heart thumped violently, but she still had to remain calm and smile in embarrassment. “Seniors, you’re too kind. I’m not as outstanding as you say. I just want to do something for the company.”","“Oh? Miss Xia, you know ancient book restoration technology?” Qiao Xi asked with slight ridicule.","Before Xia Mengyan could say anything, the higher-up at the side snorted. “Miss Qiao, you must have heard of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, right? That famous cultural relic restorer is Miss Xia. A few years ago, she caused a sensation in the cultural relic world! If you don’t know, you can search it up online. You’ll definitely be able to find relevant information.”","“That’s not necessary.” Qiao Xi’s expression did not change. She knew that she was very famous, so of course, she did not need to look up information about herself online. However, what did the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor have to do with Xia Mengyan?","Originally, Qiao Xi’s plan was to let Xia Mengyan participate in the collaboration, then let the Luo family plot against Xia Mengyan. Then, she would let the Luo family expose Xia Yunlou’s true identity. This way, Xia Mengyan would completely offend the Luo family. The Xia family and the Luo family would part ways, and Xia Yunlou’s secret would not be kept anymore. Hence, it was a plan to kill three birds with one stone.","However, Xia Mengyan had actually taken the initiative to give her a new plan. Qiao Xi was overjoyed and suddenly felt a little grateful to Xia Mengyan! Was she going to let her experience the thrill of four kills?","The higher-up had a serious expression. Could it be that Qiao Xi did not agree?","He hurriedly said, “Miss Xia is so outstanding. Let her—”","“Sure!” Qiao Xi smiled gently at everyone, and there was no dissatisfaction in her eyes.","The higher-up had originally prepared countless words to deal with Qiao Xi, but now, he held them all in his throat.","She actually agreed? She agreed so easily?","If Xia Mengyan became Qiao Xi’s assistant and cooperated with the Luo family to restore the designs, Qiao Xi’s identity as the person in charge would be useless. After all, Xia Mengyan was from the Xia family, while Qiao Xi’s surname was ‘Qiao’. Moreover, she was not close to the Xia family, so everyone would naturally not give her credit. However, Qiao Xi was not dissatisfied in the slightest and agreed with a smile. It seemed that she was a fool and did not understand the reason at all.","Everyone’s eyes were filled with mockery as they heaved a sigh of relief. They originally thought that Miss Qiao was not easy to deal with, but they did not expect her to be fooled with just a few words.","However, this was good too. It was best if she was just all looks and no brains. She should obediently stay in the position of the person in charge. She did not have to interfere in other matters.","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at everyone. “Is there anything else?”","Xia Cheng sized up Qiao Xi with slight doubt. Seeing that her expression was normal, he slowly said, “Xi Xi, now that you’ve agreed, let Mengyan follow you to the Luo family tomorrow. After all, she has negotiated collaborations a few times and is more experienced than you. If the Luo family has any requests, you can negotiate with her.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Sure! Right, Young Master Luo even called today to say that for the sake of celebrating this collaboration, he’ll send over a porcelain sculpture as a gift for Xia Corporation’s new mall.”","The moment that was said, everyone widened their eyes. Xia Cheng could not remain calm anymore and was instantly overjoyed. The Luo family was actually willing to give the Xia family a porcelain sculpture. Now that they had the Luo family’s backing, the Xia family could quickly escape their predicament and improve.","Xia Mengyan’s voice trembled with excitement. “Xi Xi, did Young Master Luo really say that? When will he come?”","“Miss Xia, you’ll know when you go to the Luo family with me tomorrow.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully.","There was a trap in the Luo family that was waiting for Xia Mengyan to jump into!","She planned to bring Xia Mengyan to the Luo family from the start. Now that the Xia family had brought it up themselves, it definitely made things easier. After all, it would definitely arouse suspicion if Qiao Xi was the one who brought it up.","Xia Mengyan could not understand why Qiao Xi was smiling. Her power was clearly about to be taken away, so how could she still smile?","After the meeting ended, Qiao Xi walked out of the meeting room and bumped into Xia Yunlou.","Xia Yunlou looked up at her and looked away guiltily. She said in a low voice, “Xi Xi...”","Qiao Xi ignored her and directly walked past her to leave. In that instant, the guilt on Xia Yunlou’s face vanished. Her eyes were filled with resentment, and she had completely changed into a different person.","When Xia Mengyan came out, she walked forward warmly. “Mengyan.”","“Aunt.” Xia Mengyan held her hand with a smile. The two of them were more like biological mother and daughter."]},{"number":1256,"title":"Chapter 1256 Unexpected Gains","paragraphs":["1256 Unexpected Gains","“Mengyan, has Xi Xi agreed to let you be her assistant?” Xia Yunlou asked anxiously.","Xia Mengyan rolled her eyes and replied, “Yes. Xi Xi even asked me to go to the Luo family with her. Young Master Luo will give a porcelain sculpture to Xia Corporation! But I’m a little unhappy. I know that in terms of status, Xi Xi is the legitimate daughter of the Xia family, while my father is an illegitimate child. No one likes me. I’m afraid that one day, Xi Xi will snatch my inheritance.","“If Xi Xi completes the collaboration with Xia Corporation this time, my situation will be even more difficult in the future. If she wants to snatch the inheritance, I won’t be able to resist at all. I...”","Xia Yunlou’s heart skipped a beat, and the last trace of guilt she had for Qiao Xi instantly vanished. She looked at Xia Mengyan with a face full of heartache and comforted her softly. “How could that be? You’re the daughter of the Xia family. Xi Xi is just an outsider. If it weren’t for you, she wouldn’t be able to be in charge of this collaboration at all. To put it nicely, she’s the person in charge. To put it bluntly, isn’t she just a decorative piece? Go to the Luo family with her tomorrow. You must be careful. Don’t let her cause trouble. The Luo family isn’t an existence we can offend!”","Qiao Xi stood in a corner and quietly listened to their conversation. The corners of her mouth could not help but curl up as she quickly left the Xia Corporation building.","At the entrance of the building, Song Shiyu saw Qiao Xi walking over and looked at her with a subtle expression. He lowered his voice and said, “Young Madam, Madam Xia came to look for the president while you were in a meeting.”","“Madam Xia? Xia Mengyan’s mother went to look for Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi’s face was filled with question marks. Why was she looking for Gu Zheng?","Madam Xia was a special existence, and she rarely appeared. She did not attend any banquets held by the Xia family. Everyone even thought that Madam Xia had long passed away.","Moreover, the last time she was in the Xia family’s villa, it was Madam Xia who secretly ran over to save her behind everyone’s backs. Madam Xia even said that she was good friends with her mother back then. What was her motive for looking for Gu Zheng now?","Her status in the Xia family was inferior to that of a servant, so she rarely went out. Wasn’t she worried that she would be discovered if she rashly ran to Xia Corporation to look for Gu Zheng? What was it that made her take the risk to see Gu Zheng?","“Why is she looking for Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi asked.","The corners of Song Shiyu’s mouth twitched. He glanced at Gu Zheng, who was leaning against the backseat with his eyes closed. He said frankly, “Young Madam, she went looking for the president mainly because she wants to see you.”","“Huh?” Qiao Xi widened her eyes. Why was Xia Mengyan’s mother looking for her at this time?","Although Madam Xia kept saying that she was her mother’s good friend back then, she was Xia Mengyan’s mother, after all. Could it be that she wanted to meet her to talk about Xia Mengyan?","Moreover, Qiao Xi was very sure that Madam Xia usually lived in seclusion and rarely went out. Even if she went out, someone would definitely follow her. Could it be that she had secretly run out?","Qiao Xi became more and more interested. “Where is she? I want to see her. Perhaps I’ll gain something unexpected!”","...","In the coffee shop beside the building of Xia Corporation.","Madam Xia sat on the sofa uneasily with her hands crossed on her lap. The coffee on the table was already cold.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi walked in and broke the silence in the air. Madam Xia raised her eyes nervously, while Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and asked, “Madam Xia, why are you looking for me?”","Madam Xia looked at Gu Zheng worriedly.","Qiao Xi understood what she meant and said without the slightest hesitation, “Gu Zheng and I are husband and wife. There’s no need for me to hide my matters from him. If you think Gu Zheng is unreliable, then let’s not talk about it first.”","Madam Xia hesitated for a moment and said carefully, “Miss Qiao, no matter what you plan to do in the future, I’ll do my best to support you.”","Qiao Xi smiled and said casually, “Madam Xia, even without your support, I’ll still do whatever I want. Did you specially come over to say this?”","Madam Xia was silent as if she did not know how to speak.","“Do you know what I want to do?” Qiao Xi suddenly asked with narrowed eyes.","“I—”","This woman looked submissive. She had been trapped in the Xia family for her entire life. Her skin was very fair as if she did not get to see the sun all day long. When she talked to someone, she did not even dare to look into their eyes. She said in a low voice, “I know that you want to deal with the Xia family and Mengyan.”","Qiao Xi looked at her with a faint smile. It seemed that Madam Xia was well aware of this and was much smarter than the Xia family. Unfortunately, she did not just want to deal with the Xia family. She wanted the truth.","Since Madam Xia was a smart person, Qiao Xi did not hide it anymore. She sat up straight and looked at Madam Xia at eye level. “Madam Xia, you said that you’ll support me. But if your daughter becomes someone else’s, will you still continue supporting me?”"]},{"number":1257,"title":"Chapter 1257 Xi Xi, Have You Heard Of The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?","paragraphs":["1257 Xi Xi, Have You Heard Of The Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?","The private room was silent. Madam Xia’s expression changed. She clenched her fists so tightly that her fingers turned pale. Her nails had already pierced through her skin, but she did not notice it.","Qiao Xi was not anxious and quietly looked at her. After a long silence, Madam Xia took a deep breath and choked slightly. “I... I’ll support you. As long as you want to do it, I’ll support you!”","As soon as she finished speaking and before Qiao Xi could speak, Madam Xia abruptly stood up. “I’m sorry, Miss Qiao. It’s getting late. I should go back. They’ll definitely look for me when they notice that I’m missing.”","She left in a hurry, leaving Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi in the room.","Gu Zheng’s expression was still gentle. In front of Qiao Xi, he would always be a noble young master who was as gentle as jade. He thoughtfully poured a cup of coffee for Qiao Xi and looked at her dotingly. “Xi Xi, did you gain anything?”","“Yes! Madam Xia’s answer just now made me even more sure of the relationship between Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan.” Qiao Xi nodded, her eyes filled with coldness.","Madam Xia was only Xia Mengyan’s mother in name. She specially came to look for her to tell her this secret about Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan.","“Madam Xia looks like a little white rabbit on the surface, but her IQ is much higher than those idiots from the Xia family. She has been locked up by the Xia family for so many years, but she secretly ran out to tell me this secret today.”","Gu Zheng gently stroked her hair and said softly, “She probably thinks that you’re someone she can trust, and only you can expose the truth.”","Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought. What other secrets did Madam Xia have?","The cafe was under Gu Zheng’s name. When the manager found out that Gu Zheng was here, he hurriedly entered to report his work. After he was done, the manager said again, “President, I’ve found the ancient painting you asked me to look for, but the painting was burned. I’m looking for someone to restore it.”","“What ancient painting?” Qiao Xi asked curiously.","Gu Zheng took a sip of coffee and replied gently, “It’s just an ordinary painting. It’s the work of an old friend of mine.”","Qiao Xi nodded, and Gu Zheng instructed in a low voice, “You don’t have to look for anyone. I’ll arrange for someone to restore it.”","“Alright, President.” With that, the manager hurriedly turned around and left the private room.","After the manager left, Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi with interest and asked, “Xi Xi, aren’t you curious why I’m looking for that painting?”","Qiao Xi waved her hand. “Since it belongs to your friend, it’s not strange for you to be looking for it!”","Gu Zheng smiled and said in a bewitching tone, “But that painting has already been destroyed. It has to be restored. I don’t know if it can still be restored to its original state.”","Qiao Xi did not notice Gu Zheng’s strange behavior and casually replied, “There are many professional restorers in the capital. Send someone to invite one back.”","With Gu Zheng’s current power, not to mention finding a restorer, it was not difficult for him to invite all the restorers in the world. Moreover, as long as he gave the order, those people would definitely fight to help him restore the painting.","Gu Zheng frowned. “But... most of those people are unreliable. I’m worried about leaving it to them.”","Qiao Xi was just about to speak and say that she could help introduce a professional to him, but before she could speak, Gu Zheng said with a smile, “I heard that there’s a famous restorer in the capital. It’d be great if we can find her.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and met Gu Zheng’s smiling eyes, and her heart couldn’t help but tremble.","“Six years ago, she repaired an ancient scroll. Many professors in the cultural relics world were unable to complete the task, yet she completed it in a month alone. Moreover, the traces of the restoration were almost impossible to see. At that time, her name caused a sensation in the cultural relics world, and she became a top figure. Xi Xi, have you heard of this person?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. “I-I’ve never heard of her.”","“I haven’t even said who it is, yet you already said you don’t know her! She goes by the name of Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, and the restoration technique she uses is very similar to the Luo family’s. Xi Xi, you and Luo Qing are siblings. I thought you’d definitely know!”","Qiao Xi: “...” This bastard was bullying her again! He was deliberately exposing her!","She gulped and retorted indignantly, “There are so many people on Xuan Island, so how could I know all of them? Moreover, the technology she uses is only similar to the Luo family’s. Maybe she doesn’t know Second Brother at all! How would I know who she is?”","Gu Zheng looked at her with a smile. “Then why don’t you help me ask Young Master Luo? I really want to meet the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","Qiao Xi: “???”","At this moment, she was a little confused. Did Gu Zheng know her identity or not?"]},{"number":1258,"title":"Chapter 1258 I’m Still An Innocent Young Man","paragraphs":["1258 I’m Still An Innocent Young Man","Qiao Xi sized up Gu Zheng. He really did not seem to know that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!","She calmed down for a moment and asked softly, “Ah Zheng, you want to invite her to restore the painting?”","Gu Zheng nodded and said, “Yes, I heard that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’s skills are outstanding. I’ll be relieved to have her take charge.”","Qiao Xi instantly felt slightly smug. Gu Zheng was worried about handing it to others, but he believed in her ability. This man had good taste!","However, Qiao Xi still had another question. She asked tentatively, “Ah Zheng, don’t you think that the name Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor sounds very childish and silly?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to hide the smile in them. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly as he said gently, “No, she sounds like a little fairy.”","A cold male voice entered her ears. Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes to meet his smiling eyes, and the smile on her face instantly stiffened.","Qiao Xi: “...”","As expected, this bastard was lying to her. He clearly knew about it long ago, yet he still pretended not to know.","“Actually, whether the name is nice or not depends on who the person is. If it’s a fairy-like young lady, the name is very suitable. Any name for her will be beautiful.”","Gu Zheng slowly said sweet words, and Qiao Xi’s heart thumped. Her fair cheeks were instantly dyed red, and the man’s smile was imprinted in her starry eyes.","The two of them looked at each other deeply, their ambiguous feelings drifting between them. Gu Zheng’s hand that was holding hers gradually moved up and landed on her shoulder. He suddenly pulled her into his arms.","Qiao Xi was already in a daze and was not prepared at all. She was shocked by his sudden embrace and abruptly leaned forward. The two of them fell onto the soft sofa at the same time.","Gu Zheng quickly reached out to protect her head and pulled her into his arms. Even if she really fell, she would not be injured.","Qiao Xi lay on Gu Zheng’s body and smelled the faint sandalwood scent emitted from his body. Her expression was slightly dazed as she lay in Gu Zheng’s embrace. After a moment, hurried footsteps suddenly came from outside.","Gu Yao and Song Shijing seemed to be discussing something. Song Shijing said anxiously, “Second Young Master, tell the president yourself. I wonder what the He family is up to.”","“I don’t f*cking know either, so I came to ask Gu Zheng. He’s so smart. He’ll definitely be able to guess the He family’s scheme! The He family suddenly gave me so many benefits. I was almost scared to death!”","Song Shijing said, “Young Master, you’re a person of status now. Watch your words.”","“Watch my words, my *ss! My *ss is already burning now. I can’t calm down at all! What is that old fart, He Weinian, trying to do? He’s also interfering in the collaboration between Xia Corporation and the Luo family. Now, he’s giving up benefits to the Gu family’s company. Everyone knows that Gu Zheng owns Gu Corporation. He shouldn’t care about the Gu family’s company at all. Why is this old fellow suddenly giving up so many benefits? Is he crazy?”","“Everyone is praising the He family for being loyal. Although they left Li City and stopped contacting the president during that period of time, they’ve been treating the president so well since coming back. It means that they want to reconcile with the president,” Song Shijing said.","“Reconcile, my *ss! Dream on! Don’t I know what He Weinian is thinking? He doesn’t do things that are not worth his effort. Moreover, since Gu Zheng decided to cut off all contact with the He family back then, he must have had his own reasons. Now that the He family is doing all this and Gu Zheng doesn’t reconcile with the He family, he’ll be known as an ingrate who doesn’t care about past relationships. That family is really good at moral coercion!”","Gu Yao’s indignant voice came from outside the door. Qiao Xi looked at their current posture and struggled to get up, but her palm that was on the sofa suddenly slipped. She fell into Gu Zheng’s arms again.","At this moment, Gu Yao and Song Shijing had already walked to the door. Their faces were filled with anger. Gu Yao was thinking about how to tell Gu Zheng when he suddenly pushed the door open. He was about to reprimand the He family for their inhumane behavior, but before he could say anything, the words in his mouth were stuck in his throat.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi were hugging each other in an ambiguous posture on the sofa. The anger in Gu Yao’s heart instantly dissipated. His eyes were filled with disdain as he said helplessly, “Can the two of you pay attention to the occasion? Why am I always bumping into you two like this?! I’m still an innocent young man. This kind of thing will leave a deep impression on me. Why are you so anxious to be with each other?”","The room was silent. The blush on Qiao Xi’s face instantly spread to the back of her ears like a delicate rose."]},{"number":1259,"title":"Chapter 1259 Unaccountably Solicitous","paragraphs":["1259 Unaccountably Solicitous","Qiao Xi struggled to get up from Gu Zheng’s body, and her face was red as she glared fiercely at Gu Yao. Was this kid asking for a beating again? He actually dared to tease her and Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng stood up and calmly straightened his clothes. His expression was calm without the slightest awkwardness.","Gu Yao pointed at Gu Zheng while trembling and shouted, “Gu Zheng, I really didn’t expect you to be such a person! Although this is a private room, how can you fool around here? You’re already an adult. Don’t you have any self-control?”","The moment that was said, the private room fell silent. Gu Zheng was still sitting on the sofa with a straight face. Gu Yao looked up at Gu Zheng. The other party did not seem to have any intention of getting angry, so he heaved a sigh of relief.","“Gu Yao.” The next second, Gu Zheng suddenly called out to Gu Yao with a faint smile. His gentle voice sounded. “You’re talkative, aren’t you? If you say another word, I’ll sew your mouth shut.”","Gu Yao: “...”","Damn! Gu Zheng was so scary! His expression was clearly so gentle, but the words he said were so terrifying. Gu Yao suddenly felt his entire body hurt, and his heart trembled.","Then, Gu Yao seemed to have lost his memory. He no longer mentioned what had just happened and complained about the He family’s actions in front of Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng listened quietly, and his expression did not change from beginning to end. He even leaned lazily on the sofa and narrowed his eyes. “If they’re willing to give in, then let them. It’s a good thing for the company.”","Gu Yao was stunned and said angrily, “He’s unaccountably solicitous. He must be up to no good! He Weinian must have ill intentions. If we really accept this money, won’t we fall into his trap?”","“Heh...” Gu Zheng sneered. His voice was still gentle, but his entire body was filled with coldness. “Since Elder He insists on giving it to us, of course, we have to accept it.”","Since He Weinian was willing to sacrifice money to maintain his image and reputation, he would take advantage of the situation and go along with the He family. Why not?","Gu Yao choked. Compared to the extremely calm Gu Zheng, he was like a panicked rabbit. The He family grabbed his ears, and he fled in a sorry state.","The anger in his heart surged. He could not help but roar, “Is the He family crazy?! Why would they give in so easily? Don’t the shareholders have any objections? They gave me such a large sum of money for no reason. Are they sure there’s a trap waiting for me to jump into?”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Gu Yao, you’ve finally grown up.”","He straightened up slightly and said calmly, “He Weinian naturally has his reasons for doing this. Every step he takes is to pave the way for the future. He has sacrificed a sum of money now, but he’ll take it back from us in the future.”","Gu Yao looked confused. “You clearly know that He Weinian has ill intentions, so why are you ignoring him and letting him do this?”","“What else can we do? It’s a good thing that he chose to give in to us. If we refuse, it’ll seem that we don’t know what’s good for us.”","Qiao Xi understood in her heart. The He family was putting on an act, and they urgently wanted to display their selflessness and kindness in front of everyone. They would naturally not let others have any evidence against them, so if they said they would give in, they would. They would not play any tricks for the time being.","This matter was a good thing for Gu Yao and Gu Zheng. What reason did they have to refuse? Moreover, if they did not cooperate with He Weinian’s acting, how would they know He Weinian’s true motive?","Gu Zheng raised his eyes slightly to look at Qiao Xi and said in a gentle voice, “You’re already very busy every day. You don’t have to worry about the He family’s matters, lest you hurt yourself.”","Gu Yao said, “How can I not care? He’s already riding on my head. Who knows what he’ll do next?! I don’t want to be schemed against by him!”","Song Shijing: “...”","The president was clearly speaking to Young Madam. What was Second Young Master doing?","...","The next day, Xia Corporation was going to send someone to the Luo family’s residence in Li City. They wanted to discuss the details of the collaboration with Luo Qing in person and bring the designs over for the Luo family to choose from.","Xia Cheng personally sent Xia Mengyan to the villa, and she was followed by many higher-ups of Xia Corporation. Everyone waited at the door happily to witness this glorious moment.","“Mengyan, the Luo family is different from the outside world. Their family probably practices many rules. You have to be careful and not cause trouble. Although you’re not the person in charge, you’re the future heir of our Xia family. You represent the entire Xia family. You can’t embarrass the Xia family!” Xia Cheng reminded softly."]},{"number":1260,"title":"Chapter 1260 The Ninth Apprentice Of The Family Head","paragraphs":["1260 The Ninth Apprentice Of The Family Head","“Xi Xi is still young, after all. I’m really worried about leaving the collaboration to her. It’ll definitely be best if you can persuade Young Master Luo to change the person in charge, but if Young Master Luo is unwilling, you can’t force him. As long as you can say a few more words to Young Master Luo and make him see you in a new light, this trip will be worth it.”","Xia Mengyan nodded gently. “Grandpa, I understand. I’ll definitely do my best to complete the mission, but...”","She looked behind her. “Why isn’t Xi Xi here yet? Didn’t we agree on the time yesterday? If she’s late, Young Master Luo might be unhappy.”","Xia Cheng frowned as a trace of disgust flashed past his eyes. “I really don’t know why Young Master Luo insisted on choosing her to be the person in charge. She clearly doesn’t have the ability...”","Before he could finish, the door of the Luo family’s villa was pushed open. A young man in a suit walked out and smiled at the two of them. He asked respectfully, “May I know if you’re the person in charge?”","Xia Mengyan was slightly hesitant, but Xia Cheng’s gaze changed. He looked around, and there were no cars approaching in the distance. Not only was Qiao Xi late, but she also did not even call. It was really rude to let them wait here.","“Yes! She’s the person in charge and my granddaughter.” Xia Cheng walked forward and introduced Xia Mengyan.","The man did not suspect anything and smiled gently. He made way and bent down slightly. “Miss, please come in.”","Xia Mengyan’s heart trembled as she looked at Xia Cheng in shock. Xia Cheng shot her a look and said softly, “Mengyan, go in first. I’ll help you handle the rest. Perform well and strive to win Young Master Luo’s favor, do you understand?”","Xia Mengyan nodded. If Young Master Luo asked why Qiao Xi was not here, she would just say that Qiao Xi was late. Grandpa was afraid that Young Master Luo would be anxious from waiting, so he had her go in first. She would let Young Master Luo know that she was the most suitable person in charge. She was more outstanding than Qiao Xi!","At this moment, she was not uneasy but filled with confidence. She raised her head and stuck out her chest as she followed the man into the villa. The servants and bodyguards on both sides all bowed to Xia Mengyan. The young man’s attitude was also very respectful. “Miss, may I know your name?”","Xia Mengyan’s body suddenly tensed up as she replied tentatively, “My surname is Xia.”","She was afraid that the other party would realize that she was not the real person in charge, so she sounded a little uneasy. However, the other party did not seem to notice it and was still gentle and respectful. “Miss Xia, our young master found out that Xia Corporation has built a new mall. He’ll send a gift, but he suddenly has something urgent to handle and has already left Li City. He won’t be able to send the gift on time. He asked me to apologize to you.”","Xia Mengyan’s face was filled with disappointment. The man lowered his head and curled his lips into a mocking smile. When he looked up again, his expression had already returned to normal. “Our family head knows about this and has decided to personally carve the gift. I believe it’ll be completed soon. At that time, the family head will send someone to Li City to hand it to you, Miss Xia.","“Miss Xia, you should also know that our Luo family has never interacted with the outside world, so it’s not convenient for us to appear on the day of the mall’s opening. As long as you take out a gift personally carved by the head of the family, that’ll be enough to prove the relationship between the Xia and Luo families.”","Hearing these words, Xia Mengyan was so excited that her entire body was trembling. She was really flattered by the Luo family’s goodwill. The head of the Luo family actually wanted to personally carve a gift for the Xia family? He even allowed her to show it to everyone on the day of the mall’s opening.","But who was this man? Were his words reliable?","The man could tell what Xia Mengyan was thinking. He smiled and said softly, “Miss Xia, I forgot to introduce myself. I’m Luo Chenjiu, the ninth apprentice of the head of the family. This is my business card. Miss Xia, feel free to look for me if you need anything.”","Xia Mengyan took the man’s business card and could not help but feel shy facing the young, handsome, and extraordinary young man. However, she did not notice the disdain that flashed past Luo Chenjiu’s eyes.","“Miss Xia, you’re the person in charge recognized by our young master. If there’s any problem during the collaboration, we’ll contact you directly and you’ll pass the message along to the Xia family. Do you have any problems with that?”","Luo Chenjiu’s eyes were filled with bewitchment. He had given Xia Mengyan a lot of power. She was the bridge between the Xia and Luo families. From now on, she could represent the Xia family to discuss a collaboration with the Luo family. At the same time, she would convey the Luo family’s intentions to the Xia family."]},{"number":1261,"title":"Chapter 1261 She Fell For It","paragraphs":["1261 She Fell For It","Xia Mengyan pondered. Being a middleman in the collaboration between the two families meant she would become a special existence in the eyes of both families. Such power was too tempting.","Actually, as long as Xia Mengyan calmed down and thought about it, she would know that Luo Chenjiu could not be trusted. However, she really wanted to surpass Qiao Xi. She did not want to be trampled under Qiao Xi’s feet, and she also wanted to be high and mighty.","Luo Qing recognized Qiao Xi as the person in charge only because Qiao Xi was Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter. Qiao Xi had never been in charge of a large-scale collaboration at all. She did not have the ability, but she relied on her identity to snatch the position of the person in charge.","If Xia Mengyan refused Luo Chenjiu’s suggestion, then this great power would be handed to Qiao Xi. She could not accept Qiao Xi surpassing her. She wanted everyone to see that she was the most outstanding one who was qualified to be the person in charge while Qiao Xi was just a useless woman with good looks!","She did not dare to tell Luo Chenjiu the truth, so she was silent for a few seconds before agreeing anxiously, “Mr. Luo, there’s no problem.”","Luo Chenjiu smiled gently. “Alright. If there’s anything else, I’ll contact you directly. When the family head’s gift is ready, I’ll inform you to come over.”","Xia Mengyan was overjoyed, and her cheeks were slightly red. She did not expect to have an unexpected gain from coming to the Luo family this time. She walked out of the villa feeling dizzy. She was still immersed in joy when she left.","...","Two days later, Luo Chenjiu informed Xia Mengyan to come to the Xia family’s villa and gave Xia Mengyan an exquisite box.","Xia Mengyan opened it and saw an exquisite and small porcelain sculpture inside. The craftsmanship was complicated, and the color was bright. It was obvious that it was expensive. She held the porcelain sculpture in her hand and asked uneasily, “Mr. Luo, is this porcelain sculpture for me?”","Luo Chenjiu nodded. “Of course. Our patriarch specially made this for the Xia family.”","Xia Mengyan started to feel nervous. If the porcelain sculpture was given to her, then Qiao Xi would not get a gift. Had Qiao Xi already caused a scene? After all, Qiao Xi was the person in charge of the collaboration. The porcelain sculpture should be handed to her.","The next second, Luo Chenjiu frowned and said, “By the way, a woman came the afternoon you came. She claimed to be the person in charge, but she was chased away by the bodyguards.”","Xia Mengyan’s heart trembled. It turned out that Qiao Xi had come, but the Luo family thought that she was a liar and chased her away. Now, everyone thought that Qiao Xi had received this porcelain sculpture, but how was Qiao Xi going to take it out in public during the mall’s opening ceremony in a few days?","Would she create a fake to deal with the situation first?","If that was the case, Xia Mengyan could find someone to expose Qiao Xi in advance before taking out the real porcelain sculpture. At that time, Qiao Xi’s reputation would plummet and she would be utterly unqualified to shoulder the heavy responsibility. Xia Mengyan would become the legitimate person in charge.","Xia Mengyan held the box tightly and had already come up with a plan. She exchanged a few pleasantries with Luo Chenjiu before rushing home.","Luo Chenjiu looked at Xia Mengyan’s back view and silently walked into the dark. He tore off the human skin mask from his face, revealing a familiar face.","Immediately after, another figure appeared behind the man. Luo Qing walked out with a calm expression. His tone was filled with a trace of ridicule. “Brother, your acting skills are really good.”","Shen Yu weighed the human skin mask and smiled. “They’re just alright. It’s mainly because you did a good job with the mask. After putting it on, my face completely changed. Xia Mengyan wasn’t able to tell at all.”","Luo Qing raised an eyebrow.","Shen Yu watched Xia Mengyan get into the car and said with a smile, “Everything is as Little Six expected. Xia Mengyan plans to let Little Six make a fool of herself in public and occupy the position of the person in charge.”","Luo Qing took out his phone and sent Qiao Xi a message: [Xi Xi, she’s been tricked.]","...","In the Xia family’s villa.","“Mengyan! You said that you’re the person in charge of the collaboration with the Luo family?” Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with surprise as she asked hesitantly, “What about Qiao Xi?”","Xia Mengyan frowned and replied helplessly, “I don’t know! When I went to the Luo family that day, Xi Xi didn’t appear for a long time, so Grandpa asked me to go in first. Later, I heard that Xi Xi had contacted the Luo family, but the Luo family thought that she was a liar and chased her away. Now that the Luo family has confirmed that I’m the person in charge, they even said that they would contact me directly if anything happened in the future. They even handed me their gift to the Xia family.”","“In that case, the Luo family has already decided that you’re in charge, yet Qiao Xi still went to look for you to cause trouble? How could she do this? We’re all family. What does it matter who between the two of you is in charge? Why must she snatch the position from you? I’ll go argue with her now!” Xia Yunlou said indignantly."]},{"number":1262,"title":"Chapter 1262 The Strongest Support","paragraphs":["1262 The Strongest Support","“Aunt, don’t go.” Xia Mengyan hurriedly pulled Xia Yunlou back and advised softly, “Even if Xi Xi is in the wrong, you can’t criticize her. Her relationship with the Xia family isn’t good to begin with. If she’s reprimanded again, she’ll definitely feel resentful. You should give her a chance to turn over a new leaf! As long as she doesn’t go astray, I’ll do anything!","“We’re about to hold the opening ceremony. If Xi Xi can correct her mistake, we won’t mention this matter anymore. I can give the porcelain sculpture to her and let her continue to be in charge. The final credit will still be hers, but if she insists on causing trouble, we have to correct her behavior. We can’t just watch her fall deeper and deeper.”","Xia Yunlou was burning with anger, and her eyes were filled with disgust. She gritted her teeth and shouted, “Why should we give the position to her?! Now that the Luo family has already decided that you’re in charge, why is she still thinking of snatching it away? You actually want to give it to her? Even if you’re kind and tolerant, she won’t remember your kindness!","“I can give her a chance to turn over a new leaf, but if she continues to be stubborn, she shouldn’t blame me for being heartless!”","A trace of viciousness flashed past Xia Mengyan’s eyes as she smiled proudly.","This collaboration with the Luo family concerned the interests and reputation of Xia Corporation. If Qiao Xi ruined this matter and embarrassed herself in front of outsiders, she would not have the qualifications to be in charge, much less compete with her for the position of heir.","The day of New City Mall’s opening ceremony would be the day Qiao Xi’s reputation was ruined!","Two days later, Xia Corporation’s New City Mall officially opened. All the big shots and noble families of Li City were invited to attend.","At nine in the morning, many higher-ups of Xia Corporation were gathered in New City Mall. Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia stood at the front, watching Xia Mengyan partake in the ceremony.","As it was the opening of the mall, they naturally had to cut the ribbon. At that time, Xia Mengyan could take out the porcelain sculpture that the Luo family had given her. This small porcelain sculpture represented how much the Luo family valued the Xia family. With this porcelain sculpture, it was equivalent to having a powerful backer. If anyone wanted to go against the Xia family, they would first have to see if they were qualified.","“Miss Xia, I heard that the Luo family gave you a porcelain sculpture?” someone asked curiously.","Xia Mengyan smiled and nodded. “Yes.”","“Where’s that porcelain sculpture? Will it be displayed today?”","Xia Mengyan was just about to speak when a commotion suddenly came from the door. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a luxury car parked at the door. Gu Zheng was sitting in the driver’s seat and looking at Qiao Xi gently. The attendant at the door immediately went forward to open the door for Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi had just gotten out of the car when she heard a gentle voice behind her. “Xi Xi.”","She turned around. Gu Zheng was staring at her fixedly. His eyes were filled with gentleness, but he said very seriously, “No matter what happens, I’ll always be your strongest support.”","Qiao Xi’s cheeks were red. She was shy and touched. The two of them looked at each other and smiled.","Such an enviable scene fell into Xia Mengyan’s eyes. Her eyes were filled with resentment. After calming down for a few seconds, she revealed a gentle smile and replied to what someone had asked just now, “Xi Xi is the person in charge of this collaboration, so of course, the porcelain sculpture is with her. She’ll naturally show it to everyone today.”","When everyone heard this, their burning gazes descended on Qiao Xi. Their gazes were different. Some gazes were filled with surprise and jealousy, but most of their gazes were filled with malice. Because the Xia family did not like Qiao Xi, they naturally hated her as well.","Now that Qiao Xi was the person in charge of the collaboration with the Luo family, the porcelain sculpture must be in her hands. Hence, when Qiao Xi approached, someone said, “Miss Qiao, can you let us see—”","However, before he could finish, he was urgently interrupted by Xia Mengyan. She hurriedly explained, “Mr. Hao, don’t be anxious! It’s not like the porcelain sculpture can run away from Xi Xi. You’ll naturally be able to see it after the ribbon-cutting ceremony.”","After that, she turned to look at Qiao Xi and said in a low voice, “Xi Xi, did you bring the porcelain sculpture over? We’ve already informed all the guests that the porcelain sculpture will be displayed today. You can’t embarrass the Xia family!”","Qiao Xi lazily opened her eyes and glanced coldly at her. Xia Mengyan met her gaze and broke out in a cold sweat. However, after thinking about it carefully, there was nothing wrong with her words!","As the person in charge, the porcelain sculpture should be in her hands. The fact that she did not get it meant that there was something wrong with her ability.","When she thought about this, Xia Mengyan instantly became confident. She raised her head arrogantly and looked into Qiao Xi’s eyes."]},{"number":1263,"title":"Chapter 1263 Real And Fake Gifts","paragraphs":["1263 Real And Fake Gifts","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered. “Miss Xia, you’re quite self-aware. You know that everyone is here to see the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture, not to attend the mall’s opening ceremony.”","The moment that was said, the surroundings instantly fell silent. Mr. Hao, who wanted to see the porcelain sculpture just now, hurriedly took a few steps back. He did not want to participate in the war between these two women.","Although Miss Qiao’s words were harsh, it was indeed the truth! It was just that Miss Qiao was really disrespectful to say this in front of Miss Xia!","As expected, Xia Mengyan’s expression darkened, but she quickly recovered her gentle expression and showed a smile on her lips. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. This porcelain sculpture is very important to the Xia family. Nothing must go wrong when you display it later...”","Before she could finish, Qiao Xi glanced coldly at her and left without turning her head.","Xia Mengyan stood on the spot and gritted her teeth. The resentment in her eyes was about to overflow.","What right did she have to be so arrogant? The Luo family had already given the porcelain sculpture to her, but Qiao Xi was stopped outside the Luo family’s door for being a liar. She had clearly been abandoned and did not have the porcelain sculpture in her hands. What right did she have to show off here?","As Luo Qing was not in Li City, he would not come back to stand up for Qiao Xi. What right did she have to be so arrogant?","Wait!","Xia Mengyan was suddenly stunned for a moment. The important figures of the Luo family had already left Li City, and the Luo family would not attend the Xia family’s opening ceremony. Hence, Qiao Xi probably thought that no one would notice if she made do with a fake porcelain sculpture. After all, no one had seen the porcelain sculpture before, so no one had the right to suspect her.","However, Xia Mengyan knew very well in her heart that the porcelain sculpture was not in Qiao Xi’s hands.","She suddenly smiled. Even the heavens were helping her. Yesterday, she thought of the possibility that Qiao Xi would pretend to pass off a random sculpture as the real gift, but with Qiao Xi’s character, she would not do such a risky thing. However, if the Luo family was not around, Qiao Xi would naturally choose this method. This might be her only way.","Alright! Then she would wait and see. She wanted to see Qiao Xi’s reputation be ruined with her own eyes and watch her fall into a sorry state!","Xia Mengyan looked at Qiao Xi’s back and revealed a vicious smile.","Everyone knew that the Luo family agreed to collaborate with Xia Corporation this time because of Xia Yunqiu. Since the news had already spread, there was no need for Xia Cheng to hide it from everyone.","There were not supposed to be so many business giants and famous families attending the opening of New City Mall, but when everyone heard that the Luo family had given the Xia family a porcelain sculpture, they all wanted to see it with their own eyes. Moreover, they had already confirmed with Miss Xia that the porcelain sculpture was in Miss Qiao’s hands.","On the other hand, in the lounge of the mall, Xia Ji asked expectantly, “Mengyan, are you sure you can ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation today and even take back her authority as the person in charge?”","Xia Mengyan smiled confidently. “Dad! I’m sure. She can’t escape this time!”","“The position of the person in charge is yours to begin with. It was Qiao Xi who interfered and caused you to suffer. Now, everyone is saying that you’re the daughter of an illegitimate child. The Luo family doesn’t like you and isn’t willing to let you be the person in charge. But Qiao Xi just relied on the fact that she’s Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter to get the position! What else does she have besides this identity? As for the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture—”","Xia Ji said indignantly. Before he could finish, Xia Mengyan interrupted him with a smile. “Dad, don’t be anxious. The Luo family’s porcelain sculpture is with me.”","Xia Ji suddenly widened his eyes and looked at Xia Mengyan in disbelief. “Didn’t Qiao Xi say that the porcelain sculpture is with her? Mengyan, what exactly is going on?”","Xia Mengyan explained the situation and said with a smile, “Dad, I originally planned to make a fake sculpture for Qiao Xi. Unexpectedly, she fell into a trap without me doing anything. Because the Luo family chased her away, she couldn’t get the porcelain sculpture, so she made a fake.","“The real porcelain sculpture has always been with me. When she’s exposed in public for bringing out a fake, I’ll step forward to save the situation and show the real porcelain sculpture.”","Xia Mengyan said with a proud expression, “At that time, the shareholders will naturally compare me to Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi is the person in charge who embarrassed the Xia family, while I’m the heir who helped the Xia family regain their dignity. At that time, who will the shareholders and higher-ups help? Will she still have the cheek to continue being the person in charge?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Yunlou walked in tiredly. “Mengyan, have you told Qiao Xi?”","When Xia Mengyan saw her, she hurriedly frowned and replied dejectedly, “Aunt, I wanted to tell Sister too, but she ignored me.”"]},{"number":1264,"title":"Chapter 1264 The Amazing Porcelain Condor","paragraphs":["1264 The Amazing Porcelain Condor","Xia Yunlou was burning with anger. “Bastard! She’ll definitely embarrass the Xia family if she shows a fake! How did I give birth to such a little b*tch?! Mengyan, you’re just too kind. You’re willing to give her a chance to turn over a new leaf, but I think we should forget it. If she’s unwilling to repent, let her be. She’ll be the one whose reputation will be ruined in the end. If she’s lucky, no one will be able to tell. But if she’s exposed in public, I want to see how she’ll face it!”","“Aunt, Xi Xi is your daughter, after all.” Xia Mengyan looked helpless.","“Why do you care so much?! If she’s exposed, I’ll publicly announce that I’m cutting ties with her. She’s not worthy to be my daughter. I’ve long wanted to do this!” Xia Yunlou said mercilessly, a trace of disgust appearing in her eyes.","Xia Mengyan and Xia Ji looked at each other and revealed sinister smiles.","!!","The opening ceremony went very smoothly. After the ribbon-cutting ceremony, it was time to showcase the gift. No one cared about the previous gifts. So what if they were valuable? Could they be more meaningful than the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture?","The Luo family of Xuan Island was mysterious and powerful. The young master of the Luo family had personally given the porcelain sculpture. This meant that the Luo family valued the Xia family very much. With the Luo family’s protection, the Xia family would forever be able to gain a foothold in Li City.","Everyone wanted to build a relationship with the Luo family, but the Luo family was elusive. Now that they knew that the Xia family and the Luo family were close, they naturally came to curry favor with the Xia family.","Xia Cheng glanced at Xia Mengyan before his gaze finally landed on Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, show the porcelain sculpture to everyone.”","The gazes of everyone descended on Qiao Xi in succession. She had become the center of attention.","It was an ordinary opening ceremony, but the surroundings were filled with people. Other than the invited guests, there were also reporters from various places and a group of Xia Mengyan’s brainless fans. The Xia family used the Luo family’s power to attract many people to come and watch the spectacle. Everyone looked at Qiao Xi expectantly and quietly waited for her to take out the porcelain sculpture.","Hearing Xia Cheng’s words, Qiao Xi only smiled lightly. “Chairman Xia, are you sure you want to see it?”","Xia Cheng frowned unhappily. “Hurry up and take it out! What are you waiting for?! Don’t tell me you didn’t bring the porcelain sculpture with you when I handed such an important task to you?”","Qiao Xi snorted coldly and took out an ordinary-looking box from her bag. “This is what you’re asking to see. If anything happens later, don’t blame me. This is your choice.”","At this point, it was time to settle the score with the Xia family. It was just that she did not know if they could handle it!","When he heard this, Xia Cheng only felt a chill run down his spine. What did Qiao Xi mean by these words? She seemed to be warning him, giving him an uneasy feeling.","Thinking about it carefully, Qiao Xi was just a girl. What could she do? Moreover, everyone was waiting. If she could not take out the porcelain sculpture, the Xia family would lose their reputation as well.","He berated unhappily, “What nonsense are you talking about?! Hurry up and take it out!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes, and her gloomy gaze landed on him. It was like she was looking at someone who was about to die, and it carried a trace of pity and ridicule.","She placed the box on the tray, and everyone hurriedly looked up. A very ordinary-looking small box appeared on the big screen. As she slowly opened it, the smile on Xia Mengyan’s face grew wider. She stared at the box until a purple porcelain sculpture was revealed.","The purple porcelain sculpture was glowing with a crystal clear light. The patterns carved on it were complicated. Actually, porcelain made of this material was not suitable for such complicated patterns. Moreover, some parts were hollow. As this material was too brittle, if any mistake was made, the entire work would be ruined. Hence, ordinary craftsmen would not choose porcelain made of this material to carve.","However, now that this purple porcelain sculpture had appeared in front of everyone, it emitted a purple glow under the sunlight. Upon closer inspection, there seemed to be the shadow of quicksand.","The entire venue was in an uproar.","“As expected of a porcelain piece personally carved by Young Master Luo. Only the Luo family can complete such a piece!”","“Although the Luo family only agreed to collaborate because of Xia Yunqiu, if it weren’t for Miss Qiao, I’m afraid the Luo family wouldn’t have given the Xia family such a valuable gift.”","Xia Mengyan’s face was ashen. She did not expect that Qiao Xi would have the ability to find such a stunning porcelain sculpture. Thinking carefully, she was Mrs. Gu. With Gu Zheng’s power and wealth, what could she not buy?","However, no matter how good this sculpture was, it was not a porcelain sculpture given by the Luo family!"]},{"number":1265,"title":"Chapter 1265 Where’s The Real Porcelain Sculpture?","paragraphs":["1265 Where’s The Real Porcelain Sculpture?","Xia Mengyan suddenly looked up and shot a look at the few people in the crowd. They nodded at her and prepared to take action.","Xia Cheng was originally worried that Qiao Xi would screw up this matter. Now that he saw the porcelain sculpture, his expression eased up a little. However, he still did not understand what Qiao Xi’s words just now meant.","This porcelain sculpture was clearly so stunning. Be it in terms of carving skills or the color of the work, it was almost perfect.","At this moment, amidst everyone’s praise, a male voice suddenly sounded. “This isn’t Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture! This is a fake! It’s fake!”","The moment that was said, the entire venue fell silent. Everyone was stunned for a long time before a huge commotion erupted.","A fake? How was that possible?","Everyone looked at the man who spoke just now in surprise. Immediately after, Xia Mengyan stood up. Her voice was gentle but a little stern. “What nonsense are you talking about?! Who allowed you to cause trouble at Xia Corporation’s opening ceremony?! My sister personally brought this porcelain sculpture from Young Master Luo. What right do you have to say that it’s a fake?”","As soon as she finished speaking, she hurriedly looked at Qiao Xi and comforted her softly. “Xi Xi, you don’t have to worry. This person was definitely sent by a competitor to cause trouble. How could the porcelain sculpture you bring back be a fake?”","As soon as she finished speaking, the man stood up and said indignantly, “Miss Xia, Chairman Xia, I’m sure that this porcelain sculpture is a fake! I’m a porcelain aficionado lover. I’ve observed all the porcelain sculptures in the Luo family. This piece definitely wasn’t carved by Young Master Luo!","“Although the craftsmanship is very good and the carving skills are not bad, they’re still inferior to Young Master Luo. Moreover, Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculptures all have a special mark, but this porcelain sculpture is clean without any marks.","“Look carefully. The patterns on it are peach blossoms. Anyone who knows porcelain sculptures knows that Young Master Luo doesn’t sculpt peach blossoms, so this definitely wasn’t sculpted by him!","“Miss Qiao, you took a fake and pretended that it was the work of Young Master Luo. Aren’t you afraid of angering the Luo family?”","Everyone from Xia Corporation turned pale and trembled in fear. They did not know much about porcelain sculptures, but hearing this man’s words, they believed him.","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed as she pointed at the man and berated, “Nonsense! Xi Xi is the person in charge that Young Master Luo has acknowledged. All the matters are handed to her to handle. Moreover, Young Master Luo said earlier that he would hand the porcelain sculpture to the person in charge. How could Xi Xi fool us with a fake?","“You said that Xi Xi has a fake, so where’s the real one?”","The man understood Xia Mengyan’s meaning and said indignantly, “I’m not the person in charge, so how would I know where the real piece is? You should ask Miss Qiao. After all, she was in charge of the porcelain sculpture from the beginning to the end. She’s also the one who’s coordinating the collaboration between the two families. Perhaps only she knows where the porcelain sculpture is.","“The porcelain sculptures that Young Master Luo personally carved are very expensive! Although the porcelain sculpture in Miss Qiao’s hand is also very exquisite, it’s only about 100,000 yuan. Miss Qiao, you made a good deal by selling the real thing and using this sculpture that costs 100,000 yuan to pass off as the real thing. You must’ve made an immeasurable amount of money!”","“Investigate her! She must be profiting from this!”","Everyone shot their gazes at Qiao Xi, and their shock carried a trace of doubt.","Could it be that Qiao Xi had really sold the real porcelain sculpture?","Suddenly, someone said disdainfully, “That makes sense! I heard that Young Master Luo hasn’t been in Li City for the past two days, and no one else has seen the porcelain sculpture. Miss Qiao is the only one who can contact the Luo family. No one else knows what the porcelain sculpture looks like. Even if she sells the real porcelain sculpture, no one will find out.”","The few people Xia Mengyan had arranged to provoke the crowd said, “Young Master Luo doesn’t know how to carve peach blossoms!”","“Young Master Luo’s signature mark isn’t on it! Moreover, I specialize in porcelain carving, and I’ve studied Young Master Luo’s work. This isn’t Young Master Luo’s work at all!”","“Young Master Luo personally gave the porcelain sculpture to Miss Qiao. Miss Qiao probably couldn’t resist the temptation and secretly sold the porcelain sculpture. Then, she bought a fake to fool us. She just didn’t expect to get exposed.”","“What kind of person did Xia Corporation choose to be the person in charge?! It’s really too embarrassing! She actually sold the porcelain sculpture Young Master Luo gave her for money. How capable she is!”","Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy like ink. The muscles on his face trembled slightly as he glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Tell me what exactly is going on. Where’s the porcelain sculpture Young Master Luo gave you?”","With an angry roar, the entire venue instantly fell silent. Xia Cheng, who had always been calm, could not help but be overwhelmed by anger. He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and gritted his teeth. If it were not for the fact that all the guests were still present, he would definitely not be able to help but rush over and slap Qiao Xi."]},{"number":1266,"title":"Chapter 1266 The Xia Family Collapsed","paragraphs":["1266 The Xia Family Collapsed","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent without the slightest nervousness.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan walked out and comforted Old Master Xia softly. “Grandpa, don’t be angry. Maybe you’ve misunderstood Xi Xi. Even if this porcelain sculpture is fake, Xi Xi wouldn’t have sold the real one. Young Master Luo might have made a mistake.”","When Xia Cheng heard this, he was even more unable to suppress the anger in his heart. “Mengyan! At this point, you’re the only one who’s still defending Qiao Xi! How could Young Master Luo have made a mistake? She actually sold the porcelain sculpture that he personally gave her and used a fake to fool us. She’s really shameless and has embarrassed our Xia family!”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with pride, but her voice was choked. “Grandpa, Xi Xi wouldn’t have done that. She wouldn’t have...”","!!","“Qiao Xi! We shouldn’t have believed you back then! I thought that you would take the matter of Miss Yunqiu’s designs very seriously. I didn’t expect that for the sake of earning money, you would actually sell the porcelain sculpture Young Master Luo gave you! Do you still care about the Xia family?! You’re really too much!”","The angry voices of everyone from Xia Corporation kept coming. Everyone stood up and glared at her.","Everyone had gathered happily today and was waiting to witness the collaboration between the Luo and Xia families. This was the Xia family’s honor, but now, the family had lost their dignity with Qiao Xi and could not raise their heads.","Xia Ji’s assistant said anxiously, “After all, Miss Qiao is still young and doesn’t understand how important this collaboration is to the Xia family. Moreover, this is her first time being in charge of such a large collaboration. It’s inevitable that she’ll be tempted by money. However, if it was Miss Xia in charge of this collaboration, such a low-level mistake wouldn’t have happened. Miss Xia, you definitely wouldn’t have disregarded the family’s reputation for a little bit of money!”","His meaning was very obvious. He wanted everyone to know that Xia Mengyan was the most suitable candidate to be the person in charge. A wild girl like Qiao Xi did not have the ability to be in charge of such a large project.","Moreover, Qiao Xi was just an outsider. She would not take the Xia family’s reputation and honor seriously.","Xia Cheng’s eyes were bloodshot, and he was almost devoured by anger. He ignored everyone’s gazes and shouted, “Qiao Xi! Tell me, where’s the porcelain sculpture?”","If she took out the porcelain sculpture now, the situation could still be salvaged. However, if the Luo family found out that she had sold the porcelain sculpture to profit from it, would the Luo and Xia families still be able to continue working together?","At this moment, Xia Cheng did not have many extravagant hopes. He only asked Qiao Xi to hand over the intact porcelain sculpture. Otherwise, not only would the Xia family lose all their dignity but they would also have offended the Luo family. He even felt that Qiao Xi was deliberately making the Xia family make a fool of themselves for the sake of taking revenge on them.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms over her chest as if she was watching a good show. It was as if everything before her had nothing to do with her.","Xia Cheng was probably about to break down at this moment, but she did not want to ruin this collaboration completely. After all, those designs were her mother’s blood, sweat, and tears. It was a good thing to recreate her mother’s works through the Luo family. Neither she nor Xia Cheng wanted this collaboration to be canceled, so she would not deliberately take revenge on the Xia family through this collaboration. However...","Someone did want to take revenge on her through this collaboration!","She had long seen through Xia Mengyan’s plan. She was just giving Xia Mengyan a chance to execute her plan and see the anxious and helpless expressions of the Xia family. However, she would not take the blame.","She was not the one who embarrassed the Xia family. It was Xia Mengyan, who had schemed everything but accidentally injured her own family!","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face grew wider and wider. She glanced at everyone, straightened her back, and replied coldly, “Chairman Xia, this is the real deal.”","The surroundings were silent as everyone looked at her in shock. People had already stood up to expose her, yet she still refused to let go. How could there be such a person?","Xia Cheng’s face alternated between red and green, and he was angered to the point his body trembled. He never expected Qiao Xi to be so shameless. Even now, she was actually unwilling to admit it. Did she think that everyone else was blind?","Waves of ridicule from the surroundings entered his ears, and his ears buzzed. He pointed at Qiao Xi while trembling and roared furiously. “Don’t you have any shame?! How did Yunqiu raise such a bastard like you?! You dare to do it but don’t dare to admit it, huh? You’ve already been exposed, so why are you still pretending?! Qiao Xi! I advise you to quickly admit your mistake and get the item back. Otherwise, you’ll have to bear the consequences!","“The opening ceremony today was supposed to be a joyous occasion. I wouldn’t have asked you to do anything else as long as you could take out the porcelain sculpture for everyone to see. However, you actually ruined the Xia family’s ceremony for money. You unfilial daughter, get out of the Xia family!”","Everyone’s faces were filled with disdain. Many noblewomen were even pointing at Xia Yunlou. “Xia Yunlou is Qiao Xi’s biological mother, right? How did she give birth to such a daughter?!”"]},{"number":1267,"title":"Chapter 1267 Severing Mother And Daughter Relationship","paragraphs":["1267 Severing Mother And Daughter Relationship","“Qiao Xi’s greedy and selfish character must have been inherited from Xia Yunlou. She ruined the Xia family’s collaboration for her own selfishness. If Young Master Luo hears that the gift he gave was sold, I don’t know how angry he’ll be. If Young Master Luo blames her, the entire Xia family will suffer with her!”","“Xia Yunlou must not be a good person to raise such a shameless daughter...”","Xia Yunlou stood in the crowd, her face ashen as she gritted her teeth.","Ever since she reunited with Qiao Xi, she had been plagued by bad luck. After Xu Anran left, she was forced to return to the Xia family. Qiao Xi caused her to lose her dignity in public time and time again and be mocked by others, but she had no ability to retort.","Why did she have to be looked down on by others with Qiao Xi? Qiao Xi had led a wandering life since she was young and was not raised by her at all. Why did she have to be implicated by Qiao Xi?","Mocking and ridicule filled Xia Yunlou’s ears. She wished for nothing more than to find a hole to hide in. The high and mighty daughter of the Xia family had never been so embarrassed.","She stood up while trembling and shouted with a ferocious expression, “Qiao Xi! Tell me, where’s the porcelain sculpture? It’s not too late to find it now!”","Qiao Xi’s cold gaze landed on her. It was about time, and her plan had already begun.","“I told you, this is the real deal.”","Qiao Xi’s tone was so calm, and such an attitude completely infuriated Xia Yunlou. She felt her cheeks burn. If she could return to the past, she would not have let Qiao Xi be born.","“You’re still lying at a time like this! How did I give birth to such a bastard daughter like you?! You’re a liar, you’re arrogant, and you’re disrespectful to your elders. Are you worthy of being in the Xia family?”","Xia Yunlou felt raging flames ignite in her heart. She was even unable to control her actions as she watched what was happening in front of her. She roared without caring about her image. “Qiao Xi, I’m warning you. If you can’t take out the real porcelain sculpture, I’ll cut off all ties with you! From now on, you’re no longer my daughter!”","The entire venue was in an uproar, and everyone could not help but be surprised. Although Qiao Xi was raised by Xia Yunqiu, she was Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter, after all. The two of them had just acknowledged each other, yet Xia Yunlou wanted to cut ties with her daughter. Wasn’t this too rash?","However, everyone thought about it from Xia Yunlou’s perspective. If their daughter was a liar and was still so arrogant after being exposed, they would definitely not want to admit that they had such a daughter. Moreover, their daughter was never raised by their side since she was young, so they would not have such deep feelings for her.","However, Xia Yunlou did not choose to talk to Qiao Xi about this in private. Instead, she publicly announced that she would cut ties with Qiao Xi, causing everyone to be surprised.","Xia Yunlou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi with a vicious expression as if she was going to rush over and tear Qiao Xi into pieces in the next second.","Qiao Xi ignored her and raised her eyes to glance at the proud Xia Mengyan. She could not help but sneer. “Madam Xia, have you thought it through?”","She was still so calm and collected. Xia Yunlou only felt that she had been looked down on. She shouted without hesitation, “I’ve thought it through. I want to cut off all ties with you. After I acknowledged you, other than embarrassing me, what else have you done for me? Other people’s daughters are gems, but you’re my enemy from my previous life! From today onward, you’re no longer my daughter. The Xia family will also cut off all contact with you!”","Xia Cheng stood on the spot and watched this scene coldly. Originally, he did not want to blow things up, but he was also angry at Qiao Xi’s indifferent attitude, so he did not persuade Xia Yunlou.","It was even more impossible for Old Madam Xia, Xia Ji, and Xia Mengyan to speak up for Qiao Xi. They wished for nothing more than for Qiao Xi to leave the Xia family immediately and disappear from this world.","The entire venue was silent. After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi chuckled and said, “Alright.”","Qiao Xi actually agreed?","She was being abandoned by her biological mother and chased out of the Xia family. However, she did not have a trace of regret or sorrow. Did she think it was very honorable?","Such a person was really hopeless. Indeed, Xia Yunlou should cut ties with her.","Xia Cheng’s expression was gloomy like ink, and the muscles on his face trembled slightly. He did not care if Qiao Xi cut ties with Xia Yunlou or not. He only wanted to find the real porcelain sculpture now.","If Young Master Luo found out that Qiao Xi had sold the porcelain sculpture he gave her, he would definitely be furious. At that time, it was inevitable that Xia Corporation would be implicated.","The most important thing now was to find the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture and personally visit Young Master Luo to apologize. It would show that they had spent a lot of effort to make up for it, and it would also let Young Master Luo know that this was not the Xia family’s fault. It was entirely because of Qiao Xi’s greed.","Xia Cheng was uneasy. If he really offended the Luo family, the Xia family’s good days would be over."]},{"number":1268,"title":"Chapter 1268 The Difference Between The Two Ladies","paragraphs":["1268 The Difference Between The Two Ladies","Xia Mengyan shifted her eyes and walked forward. She advised softly, “Grandpa, you must take care of your health. This matter can still be resolved.”","Xia Cheng looked up at her with a trace of hope in his eyes.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and watched this scene in amusement. Xia Mengyan had finally made a move.","Xia Mengyan pretended to be helpless as she looked at Qiao Xi, then she turned to Xia Cheng and said, “Grandpa, I accidentally got to know Mr. Luo Chenjiu from the Luo family. He’s the ninth apprentice of the Luo family’s head. At that time, he even gave me a porcelain sculpture that was personally carved by the Luo family’s head.","“Now that Xi Xi has sold Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture, Young Master Luo will definitely be angry when he finds out. However, if we bring out the sculpture the Luo family’s head made for us at the opening ceremony and apologize to Young Master Luo later, we can show him we still respect the Luo family. It’s just that Xi Xi was muddle-headed. Perhaps Young Master Luo can forgive us on the account of the family head.”","Xia Mengyan said generously. Xia Cheng was stunned. After a few seconds, his eyes instantly became happy. He asked in disbelief, “Mengyan, really? You have the porcelain sculpture that the head of the Luo family made?”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s words had already been transmitted through the microphone. Everyone present had roughly heard it. It turned out that Miss Xia had the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture!","It was said that the head of the Luo family had already isolated himself in the mountains ten years ago and stopped making porcelain sculptures. Now, the mysterious head of the Luo family was actually making sculptures again?","The owner of Xuan Island and Luo Qing’s father, actually asked his disciple, Luo Chenjiu, to give Xia Mengyan a porcelain sculpture that he had personally carved?","Xia Cheng was so excited that his entire body trembled. “Mengyan! Quick, quickly take out the porcelain sculpture. Why didn’t you take it out earlier? Why should we waste time on Qiao Xi?!”","Xia Mengyan felt a little aggrieved and said with a guilty expression, “Grandpa, it’s my fault. Xi Xi is the person in charge, so I didn’t want to overstep. I thought she had Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture in her hands. Moreover, she should be the one showing it today. If I rashly took out the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture, I’d be stealing her limelight. I was afraid that Xi Xi would misunderstand, so I didn’t take it out.","“I thought that Xi Xi would be able to show off the porcelain sculpture and show her face in front of everyone. I wanted to give the sculpture to you after the opening ceremony, but I didn’t expect such a thing to happen. Sigh...”","Xia Mengyan’s voice was filled with helplessness and apology. Her tone was also gentle, making one’s heart ache.","In everyone’s opinion, Qiao Xi had obtained Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture, but for the sake of satisfying her selfishness, she sold the real porcelain sculpture and changed it to a fake to display in front of everyone. Although Xia Mengyan also had the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture, she did not reveal anything and did not want to steal her sister’s limelight. Now that an accident had happened, she had no choice but to take it out in public.","The difference between them was like heaven and earth.","A smile gradually spread on Xia Cheng’s gloomy face. He thought that he would lose all his dignity at the opening ceremony today, but Mengyan actually gave him such a big surprise.","He asked anxiously, “Where’s the porcelain sculpture? Quickly take it out!”","Xia Mengyan smiled lightly. “Grandpa, don’t worry. I’ve already sent people to guard the porcelain sculpture. It’s in the lounge. I’ll get them to take it out now.”","“Mengyan, you really didn’t disappoint me! As expected of the daughter of my Xia family!” Xia Cheng smiled heartily, then glanced coldly at Qiao Xi, his eyes filled with disgust.","It was at this moment that Xia Cheng happened to see the porcelain sculpture on the table. Thinking that he had lost his reputation in front of everyone today because of this fake, his expression instantly darkened. He ordered loudly, “Someone! Throw that fake out. Such a dirty thing is not worthy to appear in my Xia family’s territory!”","This sentence not only referred to the porcelain sculpture but also to Qiao Xi. If it were not for the fact that all the guests were present, he would have sent someone to chase Qiao Xi out a long time ago.","Qiao Xi’s fair fingers landed on the purple porcelain sculpture, and she raised her eyes to look coldly at Xia Cheng. “Are you really going to throw it away? Don’t regret it afterward.”","“Why? Are you still unconvinced?” Xia Cheng frowned, then shouted, “Quickly throw this fake out. I don’t want to see it again.”","Such a fake could not appear in front of Young Master Luo. He had to get rid of it.","The bodyguard received the order and went forward to snatch the porcelain sculpture from Qiao Xi’s hand. He glanced at Qiao Xi, who nodded slightly. The bodyguard then left with the porcelain sculpture.","Earlier, Xia Cheng was roaring loudly until he was lacking oxygen. Now, he had calmed down and said gently, “Mengyan, don’t let everyone wait for too long. Quickly take out your porcelain sculpture.”"]},{"number":1269,"title":"Chapter 1269 Nothing To Say","paragraphs":["1269 Nothing To Say","Qiao Xi looked at Xia Cheng with interest. She really wanted to see Xia Cheng’s shocked and regretful expression when he found out the truth. If he found out that the instigator of all this today was Xia Mengyan and the person who embarrassed the Xia family was his most beloved granddaughter, how exciting would Xia Cheng’s expression be?","After a while, Xia Ji sent someone to bring over an exquisite sandalwood box. Just by looking at the box, one knew that the item inside was expensive. The bodyguards were careful, afraid that the item inside would knock against something.","Xia Mengyan smiled sweetly, took the microphone, and said gently, “I’m very sorry to have delayed everyone’s time and made you see some unhappy things. We indeed don’t have Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture in our hands, but we do have a treasure personally carved by the Luo family’s head.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she smiled at Qiao Xi in embarrassment. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I don’t want to embarrass you, but we can’t offend the Luo family. I can only take out this porcelain sculpture now. I hope you won’t blame me.”","!!","Xia Mengyan stared fixedly into Qiao Xi’s eyes, wanting to see a trace of anger in them. However, Qiao Xi’s eyes were so calm from the beginning until the end as if everything had nothing to do with her. Instead, the corners of her mouth curled up into a smile. “Of course not.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and met Xia Mengyan’s eyes. A trace of ridicule actually appeared in Qiao Xi’s eyes. Xia Mengyan’s entire body instantly trembled. Why was she still so indifferent?","Xia Cheng said unhappily, “Mengyan, what have you done to her? If she hadn’t messed up this matter, you wouldn’t have to step out and clean up her mess! What right does she have to blame you? So what if she doesn’t blame you? She’s no longer a member of the Xia family!”","Xia Mengyan still advised gently, “Grandpa, don’t say that about Xi Xi. It was definitely not her intention. She must be facing her own difficulties. Xi Xi, although you made a mistake today, you’ll always be a member of the Xia family. Today’s matter won’t spread. We’ll try our best to suppress it. I hope everyone here can give Xi Xi a chance. She’s still young and definitely won’t be stupid in the future.”","Xia Mengyan was so tolerant and kind. Not only did she comfort Xia Cheng, but she also spoke up for Qiao Xi. Everyone praised her in succession. As expected of the daughter of the Xia family. Even though Qiao Xi had snatched her position as the person in charge, she did not have the slightest resentment. Instead, she kept helping Qiao Xi clean up her mess. In the end, she even advised everyone not to spread this matter, lest Qiao Xi’s reputation be affected.","Seeing that Qiao Xi was silent, Xia Mengyan asked softly, “Xi Xi, promise me not to do anything stupid in the future, alright?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly, and her eyes were filled with coldness. Xia Mengyan instantly felt that Qiao Xi did not take her seriously at all. No matter how she acted and slandered Qiao Xi in front of everyone, Qiao Xi would not care.","Anger surged in Xia Mengyan’s heart as she gritted her teeth. “Xi Xi, don’t you have anything to say?”","Everyone’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi. This woman had ruined the opening ceremony that Xia Corporation had been preparing for a long time with a fake gift. At this point, she could only show weakness and beg for mercy.","In the next second, Qiao Xi smiled lazily. “No.”","Xia Mengyan’s expression froze. She pretended to be helpless and advised, “Xi Xi, I know you blame me for occupying your position today, but I have no choice—”","“Miss Xia.” Qiao Xi interrupted her and raised her eyebrows. “I never said I blamed you. I really have nothing to say.”","Qiao Xi truly did not have anything to say. She just wanted to see the expressions of the Xia family after finding out the truth. She also wanted to know if Xia Yunlou would shamelessly look for her again after cutting ties with her.","Xia Mengyan was a little aggrieved. “Since Xi Xi doesn’t want to say anything, we won’t waste any more time. After all, today is the opening ceremony of New City Mall.”","Immediately after, she straightened her back and raised her voice. “Now, I’ll show everyone the masterpiece of the Luo family!”","Xia Mengyan smiled in embarrassment. “This collaboration is very important to Xia Corporation. Xi Xi is young and has never been in charge of a collaboration project. That’s why she went astray. As her sister, I should help her take responsibility. Everyone, I ask that you don’t blame her.”","With that, Xia Mengyan opened the box. There was a beautiful porcelain sculpture of a crabapple tree inside. It shone under the sunlight.","Qiao Xi revealed a trace of ridicule when she saw the porcelain sculpture."]},{"number":1270,"title":"Chapter 1270 Mr. Luo Is Here","paragraphs":["1270 Mr. Luo Is Here","Perhaps outsiders were unable to discern the quality of this porcelain sculpture, but Qiao Xi was clearly aware that the standard of this sculpture was not bad, but this porcelain piece was not good. It only looked gorgeous, but upon closer inspection, it was flawed.","With Second Brother’s skills, he could not make porcelain sculptures of this standard. It seemed that he had casually bought it to fool the Xia family.","However, in everyone’s eyes, this porcelain sculpture was very gorgeous. Everyone was excited. “It’s indeed a treasure! I’ve seen the work of the Luo family’s head before. It’s gorgeous and dazzling!”","“This porcelain sculpture is much better than that of the peach blossom. As expected, the real deal is the real deal. Although we don’t know anything about porcelain sculptures, we can clearly differentiate between good and bad.”","“The daughter raised by the Xia family is indeed outstanding! Not only is she beautiful and kind-hearted, but she’s also capable. I heard that she’s the future heir of the Xia family!”","“Actually, in terms of appearance, Miss Qiao is more beautiful, but beauty alone is naturally not enough. She grew up in the countryside and doesn’t know etiquette. She doesn’t have the ability either. Although her identity is a little better than Miss Xia, the position of heir should be given to someone more capable.”","Xia Cheng heard the discussion around him and immediately beamed.","Ai Sumei was overjoyed. “Ah Cheng, I already said that Mengyan is the most outstanding. She saved the Xia family’s reputation and the Luo family’s collaboration. She’s more suitable to be in charge than Qiao Xi.”","“Qiao Xi is really too naughty and mischievous. If the Yin family finds out that she causes trouble all day and even sold the porcelain sculpture Young Master Luo gave her, they’ll probably chase her out of the house!”","Xia Cheng glanced at Qiao Xi in disgust. The more he looked at Xia Mengyan, the happier he felt. As expected of the granddaughter he had carefully nurtured. “Mengyan, you did very well today. In a while, I’ll announce in public that you’re the heir of Xia Corporation. I believe the company won’t object. After all, if it weren’t for you, I don’t know what consequences we would have to bear today.","“Qiao Xi has been fooling around like this and causing Xia Corporation to lose face. She’s not worthy of continuing to be the person in charge. Mengyan, I’ll leave the rest of the matters to you.”","Xia Cheng raised the microphone and announced in front of everyone, “As everyone can see, Qiao Xi almost ruined the collaboration between Xia Corporation and the Luo family. Such a person is not worthy of continuing to work at Xia Corporation. Fortunately, I have an outstanding granddaughter. If it weren’t for Mengyan, Xia Corporation would definitely have suffered a heavy blow this time.","“So I announce that the new person in charge of the collaboration between Xia Corporation and the Luo family is—”","Before he could finish, there was a sudden rumble not far away. A few black luxury cars slowly stopped in front of New City Mall. A gentleman walked out of the car.","Xia Cheng was standing on the stage. He was too far away to see who it was, but he heard a shocked voice. “Chairman Xia! The Luo family has sent someone!”","Xia Cheng stood on the spot in a daze. Before he could react, the man had already walked in front of him.","The young man was dressed in a suit and leather shoes. He had a refined temperament and a gentle smile on his face. Every move he made gave others the feeling of a spring breeze.","His voice was gentle. “Hello, Chairman Xia. My surname is Luo. Young Master sent me to celebrate the opening of Xia Corporation’s new mall.”","He was indeed from the Luo family!","Everyone had never seen him before, but when they saw the totem on his clothes and the bodyguards behind him, everyone could guess that he was from the Luo family. After all, no one dared to pretend to be from the Luo family of Xuan Island.","Mr. Luo smiled gently. “Young Master has something important to attend to and can’t come, so he asked me to congratulate you on your opening. Our Luo family previously sent over a porcelain sculpture, but that’s only half of it. I’m here today to give you the other half. The two porcelain sculptures have to be combined. I hope that your opening ceremony will go smoothly.","“Chairman Xia, who is that sculpture with?”","The moment that was said, the Xia family was so excited that they almost fainted. They were already unable to extricate themselves.","However, Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. The Luo family’s patriarch had given a porcelain sculpture to Xia Mengyan. Although Young Master Luo could not come, he sent someone to specially give another piece to her. Who did the Xia family think they were to make the Luo family think so highly of them?","Xia Mengyan was already overwhelmed by surprise. Her body seemed to be floating when Ai Sumei reminded her, “Mengyan, Mr. Luo wants to see you. Hurry up and go over!”","Xia Mengyan lifted her dress and walked forward elegantly.","“Oh! Miss Xia is really going to stand out now. So what if she’s the daughter of an illegitimate child?”","“It’s too normal for families in high society to have illegitimate children. Actually, status doesn’t matter. The main thing is ability. Previously, the Yin family insisted on not interacting with the Xia family anymore. They must be regretting it now.”"]},{"number":1271,"title":"Chapter 1271 Falling From Heaven To The Quagmire","paragraphs":["1271 Falling From Heaven To The Quagmire","Everyone discussed animatedly. “Yin Lianxin’s granddaughter lost to Ai Sumei’s granddaughter. If Yin Lianxin finds out, she’ll probably be angered to death!”","Sumei smiled proudly. She could finally vent the anger she had been suppressing for many years.","That was right, she was a mistress. She had destroyed someone else’s family, but she was the old madam of the Xia family now. She and Xia Cheng were already married, so Xia Ji was no longer an illegitimate child!","Yin Lianxin was a domineering and unfeminine woman. She even let Ah Cheng marry into her family. All those years while under the oppression of the Yin family, Ah Cheng could not raise his head at all. Yin Lianxin could not keep her man because she was useless!","!!","In love, there was no first come, first serve. There was only love or indifference. Hence, Ai Sumei had never thought of herself as a mistress. She thought that she was just brave enough to pursue love. What was wrong with that?","All these years, she had been enduring everyone’s mockery and cold eyes. Now, she had finally stood out. Mengyan relied on her own ability to obtain the recognition of the Luo family. From now on, who would dare to laugh at her for being a mistress?","At this moment, Xia Mengyan had already walked in front of the man and said gently, “Hello, Mr. Luo. It’s our Xia Corporation’s honor that you’re here in New City Mall. We’re also very grateful to Master Luo and Young Master Luo for thinking highly of the Xia family and giving us such a precious porcelain sculpture.”","Mr. Luo glanced imperceptibly at Qiao Xi, who was at the side, then quickly withdrew his gaze and replied indifferently, “It’s just a porcelain sculpture. After all, Madam and Madam Xia were good friends.”","With that, he looked up and sized up Xia Mengyan. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “This is what the family head and young master said...”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with joy. She had never dreamed of getting close to the Luo family. She could already imagine everyone’s envious gazes from now on.","Then, Mr. Luo said word by word, “Miss Qiao?”","The moment that was said, it was like a huge rock had exploded beside everyone. Mr. Luo was here to look for Miss Qiao?","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale as she stood rooted to the ground in a daze. The way Mr. Luo called her ‘Miss Qiao’ was like a slap to her face. The feeling of falling from heaven to a quagmire instantly made her almost break down.","No way! Luo Chenjiu had given her the porcelain sculpture, so she was the person in charge...","Xia Mengyan forced herself to calm down and squeezed out a smile. “Mr. Luo, I’m not Miss Qiao. My surname is Xia. You probably remembered wrongly.”","“Oh? Surnamed Xia? But Young Master said that the person in charge’s surname is Qiao. She’s Madam Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter.” Mr. Luo’s eyes were filled with confusion.","Xia Mengyan was not nervous and had already thought of an excuse in her mind. She took a deep breath. A moment later, she looked a little guilty and helpless. “Mr. Luo, I’m really sorry. A little incident happened just now. The person in charge was indeed my younger sister, Qiao Xi, but she secretly sold Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture and brought out a fake, so...”","Mr. Luo frowned. “She actually dares to offend our young master like this!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in succession, and their eyes were filled with disdain. It was this greedy woman who privately sold the porcelain sculpture. Now that the Luo family was here, how would she clean up the mess?","The corners of Xia Mengyan’s mouth curled into a cold smile as she said softly, “Mr. Luo, although that porcelain sculpture is gone, the Luo family’s head gave me another porcelain sculpture. I brought it over today, so when you asked where it was, I thought you wanted to see me.”","“A porcelain sculpture the patriarch made?” Mr. Luo’s face was filled with surprise. “The patriarch has been isolated in the mountains for ten years, yet he actually gave a porcelain sculpture to you. In that case, the patriarch values you very much.”","At this moment, Xia Cheng’s heart was instantly filled with joy. Just now, he was still worried that he would offend the Luo family. Now, Mr. Luo said that the head of the family valued Mengyan. It was a great honor to be valued by the head of the Luo family. The Xia family’s future would be limitless.","Xia Mengyan was so excited that her entire body was trembling. “Mr. Luo, why don’t you take a seat first? The ceremony will be over later. If you’re not in a rush to leave, you can stay for dinner.”","Mr. Luo smiled gently. “Alright, I want to see the family head’s porcelain sculpture too. The family head hasn’t produced anything in many years, and I haven’t seen his works in a long time.”","Everyone gasped. Such a precious porcelain sculpture was actually given to Xia Mengyan by the Luo family’s head. In other words, in the eyes of the Luo family’s patriarch, Xia Mengyan’s status was already comparable to Xia Yunqiu’s back then.","Xia Mengyan suppressed her excitement and brought Mr. Luo to the stage. “This is the porcelain sculpture that the Luo family’s head gave me.”"]},{"number":1272,"title":"Chapter 1272 Big Brother Is Indeed The Best Actor","paragraphs":["1272 Big Brother Is Indeed The Best Actor","“This is the family head’s porcelain sculpture?” Suddenly, Mr. Luo’s tone was sharp. His gentle and elegant face was filled with coldness. He looked at Xia Mengyan coldly and repeated, “Are you sure this is the family head’s porcelain sculpture?”","Xia Mengyan, who had been lowering her head to control her joy, did not notice that something was wrong. Instead, she replied with a smile, “I’m sure. It was given to me by an apprentice of the head of the family.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the air was filled with a trace of coldness. Mr. Luo’s expression was filled with anger. Xia Cheng realized that something was wrong and hurriedly went forward. “Mr. Luo...”","Xia Cheng looked at Mr. Luo’s gloomy expression but did not dare to speak. The surroundings were silent. Everyone held their breaths. No one dared to make a sound, afraid that they would anger this big shot.","Qiao Xi stood in the corner and could not help but chuckle.","Eldest Brother was indeed the Best Actor! He was too immersed in his role!","Under Mr. Luo’s burning gaze, Xia Mengyan felt that she was about to suffocate. She did not know what was wrong. Why was Mr. Luo so angry when he saw the porcelain sculpture? Wasn’t this what Luo Chenjiu had given her? Moreover, when Luo Chenjiu handed the porcelain sculpture to her, there were many members of the Luo family around. They had all seen this scene and confirmed Luo Chenjiu’s identity. Moreover, the Luo family had no reason to frame her!","Xia Mengyan’s mind was filled with doubts. She could not think of a reason.","Immediately after, Mr. Luo suddenly said coldly, “Miss Xia, I’ll give you another chance. Where did this porcelain sculpture come from?”","Such a sharp voice made Xia Mengyan come back to her senses. She was so nervous that her teeth were chattering. Under everyone’s suspicious gazes, she slowly said, “Mr. Luo, this porcelain sculpture was given to me by an apprentice of the Luo family.”","The next second, Mr. Luo’s expression suddenly darkened as he berated angrily, “Alright! Does your Xia family even take our Luo family seriously? How dare you pass off a fake as the head of the family’s work?!”","The surroundings were deathly silent. Everyone instantly widened their eyes. Xia Mengyan was so scared that her entire body was trembling, and her face was as pale as paper.","Xia Cheng instantly choked and hurriedly gestured for the reporters to stop the live broadcast. However, the reporters suddenly realized that the cameras could not be switched off. The scene just now was also recorded.","“Miss Xia, please give me a reasonable explanation!” Mr. Luo’s voice was cold.","Xia Mengyan lowered her head and trembled.","Xia Cheng quickly went forward and said respectfully, “Mr. Luo, this crabapple porcelain sculpture was really sent by the Luo family’s head to Mengyan. Mengyan would never lie. She cares so much about the Xia family. How could she watch the Xia family lose our reputation?”","Mr. Luo glanced at Xia Cheng impatiently and sneered. “Chairman Xia, I thought that the Xia family cherished this collaboration very much. Now, it seems that you don’t care about this rare opportunity at all.”","“Mr. Luo, this is all a misunderstanding. Listen to me...”","Before Xia Cheng could finish, Mr. Luo interrupted sharply, “If you were really keen on this collaboration, you would have done an investigation. You’d then find out that the madam was allergic to crabapple, so you won’t be able to find a single crabapple on the entire Xuan Island. It’s even more impossible for the head of the family to carve a crabapple. If you’ve seen Madam Xia’s designs, you should know very well that she referenced hundreds of different kinds of flowers for her patterns, but there’s no crabapple. Hence, this porcelain sculpture can’t have been carved by the head of the family!”","The moment that was said, everyone was stunned, and their ears buzzed.","It was absolutely impossible for the head of the Luo family to carve a crabapple tree. Where did this porcelain sculpture come from?","Mr. Luo looked at Xia Cheng with a sharp gaze. Xia Cheng was so scared that his forehead was covered in a cold sweat. It had to be known that if he offended the Luo family, the Xia family would definitely not have a good ending. Of course, he was afraid.","Even though he was used to facing big conflicts in the past, this was the first time he was discussing a collaboration with such a powerful family. As long as this collaboration succeeded, not only would Xia Corporation be able to escape from their predicament but the Xia family would also become a new noble family in Li City. He had been worried about this collaboration for many days. Unexpectedly, something went wrong at this critical moment.","However, why would Mengyan lie to them? Mengyan was focused on the Xia family. She would never do such a stupid thing!","Xia Cheng was silent for a moment before his emotions finally stabilized. “Mr. Luo, Mengyan did bring this porcelain sculpture back from the Luo family’s villa.”","Xia Mengyan could not help but nod, feeling a little more confident. That day, it was Luo Chenjiu who called her and asked her to go to the Luo family’s villa. Perhaps Mr. Luo remembered wrongly and it wasn’t crabapple that the madam of the Luo family was allergic to?"]},{"number":1273,"title":"Chapter 1273 Luo Chenjiu Disappeared","paragraphs":["1273 Luo Chenjiu Disappeared","Mr. Luo’s eyes were filled with mockery. “The Luo family’s villa? Chairman Xia, didn’t you say that the person in charge is Miss Qiao? Why did Miss Xia go to the Luo family’s villa, then?”","Xia Mengyan clenched her fists nervously. Of course, she could not tell the truth. She must not let others know that she wanted to snatch Qiao Xi’s position.","“Forget it, I don’t want to interfere in the Xia family’s domestic matters.” Mr. Luo’s eyes suddenly turned sharp. “Miss Xia, you insist that this porcelain sculpture was given to you by the head of the family. In that case, tell me who the head of the family sent to give it to you.”","Xia Mengyan replied without hesitation, “Luo Chenjiu! His name is Luo Chenjiu! He’s the ninth apprentice of the head of the family. He personally gave me the porcelain sculpture.”","Everyone sized up Xia Mengyan. She did not look like she was lying. If she wanted to prove whether it was true or not, she could just call Luo Chenjiu over and ask.","Unexpectedly, Mr. Luo snorted. “Luo Chenjiu? The patriarch’s apprentice?","“Miss Xia, you’ve really impressed me. You’re so self-righteous even when you’re lying. I’m sorry, but our patriarch doesn’t have any apprentices, and there’s no one called Luo Chenjiu from the Luo family!”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","If this porcelain sculpture was a fake, it was possible that Xia Mengyan had been deceived by Luo Chenjiu. However, Mr. Luo had made it very clear that Luo Chenjiu was not from the Luo family and the head of the family did not have any apprentices. Then who was Luo Chenjiu? Did Xia Mengyan make it up?","Qiao Xi stood in the crowd and smirked.","There was indeed no Luo Chenjiu in the Luo family because Luo Chenjiu and Mr. Luo were characters played by her eldest brother!","Who would have thought that Best Actor Shen Yu, who was renowned throughout the country, was putting on an act in front of them with a human skin mask? Moreover, no one noticed any flaws.","Xia Mengyan’s body went soft, and she almost fell. Sweat dripped from her forehead. Her mind was a mess, and Luo Chenjiu’s face appeared in her mind. It gradually became blurry. In the end, she could not even remember that person’s face.","Impossible! This porcelain sculpture was given to her by Luo Chenjiu!","Xia Mengyan took out her phone in a panic. “It’s not like that. That day, Luo Chenjiu called me and asked me to go to the Luo family’s villa to get the porcelain sculpture. At that time, many people in the Luo family saw it. There’s a call record on my phone. I can prove it...”","She suddenly stopped talking.","Xia Cheng said anxiously, “Mengyan, quickly show him the call records!”","Xia Mengyan’s fingers quickly moved across the screen as she stared at the call history.","Why was it gone? Even the message she sent earlier was gone. The person called Luo Chenjiu had completely disappeared without a trace!","This was impossible!","“What’s wrong? Where’s your call history? Now that things have come to this, do you still want to continue lying to me? You used a lame lie to fabricate another lie. You keep saying that this is the work of our patriarch, but you didn’t know that the patriarch doesn’t like crabapples. The patriarch and young master both like peach blossoms because Madam liked peach blossoms the most when she was alive. She even planted a ten-mile peach forest on Xuan Island. After Madam died of illness, the patriarch stopped sculpting, and the young master only sculpted peach blossoms.","“Miss Xia, if you want to lie, please go and understand the situation first. Such clumsy methods really make me doubt your IQ!","“Crabapple, ninth apprentice... Your lies come one after another. I really don’t know how you came up with them!”","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale, and the blood in her body instantly froze.","Peach blossoms?","Everyone also heard Mr. Luo’s words—peach blossoms.","The Luo family’s patriarch and young master carved peach blossoms because the deceased patriarch’s wife liked peach blossoms. The person who took out a peach blossom porcelain sculpture was Miss Qiao, who was mocked!","If the porcelain sculpture Miss Xia brought out was a fake, then was the one Miss Qiao brought out real?","Xia Mengyan broke out in a cold sweat. She was at a loss, and her heart ached. She did not understand why she had lost for no reason.","At this moment, Mr. Luo’s cold voice sounded. “I won’t bicker with you about the fake for now. Chairman Xia, where’s the peach blossom porcelain sculpture that Young Master gave to your Xia Corporation?”","Everyone was instantly stunned and looked at Xia Cheng.","That porcelain sculpture was the real one that Young Master Luo had given them. Unfortunately...","Xia Cheng’s entire body trembled, and the veins on his forehead popped out. “That peach blossom porcelain sculpture... is in Qiao Xi’s hands. Yes, it’s in Qiao Xi’s hands...”","“Heh! Director Xia, have you lost your memory?” A cold female voice sounded from not far away. Qiao Xi slowly walked over from the crowd. Her figure was slim, and her eyes were calm and clear with a trace of ridicule.","“I don’t have any porcelain sculptures in my hands. Just now, Miss Xia said that my porcelain sculpture was a fake, so you got someone to throw it away!” She raised her eyebrows and pointed at the surging river outside. “It’s probably hundreds of miles away by now. Why don’t you send someone into the water to fish it out?”"]},{"number":1274,"title":"Chapter 1274 Xia Mengyan’s Plan Failed","paragraphs":["1274 Xia Mengyan’s Plan Failed","“The porcelain sculpture was really thrown away? Chairman Xia ordered his men to throw away the porcelain sculpture that the Luo family gave him. Is he crazy? It’s fine if he doesn’t want to collaborate with them, but he even threw away the gift they gave him. Isn’t this a slap to the Luo family’s face?”","“No wonder Miss Qiao said that she hoped Chairman Xia wouldn’t regret it. He threw away the real porcelain sculpture but treated a fake as a treasure. Chairman Xia must be regretting it!”","“Of course, he regrets it! Ignoring how precious the porcelain sculpture is, now that the Xia family has completely angered the Luo family, it definitely won’t end well for them.”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Xia Cheng’s breathing quickened as he stammered, “I... ordered to have it thrown away, but... why didn’t you say so earlier? If you had told me that this was the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture, I wouldn’t have... thrown it away.”","“Chairman Xia, you must be old, so you don’t have a good memory.” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a mocking smile as she said slowly, “I told you twice that the porcelain sculpture was given to me by Young Master Luo, but you didn’t believe me. I told you not to regret it, but you thought I was threatening you, so you casually threw the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture away. Can you blame me for this?","!!","“I said that it was the real porcelain sculpture, but you heard Xia Mengyan’s instigation and concluded that it was a fake. You didn’t believe a word I said, but you firmly believed Xia Mengyan’s words. Chairman Xia, this is your prejudice. What does it have to do with me?”","Mr. Luo was instantly angry. He looked at Xia Mengyan fiercely. “I understand now. You instigated Chairman Xia to throw away the porcelain sculpture to frame Miss Qiao. Then, you took out a fake to show off. If I hadn’t come today, no one would have exposed you. Your Xia family is really bold. You actually don’t take our Luo family’s gift seriously!","“In that case, the collaboration between the two families will be canceled. I’ll call the young master immediately. Since Xia Corporation isn’t sincere, our Luo family won’t force it.”","Some blood surged out of Xia Cheng’s throat.","“Mr. Luo! This is all a misunderstanding. Mengyan wouldn’t have done that. She must have been deceived...”","No one believed such a weak explanation. Before Mr. Luo could speak, the people below the stage could not help but say, “In the end, Xia Cheng is just biased! He didn’t believe anything Miss Qiao said, and Xia Mengyan fooled him with just a few words. It’s all his fault for being muddle-headed!”","“That’s right! Miss Qiao had said many times that it was Young Master Luo’s porcelain sculpture, but Xia Cheng refused to listen and even scolded Miss Qiao. Now that the person who took out a fake and caused Xia Corporation to lose their collaboration is Xia Mengyan, he’s defending her!”","“If Xia Mengyan was deceived so easily, then she’s most likely mentally disabled. With her IQ, she’s not qualified to be the person in charge and heir at all. I think she should get treated as soon as possible!”","“Her lies are so clumsy, so it’s useless even if she seeks treatment. Moreover, IQ is hereditary, right? She’s Ai Sumei’s granddaughter, while Miss Qiao is Yin Lianxin’s granddaughter. Back then, when Yin Lianxin was all-powerful in the business world and in charge of the entire Yin family, Ai Sumei was only thinking about how to become a mistress. The two of them are not on the same level at all, so of course, Miss Qiao’s IQ is higher than Xia Mengyan’s!”","“I finally understand. This is the trap set up by Xia Corporation for Miss Qiao! Old Madam Xia, Xia Ji, and Xia Mengyan are all jealous that Miss Qiao is in charge, so they were thinking of ways to pull her down from her position.”","“First, they insisted that Miss Qiao’s porcelain sculpture was a fake. Then, Miss Xia stepped forward to salvage the situation. Not only did she show off her might, but she also stabilized her position as the person in charge. She also succeeded in making the higher-ups look at her in a different light. That way, she could become the heir!”","Xia Mengyan stood where she was, her body stiff. Those people’s words were like a huge rock blocking her heart.","Mr. Luo sneered. “I’ve really learned something today. In order to let Miss Xia inherit the family business, Chairman Xia actually thought of such a stupid method to frame Miss Qiao. At the same time, he offended our Luo family. Were all of you going to die with Miss Qiao? Isn’t the price too high?”","Her words caused everyone to laugh.","The Xia family’s method was indeed very stupid. Moreover, now that their lie had been exposed and Miss Qiao was not affected at all, they had basically shot themselves in the foot.","At this moment, Xia Cheng finally reacted. This was all Xia Mengyan’s plan. She wanted to take this opportunity to frame Qiao Xi, but she did not expect the plan to fail and implicate the Xia family.","Due to Xia Mengyan’s plan, not only was the collaboration canceled, but they had also completely offended the Luo family."]},{"number":1275,"title":"Chapter 1275 Is She Really Miss Qiao’s Mother?","paragraphs":["1275 Is She Really Miss Qiao’s Mother?","Xia Cheng roared angrily, “Mengyan!”","Xia Mengyan was so scared that her entire body trembled. Her eyes turned red like a frightened rabbit. Tears trickled down her face as she sobbed softly. “I... I didn’t do it. It has nothing to do with me.”","At this moment, everyone understood that Xia Mengyan had clearly schemed against Miss Qiao, but they naturally could not interfere in the Xia family’s matters. The outcome of this situation would depend on how Miss Qiao wished to deal with it.","However, before Qiao Xi could speak, an angry roar sounded from the side. “Qiao Xi, you clearly knew that the porcelain sculpture that was thrown away earlier was real, so why didn’t you stop it? Mengyan is in the wrong, but you have to bear the main responsibility! If you had made yourself clear, we wouldn’t have misunderstood you. You can’t blame Mengyan alone!”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and could not help but widen their eyes. The person who roared was Qiao Xi’s biological mother, Xia Yunlou.","!!","Someone said in confusion, “I don’t understand. Is Xia Yunlou Miss Qiao’s biological mother?! Why is she always helping Miss Xia deal with her daughter?!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly. “Madam Xia, what makes you think I should take responsibility? I wasn’t the one who said that the porcelain sculpture was fake, and I wasn’t the one who gave the order to throw it away. Why would I be in the wrong? Could it be that I still have to kneel down and beg you?”","Xia Yunlou was still unconvinced. “You’re in the wrong! Back then, you should have given the position of the person in charge to Mengyan. Otherwise, why would she think of ways to snatch this position back? Mengyan is the heir of Xia Corporation, but she had to watch you become the person in charge. She just wanted to snatch back what belonged to her. This is reasonable.","“You stood there and didn’t stop the bodyguards at all when they threw away the porcelain sculpture. You just wanted to see the Xia family make a fool of ourselves, right?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. “So Xia Mengyan wanted to take back what was hers. Even if she did something even worse, she wouldn’t be in the wrong and it’d still be my fault, huh? I shouldn’t have agreed to be the person in charge and stole Xia Mengyan’s limelight. If I didn’t do that, she wouldn’t have schemed against me. Is that what you’re saying?","“It’s also because I didn’t stop the bodyguards that the porcelain sculpture was thrown away and the Xia family made a fool of themselves?”","Xia Yunlou was just about to nod when she heard Qiao Xi say casually, “Madam Xia, take a closer look. That bodyguard is burly. How can a weak woman like me stop him? Could it be that you want me to jump into the river with that porcelain sculpture?","“Moreover, I wasn’t the one who wanted to snatch the position of the person in charge. Young Master Luo asked me to be the person in charge because he doesn’t like Xia Mengyan. You can’t blame me for this, right?","“Madam Xia, in your eyes, whatever I do is wrong. On the contrary, even if Xia Mengyan makes a mistake, she has her reasons. Even if she causes Xia Corporation to lose this collaboration and implicates them, she’s not in the wrong, right?”","Qiao Xi laughed loudly, and her eyes were filled with ridicule. “Madam Xia, I’m very curious as well. Are you my mother or not? Why can’t I see a trace of love in your eyes?”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone could not help but start to suspect that Xia Yunlou was indeed too biased. It was clearly Xia Mengyan’s fault, but Xia Yunlou just had to blame Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi was the victim!","Young Master Luo wanted Qiao Xi to be the person in charge, but Xia Yunlou felt that Qiao Xi had stolen Xia Mengyan’s limelight. She should not forget that if Qiao Xi had not agreed to be the person in charge, Young Master Luo might not have agreed to collaborate with the Xia family at all!","If Xia Mengyan was Xia Yunlou’s daughter, everyone could understand her reaction. After all, it was normal for a mother to protect her daughter. In the eyes of all mothers, their children were the most perfect. Hence, she could naturally think that Xia Mengyan was right. However, Xia Mengyan was only her niece, while Qiao Xi was her daughter!","Her biological daughter had been wandering outside for so many years and had just been acknowledged, yet she was unwilling to give her daughter a trace of maternal love. She even thought that everything her daughter did was wrong and wished for nothing more than to make her disappear immediately. Was she really Qiao Xi’s mother?","Everyone shook their heads helplessly, their eyes filled with disdain.","Xia Yunlou’s body stiffened as she panicked. She did think so, but no matter how muddle-headed she was, she could not say it in public!","“Qiao Xi! You... You’re misinterpreting what I mean. I just want you to know your place and not snatch Mengyan’s things. You’ve just returned to the Xia family, yet you’ve already caused a mess. You...”","Even at this moment, Xia Yunlou was still criticizing Qiao Xi in front of everyone. She did not consider her at all.","“Is this Madam Xia Yunqiu’s biological sister?”","Mr. Luo suddenly spoke with a trace of mockery in his eyes. “I heard that Madam Xia Yunqiu was kind, loving, gentle, and generous, but her younger sister doesn’t have a trace of her merits!”"]},{"number":1276,"title":"Chapter 1276 Smart People Will Choose Old Madam Yin","paragraphs":["1276 Smart People Will Choose Old Madam Yin","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile.","‘Xia Yunlou, you’ve been occupying this identity for too long. You’ve even forgotten who you really are! It’s time for you to return it!’","Mr. Luo’s words stunned everyone present for a moment. Everyone looked at Xia Yunlou again. Earlier, they saw Xia Yunlou trying her best to defend Xia Mengyan and force Qiao Xi to admit her mistake. At this moment, they finally realized that Xia Yunlou was Old Madam Xia’s daughter.","Everyone instantly snorted. “Xia Yunlou is actually Xia Yunqiu’s biological sister? In other words, she’s Yin Lianxin’s daughter?”","“I thought she was Ai Sumei’s daughter! Otherwise, why would she keep speaking up for the granddaughter of the mistress? Moreover, I never heard that Xia Yunlou was in contact with the Yin family!”","“Back then, when Yin Lianxin and Xia Cheng divorced, the three children were supposed to follow Yin Lianxin back to the Yin family. Unexpectedly, Xia Yunlou suddenly went back on her word the next day and decided to live with Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei.","“Is there a possibility that Xia Yunlou is the daughter of Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei?! Maybe Xia Cheng secretly brought Xia Yunlou home and lied to Yin Lianxin, saying that she was their daughter. After all, Xia Yunlou hasn’t been in contact with the Yin family for so many years but lives with Ai Sumei. Maybe she’s Xia Cheng’s illegitimate daughter.”","Xia Yunlou’s face suddenly turned pale. Everyone was discussing, and her body trembled uncontrollably.","It was not like that! She was Yin Lianxin’s daughter. She was not an illegitimate daughter. She had always been the legitimate daughter of the Xia family.","Mr. Luo raised an eyebrow and asked, “Madam Xia, are you sure you’re Madam Xia Yunqiu’s biological sister?”","Xia Yunlou abruptly looked up, her eyes filled with panic. Xia Cheng, who was at the side, also widened his eyes. At this moment, he could no longer care about the porcelain sculpture. He hurriedly explained, “Mr. Luo! You can’t spout nonsense. Of course, Yunlou is Yunqiu’s younger sister. She’s my and Lianxin’s daughter!”","“Oh? Really?” Mr. Luo looked at Xia Cheng with a faint smile.","Xia Cheng’s heart thumped violently. He originally thought that Mr. Luo would not interfere in the Xia family’s private matters, but the next second, Mr. Luo asked again, “But Madam Xia, since you’re Old Madam Yin’s daughter, why haven’t you been in contact with her for so many years? Moreover, after Old Madam Yin and Chairman Xia divorced, your brother and sister returned to the Yin family with Old Madam Yin. Why did you choose to stay with the Xia family? Are you unwilling to be a member of the Yin family?”","He suddenly raised his voice in the last sentence, scaring Xia Yunlou so much that her entire body trembled.","Everyone’s gaze landed on Xia Yunlou. Be it status or money, the Yin family was a hundred times better than the Xia family. Smart people would choose to live with Old Madam Yin. After all, she was their biological mother. Moreover, Old Madam Yin was the head of the Yin family, so she would not treat them badly. However, Xia Yunlou stayed in the Xia family and lived with the mistress. This was really too strange.","Could it be that she was not Old Madam Yin’s real daughter?","Once everyone began to suspect something, a seed would start to germinate in their hearts. No matter how Xia Yunlou explained, she would not be able to easily change their minds.","“That’s not true!” Xia Yunlou roared, and her lips trembled slightly. She clenched her fists nervously with a terrifying expression. “I’m Yin Lianxin’s daughter! There’s a reason why I didn’t choose to return to the Yin family with her. Could it be that I’m not her daughter just because I didn’t choose to go with her?","“My parents got divorced, and it was my choice who I wanted to live with! The Yin family’s blood flows in my body. How am I not a member of the Yin family?” Xia Yunlou roared self-righteously, and as soon as she finished speaking, she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Xia Yunlou was a little smarter than before.","Xia Cheng immediately echoed, “Mr. Luo, you’ve misunderstood. Yunlou chose me because she was afraid that I would be sad. Actually, she also wanted to live with her brother and sister, but she was sensible since she was young and couldn’t bear to abandon me, so she chose to live with me. All these years, she has been missing her brother and sister. No matter what, she’s Lianxin’s biological daughter. Her bloodline can’t be changed.”","“Chairman Xia, you have a point,” Mr. Luo replied casually.","Xia Cheng thought that Mr. Luo must be dissatisfied because of the porcelain sculpture, so he wanted to make things difficult for the Xia family. Mr. Luo was still pressing on just now, so when he suddenly responded in this way, it made Xia Cheng nervous.","As expected, Mr. Luo smiled. “Perhaps I misunderstood. It’s just that Madam Xia Yunqiu and our young madam were good friends back then. Back then, when Madam Xia was living on Xuan Island, Xia Yunlou had even gone there, so the head of the family instructed me to give a gift to Madam Xia Yunqiu’s younger sister. I was afraid that I would remember wrongly, so I wanted to be sure.”"]},{"number":1277,"title":"Chapter 1277 The Luo Family’s Guest","paragraphs":["1277 The Luo Family’s Guest","Hearing Mr. Luo’s explanation, Xia Cheng’s expression softened a little. Was this really the reason? Mr. Luo was beating about the bush just to prove that Xia Yunlou was Xia Yunqiu’s younger sister?","Why did he have a bad feeling?","Before Xia Cheng could figure it out, Mr. Luo ordered his subordinates to bring two red boxes over.","“Chairman Xia, although Miss Xia Mengyan destroyed the porcelain sculpture Young Master gave her for her own selfish reasons and caused the collaboration between the two families to be canceled, Madam Xia Yunqiu is still an honored guest of our Luo family. Back then, Madam Xia Yunlou went to Xuan Island and was considered a guest of the Luo family too, so the head of the family also prepared a big gift for her.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Mr. Luo looked at Qiao Xi and said in a gentle tone, “Miss Qiao, the patriarch prepared a gift for Madam Xia Yunqiu, but she’s no longer alive. Please accept it on her behalf, Miss Qiao.”","One of the boxes was given to Qiao Xi, while the other was placed on the table in front of Xia Yunlou.","Seeing this, Xia Cheng heaved a sigh of relief, but he was still a little uneasy. He knew that Yunqiu was close to the Luo family, which was why the Luo family was discussing a collaboration with the Xia family. However, Mr. Luo had taken such a big detour just to give a gift?","As Yunqiu and the young madam were good friends, Xia Yunlou was also receiving preferential treatment, but...","No!","Xia Cheng’s pupils constricted, and his blood froze.","Impossible! Xia Yunlou had never left the Xia family all these years! The Luo family said that Xia Yunlou had gone to Xuan Island 24 years ago, but all these years, Xia Yunlou had always been in the Xia family of Shengdu. Even when she went on a long trip, she would always be with the Xia family. It was impossible for her to have gone to Xuan Island!","Then who was the person who accompanied Xia Yunqiu to Xuan Island back then?","Xia Cheng’s body stiffened, and his throat was dry. He could not say a word.","Mr. Luo’s gaze landed on Xia Cheng. He smiled and asked, “Chairman Xia, don’t you want to know what this gift is?”","Xia Cheng’s heart was in his throat. His mind was a mess, and he did not dare to look into Mr. Luo’s eyes, afraid that he would see through him.","Xia Yunlou, who was at the side, was also confused. Had she been to Xuan Island 24 years ago? And she was there to look for Xia Yunqiu?","At that time, she had snatched Xia Yunqiu’s fiance and married into the Jiang family. She and Xia Yunqiu should have completely fallen out. She cursed Xia Yunqiu to die and not come back to disturb her life. Why would she go to Xuan Island to look for Xia Yunqiu?","Xia Yunlou’s heart skipped a beat, and her eyes were filled with horror.","She was sure that she had never been to Xuan Island, but Mr. Luo said that she had. Could it be that the Luo family and Qiao Xi were scheming against her?","On the other hand, Mr. Luo had already instructed his subordinates to open the red box. Inside was a pearl crown and an exquisite token. This was a gift for Xia Yunlou.","“Madam Xia, what do you think? Do you like this gift?” Mr. Luo asked softly.","Xia Yunlou’s heart thumped violently. She did not understand what Mr. Luo wanted to do and felt even more uneasy. She had clearly never been to Xuan Island, but...","She glanced at the gift in the box, and exclamations instantly sounded around her. Everyone hurriedly stood up and craned their necks to look at the gift in the box.","“Wasn’t this pearl crown personally made by the Luo family’s head when he was young? I heard that the pearls on it were carefully selected. Every single one of them is expensive. 20 years ago, the price of this pearl crown had already reached 80 million yuan. It’s even harder to estimate now. They’re giving such a precious thing to Xia Yunlou?”","“I remember that the Luo family’s head said that this pearl crown was specially made for Madam Luo, but Madam Luo thought it was too gorgeous and never wore it. The Luo family’s head said that Madam Luo would get to decide who to give this crown to. Now that it’s being given to Xia Yunlou, it seems that it was Madam Luo’s idea.”","“In that case, when Madam Luo was still alive, she had already prepared a gift for the Xia sisters. It’s only because Xia Yunlou is Xia Yunqiu’s younger sister that she got to receive such a valuable gift. Looks like Madam Luo really treated Xia Yunqiu as her biological sister.”","Everyone sighed and looked at Xia Yunlou with a trace of envy. However, Xia Yunlou was not happy at all. Instead, she became even more flustered.","Why did the Luo family give her such a valuable gift?","“By the way, that token is...”","At this moment, someone else exclaimed, and their voice was trembling slightly. “If I’m not wrong, that’s the token of Xuan Island. It allows one to enter and exit Xuan Island at will. The person who has this token is an honored guest of the Luo family!”"]},{"number":1278,"title":"Chapter 1278 She Would Never Make A Comeback","paragraphs":["1278 She Would Never Make A Comeback","To the Xia family, the pearl crown was already expensive enough. When Xia Cheng saw the token, he felt as if a pie had fallen from the sky. His mind was heavy.","Something was wrong! Why did the Luo family give Xia Yunlou such a valuable gift for no reason?","However, Mr. Luo did not give Xia Yunlou a chance to refuse at all. He smiled and said, “Madam once said that you were Madam Xia Yunqiu’s only sister, so she wouldn’t treat you badly. Even though Madam Xia Yunqiu has already passed away, you’re still an honored guest of the Luo family.”","Xia Yunlou’s hands trembled. She did not dare to accept that gift. What would happen if she accepted the Luo family’s gift in a daze? Was the Luo family’s anger something she could withstand?","Xia Cheng also felt that something was wrong, but they had no reason to reject the Luo family. Xia Corporation could not offend the Luo family anymore.","In the eyes of the others, it was the Xia family’s honor that the Luo family was willing to give Xia Yunlou a gift. She had also borrowed Xia Yunqiu’s limelight. Moreover, this gift was prepared many years ago. The Xia family did not have to bear any burden. If Xia Yunlou did not dare to accept it, it would be even more suspicious.","Xia Cheng suppressed the uneasiness in his heart. This was a big bet. He clenched his fists and looked up at Xia Yunlou.","At this moment, Xia Yunlou’s face was pale. Fear spread from the bottom of her heart and gradually spread throughout her body. She comforted herself over and over again, telling herself that she was Xia Yunlou. She had the right to accept these gifts, so why was she still nervous?","Xia Yunlou’s heart thumped violently. She inexplicably began to panic. The powerful fear was about to devour her.","“Yunlou.” Just as everyone was puzzled, Xia Cheng suddenly said, “Master Luo gave you such a valuable gift. Hurry up and thank Master Luo and Mr. Luo.”","Xia Yunlou was in a daze. Her face was pale, and the sweat on her forehead dripped down her face. She did not understand why she was so flustered, but she could not control herself.","“It’s good that you like it,” Mr. Luo said.","Without being asked for her opinion, she was forced to accept the gift. Mr. Luo waved his hand and instructed, “Send someone to deliver the gifts to Madam Xia’s house.”","With these two expensive gifts, Xia Yunlou’s identity would be different. If nothing unexpected happened, Xia Yunlou would be able to enjoy endless glory as an honored guest of Xuan Island, but...","Xia Cheng’s back was already drenched in sweat. His eyes were filled with worry.","“Chairman Xia, I have another request,” Mr. Luo suddenly said.","Qiao Xi, who had always been in the corner, lazily opened her eyes as the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile.","Xia Cheng’s heart trembled as Mr. Luo went straight to the point. “The head of the family is very sad to know that Madam Xia Yunqiu has passed away. He lamented that he couldn’t see her for the last time. I think the head of the family will be very happy to see Madam Xia Yunqiu’s younger sister. Can you meet our head, Madam Xia?”","Mr. Luo’s tone was very sincere. No one found it strange and even thought that it was reasonable. After all, the Luo family’s head had given Xia Yunlou such a valuable gift. He did not have any other requests and just wanted to meet Xia Yunlou to relieve the sorrow of his good friend’s death.","In everyone’s opinion, Xia Yunlou would definitely not refuse. Being able to meet the head of the Luo family was something that many people could not ask for. Moreover, Xia Yunlou had accepted his gifts, so she had no reason to refuse this request.","Unexpectedly, the Xia family did not say anything and seemed to be in a difficult position.","Xia Cheng was flustered. No, absolutely not! Although he did not know who had gone to Xuan Island, he was sure that person was not Xia Yunlou. If she went to see the Luo family’s head, then...","Xia Yunlou lowered her head and broke out in a cold sweat. She knew that she had fallen into a trap. Moreover, her reputation might be ruined this time and she would never be able to make a comeback.","Suddenly, a bright light flashed through her mind. Xia Yunlou abruptly raised her eyes and looked fiercely at Qiao Xi.","She finally understood. Everything was planned by Qiao Xi. From the moment Mr. Luo appeared, they had lured her into a trap step by step. Qiao Xi wanted to slander her for not being Xia Yunlou and completely destroy her!","Xia Yunlou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi, and her pale lips trembled violently. “Qiao Xi! I’m your biological mother! Why are you doing this to me?”","Qiao Xi blinked innocently and said aggrievedly, “Madam Xia, what are you talking about? What did I do to you? Mr. Luo is still waiting for your reply, but you came over to look for trouble with me. Could it be that you don’t want to see the head of the Luo family, so you’re deliberately changing the topic?”"]},{"number":1279,"title":"Chapter 1279 In Order To Expose Her Identity","paragraphs":["1279 In Order To Expose Her Identity","Xia Yunlou instantly choked. She subconsciously looked at Mr. Luo and met his smiling eyes.","Mr. Luo was still so gentle and refined. His voice was gentle, but he was like a venomous snake that was flicking out its forked tongue, making one shudder. “Madam Xia, are you going to reject me? What are you afraid of?”","His words were like a sharp knife that stabbed into Xia Yunlou’s heart.","Everyone was also very puzzled. Xia Yunlou had already accepted the gifts. Even if Mr. Luo did not ask, Xia Yunlou should thank the Luo family’s head in person. However, why was she unwilling to see the Luo family’s head?","Since she was afraid, it meant that there was something going on. Otherwise, she had no reason to refuse!","Everyone’s suspicious gazes landed on Xia Yunlou. Xia Yunlou panicked and could not help but look at Xia Cheng. Xia Cheng’s expression was not good either. He could only pretend to be calm and explain with a smile, “Mr. Luo, don’t take offense. Yunlou has been sick recently and isn’t suitable to meet guests. Moreover, Xuan Island is far away. It’s really inconvenient for her to travel all the way there. It’s not that she doesn’t want to see the Luo family’s head.”","Mr. Luo smiled. “Why is it inconvenient? Our Luo family has a private plane. We’ll bring Madam Xia to Xuan Island to see the Luo family’s head. If it’s not convenient for her to stay, she can come back on the same day.”","Xia Cheng instantly choked, and his expression darkened. If Xia Yunlou really went to see the Luo family’s head, then...","Actually, there was no need for him to be afraid. Xia Yunlou’s face was exactly the same as that woman. Even if she really saw the Luo family’s head, she would not be discovered. Moreover, 24 years had passed. It was normal for her appearance and personality to have changed.","Xia Cheng instantly became confident. Just as he was about to speak, Mr. Luo beat him to it. “If Madam Xia is really sick, it’s indeed not suitable for her to travel far.”","He paused for a moment and continued, “It just so happens that the head of the family is free today. If it’s not convenient for you to go to Xuan Island, then you can directly video call the head of the family. Anyway, it’s just a short meeting. It’s the same if you meet through a video call. We’re just letting the head of the family see an old friend.”","Everyone was instantly stunned.","A video call? Why did it sound a little strange?","Mr. Luo said casually, “Considering that Madam Xia is sick and it’s not convenient for her to go to Xuan Island, it shouldn’t matter if we do it through a call. Coincidentally, the head of the family has just received the news. He also wishes to see his old friend. Madam Xia, you won’t refuse, right?”","Mr. Luo took a few steps forward and lowered his voice in front of Xia Yunlou. “Madam Xia, it’s a pity that you don’t have the chance to refuse. You can’t hide your identity anymore.”","Xia Yunlou’s pupils suddenly constricted. She abruptly looked up. Mr. Luo was still gentle and refined. He looked at her with smiling eyes as if he had never said those words.","Her body trembled uncontrollably as fear swept through her body. She might have had her doubts just now, but now, she was sure that Mr. Luo was here to expose her identity.","Why could she not refuse? If she did not want to see him, who could force her?","“Madam Xia, why aren’t you saying anything? Are you going to refuse?” Mr. Luo frowned. “I can understand that it’s not convenient for you to go to Xuan Island, but can’t you just meet the head of the family through a simple video call?”","Xia Yunlou finally reacted. She did not have the chance to refuse because she had already refused just now. If she could not even satisfy such a simple request, she would completely offend the Luo family and be despised by everyone.","“Sir, we’ve already contacted the patriarch’s assistant.” The bodyguard walked forward respectfully with his phone and handed it to Mr. Luo.","The screen was dark, so the face of the patriarch could not be seen by everyone. His assistant’s voice came from the other end of the phone. “Sir, the head of the family happens to be free. Shall I pass him the phone now?”","Mr. Luo looked up at Xia Yunlou and replied, “Yes! Madam Xia, come on.”","Xia Yunlou’s body stiffened, and her expression was strange. Her footsteps were weak and she was very unwilling, but she had no choice but to go forward like a walking corpse.","She wanted to refuse, but she did not dare to speak. She could only slowly move forward.","Xia Cheng gritted his teeth and took the phone.","They were only meeting through a video call. Moreover, the two of them had not seen each other for 24 years. The patriarch of the Luo family would be seeing the same face, so he definitely would not notice that something was wrong.","All these years, the Yin family had always suspected Xia Yunlou’s identity, but they were still helpless because they did not have any evidence. Meanwhile, the head of the Luo family had only met Xia Yunlou once. What could he do?"]},{"number":1280,"title":"Chapter 1280 You’re Not The Real Xia Yunlou","paragraphs":["1280 You’re Not The Real Xia Yunlou","Xia Cheng had to take a gamble this time. He wanted to bet that the head of the Luo family wouldn’t be able to tell that there was something wrong. Now, the Xia family was like fish on the chopping board. If they rejected the Luo family, it would be equivalent to completely offending them. Hence, they had to agree to the video call. Otherwise, they would not be able to explain it to the Luo family or the others. After all, as long as they thought about it carefully, they would be able to understand the truth.","Xia Cheng took the phone and heard the patriarch of the Luo family’s dignified voice. “Chairman Xia.”","Everyone pricked up their ears and discussed softly. “Yes! This is definitely the Luo family’s head!”","“That’s right. I attended a banquet before, and I heard the head of the Luo family saying something behind a screen door. He sounded exactly the same as this voice!”","Xia Cheng’s voice trembled slightly. “M-Master Luo.”","With that, Xia Cheng placed the phone in front of Xia Yunlou. He wanted Xia Yunlou to greet the head of the Luo family and quickly end the call.","However, before Xia Yunlou could speak, the dignified voice of the Luo family’s patriarch sounded again. “Where’s Yunlou?”","Everyone was stunned.","Wasn’t Xia Yunlou in front of the phone camera? Since the Luo family’s head could see Xia Cheng earlier, he could naturally see Xia Yunlou too! He had clearly seen her, so why was he asking for Xia Yunlou?","Xia Yunlou’s face was pale as she gritted her teeth.","The entire venue was silent. Everyone looked at Xia Cheng and Xia Yunlou in surprise.","Xia Cheng’s heart felt like it was being weighed on by a huge rock. He could not breathe and said while trembling, “Master Luo, Yunlou is right in front of you.”","The head of the Luo family was over 50 years old and could be considered a junior of Xia Cheng. However, Xia Cheng had to be so humble in front of him, lest he incurred the patriarch’s wrath.","The smell of blood surged in Xia Cheng’s throat, but he still had to remain calm. He forced a smile. “This is my daughter, Xia Yunlou.”","No matter what, their faces were exactly the same. After 24 years, no one would be able to tell the slightest difference. Thinking of this, Xia Cheng’s heart gradually calmed down.","Just as everyone thought that the head of the Luo family did not get a clear look, an extremely cold voice suddenly came from the phone. “She’s Xia Yunlou?”","This voice was filled with coldness and a trace of anger. The innate kingly aura scared Xia Cheng so much that his entire body trembled. He almost fainted.","The Xia family was shocked. Ai Sumei’s body was limp as she was supported by Xia Ji. Xia Yunlou was naturally the most afraid. She stood on the spot and trembled.","At this moment, a woman who was exactly the same as her appeared in Xia Yunlou’s mind, but she was different. That woman was smiling gently, while she had never smiled like that.","No! Impossible! She was Xia Yunlou, the daughter of the Xia family!","She kept comforting herself to prevent a breakdown, but the patriarch’s gloomy voice still sounded again. “Chairman Xia, do you think my memory is bad? Do you think that I won’t be able to recognize an old friend after 24 years have passed?”","The voice sounded calm and indifferent, but every word was so cold that Xia Cheng felt his scalp tingle.","The entire venue was silent as everyone held their breaths. At this moment, they were puzzled. What was going on?","After a few seconds of silence, Mr. Luo seemed to have come to a realization. His sharp gaze landed on Xia Yunlou. “You’re not the real Xia Yunlou?”","Everyone gasped. What the Luo family’s head meant just now was that this woman in front of him was not the Xia Yunlou from 24 years ago. He thought that the Xia family was lying to him.","The head of the Luo family only took a glance and was sure that she was not Xia Yunlou. However, she had always lived with the Xia family. If she was not the real Xia Yunlou, how could the Xia family not have noticed?","Xia Yunlou felt as if she had fallen into an ice cave. Her back was already drenched in a cold sweat. She shouted weakly, “I’m Xia Yunlou! I’ve always been her!”","The cold voice of the Luo family’s head sounded. “Yunlou and Yunqiu took many photos on Xuan Island. They’re still hanging in my wife’s room. Moreover, many people on Xuan Island remember Xia Yunlou’s appearance. Chairman Xia, are you sure you want to continue lying to me?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Mr. Luo explained, “I was still too young 24 years ago, so I’ve never seen Madam Xia. However, the elders on Xuan Island have all seen her. Our patriarch won’t forget his old friend, so it can only mean that the person who went to Xuan Island with Miss Xia Yunqiu back then wasn’t the current Xia Yunlou!”","The last sentence was like a huge rock smashing into a calm lake, causing ripples. The venue was silent. Everyone thought that it would just be an ordinary opening ceremony. They did not expect it to involve such a shocking piece of news."]},{"number":1281,"title":"Chapter 1281 Taking Over","paragraphs":["1281 Taking Over","“Could it be that Xia Yunlou is really sick? Chairman Xia happened to know about the relationship between the Luo family and Xia Yunlou and guessed that the Luo family’s head would give Xia Yunlou a gift, so he found another woman to replace her?”","“Chairman Xia, if Xia Yunlou is really sick, you could’ve just explained it to Mr. Luo. Why find someone to replace her? Moreover, Madam Xia is unique and can’t be replaced. Doing this will anger the Luo family!”","Everyone did not agree with the Xia family’s actions. They really did not understand what the family was thinking. They clearly had a good opportunity to get close to the Luo family, but it was forcefully ruined by them.","On the other end of the phone, the head of the Luo family said impatiently, “Chairman Xia, let me ask you one last time. Where’s Yunlou?”","Xia Cheng gasped. He wanted to speak but did not know how to explain. He did not know where Xia Yunlou was at all.","At this moment, someone suddenly reacted. “That’s not right! All these years, we’ve been in contact with the Xia family. Everyone has seen Xia Yunlou before. Hasn’t she always looked like this? Could it be that this impostor had already replaced the real Xia Yunlou in the Xia family 20 years ago?”","“Patriarch Luo has seen Xia Yunlou before. It’s been 24 years, but he immediately knew that she was an impostor after seeing her. It seems that she’s indeed been pretending for many years!”","“Back then, Xia Yunlou went to Xuan Island with Xia Yunqiu. It’s impossible for Xia Yunqiu not to know her younger sister! Moreover, there’s no need for the Luo family to lie. The head of the Luo family just wanted to see an old friend today, but he ended up exposing this impostor!”","“That’s right! The Luo family has never interfered in the grudges between noble families. Moreover, with the Luo family’s status, it’s easy for them to deal with the Xia family. Why beat about the bush? Hence, what the Luo family’s head said must be true. This woman isn’t the real Xia Yunlou!”","“If she’s an impostor, where’s the real Xia Yunlou?”","“Why is this woman staying in the Xia family and pretending to be Xia Yunlou? Moreover, why is Xia Cheng letting her pretend to be his biological daughter?”","For a moment, the atmosphere fell into a deadlock. Everyone was making guesses about the Xia family’s secret.","Suddenly, someone shouted loudly, “I knew it. This woman must be Xia Cheng and Ai Sumei’s illegitimate daughter. Otherwise, why would Chairman Xia spend so much effort to let her take Xia Yunlou’s place? He just wants to help her get rid of the infamy of being an illegitimate daughter and live in the Xia family as the legitimate daughter! They’re really too much!”","“Then where’s the real Xia Yunlou? Could it be that they...” The person who spoke made a throat-slitting gesture.","“Oh my God! Xia Cheng is really heartless! Back then, if Yin Lianxin hadn’t married him and used the Yin family’s resources to support the Xia family’s assets, would he have been able to steadily become the head of the Xia family? It’s fine that he cheated and divorced, but he actually let an illegitimate daughter occupy the identity of Old Madam Yin’s daughter. I wonder if Xia Yunlou is still alive. She’s his biological daughter! Even a vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs, but he doesn’t feel guilty at all. He’s really vicious!”","No one would suspect that the head of the Luo family was lying because there was no need for him to do so. After confirming this matter, the rest could be deduced logically. Everyone was sure that the daughter of the Xia family in front of them was not the real Xia Yunlou.","“I knew it. Xia Yunlou and Xia Yunqiu are biological sisters. Why are their personalities so different? All these years, she has been relying on the fact that her mother is Old Madam Yin to commit crimes. Everyone in the socialite circle has to tolerate her. Now, her identity has been exposed. It turns out that she’s just an illegitimate daughter!”","“This impostor has ruined Xia Yunlou’s reputation. She deserves to die!”","“So that’s why I kept feeling like she’s becoming more and more like Ai Sumei. She looks like a shrew in the market. She doesn’t have the magnanimity and nobility that Old Madam Yin has at all. I finally understand the reason why now.”","“Xia Cheng is a scumbag! For the sake of his illegitimate daughter’s future, he disregarded the life of the legitimate daughter. Is he still human?”","The curses were endless. Xia Yunlou’s face was as pale as paper. She wanted to retort, but her throat was dry and painful. She could not say anything.","She was Xia Yunlou, the daughter of the Xia family. She could not be exposed, or her life would be completely ruined.","Xia Cheng gritted his teeth, the muscles on his face trembling violently. He looked ferocious and terrifying.","Why? Why was this secret discovered? Xia Yunlou had been pretending for so many years. Even she was sure that she was Xia Yunlou. They clearly looked exactly the same, so how did the Luo family’s head know that she was not the real Xia Yunlou?","Impossible! This was impossible!"]},{"number":1282,"title":"Chapter 1282 Xia Yunlou Reveals Her Secret Again","paragraphs":["1282 Xia Yunlou Reveals Her Secret Again","Xia Cheng’s entire body trembled as if he had thought of something. He abruptly raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. She stood in the corner with her head lowered, and the corners of her mouth were curled into a cold smile.","Qiao Xi sensed that someone was looking at her. She slowly raised her eyes, and her gaze was calm without a trace of panic. She smiled lightly at Xia Cheng.","At that instant, Xia Cheng felt his heart stop beating. An indescribable fear and shock swept through his entire body. His ears buzzed, but he was extremely clear-headed. When he saw Qiao Xi’s eyes, he understood everything.","Everything today was Qiao Xi and the Luo family’s plan!","!!","Even Yin Lianxin could not confirm if the person in front of her was her daughter. If even she could not tell when she was Xia Yunlou’s mother, how did the head of the Luo family figure it out? How could he be so sure that the person in front of him was not Xia Yunlou?","Was it because there was an agreement that no matter what the person looked like, the head of the Luo family would deny it?","There was no enmity between the Luo and Xia families, so there was no need for the head of the Luo family to do this. The only possibility was that it was because of Qiao Xi. It was Qiao Xi who begged the Luo family to cooperate with her and set up a trap for them to be exposed.","After Xia Cheng thought it through, his head felt like it was about to explode. His breathing quickened as he gritted his teeth. His eyes burst with strong hatred.","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at him, her eyes filled with ridicule.","It seemed that the old master was very angry! But so what? No matter how unwilling he was, he could not refute the head of the Luo family because no one would suspect him.","She did not have any evidence, but she could get the Luo family to help her create evidence. Now that everyone knew about the Xia family’s scandal and the seeds of doubt were planted, no one would believe anything the Xia family said.","Xia Cheng’s eyes almost popped out. He took a deep breath and forced himself to calm down. He absolutely could not admit to this. However, before he could think of a countermeasure, Xia Yunlou, who was at the side, broke down. “Nonsense! I’m Xia Yunlou! Qiao Xi! Tell them that I’m Xia Yunlou, your biological mother! You know—”","Xia Cheng was shocked. Just as he was about to stop Xia Yunlou, Mr. Luo spoke first, “Madam Xia, at this point, are you still thinking of getting Miss Qiao to help you? When you helped Xia Mengyan slander Miss Qiao just now, did you remember that she’s your daughter? Now that you’re in this situation, you finally remember your daughter, huh?","“Moreover, I remember you said that you wanted to cut off all ties with Miss Qiao. You even helped Miss Xia Mengyan force Miss Qiao to admit her mistake. Madam Xia, apart from pretending to be the daughter of the Xia family, could it be that you’re also pretending to be Miss Qiao’s biological mother?”","Everyone was instantly stunned. It took them a few seconds to understand Mr. Luo’s words.","Xia Yunlou retorted without hesitation, “That’s not true—”","“Madam Xia, don’t be in a rush to explain. I’m just making a reasonable guess. The person who took out the fake is Miss Xia Mengyan, but you forced Miss Qiao to confess to the crime. You also knew what kind of price she’d have to pay if she lost the Luo family’s porcelain sculpture. Not only would her reputation be ruined, but she might even be punished by the law. However, you didn’t care about your daughter at all. Instead, for the sake of your niece, you deliberately pushed all the blame onto Miss Qiao. Hence, I suspect that you...”","Mr. Luo’s voice dragged out. Xia Yunlou’s heart thumped violently as she felt her entire body being surrounded by coldness.","There was no need for Mr. Luo to say the rest. Everyone knew what was going on. “In that case, she’s not the real Xia Yunlou, nor is she Qiao Xi’s mother. Perhaps she’s Xia Mengyan’s biological mother!”","This thought was deeply rooted in everyone’s hearts. In this way, everything made sense. Why was Xia Yunlou unwilling to believe Qiao Xi’s words but believed Xia Mengyan’s nonsense? Why was she blaming Qiao Xi for stealing Xia Mengyan’s limelight? Why was she praising Xia Mengyan for being outstanding but unwilling to give Qiao Xi a trace of warmth?","Everything could be explained if Xia Yunlou was Xia Mengyan’s biological mother! It was not that she did not have motherly love, but her motherly love was given to Xia Mengyan. She did not care about Qiao Xi at all.","Xia Yunlou insisted on saying that she was Qiao Xi’s biological mother probably because Qiao Xi’s adoptive mother, Xia Yunqiu, had left behind a large inheritance. As long as she controlled Qiao Xi, she might be able to obtain benefits from Qiao Xi.","Even if Qiao Xi did not have any evidence, the Xia family was unable to change everyone’s thoughts.","Xia Cheng’s expression was as dark as ink. He originally had a way out, but Xia Yunlou had exposed her weakness again. No matter how he explained, no one would believe him."]},{"number":1283,"title":"Chapter 1283 You’re More Vicious Than A Tiger","paragraphs":["1283 You’re More Vicious Than A Tiger","The Xia family’s opening ceremony ended like this. The matter of Xia Mengyan framing Qiao Xi was exposed. Xia Yunlou was not the real daughter of the Xia family, nor was she Qiao Xi’s biological mother. The Xia family’s secret was instantly exposed to everyone.","Xia Yunlou’s body went weak. She knew that if she was no longer Yin Lianxin’s daughter, her life would be completely ruined.","“Director Xia, this ceremony can’t be held anymore. I’ll take my leave first,” Mr. Luo suddenly said.","As soon as Mr. Luo left, everyone could not sit still anymore. They stood up one after another. “Director Xia, I’m really sorry. Something happened in the company, so I have to rush over.”","!!","“Director Xia, my wife is about to give birth, so I’ll leave first.”","These people naturally would not say that they looked down on the Xia family. They could only find an excuse to leave.","Xia Cheng, who was standing in front of the stage, lowered his head. He looked as if he had aged ten years in an instant. He knew very well that the Xia family was really hopeless this time. The company was already in a difficult situation, and there was another force secretly dealing with them. He thought that all his difficulties would be resolved if he got close to the Luo family. Unexpectedly, not only did the collaboration get canceled, but he also offended the Luo family.","What should the Xia family do?","Xia Yunlou’s legs went weak as she fell heavily to the floor. However, it was as if she could not feel any pain. She just sat there with empty eyes.","Xia Mengyan’s teeth chattered as her heart ached. Why was this happening? Today was clearly supposed to be the Xia family’s most glorious day, but it had become their most humiliating day.","“Qiao Xi...” After everyone left, Xia Cheng called out in an old voice.","Xia Mengyan slowly raised her eyes and realized that Qiao Xi had been standing in the corner. She looked at them indifferently and quietly watched the Xia family’s disheveled appearance.","Qiao Xi’s appearance completely infuriated Xia Mengyan. She was the daughter of the Xia family and a socialite of high society. What right did Qiao Xi have to look at her with such disdain?","At this moment, Xia Mengyan was unable to suppress the flames of rage in her heart anymore. Her gentle mask cracked as she pointed at Qiao Xi and roared furiously. “Qiao Xi! It’s all because of you! You harmed us!”","The sharp gazes of everyone from the Xia family shot at Qiao Xi in unison, while Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and walked forward calmly while nodding with a smile. “That’s right, it’s me.”","Xia Mengyan did not expect Qiao Xi to admit it so readily. She roared in exasperation, “You’re also from the Xia family. What’s in it for you to scheme against us? Why are you—”","“Why? What do you think?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows with an indifferent expression.","“We didn’t do anything. You and the Luo family are the ones who joined forces to frame us!”","As soon as Xia Mengyan finished speaking, Qiao Xi sneered, her eyes filled with ridicule. “Miss Xia, do you want to record this? I can cooperate with you. I admit that I schemed against you.”","“Luo Chenjiu is my subordinate. I instructed him to give you the porcelain sculpture. Everything was planned by me to expose Madam Xia’s identity. Miss Xia, have you recorded everything?”","Xia Mengyan held her phone tightly with her pale fingers and could not help but tremble.","Qiao Xi’s voice suddenly became aggrieved. “Miss Xia, I’ve already admitted that all of this was my plan. The Xia family was framed by me.","“Miss Xia, are you satisfied now?” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile. As far as she was concerned, the Xia family had already lost and had no chance of making a comeback.","Xia Mengyan was stunned on the spot. For a moment, she did not understand what Qiao Xi meant, but Xia Cheng reacted and roared from his throat. “Qiao Xi!”","At this moment, the Xia family no longer had any credibility in everyone’s hearts. If Xia Mengyan released this recording, everyone would think that the Xia family had forced Qiao Xi to admit it. Her voice was filled with grievance and helplessness. This recording could not be used as evidence at all. Instead, it would make everyone hate the Xia family even more.","Qiao Xi took a few steps forward and narrowed her eyes. “Chairman Xia, do you think I’m heartless? But I learned all of this from you! You harmed your own biological daughter! Everyone says that even a vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs, but you’re even more vicious than a tiger!”","“She’s Xia Yunlou!” Xia Cheng pointed at Xia Yunlou and roared.","A trace of a cold snort seeped out of Qiao Xi’s nose as she turned around indifferently, leaving only her back view for them to see. She said coldly, “Goodbye, Chairman Xia.”","As soon as she left, Xia Cheng received countless calls. What had happened in New City Mall had already spread to Li City. Now, not only did the people of high society know about it, but the news had also spread online. The fans who once supported Xia Mengyan were the most shocked."]},{"number":1284,"title":"Chapter 1284 Selfish Heir","paragraphs":["1284 Selfish Heir","Xia Mengyan’s pure and gentle image completely collapsed. Her former fans trampled all over her. All her contracts and endorsements were canceled overnight. She also needed to compensate a huge sum of money for the breach of contract. Everyone knew that Xia Mengyan had framed her cousin and even destroyed the porcelain sculpture given by the Luo family. Whoever worked with her would be going against the Luo family. Naturally, they did not want to have anything to do with her.","At this moment, the Xia family was like drowning dogs. The company was in danger. What worried Xia Cheng even more was now that they had offended the Luo family and the others in Li City could step on them, how could they survive?","Xia Mengyan screamed, “No! I don’t want to go back to Shengdu! If I go back now, everyone will look down on me!","“Grandpa, save me! I can’t go back like this. I might as well die!”","!!","As she spoke, Xia Mengyan threw her phone on the ground like a lunatic. Xia Yunlou picked it up and looked at it. It was filled with curses from the netizens. They said that Xia Mengyan was vicious and pretentious. They also said that Qiao Xi was a hundred times better than her. Normal people would choose Qiao Xi, while only the fools of the Xia family would choose Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan had been pampered since she was young. She was smart, and everyone in the Xia family doted on her. At a young age, she became an internationally famous perfumer. She was a top socialite with countless fans and was the goddess in everyone’s hearts. However, now that all her dirt had been exposed, she would naturally be exposed if she still called herself the ‘Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor’. She had fallen from heaven to hell in an instant. Of course, she could not accept it.","Xia Yunlou was also very haggard with a sad face. “Dad, quickly think of a way. You have to help Mengyan! She’s still so young. If she has to bear this infamy in the future, her life will be completely ruined.”","“Shut up!” Xia Cheng roared angrily, then turned to look at Xia Mengyan. His eyes were bloodshot, and he was like a crazy beast. “Xia Mengyan, you’re still thinking about your reputation? I thought that Qiao Xi had ill intentions and wanted to destroy the Xia family. I never expected that you would be the one to destroy the Xia family in the end!”","Xia Yunlou immediately retorted, “Qiao Xi framed—”","“Qiao Xi did scheme against you, but if you hadn’t done it, Qiao Xi’s plan would’ve failed?","“All these years, I’ve carefully nurtured you to be the successor of the Xia family. I didn’t expect you to be an idiot who only cares about yourself! For your own selfishness, you ignored the Xia family’s interests? Are you still worthy of being the successor of the Xia family?”","Xia Cheng knew that if Xia Mengyan had not wanted to frame Qiao Xi, those events wouldn’t have unfolded. In the end, it was because she was too selfish. For her own selfish desires, she did not hesitate to put the entire Xia family at stake.","Now that everyone in the Xia family was implicated, she only cared about her reputation and future. She had never considered how the others would suffer and whether the Xia family’s company would go bankrupt.","Why were the two heirs he had spent so many years nurturing so useless? Xia Ji was useless, and so was Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan explained in a panic, “Grandpa, it’s not like that. I...”","Ai Sumei couldn’t stand it anymore and retorted anxiously, “How can you blame Mengyan? If you had let Mengyan be in charge earlier, everything wouldn’t have happened.”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with fear as she hid behind Xia Ji and Ai Sumei. She did not feel that she was in the wrong at all. What was wrong with taking back her position? If she succeeded, the opening ceremony of New City Mall would not have been affected at all and the Xia family would not have offended the Luo family.","If they had to blame someone, it would be Qiao Xi. If she hadn’t schemed against the Xia family, they wouldn’t have ended up like this.","Ai Sumei was still unconvinced. She tugged on Xia Cheng’s sleeve and said, “Ah Cheng, you must help Mengyan this time. Mengyan is the hope of the Xia family. She’s an internationally famous perfumer. If her reputation is ruined, we’ll have no hope at all.","“Don’t forget that she’s the heir of the Xia family! No matter what the price is, we have to protect Mengyan!”","Xia Cheng’s eyes were filled with disappointment. He glanced at Ai Sumei and Xia Ji, feeling a strong sense of powerlessness.","At this moment, he was filled with regret. Why did he get a divorce because of Ai Sumei back then? Ai Sumei’s looks and intelligence were clearly far inferior to Yin Lianxin’s. She was not even qualified to compare to Yin Lianxin. But back then, he was obsessed and ruined his originally happy marriage for this stupid woman."]},{"number":1285,"title":"Chapter 1285 Charity Banquet","paragraphs":["1285 Charity Banquet","“The Xia family is going to disappear. What’s the use of keeping an heir? We’ve already offended the Luo family. Who will still do business with our Xia family in the future? Xia Mengyan, you’re selfish and only care about yourself. Without the Xia family, who do you think you are?!” Xia Cheng pointed at Xia Mengyan and cursed.","Ai Sumei, who was at the side, was still unconvinced. She muttered in a low voice, “It’s not Mengyan’s fault. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault.”","Xia Cheng choked on his words and almost fainted. The foundation that he had worked so hard for his entire life was ruined just like that. The Xia family’s reputation was ruined, and they were despised by everyone because of Xia Mengyan, Xia Yunlou, and Ai Sumei.","The taste of blood rose in his throat, and his chest felt stuffy. His vision darkened, and he fainted.","!!","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had just left New City Mall when she saw a tall man standing there. At this moment, Shen Yu had already taken off his human skin mask and stood in the crowd, looking especially dazzling. Many fans noticed Shen Yu and hurriedly went up to ask for his autograph. He smiled gently and signed autographs for every fan.","This was the first time many fans had seen Shen Yu in person. They were extremely excited. “Are you here to participate in a variety show?”","Shen Yu smiled and replied, “It’s just a small event, not a recording.”","The fans asked in surprise, “Are you attending the opening ceremony of the New City Mall?”","Qiao Xi was hiding in a corner when she heard Shen Yu pretend to be puzzled and say, “What’s New City Mall? I’ve never heard of it! I’m here to attend a private gathering. I hope you guys won’t tell anyone about seeing me here.”","His tone was sincere and gentle. The fans present nodded crazily in agreement. No one would have thought that this gentle-looking Best Actor was pretending to be a member of the Luo family in New City Mall just now!","The fans held their autographs and said goodbye to Shen Yu excitedly. Shen Yu said softly to his manager, “It’s about time. We should go to the gathering.”","The manager looked at Shen Yu in confusion, then his eyes were filled with admiration. As expected of the Best Actor! His acting skills were natural!","Shen Yu revealed an indifferent smile. As soon as he raised his eyes, he saw Qiao Xi’s figure. He quickly walked over and asked softly, “How is it? Are you satisfied?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Shen Yu looked up in the direction of the New City Mall. “Why are you out so soon? Xia Cheng didn’t stop you from leaving? Shouldn’t he be looking for you to settle scores?”","Qiao Xi replied casually, “They’re all so anxious that they don’t have the mood to care about me! When I came out, I think I heard that Chairman Xia fainted. The Xia family should be in chaos now.”","The smile on Shen Yu’s face widened.","...","Longwan Residential.","After Qiao Xi returned home, she took out her phone. As expected, as soon as she went online, she saw the news about the incident at New City Mall. At this moment, the Xia family’s reputation had been ruined. Coupled with the fact that they had offended the Luo family, they were in grave danger.","The netizens stood up and criticized the Xia family for their crimes. Some of their competitors also scolded them online. However, Xia Cheng hadn’t fainted, so he couldn’t do anything about it.","Now that Xia Cheng was unconscious and the Xia family had lost their decision-maker, it seemed that they were already in a state of disunity.","The next day.","Qiao Xi was resting at home when Song Shiyu and the servants walked up to her with a few gowns. “Madam, the He family is holding a charity banquet tonight and invited you and the president. These are the gowns prepared for you.”","She put down the book in her hand and raised her eyes slightly. She casually pointed at a simple gown and frowned. “Why is He Weinian suddenly holding a charity banquet?”","“Actually, He Weinian holds a charity banquet almost every year, but the timing is not fixed. He has invited many guests, and all the famous people in Li City will attend.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “When the He family was in Li City, they were considered a middle-level wealthy family. Now that they’re back after so many years, how did they manage to invite so many people to the charity banquet?”","Song Shiyu’s lips curled into a mocking smile. “Because He Weinian has a good reputation! He’s very popular in Li City now! Although the He family’s business isn’t as good as before, he donates at least 100 million yuan every year. This isn’t a small sum for the He family.”","Qiao Xi said thoughtfully, “Could it be that he just wants a good reputation, so...”","“It’s not that simple.” Song Shiyu’s expression was subtle as he raised his eyebrows and said, “Do you really think they’ll take out such a large sum of money to donate? Then what will the He family use to spend? Actually, that money has never left the He family.”"]},{"number":1286,"title":"Chapter 1286 Special Ceremony","paragraphs":["1286 Special Ceremony","Qiao Xi abruptly sat up straight and widened her eyes. “How is this possible?”","Could it be that the He family had been putting on an act all these years? If they did not want to donate, they could just not hold a charity banquet. However, they insisted on holding it every year. Was it just for their reputation?","Song Shiyu looked up and explained, “The He family is constantly promoting a kind image for the He family. They donate to the mountains to build schools and repair roads. Everyone says that they’re kind, but who knows if the money they donated actually goes to building schools?","“He Weinian holds charity banquets every year and uses his position to take a portion of the money. Not only does he earn a reputation, but he also earns a lot. It’s really killing two birds with one stone.”","!!","Qiao Xi chuckled. “In that case, He Weinian wants both reputation and money. I thought he had no desires!”","“But the He family doesn’t deposit the money in the bank or change it into cash. Instead, they exchange it for gold and jewelry and hide it in the He family,” Song Shiyu added.","Qiao Xi nodded. Gold was valuable no matter what, but why did the He family exchange all their money for gold? After all, gold was not as convenient as cash.","Song Shiyu was about to say something when he suddenly saw the man standing outside the door. He immediately left.","Qiao Xi was just about to turn around when the man hugged her from behind. His long fingers gently landed on her fair neck, and a cold touch assaulted her.","“How beautiful.”","Qiao Xi looked in the mirror. She did not wear makeup, but her lips were red and her teeth were white. She wore a sparkling ruby necklace on her fair neck. The design was ingenious. The ruby was pure without a trace of impurity, and it was as gorgeous as blood.","With her identity as a jewelry designer, she could tell that this necklace was probably worth hundreds of millions. However, she seemed to have seen this necklace somewhere before.","Before she could react, she heard Gu Zheng whisper in her ear, “Five years ago, the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor donated a necklace called ‘Scorching Heart’. I think this necklace suits you very well.","“Xi Xi, do you like this gift?”","Qiao Xi’s expression instantly stiffened: “...” It turned out that she was the one who donated this necklace!","Hence, Gu Zheng must know that she was the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor and deliberately bought this necklace!","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly, and her face was slightly red. “I do, but won’t I look too ostentatious wearing this necklace to attend the charity banquet?!”","“Xi Xi, you should know that there’ll be a special ceremony at the charity banquet, right?” Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully.","Special ceremony?","Qiao Xi recalled that the charity banquet was actually an occasion for many big shots to compete with each other. Everyone wanted to display their noble status, so they would put in the effort to wear expensive jewelry or watches to the charity banquet. Then, they would donate their things in public to earn a good reputation.","Gu Zheng’s slightly cold finger landed on her neck and stroked it. “Xi Xi, you can donate this necklace tonight.”","She was willing to donate it. As long as she could help those who were really in trouble, of course, she would not be stingy, but...","“The He family holds charity banquets every year. But in the end, is that money really used for the construction of schools?”","“Xi Xi, you’re starting to suspect something too, right?” Gu Zheng’s tone was calm, but his eyes were filled with a sharp coldness. “Of course, they don’t hold charity banquets to show their love but to fill their pockets. All that money from previous banquets is still kept in the He family.”","Judging from He Weinian’s character, the man must only believe in himself. It was safest to keep the money by his side.","Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something. “You want to donate this necklace because you want to track the money using it?”","“How smart!” Gu Zheng rubbed her head with a gentle smile.","Qiao Xi immediately took off the necklace and carefully examined it. In the end, she noticed something on one of the gems. She raised her eyes in surprise. “This gem has been dismantled!”","Gu Zheng had personally done the work. Ordinary people were unable to notice this slight difference. Only the original owner of the necklace, Qiao Xi, was able to notice this slight difference.","“But Song Shiyu said that He Weinian will exchange some of his money for gold. How can you be sure that he won’t sell this necklace?” Qiao Xi asked.","Gu Zheng replied confidently, “This necklace is different. It’s extremely valuable. He Weinian is a businessman and will maximize his benefits. Wouldn’t it be a waste to exchange the necklace for gold?”","“That’s why I’m sure that He Weinian will definitely put this necklace in the He family’s treasure vault. At that time, we’ll know the exact location of the He family’s treasure vault.”"]},{"number":1287,"title":"Chapter 1287 He’s Really An Actor","paragraphs":["1287 He’s Really An Actor","Qiao Xi understood and revealed a sweet smile. “Then I’ll wear the necklace to the charity banquet! Not only that, but I also want to invite someone. If he goes, He Weinian will absolutely not sell this necklace.”","...","In the He family’s villa.","He Wenyin read the news about the Xia family’s scandal and looked at the photo of Xia Yunlou. However, it seemed that the He family had not found out her secret and did not suspect her for the time being. She could heave a sigh of relief.","At this moment, the He family were gathered together to discuss the charity banquet. He Wenyin never attended such meetings. Even if she wanted to attend, the He family would probably use all sorts of reasons to reject her.","She turned on her computer and tapped into the surveillance device. She could hear their conversation.","He Weinian said seriously, “Tingchen, as the future heir of the He family, you must perform well at tonight’s banquet. Nothing must happen.”","He Tingchen agreed. “I understand, Dad. But are you sure you want to donate that valuable item?”","“Tingchen!” He Weinian berated. “So what if it’s expensive? As long as it can help with the construction of schools, it’s worth it! Moreover, our He family is the organizer of this charity banquet. If we don’t take the lead in donating, why would others donate?”","“The luxury car under your name is valued at ten million yuan. This sum of money is enough to cover the expenses of a child in school for a few years! Tingchen, as the heir of the He family, you should broaden your horizons and not only look at benefits.”","He Tingchen felt a little guilty and looked at He Weinian in admiration. “Father, you’re right. I was too narrow-minded.”","On the other hand, He Wenyin listened to the voice coming from her earpiece with a look of disdain. He Weinian still had the cheek to say such things. He was really a drama queen!","Everyone in the He family was smart. Only He Tingchen was silly enough to believe He Weinian’s nonsense.","He Weinian’s voice came from the earpiece again. “Wenxian is donating a necklace this time. Speaking of which, she’s quite fated with this necklace. She donated it previously and didn’t expect to find it again. The market value is 120 million.”","He Tingchen was so ashamed that his face turned red. “Wenxian, you’re too kind. I have to learn more from you.”","He Wenxian smiled gently. “Brother, it’s nothing. I’m usually busy with work, so it’s not convenient for me to wear such expensive jewelry. Instead of leaving it to gather dust in my jewelry box, I might as well donate it to help the children in the mountains.”","“What necklace can be so expensive?” He Tingchen asked.","He Wenxian said casually, “The ruby necklace called ‘Scorching Heart’.”","“Then what is Yin Yin donating? Why didn’t you ask her to come over and discuss it?” Only then did He Tingchen remember that the siblings were both here except for He Wenyin.","He Weinian’s gaze changed as he replied indifferently, “It doesn’t matter what Yin Yin donates. She’s just a child. No one will find faults with her. Moreover, I’ve already prepared something for her. If she’s willing, she can donate it.”","“Yin Yin is playful. I don’t know where she went. Anyway, it’s not a big deal, so I didn’t ask her to come over. She probably doesn’t pay attention to such things, so let’s not disturb her.”","He Tingchen frowned. “She’s not young anymore. She can’t always be so playful. If she continues to be like this, she’ll become a wild child.”","He Wenyin was speechless when she heard this. Only by being playful could the He family be at ease. If she suddenly became studious, the He family would probably not tolerate her anymore.","Five minutes later, He Tingchen left the study, leaving He Wenxian and the He couple alone.","He Weinian looked at the door, and the kindness in his eyes instantly vanished. He removed his hypocritical mask. “Wenxian, your brother is kind-hearted. He definitely won’t be able to accept what we’re doing. You must not let him know.”","He Wenxian nodded obediently. “Dad, don’t worry. I won’t say anything. One day, Brother will understand your painstaking efforts and accept us.”","He Weinian smiled in relief. “Wenxian, donate that necklace. Of course, the He family will get it back later. You just have to arrange for the necklace to go through the motions in front of everyone. I’ll handle the rest.”","“Dad, we’ve been holding charity banquets all these years. After returning to Li City, we’ve done so many good things. Tomorrow when I donate ‘Scorching Heart’, the He family will definitely become kind people in everyone’s hearts!” He Wenxian’s voice was filled with joy.","He Wenyin turned off the surveillance and lazily leaned against the sofa with her eyes closed."]},{"number":1288,"title":"Chapter 1288 He Wenxian Encounters A Dead End","paragraphs":["1288 He Wenxian Encounters A Dead End","At eight in the evening, the guests gradually entered the banquet hall. He Weinian and Madam He were talking to the guests in the center of the banquet hall with gentle smiles on their faces.","He Wenxian and He Wenyin were chatting with a group of young masters and young ladies from high society. The scene was very lively.","On the other hand, Gu Zheng had already entered a spacious and luxurious private room through a special passage. When He Weinian heard that Gu Zheng had arrived, he immediately abandoned everyone and went upstairs. As soon as he saw him, he greeted him warmly. “President Gu, I’m really happy that you’re here!”","Madam He smiled gently and even instructed the servants to bring pastries and fruit tea to Qiao Xi. She asked Qiao Xi not to be restrained and to treat this as her own home.","It had to be said that these two people acted very well. Even Qiao Xi was almost deceived by their hypocritical appearance. The He family was skilled at pretending to be kind.","After they left, Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa and took out the necklace from her bag. She was about to put it on when the voices of passersby came from outside.","“Have you heard of the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor?”","“Of course, I’ve heard of her. She repaired that incomplete scroll and caused a sensation in the industry!”","“I wonder which family nurtured her? Not only did she repair the damaged scroll, but she also donated an expensive ruby necklace. I think it’s called Scorching Heart.”","“I heard that the necklace is worth more than 100 million yuan. I wonder who got it? I really want to see what that necklace looks like. Is it really as shockingly beautiful as the rumors say?”","Qiao Xi pricked up her ears and smiled in embarrassment when she heard everyone’s praise. It seemed that everyone had heard of this necklace. If they knew that the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor was sitting here, they would definitely break the threshold.","Could it be that in order to get He Weinian to keep this necklace, Gu Zheng specially released the news of it? When the time came and this necklace stunned everyone, it would naturally not be convenient for He Weinian to sell it.","Qiao Xi was just about to ask Gu Zheng when a voice suddenly sounded from outside the door again. “We’ll be able to see Scorching Heart today because that necklace is in He Wenxian’s hands!”","Qiao Xi’s expression suddenly stiffened, then she couldn’t help but roll her eyes.","“The He family donates so much money every year and has always lived a simple life. Why did MIss He still buy such an expensive necklace?”","“What’s strange about it? The He family has so many businesses both domestically and overseas. They definitely have the money to buy that necklace. Moreover, they bought this necklace to donate, not to show off.”","“Really? Miss He is donating Scorching Heart?”","Everyone’s voices were filled with surprise and admiration. “The He family is too kind and loving! They’ve been benevolent for so many years. They’ve donated loads and even arrange for other businessmen to donate. A family like the He family deserves to be rich.”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Qiao Xi looked at the necklace in the box and sneered in her heart. He Wenxian was in trouble this time.","She had donated this necklace as the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor. Moreover, she designed it with Lu Zhi when she was in Liuli. Others might not have seen this necklace, but as the original owner of the necklace, how could she not tell if it was real or fake?","Moreover, this necklace was bought by Gu Zheng for her. How could Gu Zheng have given her a fake? Hence, it was obvious that the necklace in He Wenxian’s hand was a fake.","Perhaps He Wenxian knew that the necklace in her hand was fake. She did this only to add to the He family’s reputation. She wanted everyone to know that the He family was benevolent and was willing to donate such a valuable necklace.","Qiao Xi pondered for a moment before her eyes suddenly lit up. “Ah Zheng, I’m going out to take a breather.”","“Why? Is it very stuffy here? Or do you have something else to do?” Gu Zheng looked at her with interest. His eyes seemed to have seen through her thoughts.","Qiao Xi’s expression remained unchanged as she blinked innocently. “What’s wrong? It’s very lively outside, so I want to go out to take a look. Do you think I’d hit on someone in the banquet hall?”","Gu Zheng stared at her for a few seconds, then looked away and curled his lips slightly. “Xi Xi, I heard that a jewelry appraiser will be coming tonight. This master has already settled down overseas, but he suddenly returned a year ago. Do you know about this?”","Qiao Xi squeezed out a smile and replied gently, “I do!”","“I also heard that the master has seen ‘Scorching Heart’.”","Qiao Xi still maintained her smile, but she did not speak. The two of them quietly looked at each other until Gu Zheng’s ears turned red and he looked away. “Go play.”"]},{"number":1289,"title":"Chapter 1289 The Unique Necklace","paragraphs":["1289 The Unique Necklace","With Gu Zheng’s permission, Qiao Xi happily left. She had just left when Gu Zheng’s entire body instantly emitted a strong chill.","“Returned to the country a year ago?”","Song Shiyu could feel the coldness in his tone and said considerately, “President, I’ll go see who that jewelry appraiser is!”","Gu Zheng smiled coldly. “Go ahead.”","Song Shiyu patted his chest and promised, “President, don’t worry. I won’t let him snatch Young Madam away!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","At this moment, the banquet hall was still extremely lively.","As the charity banquet was held by the He family, He Wenxian became the focus of the banquet. Everyone surrounded her and chatted.","The He family did not hide anything and told everyone in advance that they would display ‘Scorching Heart’ today. Hence, most of the guests came today to see this expensive necklace. Everyone saw the dazzling ruby necklace on He Wenxian’s neck at a glance.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi sat in a corner and quietly looked at He Wenxian, who was in the crowd.","“Oh my God! This necklace is too beautiful. No wonder it fetched a price of 120 million last time!”","“To be honest, only a generous socialite like Miss He is qualified to wear such an expensive necklace. Even if others wear it, they definitely won’t look as elegant and beautiful as Miss He.”","He Wenxian smiled in embarrassment. “Thank you for your praise, but I’m not wearing this necklace to show off at the banquet today. I’m donating it.”","Everyone widened their eyes and looked at He Wenxian in surprise.","“Miss He, are you really willing to donate Scorching Heart?”","He Wenxian smiled gently. “What’s there to be reluctant about? My father has been dedicated to charity for so many years. Moreover, this charity banquet is mainly for the construction of schools on the mountains. This requires a lot of money. As my father’s child, I naturally have to support him and do my best to contribute to the construction of schools. This necklace is just a precious accessory to me. It won’t affect me even if I don’t wear it. However, to the children on the mountains, it might change their lives or even the entire village!","“I feel very honored to be able to contribute to the construction of schools on the mountains!”","At this point, He Wenxian felt a little guilty. “Actually, compared to my father, what I’m doing is insignificant. Everyone knows that my father holds charity banquets every year. He started preparing almost a month in advance. He often tells us that money is just a worldly possession and that we have to be kind at all times.”","Qiao Xi: “...” These words sounded very touching, but when they came from He Wenxian’s mouth, they made one feel nauseous.","Perhaps it was because the He family had indeed done many good deeds all these years, so when He Wenxian said these words, no one felt that it was inappropriate. Moreover, it further solidified the kind image of the He family in their hearts.","Everyone was very impressed with He Wenxian. After all, there was no woman who did not like jewelry. Moreover, it was such a precious necklace. If it were them, they would not bear to donate such a precious thing.","“Miss He, Scorching Heart fetched a price of 120 million previously. Did Chairman He bid for it and give it to you?”","He Wenxian nodded without hesitation. “Yes.”","120 million was the price four years ago. At that time, the mysterious buyer did not appear and directly bid for Scorching Heart. The He family investigated and found out that the mysterious buyer had gone overseas. After that, there was no more news of Scorching Heart.","The He family had been looking for this necklace for many years. Presumably, this necklace was either far away overseas or had long been abandoned in the transportation process. In short, it was almost impossible for it to appear again. Hence, the necklace He Wenxian was wearing naturally became Scorching Heart. Moreover, no one would suspect anything.","“The auction will be held in an hour. I wonder who will bid for Scorching Heart. If no one offers a suitable price, they can bring it to the auction house in the capital. The price will definitely be higher than 120 million.”","“Of course, 120 million was the price four years ago. With the value of Scorching Heart, it’s at least 150 million now. Moreover, this necklace was originally donated by the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor!”","“What? A unique piece?” Someone exclaimed, “In other words, this necklace is unique through and through. There’s no second piece in the world that’s like it!”","Scorching Heart’s design was very ingenious. The embedding of each gem was very unique. Ordinary craftsmen could not replicate it at all. Moreover, even if they could, they could not afford the expensive gems."]},{"number":1290,"title":"Chapter 1290 Wearing Fake Goods Is Embarrassing!","paragraphs":["1290 Wearing Fake Goods Is Embarrassing!","He Wenxian said gently, “That’s right, it’s a unique piece. Moreover, the gems on the necklace are unique. You can’t find anything more perfect than this.”","“Look...” Suddenly, someone pointed not far away and said in surprise, “The necklace that lady is wearing seems to be... the same as Miss He’s necklace?”","Everyone immediately turned around. He Wenxian’s heart trembled as she hurriedly turned around.","Qiao Xi was leaning against the sofa alone. She was wearing a pearl-white dress that revealed her shoulders. It was simple but luxurious. What was even more eye-catching was the necklace around her neck. It flickered with a red light, accentuating her snow-white skin. She looked like a fairy who had descended to the mortal world.","That necklace was almost identical to Miss He’s!","“Why is there another one?”","“The He family wouldn’t lie, right? But that lady is wearing the same necklace. What exactly is going on?”","“Which family is that lady from?”","As the daughter of the He family and the person wearing a piece of jewelry that was worth more than 100 million yuan, He Wenxian was naturally the most eye-catching person here. However, there was a lady in the banquet hall who was wearing the same necklace as her. Since it was a unique piece, one of them must be fake.","The instant He Wenxian saw Qiao Xi, her heart seemed to have been dealt a heavy blow. Could it be that Qiao Xi’s necklace was real?","Impossible! Her father gave her the necklace, which meant that he was sure that the real Scorching Heart would not appear. Moreover, the mysterious person who bought that necklace back then had long left the country. It was impossible for the buyer to be Gu Zheng.","He Wenxian’s expression softened a little as she gradually calmed down.","Everyone stared at Qiao Xi. Actually, she rarely attended high society gatherings. Coincidentally, none of the socialites and young masters present today had seen her before, so when they saw her wearing the ruby necklace, they instantly thought that the necklace she was wearing was fake.","Just as someone was about to ask He Wenxian about this lady’s identity, He Wenxian warmly went forward to greet her. “Xi Xi, when did you come? Why didn’t you look for me?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and smiled at He Wenxian without saying anything.","Faced with Qiao Xi’s cold attitude, the smile on He Wenxian’s face was slightly stiff. “What? You came alone?”","The socialite beside her frowned and asked, “Wenxian, who is she?”","“She...” He Wenxian was a little hesitant. If she said that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife, everyone present would naturally think highly of her. Hence, she changed the topic and said, “All of you have heard of the Xia family, right? She’s Madam Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter.”","Everyone here had never seen Qiao Xi before, but they had all heard of the Xia family’s scandal. Someone had pretended to be Xia Yunlou, and the real Xia Yunlou’s whereabouts were unknown. Now that Qiao Xi was no longer Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter, she could naturally only consider herself Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter.","In everyone’s opinion, a woman with such an identity was not qualified to attend high society banquets. Moreover, how could such a woman bid for a necklace worth more than 100 million? Even if she was really rich, how could she have snatched something from the He family?","One was the eldest daughter of the He family, while the other was the adopted daughter of a declining family. Yet, the two of them were wearing the same necklace. It was already very obvious who was telling the truth.","At this moment, someone said sarcastically, “If you can’t afford expensive jewelry, you can choose not to wear it! Otherwise, everyone will laugh at you for wearing a fake! How embarrassing!”","“She probably didn’t know that Miss He would wear Scorching Heart to the banquet. This is too awkward.”","He Wenxian’s eyes were filled with helplessness and heartache. She waved at the people who were talking, then took a few steps forward, bent down, and said softly, “Xi Xi, I think you must have been deceived. There are many fake goods on the market, and ordinary people won’t be able to distinguish them. If you really like this necklace, I’ll lend it to you to wear first. Take off this fake one first.”","With that, He Wenxian immediately wanted to take off her necklace.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and glanced at her. Why was He Wenxian pretending in front of her?! She clearly knew that she was Gu Zheng’s wife, yet she did not tell them. Instead, she said that she was from the Xia family. Did she think that without Gu Zheng’s identity, she would have no one to rely on?","He Wenxian stared fixedly at Qiao Xi. Even if Qiao Xi said that she was Gu Zheng’s wife, it was too late. After all, everyone already suspected that she was wearing a fake. Since no one had seen the real Scorching Heart, it would depend on who everyone believed.","She took off the necklace and handed it to Qiao Xi with a gentle smile. “Xi Xi, I’ll lend you my necklace first.”","He Wenxian’s kind actions made the other socialites jealous. They also wanted to wear it. After all, it was the dream of all girls. What right did that woman who brought a fake here have to wear it so easily?"]},{"number":1291,"title":"Chapter 1291 My Sister Is Beautiful And Kind","paragraphs":["1291 My Sister Is Beautiful And Kind","“Xi Xi is my friend,” He Wenxian explained to everyone, then looked at Qiao Xi gently. “Xi Xi, I’m donating this necklace later. Before I donate it, you can wear this necklace. It’s okay.”","He Wenxian’s words made everyone even more sure that this woman was wearing a fake. The only necklace in the world appeared on two women at the same time. One of them must be wearing a fake. The eldest daughter of the He family had a noble status and was the organizer of the charity banquet. She even wanted to donate this necklace. Of course, the necklace she was wearing could not be fake. There were so many pieces of expensive jewelry, so why did she have to wear a fake to ruin her reputation?","The socialites and noblewomen thought that they had noble statuses and looked down on people who wore fake goods the most. Moreover, Qiao Xi was exposed on such an important occasion. She would be treated as a joke by everyone in high society.","Moreover, He Wenxian said that this woman was her friend, but this woman ignored her. She knew that the two of them were wearing the same necklace, but she had no intention of taking it off. Perhaps she had long known that He Wenxian wanted to wear Scorching Heart to the banquet, so she deliberately wore a fake to cause trouble.","A trace of bright light flashed through He Wenxian’s eyes. If Qiao Xi had not worn this necklace today, she wouldn’t have bothered to bicker with her. After all, in front of everyone, she had to maintain her gentle and understanding image at all times. However, she was wearing Scorching Heart now and was about to donate it. If others realized that her necklace was fake, she would definitely be mocked.","She absolutely would not allow such a thing to happen, so she could only blame Qiao Xi for being unlucky. She could have worn any jewelry, but she just had to wear the same one as her.","He Wenxian curled her lips and said softly, “Xi Xi, don’t be shy. I’ll bring you to the lounge now. Wear my necklace...”","Qiao Xi paid no attention to her. She just glanced lazily and casually at her as if she didn’t take He Wenxian seriously at all.","Mocking laughter came from around her, but she pretended not to hear it. After a moment of silence, she chuckled. “Miss He, how can you be sure that I’m wearing a fake?”","He Wenxian’s expression froze, and her tone carried a trace of bewitchment. “Xi Xi, there are so many people in the banquet hall. Why don’t we talk in the lounge?”","As soon as she finished speaking, He Wenxian stretched out her hand to pull Qiao Xi back, but she was flung away by Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi’s gaze shifted and swept past a figure in front of her.","He Wenxian’s expression was a little ugly as she pursed her lips tightly. The people beside her could not stand it anymore and hurriedly stood up to defend the injustice. “You really don’t know what’s good for you! You’re clearly wearing a fake, so Wenxian wanted to save you some dignity and decided to lend you her necklace. It’s fine if you don’t thank her, but you still dare to be so arrogant?”","“This is the He family’s charity banquet. Who do you think you are to dare to throw a tantrum at the eldest daughter of the He family? This necklace is unique. One of the two identical necklaces must be fake. Miss He is the daughter of the He family. How could she wear a fake to attend her own charity banquet?”","“That’s right! Miss He even wants to donate the necklace! It’s absolutely impossible for her to wear a fake!”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa and did not care about everyone’s accusations in the slightest. Her gaze had already drifted ahead. He Wenyin was sitting and chatting with a few rich young ladies. They had also heard the commotion here.","He Wenyin looked over and stood up abruptly. “My sister is beautiful and kind-hearted. She clearly knows that that woman is wearing a fake, but she didn’t expose her and still offered to lend her the necklace.","“My sister is the eldest daughter of the He family. She’s so rich and noble. How could she be wearing a fake? My sister is definitely wearing the real one!”","The young ladies beside her were instantly stunned. One of the socialites who was close to He Wenyin asked with a subtle expression, “Yin Yin, who taught you these words?”","He Wenyin retorted in a panic, “No! It’s all my own thoughts!”","Actually, these young ladies all knew that He Wenyin was innocent and ignorant. He Wenxian must have taught her to say these words. Although she was telling the truth, no one expected a gentle and kind woman like He Wenxian to use her innocent sister. She got He Wenyin to say in public that she was beautiful and kind-hearted, while she stood behind He Wenyin and pretended to be humble. She wanted to maintain a noble image in front of everyone.","He Wenxian was not as gentle as she looked on the surface. In fact, she was actually very scheming.","He Wenyin saw the doubt in the ladies’ eyes and lowered her eyes to smile."]},{"number":1292,"title":"Chapter 1292 Jewelry Appraisal Master","paragraphs":["1292 Jewelry Appraisal Master","On the other hand, He Wenxian’s expression was slightly cold when she saw that Qiao Xi was stubborn, but her tone was still gentle. “Xi Xi, it’s useless even if you don’t admit it now. After all, it’s not good for your reputation!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at He Wenxian with a subtle gaze.","He Wenxian smiled confidently. Although her necklace was not the real one, Qiao Xi’s necklace was definitely fake as well. She knew that Qiao Xi was a jewelry designer, but so what? Who said that jewelry designers could not wear fakes? Perhaps she was the one who imitated it and was confident that she could make it look real. Unexpectedly, something went wrong.","Qiao Xi suddenly spoke with an extremely calm tone, “Miss He, what should I admit to? Why must you force me to admit it? If you suspect that my necklace is fake, you can get a professional to appraise it. We’ll know the truth then.”","!!","Everyone suddenly reacted. They might not be able to tell if the jewelry was real or fake, but there were professional jewelry appraisers. Everyone here would know if the necklace was real or fake after getting someone to check it.","Someone voiced out, “But... very few people have seen Scorching Heart. If someone hasn’t seen it before, how can they judge if it’s real or fake? I don’t think the gems on Miss Qiao’s necklace look fake. If the gems are all real, but there’s a small difference in the necklace, who will be able to tell?”","Even so, everyone still thought that the necklace Qiao Xi was wearing was fake. Presumably, Qiao Xi had spent a lot of money to replicate this necklace, but a fake was a fake. She was clearly here today to ruin the scene!","“Then who do you think is suitable to appraise it, Miss Qiao? If you casually find an appraiser, we won’t be able to tell if the necklace is real or fake.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were bright like stars as she gently swirled the contents of the glass in her hand with a carefree appearance.","He Wenxian seemed to be in a dilemma. “This idea isn’t...”","“Wenxian, quickly get the bodyguards to pull this woman to the lounge and get her to take off the necklace. Don’t let her cause trouble in the banquet hall anymore. You’ve already given her face, but she doesn’t know what’s good for her!”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Miss He, you concluded that my necklace is fake, and you even want to chase me out of the banquet hall. The threshold for this He family’s charity banquet is quite high!”","Everyone could hear Qiao Xi’s strange tone. Before He Wenxian could speak, a young lady who was trying to curry favor with her stood up to defend the injustice. “Miss Qiao, you should know that you have to donate money or things to attend the charity banquet. What are you donating? Could it be that it’s the fake necklace you’re wearing? If you don’t have any expensive jewelry, you can choose not to wear it. Why would you wear a fake to the banquet? Who are you trying to disgust?","“You’re just afraid of losing your dignity if you don’t admit it, but even if you don’t admit it, we’ll still believe Miss He. After all, you’re just—”","Before she could finish, a clear and hearty voice came from afar. However, there was a trace of impatience in this voice. “Why are you so noisy?!”","The huge banquet hall instantly fell silent. The daughters beside He Wenxian exclaimed. They all recognized the young and handsome man in front of them—Cheng Juan, the jewelry appraiser.","Cheng Juan looked to be in his 20s, but he was already an internationally renowned jewelry appraiser who had won countless awards overseas. Moreover, he had never made a mistake in his career. He very quickly became a top figure in the jewelry industry.","A year ago, he returned to the country to develop his career and had been operating in the capital. What everyone was most afraid of was not him but the noble families who were inextricably linked to him. Cheng Juan was protected by those noble families, so no one dared to easily offend him.","The young lady’s name was Lan Rong. When she saw Cheng Juan appear, she immediately cowered and said while trembling, “M-Mr. Cheng, I’m really sorry to have disturbed you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she glared at Qiao Xi unwillingly and said in a hoarse voice, “If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have spoken so loudly. It’s all your fault for disturbing Mr. Cheng!”","Qiao Xi was speechless to the extreme. This woman was so good at pushing the blame. How could Qiao Xi be blamed for such a small matter?","After a few seconds of silence, everyone’s eyes landed on Cheng Juan. Didn’t Miss Qiao want to find a professional to appraise it? Mr. Cheng was the top jewelry appraiser and had never made a mistake. Moreover, with his strength and reputation, he would definitely be able to differentiate the two necklaces.","Lan Rong knew that Cheng Juan’s identity was extraordinary. Afraid of offending him, she hurriedly explained, “Mr. Cheng, I shouldn’t have made a fuss, but I just couldn’t stand it anymore.”"]},{"number":1293,"title":"Chapter 1293 Miss He, Are You Afraid?","paragraphs":["1293 Miss He, Are You Afraid?","“It’s all because of her! She wore a fake Scorching Heart to attend the charity banquet. Miss He thought that this occasion was special and it was not suitable for her to wear a fake, so she advised this lady to take off the fake necklace to avoid embarrassing herself later. However, not only did she not listen to Miss He, but she even said that her necklace is genuine. She means to say that the necklace Miss He is wearing is fake!”","Hearing Lan Rong’s words, Cheng Juan, who was about to leave, stopped in his tracks. He slowly turned around, and his gaze landed on He Wenxian’s necklace. “Scorching Heart?”","He Wenxian was not nervous at all. Cheng Juan was an honored guest invited by her father. Her father must have already made plans. If they really got it appraised on the spot, Cheng Juan would not hesitate to say that her necklace was the real thing.","Moreover, Cheng Juan had worked with her father before. Since he agreed to attend the charity banquet, he must be extremely respectful to her father. He naturally would not speak up for outsiders.","!!","If Cheng Juan said in public that Qiao Xi’s necklace was a fake, then Qiao Xi would not be able to explain herself.","He Wenxian’s eyes narrowed slightly as she looked at Qiao Xi with slight pride. Her father had always reminded her not to become enemies with Qiao Xi, but she was truly unable to control herself. What right did Qiao Xi have to occupy the position of Mrs. Gu? What right did she have to stand by Gu Zheng’s side? What was so good about her?","He Wenxian originally thought that she could renew her relationship with Gu Zheng after returning to the country this time, but she did not expect that Gu Zheng would have gotten married a long time ago. Moreover, the two of them were very close now. She had to hide the emotions in her heart at all times and respectfully call Qiao Xi ‘Mrs. Gu’. She even had to give a wedding gift to please Qiao Xi.","She was indignant!","Now, she could not openly become enemies with Qiao Xi, but she could make Qiao Xi make a fool of herself in public and let everyone know that Qiao Xi was utterly unqualified to be Gu Zheng’s wife. She could watch her reputation be ruined. When the time was right, she could kick Qiao Xi away and become the woman standing by Gu Zheng’s side.","Her thoughts quickly occupied her mind like a monstrous fire. He Wenxian looked away and said gently, “That’s right, it’s Scorching Heart.”","A trace of surprise flashed past Cheng Juan’s eyes as his gaze landed on her necklace.","Lan Rong, who was at the side, immediately provoked him. “Mr. Cheng, Wenxian’s necklace is the real deal. Miss Qiao is wearing a fake. This is an insult to the charity banquet. She doesn’t take the He family seriously at all.","“Moreover, she must have known that you would be attending the banquet, but she still decided to wear a fake in front of a noble jewelry appraiser like you. She’s clearly disrespecting you!”","Cheng Juan raised his eyes slightly and looked at Qiao Xi. His tone carried a trace of playfulness. “She’s wearing a fake?”","For some reason, He Wenxian became inexplicably nervous when she heard Cheng Juan’s voice. She hoped that Cheng Juan would quickly come to a conclusion. She wanted to see Qiao Xi lose all her dignity and be chased out by everyone.","Cheng Juan smiled brightly. “Miss Qiao, do you know what will happen if you wear fake jewelry in front of me?”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in unison. Her back was straight, and her figure was extremely perfect. The gorgeous ruby necklace made her skin look snow-white, and her entire body was glowing.","“I’m not too sure.” Qiao Xi shook her head indifferently.","Cheng Juan smiled. “Looks like you’re very confident, Miss Qiao.”","Qiao Xi blinked and said casually, “Because I’m sure that my necklace is real. It’s just that everyone else has publicly concluded that my necklace is fake. Isn’t this too arbitrary?”","Everyone was instantly stunned. Cheng Juan was already here, yet she still refused to admit it? What right did she have to be sure that her necklace was real?","He Wenxian subconsciously glanced at Cheng Juan, gritted her teeth, and continued to drive a wedge between them. “Xi Xi, how can you say that in front of Mr. Cheng?! Mr. Cheng will decide which necklace is real and which is fake. It’s better if you don’t—”","“Since that’s the case, why waste your breath, Miss He? Just get Mr. Cheng to appraise it as soon as possible. I think Mr. Cheng won’t refuse if you ask him. Or are you afraid and deliberately stalling for time?” Qiao Xi interrupted her mercilessly with a trace of ridicule in her tone.","He Wenxian’s heart trembled. She originally thought that Qiao Xi did not dare to get the necklaces appraised and was just thinking about how to get Qiao Xi to agree. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi jumped into her trap herself.","He Wenxian wanted Cheng Juan to do the appraisal and give the final conclusion in front of everyone, but she was the gentle and kind eldest daughter of the He family. She could not force Qiao Xi openly. However, not only did Qiao Xi agree, but she was also anxious to do the appraisal.","Could it be that Qiao Xi did not know that since the He family was able to invite Cheng Juan, it meant that Cheng Juan was close to the He family and he would help the He family instead of an outsider like Qiao Xi?"]},{"number":1294,"title":"Chapter 1294 Nothing Can Be Done Without Rules","paragraphs":["1294 Nothing Can Be Done Without Rules","He Wenxian shook her head helplessly. “Xi Xi, I have nothing to be afraid of. Since you’re strongly requesting an appraisal, I’ll have to trouble you, Mr. Cheng.”","Cheng Juan raised his eyes to glance at Qiao Xi before slowly asking, “Are you sure you want me to do an appraisal?”","His voice was gentle and a little hoarse. It carried a unique male charm, making the women present blush. He Wenxian smiled in embarrassment. “Mr. Cheng, I don’t want to waste your time, but this is no small matter. If you don’t come forward to appraise the two necklaces, there won’t be a conclusion today. Since Xi Xi has agreed, please appraise the necklaces.”","Lan Rong echoed, “That’s right. Only Mr. Cheng’s appraisal results can convince Miss Qiao. Those who don’t know might think that we’ve wronged her!”","!!","Cheng Juan smiled and said in a gentle voice, “Everyone should know my rules.”","Most people had heard of Mr. Cheng’s rules. He had never made a mistake in his career and could not tolerate anything. Hence, his rule was that once a fake was discovered, it would be mercilessly destroyed on the spot. It did not matter who it belonged to or how much it was worth.","Back then, a young miss from the capital was attending a banquet and happened to wear the same brooch as a lady. At that time, the young miss insisted on appraising it. In the end, the young miss’ brooch was fake. Cheng Juan ignored the young miss’ scream and smashed the brooch on the spot.","The entire venue was in an uproar, but ever since then, he became famous in the industry and everyone naturally knew about his special rules.","He Wenxian had no objections. Since Cheng Juan could even smash the belongings of those daughters from wealthy families in the capital, he would naturally not give them an exception. Actually, this was also a good thing. After Cheng Juan determined that Qiao Xi’s necklace was a fake, it would immediately be smashed. Not only would Qiao Xi lose an expensive necklace, but she would also be despised by everyone. Perhaps even Gu Zheng would hate her for her stupidity.","“I agree. What do you think, Xi Xi?” He Wenxian asked softly.","Qiao Xi nodded and did not object.","A trace of playfulness flashed past Cheng Juan’s eyes. “Since the two of you have no objections, let’s start.”","He slowly sat down, put on gloves, and instructed his assistant to spread a layer of velvet on the table. Then, both parties took off their necklaces and placed them on the table.","In everyone’s eyes, the two necklaces were almost identical. The color, saturation, and angle of embedding were all the same.","Cheng Juan picked up the two necklaces and observed them carefully. He revealed a subtle smile.","The next second, the assistant took out a box. Inside was a small exquisite hammer. It was the tool Cheng Juan used to smash the brooch of the daughter of a rich family in the capital.","When everyone saw the hammer, they knew that Cheng Juan had already come to a conclusion. They stared fixedly at the two necklaces, and He Wenxian became nervous.","‘With Cheng Juan’s hammer, Qiao Xi’s necklace will be shattered into pieces. From then on...’","“Miss He, are you really going to let Mr. Cheng smash it?” Qiao Xi suddenly interrupted He Wenxian’s thoughts. “If you go back on your word now, I believe Mr. Cheng won’t make things difficult for you.”","He Wenxian smiled and shook her head. “Xi Xi, there are rules we have to follow. Since this is Mr. Cheng’s rule, it’s not good for him to make an exception for us. No matter whose necklace is a fake, it has to be destroyed according to Mr. Cheng’s wishes. Xi Xi, are you going back on your word?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Lan Rong snorted. “I think her necklace is quite good. It shouldn’t be cheap either. Now that she heard that the fake is going to be smashed, she can’t bear to part with it and wants to go back on her word.","“If you want to go back on your word, then tell the truth. You even asked Wenxian if she wants to go back on her word. How shameless! Wenxian had already given you a chance. You didn’t cherish it and insisted on doing an appraisal!”","He Wenxian waved her hand gently. “Rong Rong, don’t say that. If Xi Xi wants to go back on her word, I’ll agree. It’s just that I don’t know what Mr. Cheng will think.","“After all, Xi Xi is my friend’s wife. I can’t just watch her make a fool of herself. If she hadn’t insisted on getting it appraised, I wouldn’t have troubled you, Mr. Cheng.","“Xi Xi, if you want to go back on your word, we’ll stop here. Mr. Cheng, please show mercy and treat it as a joke.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. He Wenxian’s behavior was really nauseating. No matter what she said or did, she always maintained the appearance of being very kind and wholeheartedly thinking for the sake of others. It was as if she only agreed to the appraisal because she had no choice and was respecting the other party’s opinion. However, every word she said was actually adding fuel to the fire."]},{"number":1295,"title":"Chapter 1295 Are You Doubting My Standard?","paragraphs":["1295 Are You Doubting My Standard?","Qiao Xi knew very well in her heart that He Wenxian must be thinking that Cheng Juan was invited by He Weinian, so he would definitely stand on her side in the end. That was indeed the case on the surface. Moreover, Qiao Xi had heard from Cheng Juan that he grew up in an orphanage and had suffered a lot. However, a family had donated a sum of money to the orphanage at that time, allowing him to obtain some benefits.","The family who donated the money was the He family. If that were the case, Cheng Juan should be very grateful to the He family. After all, he seemed to be a grateful person, but—","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Miss He, I never said that I wanted to go back on my word. I was just reminding you.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Cheng Juan had already picked up the small hammer. He Wenxian’s excited voice trembled slightly. “Xi Xi, what do you mean?”","!!","Qiao Xi glanced at her and did not say anything because He Wenxian would soon find out.","The hammer was raised high, and everyone held their breaths as their gazes landed on Qiao Xi’s necklace. They all thought that Cheng Juan would smash Qiao Xi’s necklace. With Miss He’s identity, she would not wear a fake.","Bang!","A violent bang sounded as a ruby necklace shattered. The smile on He Wenxian’s face froze.","The entire venue was silent. They could not believe the scene in front of them. He Wenxian’s necklace had actually been smashed by Cheng Juan!","How did this happen?","When everyone was shocked to the point of being speechless, Qiao Xi broke the silence. “I just wanted to remind Miss He as it’d be too embarrassing for your necklace to be smashed in public, so I wanted to give you a chance to go back on your word. Unfortunately, you didn’t cherish it!”","As soon as she finished speaking, He Wenxian looked as if she had eaten a fly. Even though she had been putting on an act for so many years, she couldn’t help but be furious when she saw the ruby necklace she had painstakingly obtained shatter.","Everyone saw the two of them take off their necklaces with their own eyes. Qiao Xi placed hers on the left, while He Wenxian placed hers on the right. The broken necklace was on the right. This scene happened under everyone’s eyes. Qiao Xi had no chance to pull a trick, so He Wenxian’s necklace was a fake.","The entire venue was in an uproar.","“Mr. Cheng smashed Miss He’s necklace, which means that she was wearing a fake!”","“Oh my God! I didn’t expect the high and mighty Miss He to wear a fake!”","He Wenxian’s face was ashen, and her entire body was extremely cold. She almost stopped breathing. She raised her eyes to look at Cheng Juan in disbelief. Perhaps Cheng Juan really could not tolerate fakes. It was understandable that he smashed her necklace, but shouldn’t he have smashed Qiao Xi’s necklace too?","However, after Cheng Juan smashed He Wenxian’s necklace, he handed the hammer to his assistant and instructed him to put it away. Then, he leaned back in the chair and crossed his long legs, looking extremely lazy. His actions had already told everyone the final conclusion.","He Wenxian’s sharp nails had already dug into her palms. The pain made her stay awake and rational. The group of young ladies who were speaking up for her just now was instantly anxious. “No! No! Wenxian, what exactly is going on? Why were you wearing a fake? Moreover, you said that your father gave you this necklace!”","Lan Rong’s face was pale. When she recalled the scene of her standing up for He Wenxian and mocking Qiao Xi, she wished for nothing more than to slap herself. However, she was still unconvinced and argued loudly, “Mr. Cheng, take a good look again. Wenxian is the eldest daughter of the He family. She wouldn’t wear a fake. On the other hand, that woman is just the adopted daughter of the Xia family. I don’t know where she found this fake. She...”","“Are you doubting my standard?” Cheng Juan looked up slightly, his eyes filled with coldness. Lan Rong was so scared that she instantly swallowed the words in her mouth.","After a few seconds of silence, Cheng Juan snorted. “Rubies are indeed not rare, but every ruby on Scorching Heart is expensive and extremely rare. The rubies in the fake aren’t big enough, so they used fillings on the back of the gems and the diamonds and platinum beside to cover it up. From afar, one really wouldn’t be able to tell. But do you think I can’t tell when it was so poorly made?","“It’s a fake Scorching Heart, and it only imitated the genuine necklace’s appearance. It’s difficult to imitate the essence of it. That fake was truly laughable.”","The moment that was said, everyone gasped. Although they did not know anything about jewelry appraisal, Cheng Juan had already made himself very clear. No one would doubt his professionalism. Moreover, Cheng Juan had always been fair. He did not have to offend the He family for Miss Qiao and ruin his reputation."]},{"number":1296,"title":"Chapter 1296 This Is How The He Family Treats Their Guests","paragraphs":["1296 This Is How The He Family Treats Their Guests","He Wenxian’s face was as pale as paper. She clenched her fists tightly and took a deep breath. The truth was already in front of her. If she continued to explain, everyone would laugh at her and hate her.","She frowned and said helplessly, “Mr. Cheng, I’m really sorry. I didn’t expect this necklace to be a fake. After all, my father did spend 150 million to buy this necklace back then. He probably didn’t know anything about jewelry, so he was deceived.”","Seeing this, everyone echoed, “That’s right! Now that the technology used for jewelry imitation is so advanced, ordinary people will definitely find it difficult to differentiate between the real thing and fake goods. Chairman He just wanted to give Miss He a valuable piece of jewelry. He didn’t expect to encounter such a thing.”","“Miss He can’t be blamed for this. After all, she didn’t know either!”","!!","He Wenxian said tiredly, “Mr. Cheng, I’m really sorry that a fake appeared at the charity banquet. I’ve disturbed you. It’s getting late, and the banquet is about to start. Let’s go to the main hall.”","“Miss He.” Just as He Wenxian wanted to wrap up this matter as soon as possible, Qiao Xi suddenly spoke. He Wenxian’s body instantly stiffened as she slowly turned around.","Qiao Xi’s tone carried a trace of ridicule. “Miss He, so your necklace is fake! But it’s okay. If you like this necklace, I can lend the real one to you to wear first. You don’t have to be polite with me!”","As soon as these words were spoken, He Wenxian’s expression instantly turned ugly. Qiao Xi was clearly imitating her tone from earlier.","This was the He family’s charity banquet, but Qiao Xi was so arrogant. Was she going to completely offend the He family?","He Wenxian suppressed the anger in her heart and did not say anything for a long time. Lan Rong, who was at the side, said indignantly, “Miss Qiao, why are you saying that?! Wenxian didn’t do it on purpose. Do you have to be so unforgiving?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi abruptly widened her eyes and blinked innocently. “Huh? Is this being unforgiving? But these words were said by Miss He in the beginning! I thought this was a way to express one’s goodwill, so I learned these words from her. It turns out that she was actually being unforgiving!”","The veins on He Wenxian’s forehead were bulging.","Lan Rong instantly choked and pointed at Qiao Xi as she shouted, “You! Are you worthy of learning from Miss He? She can say some things, but you can’t!”","“Why am I not worthy? I was wearing the same necklace as Miss He, but you concluded that mine was a fake. Now that Mr. Cheng has already proven that mine is the real deal, you’re saying that I’m not worthy. In that case, no matter who has the fake necklace and who has the real one, Miss He will still be noble and perfect in your eyes while I’m still the adopted daughter who’s wearing a fake necklace. If that’s the case, is there any point in appraising the authenticity of the necklace?”","Qiao Xi spoke indifferently, but it caused He Wenxian to frown.","Lan Rong was so angry that her face turned red. “I already said that Miss He didn’t do it on purpose. She’s the eldest daughter of the He family. There’s no need for her to wear a fake to the banquet. This is just a misunderstanding. Actually, it’s all your fault. If you hadn’t worn Scorching Heart here to show off, Wenxian wouldn’t have made a fool of herself in public!”","Qiao Xi was instantly angered to the point of laughing. “It’s ostentatious for me to wear a necklace when I go out, but it’s noble for Miss He to do the same? It’s my fault that her necklace was appraised as a fake, and I’m not showing Miss He any respect? I’ve really learned something today. So, this is how the famous daughter of the He family treats guests!","“Miss He, you thought that my necklace was fake. You’ve already embarrassed yourself, but you’re blaming me when I haven’t even settled the score with you yet?”","He Wenxian originally thought that this matter could be resolved. If it really did not work out, she could apologize to Qiao Xi and resolve this matter as soon as possible so that it would not delay the banquet.","However, she was unable to open her mouth no matter what. She was unwilling, and she was unable to apologize to Qiao Xi.","What right did Qiao Xi have to possess the true Scorching Heart? Wasn’t it all because of Gu Zheng? Besides Gu Zheng, who else would give her such a precious gift? Why did Gu Zheng give Scorching Heart to that b*tch? That necklace should belong to her!","He Wenxian lowered her head and looked very aggrieved. The young man at the side could not stand it anymore and said unhappily, “Miss Qiao, this isn’t Miss He’s fault. She was originally prepared to donate the necklace. Now that she knows that the necklace is a fake, she’s very sad. However, you just insist on being unreasonable and not letting her off. Anyway, you didn’t suffer any losses. Can’t this matter end here?”","“That’s right!” Someone else stood up and echoed, “Miss He is kind-hearted. She didn’t mean to do it. It’s just a misunderstanding. Moreover, she hasn’t donated it yet, and there are no negative consequences. Why are you criticizing her so sarcastically? Don’t think that you can bully others just because you’re wearing the real necklace!”"]},{"number":1297,"title":"Chapter 1297 Who’s Bullying Who?","paragraphs":["1297 Who’s Bullying Who?","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. This group of people had really been brainwashed by He Wenxian. All these years, He Wenxian had always maintained a good image, so she had an extremely good reputation among socialites. She treated others gently, was capable, and was not arrogant. Many men treated her as a goddess in their hearts. They came to the charity banquet for the sake of approaching this goddess. In order to show a good performance in front of He Wenxian, they had already lost their minds at this moment.","‘Don’t think that you can bully others just because you’re wearing the real necklace.’","Was this what a human should say? He Wenxian indiscriminately said that she was wearing a fake. Now that she had been slapped in the face, she was still pretending to be innocent in front of everyone. Who was bullying who?","Actually, these people knew very well that He Wenxian was not as kind as she looked on the surface. At that time, He Wenxian’s words were clearly filled with mockery, but many men saw He Wenxian through rose-colored lenses. Even if she did something bad, they would find all kinds of reasons to defend her.","When He Wenxian arrogantly suggested letting Qiao Xi wear her necklace, it was because He Wenxian was being kind. Now that Qiao Xi said the same words, she was being unreasonable and deliberately targeting He Wenxian.","How unreasonable!","The young man sized up Qiao Xi. He had to admit that this woman was really beautiful, but her character was too domineering and unforgiving. Moreover, her identity was not noble enough, so she was completely unqualified to marry him. Hence, Miss He was more suitable for him.","Then, an inexplicable sense of confidence suddenly surged in his heart. “Miss Qiao, you’re different from Miss He. She wanted to donate the necklace, while you’re wearing it to show off. The two of you are of different natures, so you have no right to blame her!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly and said casually, “Then I’ll really have to disappoint you. I wore the necklace today for the sake of donating it.”","As soon as these words were spoken, the man instantly choked. He Wenxian, who was at the side, also widened her eyes. Her eyes were filled with surprise and joy. If Qiao Xi donated this necklace, then this necklace would still fall into her hands in the end. The charity banquet was just a cover. It was just a tool for the He family to earn money.","However, if Qiao Xi donated such expensive jewelry, she would definitely be in the limelight at the charity banquet.","He Wenxian’s delighted expression was mixed with a trace of unwillingness. She said in surprise, “Xi Xi, are you really donating to Scorching Heart? This necklace is worth 150 million. Are you sure?”","“I’m sure. If you could have the idea of donating the necklace, why can’t I? Besides, I don’t lack this necklace,” Qiao Xi said casually.","He Wenxian bit her lip. Lan Rong immediately stood up to defend the injustice. “Wenxian wanted to donate the necklace, and now you want to donate it too. You just want to copy Wenxian. Why are you so annoying?!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said slowly, “Didn’t everyone come to the charity banquet today to donate money and things? Could it be that just because Miss He wanted to donate the necklace, no one else can donate it?","“Did the He family come up with such a special rule for this charity banquet? This necklace is worth 150 million. I want to donate it so that schools can be built on the mountains. What does it have to do with Miss He? This necklace belongs to me. Do I need Miss He’s permission to donate it to anyone?","“Or perhaps...” Qiao Xi paused, and her tone carried a trace of bewitchment. “Miss He, do you not want me to donate to the villages in the mountaineous area or see schools being built there?”","He Wenxian’s face was pale while her mind buzzed. Qiao Xi was slandering her!","All these years, the He family relied on charity work to become famous. If others knew that Miss He was such a two-faced person, everyone would wonder if the real purpose of the He family’s charity banquet was really for the sake of the people in trouble or to flatter themselves.","He Wenxian suppressed the anger in her heart and said with difficulty, “Xi Xi, t-that’s not what I meant. I’m just reminding you that this necklace is very expensive. If you really want to donate, of course, I’ll be very happy. But if you’re just angry about the incident, then there’s no need. After all, this necklace is someone else’s goodwill. If you donate it just like that...”","Everyone was puzzled. Miss He meant that this necklace was given to Miss Qiao by someone and she did not buy it herself. After all, Miss Qiao was only Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter. She probably did not have the ability to buy such a valuable necklace."]},{"number":1298,"title":"Chapter 1298 Being Generous","paragraphs":["1298 Being Generous","When Lan Rong heard Qiao Xi say that she wanted to donate Scorching Heart, she was unable to control the flames of rage in her heart even more. She said sarcastically, “Although Wenxian was wearing a fake, the gift was given to her by Uncle He with kind intentions. It’s just that Uncle He was deceived. Whether it’s real or fake isn’t actually that important. The main thing is the sender of the gift. I don’t know where your necklace came from. Perhaps you stole it or got it from scamming someone!”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly.","“Wenxian, am I right?” Lan Rong was extremely proud as she went to He Wenxian to claim the credit. Her guess must be right. That woman was not worthy of having such a valuable necklace at all. She must have obtained it through inappropriate methods.","She said righteously, “Miss Qiao, actually, the owner of this necklace isn’t you, right?! If you brace yourself and donate it now, how will you explain it to the owner of the necklace later? I’ve never seen such a shameless person like you!”","He Wenxian’s lips were tense as she shook her head helplessly. The disdain in everyone’s eyes deepened as they looked at Qiao Xi in disgust.","If it was really as Miss He had said and this necklace did not belong to Qiao Xi but was only borrowed, then what right did she have to donate it? It was truly nauseating to be generous with the belongings of another just to boost one’s reputation.","He Wenxian said earnestly, “Xi Xi, Scorching Heart is really too precious. You really don’t have to donate the necklace for the sake of your reputation. Donating things depends on your ability. Even if you donate cheap things, no one will laugh at you.”","Qiao Xi was almost convinced by He Wenxian’s pretentious appearance. She had really met her match.","Lan Rong instantly became confident. “Wenxian is right! I advise you not to pretend anymore. If you donate someone else’s things, the true owners will come looking for you. It’ll be awkward if you can’t afford it. We just wanted to save you some dignity, so we didn’t expose you earlier. Do you really think we believe that you can have such an expensive piece of jewelry?","“Actually, I’m already giving you face by saying that you borrowed it. If you continue to fool around and we tell the truth, what right do you have to continue staying here?”","As soon as she finished speaking, footsteps came from the door. Then, a cold male voice sounded in everyone’s ears. “I want to hear the truth.”","The man’s voice was low with a trace of mockery and disdain. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a tall man in a custom-made suit slowly walking over.","When they got closer, everyone could see his face clearly. His eyebrows were resolute, and his light brown eyes were deep and cold. He had a high nose bridge, making him look like the work of God. What was even more shocking was that the kingly aura he exuded was noble and gentle, but it was also filled with an unapproachable aura.","Most of the guests had never seen the person in front of them, but they knew that the young man behind him was Gu Zheng’s personal assistant, Song Shijing.","It seemed obvious who the man who made Song Shijing follow him so respectfully was.","Everyone was dumbfounded, but Lan Rong had mixed feelings. Fear, joy, and shock surged into her mind. She explained while trembling, “S-She stole this necklace and even said she wanted to donate it. I...”","Lan Rong was so scared that she could not finish her sentence. The entire venue was silent. After a few seconds of silence, Gu Zheng sneered.","This sudden laugh made He Wenxian’s heart twitch, then beat violently.","What did Gu Zheng want to do? Even if he doted on Qiao Xi, he could not cause trouble at the He family’s charity banquet. Her father was Gu Zheng’s master. Although that was in the past, Gu Zheng had to show her father some respect no matter what. Moreover, Gu Zheng and her brother had been good friends for many years. Gu Zheng would not go too far!","Gu Zheng glanced coldly at everyone. In the end, his gaze landed on Qiao Xi, and his gaze instantly softened. Then, he looked sharply at He Wenxian.","“She stole the necklace?” he suddenly asked. His tone was calm, making it impossible to tell if he was happy or angry. However, Lan Rong felt that she was surrounded by a cold aura. She could not even breathe.","Under this man’s powerful pressure, she could not say a word. Before she could speak, she heard Gu Zheng’s cold voice. “He Wenxian, why didn’t you tell everyone who she is?”","He Wenxian’s body suddenly stiffened. It was as if a huge rock was stuck in her throat, and she"]},{"number":1299,"title":"Chapter 1299 Her Real Identity","paragraphs":["1299 Her Real Identity","The surroundings instantly fell silent. What did Gu Zheng mean? Could it be that Miss Qiao’s identity was extraordinary? Wasn’t she just Xia Yunqiu’s adopted daughter? What was there to be afraid of?","He Wenxian’s face was pale as she widened her eyes at Gu Zheng. Why did he say that? Did he have to expose her thoughts in front of everyone?","Why didn’t she tell everyone Qiao Xi’s identity? It was because she was unwilling. What right did Qiao Xi have to become the legitimate Mrs. Gu? What right did Qiao Xi have to make her be polite and respectful to her? Why did she have to only consider herself as Gu Zheng’s friend while Qiao Xi could stand by Gu Zheng’s side forever?","She hated all of this, so she naturally would not reveal Qiao Xi’s identity. Moreover, if she said that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife and Cheng Juan happened to appraise Qiao Xi’s necklace as a fake, wouldn’t Qiao Xi implicate Gu Zheng and make him lose face? Hence, there was a reason why she did not say anything.","!!","At the thought of this, He Wenxian instantly became confident. “Ah Zheng, I didn’t say anything just now because I thought that Xi Xi’s necklace was a fake. If I revealed her identity, I was afraid I’d implicate others.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she understood what He Wenxian meant.","If she wore a fake, not only would she lose her reputation, but Gu Zheng would also lose his. He Wenxian did not say anything because of Gu Zheng’s reputation.","In that case, Gu Zheng had to thank her? However, Gu Zheng was not just referring to her identity as Mrs. Gu.","Only then did everyone react to He Wenxian’s words. He Wenxian did not reveal Miss Qiao’s true identity because she was worried that Qiao Xi was wearing a fake. It would embarrass her backer. This was reasonable.","It had to be said that Miss He was really meticulous and understanding.","“Implicated?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, and his tone rose slightly. Every subtle move he made was so elegant. His entire body exuded a powerful aura, making others admire and fear him. Hence, the moment he spoke, the surrounding discussion instantly stopped.","He Wenxian gritted her teeth and looked a little aggrieved. “Ah Zheng, it’s all my fault. I didn’t figure out the truth and rashly—”","“Miss He, you were unwilling to reveal her identity because you were worried that she’d implicate others. But since you know her identity, you should know that the necklace she’s wearing is absolutely not a fake.” Gu Zheng sneered coldly. “As the chief designer of Liuli, is there a need for Gu Shan to wear a fake necklace?”","Everyone was instantly dumbfounded. They even suspected that they had heard wrongly. Gu Zheng was saying that Miss Qiao was the chief designer, Gu Shan?","He Wenxian clenched her fists tightly, her expression slightly stiff.","The people present were the daughters and young masters of high society. They might not know Gu Shan, but they definitely knew Liuli Corporation. To be able to become the chief designer of Liuli, a top fashion design company, one had to be outstandingly capable. Moreover, one had to be internationally famous. It just so happened that this international top designer was the young and beautiful Miss Qiao.","After a long silence, someone muttered in a low voice, “I heard that not only do designers of Liuli have to know how to design clothes, but they also have to be proficient in identifying jewelry and luxury goods. As the chief designer, Gu Shan must know if the necklace she’s wearing is real or fake! Moreover, with her identity and wealth, it’s impossible for her to wear a fake to the banquet, right?! No wonder Miss Qiao was so confident in asking for the necklace to be appraised. It seems that she had already checked her necklace.”","Cheng Juan stood up and said in a gentle voice, “Let me explain to everyone. Scorching Heart was designed by Miss Gu Shan and Lu Zhi, the president of Liuli. At that time, Lu Zhi spent half a year collecting these perfect rubies. It took a year from the design to the final completion. The process of forging the necklace was personally supervised by Gu Shan, which is why every detail is perfect.","“Everyone should know that this necklace was donated by the Thousand Faces Immortal Doctor, but we’ve never heard of the creator of the necklace. Even so, as long as you investigate, you’ll probably find out. After all, the name Gu Shan is very famous both domestically and overseas. Moreover, Liuli has never hidden the relevant information about this necklace.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone looked at Qiao Xi. They did not dare believe that this necklace was actually designed and completed by Qiao Xi.","He Wenxian, who had always been calm and composed, could not help but have a shocked expression. At the same time, a trace of resentment flashed past her eyes. How was this possible? It was actually designed by Qiao Xi?","Cheng Juan sneered. “I’m really curious why you asked me to appraise this necklace, Miss He? Gu Shan is wearing a necklace that she designed herself. How can it be fake?”","Everyone sighed in their hearts. He Wenxian was in trouble!"]},{"number":1300,"title":"Chapter 1300 The Collapse Of A Perfect Image","paragraphs":["1300 The Collapse Of A Perfect Image","At this moment, the man standing beside He Wenxian frowned and retorted indignantly, “But how could Miss He have known—”","“Miss He.” The corners of Song Shijing’s mouth curled up slightly as he interrupted the other party rudely. He turned to look at He Wenxian. “I remember that the last time you went to Gu Corporation to bid, you accused Young Madam in public of not being qualified to work as a designer in Gu Corporation. The He family withdrew from the collaboration because of your rash actions. Chairman He even brought you to apologize to Young Madam personally. It seems that what happened last time wasn’t enough to teach you a lesson as you forgot Young Madam’s identity so quickly.”","He Wenxian’s body stiffened as she widened her eyes at Song Shijing.","He was just an assistant. What right did he have to expose her in public? All these years, in order to protect her perfect image, she had always been careful and did not dare make a single mistake. She maintained a gentle and elegant image in front of outsiders at every moment, but after meeting Qiao Xi, she seemed to be plagued by bad luck and was exposed every time.","If this continued, it wouldn’t be long before her image was completely ruined. Everyone would think that she was deliberately targeting Qiao Xi and was jealous of Qiao Xi!","Everyone looked at He Wenxian with doubt and mockery. They had previously heard that the He family suddenly withdrew from the collaboration with Gu Corporation. Chairman He even personally came to apologize, but they did not expect that it was because He Wenxian had criticized Miss Qiao in public. It turned out that Miss Qiao was the chief designer of Liuli, Gu Shan.","He Wenxian had lived for more than 20 years, but this was the first time she needed to apologize to someone. It must have been very embarrassing, but it had only been a few days since the incident. She wouldn’t have forgotten so quickly, right?","Hence, He Wenxian must have known that Miss Qiao was Gu Shan but deliberately did not say it out loud. She clearly knew that it was impossible for Gu Shan to be wearing a fake, yet she still deliberately wronged her to protect her reputation. If Gu Zheng had not stepped forward to clarify things, then...","Wait!","Everyone widened their eyes and thought about what Song Shijing had just said. They all looked at Qiao Xi, their eyes wandering between her and Gu Zheng. Did they hear Song Shijing call Qiao Xi ‘Young Madam’ just now?","Song Shijing was Gu Zheng’s personal assistant. He called Qiao Xi ‘Young Madam’, which meant that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s wife?","“She’s Mrs. Gu?”","“I heard that President Gu dotes on Mrs. Gu very much. Why would he stand up for other women? So, Miss Qiao is Mrs. Gu! They’re indeed a perfect match!”","“Since Miss Qiao is Mrs. Gu, it’s even more impossible for her to be wearing a fake!”","“As the eldest daughter of the He family, He Wenxian visited Longwan Residential as soon as she returned to the country. She even claimed to be President Gu’s childhood sweetheart. She must know that Miss Qiao is Mrs. Gu and also Gu Shan. Why did she suspect that Miss Qiao was wearing a fake in public, then?”","“Let’s not talk about Gu Shan’s identity first. Miss Qiao is Mrs. Gu! President Gu is so rich. Why would he let his wife wear a fake to the charity banquet?”","Perhaps He Wenxian could explain that she had forgotten that Qiao Xi was Gu Shan, but she would absolutely not forget that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu. The He family had always told the public that they were close to Gu Zheng, so how could they not know who Gu Zheng’s wife was?","Everyone discussed softly, their eyes filled with doubt. He Wenxian gasped and bit her lip. She took a deep breath and endured the mockery around her with difficulty.","She did not expect that Gu Zheng would stand up for Qiao Xi in public and not leave her with the slightest bit of dignity. Just because Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu, he had to care for Qiao Xi without any scruples?","Her necklace had clearly been smashed, and Cheng Juan had already confirmed that Qiao Xi’s necklace was the real deal. Why was he still unwilling to let the matter go? Did he have to announce Qiao Xi’s identity and embarrass her in public?","At this moment, He Wenxian was already overwhelmed by anger. Her body could not help but tremble. She suppressed the anger in her heart and explained helplessly, “Xi Xi, I’m really sorry. I’ve been busy with the charity banquet recently, so I forgot that you’re Gu Shan. I didn’t know that you designed this necklace. You’re really outstanding. Ah Zheng, it’s my fault this time. I apologize.”","Qiao Xi had an expression of disdain. Miss He was really tolerant. Her thoughts had been exposed in front of everyone, yet she could still apologize calmly. Moreover, her tone was extremely sincere, and no one could find fault with it.","Indeed, maintaining a perfect image for more than 20 years was not something that ordinary people could do!"]}]);
